Vaermina, the Daedric Prince of Nightmares, Dreams, and Dark Omens, controls dreams and nightmares, tormenting mortals with visions of fear and despair. Her realm, Quagmire, is a shifting, horrifying landscape. Vaermina feeds on the memories and fears of mortals and is known for her dark prophecies. Worshiped by cults that perform sacrifices and use dark magic, she grants followers the ability to enter a dream-state known as the Dreamstride. Vaermina’s artifact, the Skull of Corruption, creates dark duplicates of victims and feeds on their memories. Though malevolent, she is also seen as a weaver of truth in dreams, though often bringing madness.', '', '', 'figures');
