INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_apprentice''s_assistant', 'The Apprentice''s Assistant, written by Aramril, provides practical advice for aspiring mages, delivered with a touch of arrogance and humor by Valenwood''s most celebrated spellcaster. Framed as a guide to achieving fame and fortune through magical duels, the book outlines five key principles for success: understanding an opponent’s weaknesses, recognizing one’s own limitations, using wards judiciously, balancing spellcasting techniques, and strategically engaging with challenges. Aramril emphasizes both the technical and performative aspects of spellcasting, highlighting the importance of pleasing spectators to sustain a mage’s reputation and livelihood.

Themes of self-awareness, strategy, and showmanship run throughout the text, underscoring the balance between practical survival skills and the theatrical nature of public dueling. Aramril’s tone combines playful egotism with genuine wisdom, making this single-volume work as much a reflection of the author’s personality as it is a manual for mastering the arcane arts.', '''achieving'':37B ''advic'':14B ''an'':53B ''and'':24B,39B,68B,78B,95B,103B,116B ''apprentic'':2A,6B ''aramril'':11B,73B,123B ''arcan'':155B ''arroganc'':23B ''arts'':156B ''as'':33B,138B,147B ''aspects'':80B ''aspiring'':16B ''assistant'':4A,8B ''author'':144B ''awareness'':101B ''balanc'':111B ''balancing'':65B ''betw'':112B ''book'':45B ''both'':75B ''by'':10B,26B ''celebrat'':30B ''challeng'':72B ''combin'':126B ''deliver'':18B ''dueling'':122B ''duels'':43B ''egotism'':128B ''emphasiz'':74B ''engaging'':70B ''fam'':38B ''fiv'':47B ''for'':15B,50B,152B ''fortun'':40B ''fram'':32B ''genuin'':130B ''guid'':35B ''highlighting'':83B ''humor'':25B ''importanc'':85B ''is'':149B ''it'':148B ''judiciously'':64B ''key'':48B ''limitations'':61B ''livelihood'':96B ''mag'':17B,92B ''magical'':42B ''making'':132B ''manual'':151B ''mastering'':153B ''most'':29B ''much'':139B ''natur'':119B ''of'':22B,81B,86B,98B,120B,142B ''one'':58B ''opponent'':54B ''outlin'':46B ''own'':60B ''performativ'':79B ''personality'':146B ''playful'':127B ''pleasing'':87B ''practical'':13B,113B ''principl'':49B ''provid'':12B ''public'':121B ''recognizing'':57B ''reflection'':141B ''reputation'':94B ''run'':105B ''s'':3A,7B,28B,55B,59B,93B,124B,145B ''self'':100B ''self-awareness'':99B ''showmanship'':104B ''singl'':135B ''single-volum'':134B ''skills'':115B ''spectators'':88B ''spellcast'':31B ''spellcasting'':66B,82B ''strategically'':69B ''strategy'':102B ''success'':51B ''survival'':114B ''sustain'':90B ''technical'':77B ''techniqu'':67B ''text'':108B ''the'':1A,5B,44B,76B,84B,107B,110B,117B,143B,154B ''theatrical'':118B ''the