INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('arcana_restored', 'Arcana Restored, written by Wapna Neustra, serves as a cryptic and esoteric manual for restoring magical artifacts to their full potency through a hazardous process involving a Mana Fountain. In this single-volume work, Neustra details the ritual’s steps, emphasizing the need for pure gold to prime the Mana Fountain, precise recitations from the manual to avoid catastrophic results, and swift healing after enduring the inevitable injuries caused by "manacaust." The text is interspersed with vitriolic remarks against rival scholars, highlighting Neustra’s contentious personality and his claim to unmatched expertise.

The book’s themes revolve around the peril and precision of arcane restoration, the interplay between knowledge and risk, and the author''s disdain for competing theories. While the instructions are presented with authority, their convoluted language and the author’s arrogance make the manual as much a critique of academic rivalries as it is a guide to arcane practice.', '''academic'':146B ''after'':67B ''against'':82B ''and'':13B,64B,90B,104B,113B,115B,133B ''arcan'':1A,3B,107B,154B ''are'':126B ''around'':101B ''arroganc'':137B ''artifacts'':19B ''as'':10B,141B,148B ''author'':117B,135B ''authority'':129B ''avo'':61B ''betw'':111B ''book'':97B ''by'':6B,73B ''catastrophic'':62B ''caus'':72B ''claim'':92B ''competing'':121B ''contentious'':88B ''convolut'':131B ''critiqu'':144B ''cryptic'':12B ''details'':39B ''disdain'':119B ''emphasizing'':44B ''enduring'':68B ''esoteric'':14B ''expertis'':95B ''for'':16B,47B,120B ''fountain'':31B,54B ''from'':57B ''full'':22B ''gold'':49B ''guid'':152B ''hazardous'':26B ''healing'':66B ''highlighting'':85B ''his'':91B ''in'':32B ''inevit'':70B ''injuri'':71B ''instructions'':125B ''interplay'':110B ''interspers'':78B ''involving'':28B ''is'':77B,150B ''it'':149B ''knowledg'':112B ''languag'':132B ''magical'':18B ''mak'':138B ''man'':30B,53B ''manacaust'':74B ''manual'':15B,59B,140B ''much'':142B ''need'':46B ''neustr'':8B,38B,86B ''of'':106B,145B ''peril'':103B ''personality'':89B ''potency'':23B ''practic'':155B ''precis'':55B ''precision'':105B ''present'':127B ''prim'':51B ''process'':27B ''pur'':48B ''recitations'':56B ''remarks'':81B ''restor'':2A,4B ''restoration'':108B ''restoring'':17B ''results'':63B ''revolv'':100B ''risk'':114B ''ritual'':41B ''rival'':83B ''rivalri'':147B ''s'':42B,87B,98B,118B,136B ''scholars'':84B ''serv'':9B ''singl'':35B ''single-volum'':34B ''steps'':43B ''swift'':65B ''text'':76B ''the'':21B,40B,45B,52B,58B,69B,75B,96B,102B,109B,116B,124B,130B,134B,139B ''them'':99B ''theori'':122B ''this'':33B