INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('atlas_of_Dragons', '
Atlas of Dragons, 2E 373, written by Brother Mathnan, serves as a detailed glossary of dragons in Skyrim, documenting both deceased and living dragons from the Dragon War to the Second Era. The text categorizes dragons into those reportedly slain in ancient times, those definitively killed by the Dragonguard, and those known to still live. Notable entries include Paarthurnax, Alduin''s lieutenant now residing under the Greybeards'' protection, and Nahfahlaar, a dragon known for forming alliances with mortals to evade elimination. The book highlights the efforts of the Dragonguard and the ongoing challenges of confronting these powerful creatures.

Thematically, the work reflects the persistent struggle between mortals and dragons, emphasizing themes of perseverance, record-keeping, and the blend of myth and history. While it acknowledges the limitations of its records, the book offers a vital historical resource, preserving the legacies of legendary dragons and the heroes who battled them. This single-volume work is both an archival document and a testament to the enduring influence of dragons in Tamriel.', '''2e'':7B ''373'':8B ''acknowledg'':129B ''alduin'':63B ''allianc'':79B ''an'':161B ''ancient'':45B ''and'':25B,53B,72B,93B,111B,120B,125B,148B,164B ''archival'':162B ''as'':14B ''atlas'':1A,4B ''battl'':152B ''betw'':109B ''blend'':122B ''book'':86B,136B ''both'':23B,160B ''broth'':11B ''by'':10B,50B ''categoriz'':38B ''challeng'':96B ''confronting'':98B ''creatur'':101B ''deceas'':24B ''definitively'':48B ''detail'':16B ''document'':163B ''documenting'':22B ''dragon'':30B,75B ''dragonguard'':52B,92B ''dragons'':3A,6B,19B,27B,39B,112B,147B,172B ''efforts'':89B ''elimination'':84B ''emphasizing'':113B ''enduring'':169B ''entri'':60B ''evad'':83B ''for'':77B ''forming'':78B ''from'':28B ''glossary'':17B ''greybeards'':70B ''her'':150B ''highlights'':87B ''historical'':140B ''history'':126B ''in'':20B,44B,173B ''includ'':61B ''influenc'':170B ''into'':40B ''is'':159B ''it'':128B ''its'':133B ''keeping'':119B ''kill'':49B ''known'':55B,76B ''legaci'':144B ''legendary'':146B ''lieutenant'':65B ''limitations'':131B ''liv'':58B ''living'':26B ''mathn'':12B ''mortals'':81B,110B ''myth'':124B ''nahfahl'':73B ''notabl'':59B ''now'':66B ''of'':2A,5B,18B,90B,97B,115B,123B,132B,145B,171B ''offers'':137B ''ongoing'':95B ''paarthurnax'':62B ''perseveranc'':116B ''persistent'':107B ''powerful'':100B ''preserving'':142B ''protection'':71B ''record'':118B ''record-keeping'':117B ''records'':134B ''reflects'':105B ''reportedly'':42B ''residing'':67B ''resourc'':141B ''s'':64B ''second'':34B ''serv'':13B ''singl'':156B ''si