INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_axe_man', 'The Axe Man, written by X, recounts the chilling story of Minas Torik, a reserved member of the Morag Tong whose proficiency with an axe stemmed from his abusive upbringing. Torik’s childhood was defined by relentless servitude to his cruel uncle, performing tasks that demanded strength and repetitive motions. These grueling chores, such as ringing a heavy bell and sweeping with a long duster, unwittingly trained him for the physicality of wielding an axe. Torik’s transformation into an assassin began when his uncle, abandoning him without remorse, pushed Torik to retaliate. Using a Dwemer axe, Torik killed his uncle with the same motions he had perfected through years of servitude, marking the start of his lethal career.

Thematically, the book explores the interplay between oppression, survival, and the dark emergence of skill from trauma. It highlights how adversity and repetition can shape unexpected paths, even leading to mastery in violence. The story also reflects on the psychological toll of abuse and the cold detachment Torik adopts as he turns his hardships into tools for his survival and craft. This single-volume tale weaves elements of tragedy, irony, and transformation into the origins of a feared assassin.', '''abandoning'':89B ''abus'':165B ''abusiv'':32B ''adopts'':171B ''adversity'':143B ''also'':158B ''an'':27B,77B,83B ''and'':51B,63B,132B,144B,166B,182B,194B ''as'':58B,172B ''assassin'':84B,202B ''axe'':2A,5B,28B,78B,100B ''beg'':85B ''bell'':62B ''betw'':129B ''book'':125B ''by'':8B,39B ''can'':146B ''car'':122B ''childhood'':36B ''chilling'':12B ''chor'':56B ''cold'':168B ''craft'':183B ''cruel'':44B ''dark'':134B ''defin'':38B ''demand'':49B ''detachment'':169B ''dust'':68B ''dwem'':99B ''elements'':190B ''emergenc'':135B ''even'':150B ''explor'':126B ''fear'':201B ''for'':72B,179B ''from'':30B,138B ''grueling'':55B ''had'':110B ''hardships'':176B ''heavy'':61B ''highlights'':141B ''him'':71B,90B ''his'':31B,43B,87B,103B,120B,175B,180B ''how'':142B ''in'':154B ''interplay'':128B ''into'':82B,177B,196B ''irony'':193B ''it'':140B ''kill'':102B ''leading'':151B ''lethal'':121B ''long'':67B ''man'':3A,6B ''marking'':116B ''mastery'':153B ''memb'':19B ''min'':15B ''morag'':22B ''motions'':53B,108B ''of'':14B,20B,75B,114B,119B,136B,164B,191B,199B ''on'':160B ''oppression'':130B ''origins'':198B ''paths'':149B ''perfect'':111B ''performing'':46B ''physicality'':74B ''proficiency'':25B ''psychological'':162B ''push'':93B ''recounts'':10B ''reflects'':159B ''relentless'':40B ''remors'':92B ''repetition'':145B ''repetitiv'':52B ''reserv'':18B ''retaliat'':96B ''ringing'':59B ''s'':35B,80B ''sam'':107B ''servitud'':41B,115B ''shap'':147B ''singl'':186B ''single-volum'':185B