INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('dragonborn_song', 'Verses for the Dragonborn Song:
Dragonborn, Dragonborn, by his honor is sworn, To keep evil forever at bay!
And the fiercest foes rout when they hear triumph''s shout, Dragonborn, for your blessing we pray!
Hearken now, sons of snow, to an age, long ago, and the tale, boldly told, of the one!
Who was kin to both wyrm, and the races of man, with a power to rival the sun!
And the Voice, he did wield, on that glorious field, when great Tamriel shuddered with war!
Mighty Thu''um, like a blade, cut through enemies all, as the Dragonborn issued his roar!
And the Scrolls have foretold, of black wings in the cold, that when brothers wage war come unfurled!
Alduin, Bane of Kings, ancient shadow unbound, with a hunger to swallow the world!
But a day, shall arise, when the dark dragon''s lies, will be silenced forever and then!
Fair Skyrim will be free from foul Alduin''s maw, Dragonborn be the savior of men!', '''age'':45B ''ago'':47B ''alduin'':124B,162B ''all'':99B ''an'':44B ''ancient'':128B ''and'':21B,48B,62B,74B,106B,153B ''aris'':142B ''as'':100B ''at'':19B ''ban'':125B ''bay'':20B ''be'':150B,158B,166B ''black'':112B ''blad'':95B ''blessing'':35B ''boldly'':51B ''both'':60B ''brothers'':119B ''but'':138B ''by'':10B ''cold'':116B ''com'':122B ''cut'':96B ''dark'':145B ''day'':140B ''did'':78B ''dragon'':146B ''dragonborn'':1A,6B,8B,9B,32B,102B,165B ''enemi'':98B ''evil'':17B ''fair'':155B ''field'':83B ''fiercest'':23B ''foes'':24B ''for'':4B,33B ''foretold'':110B ''forev'':18B,152B ''foul'':161B ''fre'':159B ''from'':160B ''glorious'':82B ''great'':85B ''hav'':109B ''hear'':28B ''heark'':38B ''his'':11B,104B ''honor'':12B ''hung'':133B ''in'':114B ''is'':13B ''issu'':103B ''keep'':16B ''kin'':58B ''kings'':127B ''lies'':148B ''lik'':93B ''long'':46B ''man'':66B ''maw'':164B ''men'':170B ''mighty'':90B ''now'':39B ''of'':41B,53B,65B,111B,126B,169B ''on'':80B ''one'':55B ''pow'':69B ''pray'':37B ''rac'':64B ''rival'':71B ''roar'':105B ''rout'':25B ''s'':30B,147B,163B ''savior'':168B ''scrolls'':108B ''shadow'':129B ''shall'':141B ''shout'':31B ''shudder'':87B ''silenc'':151B ''skyrim'':156B ''snow'':42B ''song'':2A,7B ''sons'':40B ''sun'':73B ''swallow'':135B ''sworn'':14B ''tal'':50B ''tamriel'':86B ''that'':81B,117B ''the'':5B,22B,49B,54B,63B,72B,75B,101B,107B,115B,136B,144B,167B ''then'':154B ''they'':27B ''through'':97B ''thu'':91B ''to'':15B,43B,59B,70B,134B ''told'':52B ''triumph'':29B ''um'':92B ''unbound'':130B ''unfurl'':123B ''vers'':3B ''voic'':76B ''wag'':120B ''war'':89B,121B ''was'':57B ''we'':36B ''when'':26B,84B,118B,143B ''who'':56B ''wield'':79B ''will'':149B,157B ''wings'':113B ''with'':67B,88B,131B ''world'':137B ''wyrm'':61B ''your'':34B', 'bard, scholar', 'The Dragon Born song is an ancient song calling for the return of the Dragonborn to save the people of tam