INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brief_history_of_the_empire', '
A Brief History of the Empire, written by Stronach k''Thojj III, Imperial Historian, is a four-volume series chronicling the rise and reign of the Septim Dynasty. Beginning with Tiber Septim’s conquest of Tamriel and the establishment of the Third Era, the books explore the subsequent rulers, political struggles, and pivotal events that shaped the Empire. From the glory of Tiber’s rule to the War of the Red Diamond and the turmoil of assassinations, rebellions, and betrayals, the series provides a detailed account of the Empire’s fluctuating fortunes. Themes of power, unity, ambition, and the consequences of governance underlie the narrative, emphasizing the challenges of maintaining a vast empire.

The series concludes with the reign of Uriel Septim VII, detailing his imprisonment by the treacherous Battlemage Jagar Tharn and his subsequent liberation. Uriel VII’s efforts to restore Tamriel to its former glory reflect the ongoing struggle to uphold the vision of the Septim legacy. This comprehensive history offers a rich perspective on the political and cultural evolution of the Empire, blending triumph and tragedy in its portrayal of one of Tamriel’s most iconic dynasties.', '''account'':92B ''ambition'':103B ''and'':29B,43B,58B,79B,85B,104B,139B,176B,184B ''assassinations'':83B ''battlemag'':136B ''beginning'':35B ''betrayals'':86B ''blending'':182B ''books'':51B ''brief'':1A,7B ''by'':13B,133B ''challeng'':114B ''chronicling'':26B ''comprehensiv'':167B ''conclud'':122B ''conquest'':40B ''consequenc'':106B ''cultural'':177B ''detail'':91B ''detailing'':130B ''diamond'':78B ''dynasti'':196B ''dynasty'':34B ''efforts'':146B ''emphasizing'':112B ''empir'':5A,11B,64B,95B,119B,181B ''establishment'':45B ''events'':60B ''evolution'':178B ''explor'':52B ''fluctuating'':97B ''form'':152B ''fortun'':98B ''four'':23B ''four-volum'':22B ''from'':65B ''glory'':67B,153B ''governanc'':108B ''his'':131B,140B ''histori'':19B ''history'':2A,8B,168B ''iconic'':195B ''iii'':17B ''imperial'':18B ''imprisonment'':132B ''in'':186B ''is'':20B ''its'':151B,187B ''jag'':137B ''k'':15B ''legacy'':165B ''liberation'':142B ''maintaining'':116B ''most'':194B ''narrativ'':111B ''of'':3A,9B,31B,41B,46B,68B,75B,82B,93B,100B,107B,115B,126B,162B,179B,189B,191B ''offers'':169B ''on'':173B ''one'':190B ''ongoing'':156B ''perspectiv'':172B ''pivotal'':59B ''political'':56B,175B ''portrayal'':188B ''pow'':101B ''provid'':89B ''rebellions'':84B ''red'':77B ''reflect'':154B ''reign'':30B,125B ''restor'':148B ''rich'':171B ''ris'':28B ''rul'':71B ''rulers'':55B ''s'':39B,70B,96B,145B,193B ''septim'':33B,38B,128B,164B ''seri'':25B,88B,121B ''shap'':62B ''stronach'':14B ''struggl'':57B,157B ''subsequ