INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_buying_game', '
The Buying Game, written by Adabael Timsar-Dadisun, provides practical advice on the art of bargaining, a common and expected practice across Tamriel. Emphasizing both strategy and etiquette, the book highlights the importance of politeness, cultural awareness, and the subtleties of negotiation. From initiating pleasantries with shopkeepers to gauging regional specialties and prejudices, it offers insights into navigating trade effectively. The author underscores the importance of recognizing different types of merchants and being prepared for their quirks, such as rural shopkeepers’ resourcefulness or city merchants’ shrewdness.

Themes of cultural nuance, adaptability, and strategic thinking permeate the text. The book also cautions against hesitation, advising readers to seize opportunities for valuable purchases rather than risking regret. By treating trade as a "game" where both buyer and seller can benefit, the guide promotes a balanced and rewarding approach to commerce in Tamriel.', '''across'':26B ''adabael'':9B ''adaptability'':95B ''advic'':15B ''advising'':108B ''against'':106B ''also'':104B ''and'':23B,31B,42B,56B,76B,96B,129B,138B ''approach'':140B ''art'':18B ''as'':83B,123B ''author'':66B ''awareness'':41B ''balanc'':137B ''bargaining'':20B ''being'':77B ''benefit'':132B ''book'':34B,103B ''both'':29B,127B ''buy'':128B ''buying'':2A,5B ''by'':8B,120B ''can'':131B ''cautions'':105B ''city'':88B ''commerc'':142B ''common'':22B ''cultural'':40B,93B ''dadisun'':12B ''different'':72B ''effectively'':64B ''emphasizing'':28B ''etiquett'':32B ''expect'':24B ''for'':79B,113B ''from'':47B ''gam'':3A,6B,125B ''gauging'':53B ''guid'':134B ''hesitation'':107B ''highlights'':35B ''importanc'':37B,69B ''in'':143B ''initiating'':48B ''insights'':60B ''into'':61B ''it'':58B ''merchants'':75B,89B ''navigating'':62B ''negotiation'':46B ''nuanc'':94B ''of'':19B,38B,45B,70B,74B,92B ''offers'':59B ''on'':16B ''opportuniti'':112B ''or'':87B ''permeat'':99B ''pleasantri'':49B ''politeness'':39B ''practic'':25B ''practical'':14B ''prejudic'':57B ''prepar'':78B ''promot'':135B ''provid'':13B ''purch'':115B ''quirks'':81B ''rath'':116B ''readers'':109B ''recognizing'':71B ''regional'':54B ''regret'':119B ''resourcefulness'':86B ''rewarding'':139B ''risking'':118B ''rural'':84B ''seiz'':111B ''sell'':130B ''shopkeepers'':51B,85B ''shrewdness'':90B ''specialti'':55B ''strategic'':97B ''strategy'':30B ''subtleti'':44B ''such'':82B ''tamriel'':27B,144B ''text'':101B ''than'':117B ''the'':1A,4B,17B,33B,36B,43B,65B,68B,80B,100B,102B,133B ''them'':91B ''thinking'':98B ''tims'':11B ''timsar-dadisun'':10B ''to''