INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('death_of_a_wanderer', '
The Death of a Wanderer, written by Anonymous, is a tale of an Argonian who meets a tragic end after venturing into a Draugr crypt. The story is told through the eyes of a companion, who recounts the final moments of the Argonian''s life as he reflects on his failed attempt to use a mysterious claw he had found in an ancient crypt. The claw, believed to be a key for opening sealing doors in crypts, holds an important revelation about the Draugr: the symbols on the doors were not just locks, but a mechanism to ensure that only the living could enter, while the Draugr were trapped inside.

The themes of the story revolve around the dangers of seeking forbidden knowledge, the wisdom gained through hardship, and the ironies of life and death. The Argonian''s struggle with the Draugr highlights the conflict between mortal ambition and the inevitability of death. His final insights, including the realization that the crypt doors were meant to keep the Draugr in, provide a somber reflection on the cost of discovery and the meaning of survival. The book is a single, standalone tale that offers a glimpse into the life and untold stories of an adventurous Argonian who, despite his survival instincts, ultimately succumbs to the dangers he sought to conquer.', '''about'':86B ''adventurous'':208B ''after'':24B ''ambition'':152B ''an'':17B,66B,83B,207B ''ancient'':67B ''and'':133B,138B,153B,184B,203B ''anonymous'':12B ''argoni'':18B,47B,141B,209B ''around'':121B ''as'':50B ''attempt'':56B ''be'':73B ''believ'':71B ''betw'':150B ''book'':190B ''but'':98B ''by'':11B ''claw'':61B,70B ''companion'':39B ''conflict'':149B ''conqu'':223B ''cost'':181B ''could'':107B ''crypt'':29B,68B,166B ''crypts'':81B ''dangers'':123B,219B ''death'':1A,6B,139B,157B ''despit'':211B ''discovery'':183B ''doors'':79B,93B,167B ''draugr'':28B,88B,111B,146B,173B ''end'':23B ''ensur'':102B ''enter'':108B ''eyes'':36B ''fail'':55B ''final'':43B,159B ''for'':76B ''forbidd'':126B ''found'':64B ''gain'':130B ''glimps'':199B ''had'':63B ''hardship'':132B ''highlights'':147B ''his'':54B,158B,212B ''holds'':82B ''important'':84B ''in'':65B,80B,174B ''including'':161B ''inevitability'':155B ''insid'':114B ''insights'':160B ''instincts'':214B ''into'':26B,200B ''ironi'':135B ''is'':13B,32B,191B ''just'':96B ''keep'':171B ''key'':75B ''knowledg'':127B ''lif'':49B,137B,202B ''living'':106B ''locks'':97B ''meaning'':186B ''meant'':169B ''mechanism'':100B ''meets'':20B ''moments'':44B ''mortal'':151B ''mysterious'':60B ''not'':95B ''of'':2A,7B,16B,37B,45B,117B,124B,136B,156B,182B,187B,206B ''offers'':197B