Dwemer Inquiries: Their Architecture and Civilization, you do not know the author of the book and have limited knowledge of it, is a scholarly exploration of the Dwemer''s architectural practices, intellectual pursuits, and the mysteries surrounding their disappearance. The work delves into the intricacies of Dwemer construction, their focus on logic and science over magic, and the enigmatic aspects of their civilization, challenging traditional beliefs and suggesting deeper, hidden aspects of their culture.', '', '', 'lore');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('miraak', '
Miraak, the First Dragonborn, was a powerful Dragon Priest during the Merethic Era who ruled over Solstheim and was granted a Dragon Priest Mask by the dragons. Seeking the teachings of Hermaeus Mora, the Daedric Prince of Knowledge, Miraak became his champion and learned to bend dragons to his will, eventually turning on his former masters and killing many of them. Despite being offered as an ally during the Dragon War, Miraak refused to aid humanity and was later defeated in a duel by the Dragon Priest Vahlok, who uncovered his treachery. After his defeat, Miraak was saved by Hermaeus Mora and spent ages in Apocrypha, gathering knowledge and power to eventually free himself from Mora''s service.', '''after'':94B ''ages'':105B ''aid'':76B ''ally'':68B ''an'':67B ''and'':19B,44B,58B,78B,103B,110B ''apocryph'':107B ''as'':66B ''becam'':41B ''being'':64B ''bend'':47B ''by'':26B,85B,100B ''champion'':43B ''daedric'':36B ''defeat'':81B,96B ''despit'':63B ''dragon'':9B,23B,71B,87B ''dragonborn'':5B ''dragons'':28B,48B ''duel'':84B ''during'':11B,69B ''eventually'':52B,113B ''first'':4B ''form'':56B ''fre'':114B ''from'':116B ''gathering'':108B ''grant'':21B ''hermaeus'':33B,101B ''himself'':115B ''his'':42B,50B,55B,92B,95B ''humanity'':77B ''in'':82B,106B ''killing'':59B ''knowledg'':39B,109B ''lat'':80B ''learn'':45B ''many'':60B ''mask'':25B ''masters'':57B ''merethic'':13B ''miraak'':1A,2B,40B,73B,97B ''mor'':34B,102B,117B ''of'':32B,38B,61B ''offer'':65B ''on'':54B ''over'':17B ''pow'':111B ''powerful'':8B ''priest'':10B,24B,88B ''princ'':37B ''refus'':74B ''rul'':16B ''s'':118B ''sav'':99B ''seeking'':29B ''servic'':119B ''solstheim'':18B ''spent'':104B ''teachings'':31B ''the'':3B,12B,27B,30B,35B,70B,86B ''them'':62B ''to'':46B,49B,75B,112B ''treachery'':93B ''turning'':53B ''uncover'':91B ''vahlok'':89B ''war'':72B ''was'':6B,20B,79B,98B ''who'':15B,90B ''will'':51B', 'miraakcult, dragon, scholar, daedra', 'Miraak is rumored to be a dragon priest on Solstheim who 