INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_firsthold_revolt', '
The Firsthold Revolt, written by Maveus Cie, tells the story of political intrigue and betrayal within the city of Firsthold, Summerset Isle. The tale centers around the tension between Lady Gialene, the powerful concubine of King Reman, and Queen Morgiah, her rival for influence in the court. Gialene seeks to incite a revolt with the help of the Trebbite Monks, a faction that opposes the Dunmer influence in the royal family. As the revolt escalates, Gialene orchestrates a dangerous strategy using reflection spells to counter the King''s fireball-wielding battlemages. However, her plot backfires, leading to chaos, betrayal, and her eventual return to her father''s court, while the king''s forces remain in control.

The story highlights themes of power, loyalty, and the dangerous games played in the pursuit of influence. It explores the delicate balance between ambition and treachery within a royal court, as well as the deep-seated divisions between the Dunmer and Altmer cultures. The book is a single work that offers a glimpse into the political landscape of Summerset Isle during a time of unrest.', '''altmer'':163B ''ambition'':144B ''and'':17B,41B,104B,128B,145B,162B ''around'':29B ''as'':75B,151B,153B ''backfir'':99B ''balanc'':142B ''battlemag'':95B ''betrayal'':18B,103B ''betw'':32B,143B,159B ''book'':166B ''by'':8B ''centers'':28B ''cha'':102B ''cie'':10B ''city'':21B ''concubin'':37B ''control'':120B ''count'':88B ''court'':50B,112B,150B ''cultur'':164B ''dangerous'':82B,130B ''deep'':156B ''deep-seat'':155B ''delicat'':141B ''divisions'':158B ''dunm'':69B,161B ''during'':182B ''escalat'':78B ''eventual'':106B ''explor'':139B ''faction'':65B ''family'':74B ''fath'':110B ''fireball'':93B ''fireball-wielding'':92B ''firsthold'':2A,5B,23B ''for'':46B ''forc'':117B ''gam'':131B ''gialen'':34B,51B,79B ''glimps'':174B ''help'':59B ''her'':44B,97B,105B,109B ''highlights'':123B ''howev'':96B ''in'':48B,71B,119B,133B ''incit'':54B ''influenc'':47B,70B,137B ''into'':175B ''intrig'':16B ''is'':167B ''isle'':25B,181B ''it'':138B ''king'':39B,90B,115B ''lady'':33B ''landscap'':178B ''leading'':100B ''loyalty'':127B ''maveus'':9B ''monks'':63B ''morgiah'':43B ''of'':14B,22B,38B,60B,125B,136B,179B,185B ''offers'':172B ''oppos'':67B ''orchestrat'':80B ''play'':132B ''plot'':98B ''political'':15B,177B ''pow'':126B ''powerful'':36B ''pursuit'':135B ''que'':42B ''reflection'':85B ''rem'':40B ''remain'':118B ''return'':107B ''revolt'':3A,6B,56B,77B ''rival'':45B ''royal'':73B,149B ''s'':91B,111B,116B ''seat'':157B ''seeks'':52B ''singl'':169B ''spells'':86B ''story'':13B,122B ''strategy'':83B ''summerset'':24B,180B ''tal'':27B ''tells'':11B ''tension'':31B ''that'':66B,171B ''the'':1A,4B,1