INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('horror_of_castle_xyr', '
The Horror of Castle Xyr, written by Baloth-Kul, is a one-act play that follows a tense investigation within the eerie Castle Xyr. The story is set in the grand entrance hall of the castle, where Captain Clavides of the Imperial Guard arrives to investigate the mysterious death of an Ashlander. He soon uncovers a dark secret when he finds a hidden passage beneath the castle, leading to a cellar filled with grotesque remnants of necromantic experiments. The maid, Anara, is revealed to be part of the sinister activities, and her true identity as Iachilla Xyr, a member of the Telvanni family, is exposed. The plot revolves around themes of magical torture, betrayal, and the twisted experimentation with destruction magic.

The play explores the psychological and physical torment inflicted by those who wield magic, delving into the moral decay and monstrous acts committed by those with power. The disturbing actions of the Telvanni family reveal a dark side to the pursuit of knowledge and magic, highlighting themes of cruelty and the abuse of power. The play ends on a chilling note, leaving the audience to contemplate the horrors of unchecked ambition. ', '''abus'':179B ''act'':19B ''actions'':157B ''activiti'':96B ''acts'':149B ''ambition'':198B ''an'':57B ''anar'':87B ''and'':97B,121B,133B,147B,171B,177B ''around'':115B ''arriv'':50B ''as'':101B ''ashland'':58B ''audienc'':191B ''baloth'':13B ''baloth-kul'':12B ''be'':91B ''beneath'':71B ''betrayal'':120B ''by'':11B,137B,151B ''captain'':44B ''castl'':3A,8B,29B,42B,73B ''cell'':77B ''chilling'':187B ''clavid'':45B ''committ'':150B ''contemplat'':193B ''cruelty'':176B ''dark'':63B,164B ''death'':55B ''decay'':146B ''delving'':142B ''destruction'':126B ''disturbing'':156B ''eeri'':28B ''ends'':184B ''entranc'':38B ''experimentation'':124B ''experiments'':84B ''explor'':130B ''expos'':111B ''family'':109B,161B ''fill'':78B ''finds'':67B ''follows'':22B ''grand'':37B ''grotesqu'':80B ''guard'':49B ''hall'':39B ''her'':98B ''hidd'':69B ''highlighting'':173B ''horror'':1A,6B ''horrors'':195B ''iachill'':102B ''identity'':100B ''imperial'':48B ''in'':35B ''inflict'':136B ''into'':143B ''investigat'':52B ''investigation'':25B ''is'':15B,33B,88B,110B ''knowledg'':170B ''kul'':14B ''leading'':74B ''leaving'':189B ''magic'':127B,141B,172B ''magical'':118B ''maid'':86B ''memb'':105B ''monstrous'':148B ''moral'':145B ''mysterious'':54B ''necromantic'':83B ''not'':188B ''of'':2A,7B,40B,46B,56B,82B,93B,106B,117B,158B,169B,175B,180B,196B ''on'':185B ''one'':18B ''one-act'':17B ''part'':92B ''passag'':70B ''physical'':134B ''play'':20B,129B,183B ''plot'':113B ''pow'':154B,181B ''psychological'':132B ''pursuit'':168B ''remnants'':81B ''reveal'':89B,162