INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('incident_at_necrom', 'Incident in Necrom, written by Jonquilla Bothe, is a suspenseful tale about a group of adventurers tasked with cleansing a haunted cemetery near the city of Necrom. The story follows Phlaxith, the leader of the group, as he assembles a team consisting of Nitrah, a skilled swordswoman, Osmic, a burglar, and Massitha, a sorceress specializing in illusion magic. The group sets out to eliminate a vampire infestation in the graveyard and encounters deadly foes, with Massitha''s unique abilities playing a crucial role in their survival. As the group navigates the crypts, they face overwhelming odds, but ultimately, Massitha''s powers help them defeat the vampires, only for a final, shocking twist.

The book explores themes of betrayal, the unexpected nature of allies, and the dangers of underestimating the power of illusion magic. Massitha’s development from an unsure illusionist into a vital force in the battle highlights the versatility and unpredictability of magic. The play concludes with an ironic twist, as Massitha, thought to be the victim, turns the tables on her treacherous companions. The story is self-contained within a single volume, blending action with deception and dark magic.', '''abiliti'':82B ''about'':15B ''action'':190B ''adventurers'':19B ''alli'':126B ''an'':141B,162B ''and'':54B,74B,127B,154B,193B ''as'':40B,90B,165B ''assembl'':42B ''at'':2A ''battl'':150B ''be'':169B ''betrayal'':121B ''blending'':189B ''book'':117B ''both'':10B ''burgl'':53B ''but'':100B ''by'':8B ''cemetery'':25B ''city'':28B ''cleansing'':22B ''companions'':178B ''conclud'':160B ''consisting'':45B ''contain'':184B ''crucial'':85B ''crypts'':95B ''dangers'':129B ''dark'':194B ''deadly'':76B ''deception'':192B ''defeat'':107B ''development'':139B ''eliminat'':67B ''encounters'':75B ''explor'':118B ''fac'':97B ''final'':113B ''foes'':77B ''follows'':33B ''for'':111B ''forc'':147B ''from'':140B ''graveyard'':73B ''group'':17B,39B,63B,92B ''haunt'':24B ''help'':105B ''her'':176B ''highlights'':151B ''illusion'':60B,135B ''illusionist'':143B ''in'':5B,59B,71B,87B,148B ''incident'':1A,4B ''infestation'':70B ''into'':144B ''ironic'':163B ''is'':11B,181B ''jonquill'':9B ''lead'':36B ''magic'':61B,136B,157B,195B ''massith'':55B,79B,102B,137B,166B ''natur'':124B ''navigat'':93B ''near'':26B ''necrom'':3A,6B,30B ''nitrah'':47B ''odds'':99B ''of'':18B,29B,37B,46B,120B,125B,130B,134B,156B ''on'':175B ''only'':110B ''osmic'':51B ''out'':65B ''overwhelming'':98B ''phlaxith'':34B ''play'':159B ''playing'':83B ''pow'':133B ''powers'':104B ''rol'':86B ''s'':80B,103B,138B ''self'':183B ''self-contain'':182B ''sets'':64B ''shocking'':114B ''singl'':187B ''skill'':49B ''sorceress'':57B '