INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('nerevar_moon_and_star', 'Nerevar Moon-and-Star, written by Imperial scholars, is a monograph that delves into the legend of Indoril Nerevar, a great leader of the Dunmer. The text recounts Nerevar''s role in uniting the Dunmer under the banner of the One-Clan-Under-Moon-and-Star to fight against the invading Deep Elves (Dwemer) and outlanders. Nerevar''s victory at Red Mountain and his honor in respecting the Ancient Spirits and Tribal law are celebrated, but his assassination by power-hungry leaders from the Great Houses, who later claimed godhood, marks a tragic turn. The legend suggests that Nerevar will one day return to fulfill his promises to the Tribes, overthrow the false gods, and restore the honor of the Dunmer.

Themes of betrayal, the struggle for power, and the preservation of tradition versus corruption are central to this work. The idea of Nerevar''s return as a messianic figure is a key aspect of Dunmer mythology, reflecting hopes for justice and the restoration of rightful order. This work is part of a series of monographs by various Imperial scholars, focusing on Ashlander legends and their interpretations.', '''against'':55B ''ancient'':75B ''and'':3A,8B,51B,61B,69B,77B,122B,136B,169B,192B ''are'':80B,143B ''as'':154B ''ashland'':190B ''aspect'':161B ''assassination'':84B ''at'':66B ''bann'':43B ''betrayal'':131B ''but'':82B ''by'':11B,85B,184B ''celebrat'':81B ''central'':144B ''claim'':96B ''clan'':48B ''corruption'':142B ''day'':109B ''deep'':58B ''delv'':18B ''dunm'':30B,40B,128B,163B ''dwem'':60B ''elves'':59B ''fals'':120B ''fight'':54B ''figur'':157B ''focusing'':188B ''for'':134B,167B ''from'':90B ''fulfill'':112B ''godhood'':97B ''gods'':121B ''great'':26B,92B ''his'':70B,83B,113B ''honor'':71B,125B ''hop'':166B ''hous'':93B ''hungry'':88B ''ide'':149B ''imperial'':12B,186B ''in'':37B,72B ''indoril'':23B ''interpretations'':194B ''into'':19B ''invading'':57B ''is'':14B,158B,177B ''justic'':168B ''key'':160B ''lat'':95B ''law'':79B ''lead'':27B ''leaders'':89B ''legend'':21B,103B ''legends'':191B ''marks'':98B ''messianic'':156B ''monograph'':16B ''monographs'':183B ''moon'':2A,7B,50B ''moon-and-st'':6B ''mountain'':68B ''mythology'':164B ''nerev'':1A,5B,24B,34B,63B,106B,151B ''of'':22B,28B,44B,126B,130B,139B,150B,162B,172B,179B,182B ''on'':189B ''one'':47B,108B ''one-clan-under-moon-and-st'':46B ''order'':174B ''outlanders'':62B ''overthrow'':118B ''part'':178B ''pow'':87B,135B ''power-hungry'':86B ''preservation'':138B ''promis'':114B ''recounts'':33B ''red'':67B ''reflecting'':165B ''respecting'':73B ''restor'':123B ''restoration'':171B ''return'':110B,153B ''rightful'':173B ''rol'':36B ''s'':35B,64B,152B ''scholars'':13B,187B ''seri'':181B ''spirits'':76