INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_real_barenziah', 'The Real Barenziah, written by unknown, is a series of books that follows the life of Queen Barenziah, a powerful and complex figure in Tamriel''s history. The books explore her rise to power, her political maneuvering, and the personal challenges she faces as a ruler. Through the narrative, the reader delves into themes of ambition, betrayal, and survival, as Barenziah navigates the turbulent political landscape of Mournhold, Skyrim, and beyond. The books also reveal her encounters with notable figures like the Thieves Guild and the Daedric Princes, highlighting her connections to both the criminal underworld and the divine.

The story is spread across multiple volumes, with each one focusing on a different period of Barenziah''s life, capturing her evolving role as a queen, a mother, and a political player. Throughout the series, the themes of power, manipulation, and personal sacrifice are explored, with Barenziah constantly seeking to maintain control over her destiny despite the forces that conspire against her.', '''across'':107B ''against'':163B ''also'':77B ''ambition'':59B ''and'':24B,41B,61B,73B,88B,100B,131B,143B ''are'':146B ''as'':47B,63B,126B ''barenziah'':3A,6B,21B,64B,119B,149B ''betrayal'':60B ''beyond'':74B ''books'':14B,32B,76B ''both'':96B ''by'':8B ''capturing'':122B ''challeng'':44B ''complex'':25B ''connections'':94B ''conspir'':162B ''constantly'':150B ''control'':154B ''criminal'':98B ''daedric'':90B ''delv'':55B ''despit'':158B ''destiny'':157B ''different'':116B ''divin'':102B ''each'':111B ''encounters'':80B ''evolving'':124B ''explor'':33B,147B ''fac'':46B ''figur'':26B,83B ''focusing'':113B ''follows'':16B ''forc'':160B ''guild'':87B ''her'':34B,38B,79B,93B,123B,156B,164B ''highlighting'':92B ''history'':30B ''in'':27B ''into'':56B ''is'':10B,105B ''landscap'':69B ''lif'':18B,121B ''lik'':84B ''maintain'':153B ''maneuvering'':40B ''manipulation'':142B ''moth'':130B ''mournhold'':71B ''multipl'':108B ''narrativ'':52B ''navigat'':65B ''notabl'':82B ''of'':13B,19B,58B,70B,118B,140B ''on'':114B ''one'':112B ''over'':155B ''period'':117B ''personal'':43B,144B ''play'':134B ''political'':39B,68B,133B ''pow'':37B,141B ''powerful'':23B ''princ'':91B ''que'':20B,128B ''read'':54B ''real'':2A,5B ''reveal'':78B ''ris'':35B ''rol'':125B ''rul'':49B ''s'':29B,120B ''sacrific'':145B ''seeking'':151B ''seri'':12B,137B ''she'':45B ''skyrim'':72B ''spre'':106B ''story'':104B ''survival'':62B ''tamriel'':28B ''that'':15B,161B ''the'':1A,4B,17B,31B,42B,51B,53B,66B,75B,85B,89B,97B,101B,103B,136B,138B,159B ''them'':57B,139B ''thiev'':86B ''through'':50B ''throughout'':135B ''to''