INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wuuthrad', 'Wuuthrad, known as "Storm''s Tears" in the Atmoran language, is a legendary battleaxe forged from the ebony tears of Ysgramor, the founder of the First Empire of the Nords. The axe was created during a pivotal moment in Nord history, specifically during the Night of Tears, when Ysgramor and his son, Yngol, fled to Atmora after witnessing the destruction of Saarthal, the first human city in Skyrim. Overcome with grief, Ysgramor''s tears transformed into pure ebony, which Yngol, renowned as the greatest blacksmith of the Atmorans, collected and used to forge the axe aboard their ship.', '''aboard'':97B ''after'':58B ''and'':51B,91B ''as'':4B,83B ''atmor'':10B,57B ''atmorans'':89B ''axe'':33B,96B ''battleax'':15B ''blacksmith'':86B ''city'':67B ''collect'':90B ''creat'':35B ''destruction'':61B ''during'':36B,44B ''ebony'':19B,79B ''empir'':28B ''first'':27B,65B ''fled'':55B ''forg'':16B,94B ''found'':24B ''from'':17B ''greatest'':85B ''grief'':72B ''his'':52B ''history'':42B ''hum'':66B ''in'':8B,40B,68B ''into'':77B ''is'':12B ''known'':3B ''languag'':11B ''legendary'':14B ''moment'':39B ''night'':46B ''nord'':41B ''nords'':31B ''of'':21B,25B,29B,47B,62B,87B ''overcom'':70B ''pivotal'':38B ''pur'':78B ''renown'':82B ''s'':6B,74B ''saarthal'':63B ''ship'':99B ''skyrim'':69B ''specifically'':43B ''storm'':5B ''tears'':7B,20B,48B,75B ''the'':9B,18B,23B,26B,30B,32B,45B,60B,64B,84B,88B,95B,98B ''to'':56B,93B ''transform'':76B ''used'':92B ''was'':34B ''when'':49B ''which'':80B ''with'':71B ''witnessing'':59B ''wuuthr'':1A,2B ''yngol'':54B,81B ''ysgramor'':22B,50B,73B', 'companions, scholar', '
