INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_third_era_timeline', 'Third Era: An Abbreviated Timeline, written by Jaspus Ignateous, provides a succinct overview of the major events that occurred during the Third Era of Tamriel. The book compiles key historical moments, including the rise and fall of numerous emperors, wars, assassinations, and significant political shifts. The timeline spans over five centuries, beginning with the unification of Tamriel in 3E 0 and ending with the events of the Oblivion Crisis in 3E 433. It highlights the frequent changes in leadership within the Empire, showcasing the turbulent nature of Tamriel''s politics and the constant struggles for power.

The themes of the book center around political instability, the cyclical nature of history, and the challenges of maintaining an Empire in a world of constant warfare and intrigue. The work reflects the Empire''s tumultuous history, emphasizing the frequent turnover of rulers and the constant threats from both external invaders, such as the Camoran Usurper, and internal struggles, such as the assassination of key leaders. The book serves as both a historical record and a cautionary tale, urging future generations to learn from past mistakes to prevent repeating the disasters of the past. With its concise presentation, it offers a starting point for those interested in studying the Empire''s complex and ever-changing history.', '''0'':64B ''3e'':63B,75B ''433'':76B ''abbreviat'':8B ''an'':7B,120B ''and'':39B,46B,65B,95B,115B,128B,144B,157B,175B,213B ''around'':107B ''as'':153B,161B,170B ''assassination'':163B ''assassinations'':45B ''beginning'':56B ''book'':31B,105B,168B ''both'':149B,171B ''by'':11B ''camor'':155B ''cautionary'':177B ''cent'':106B ''centuri'':55B ''challeng'':117B ''chang'':81B ''changing'':216B ''compil'':32B ''complex'':212B ''concis'':197B ''constant'':97B,126B,146B ''crisis'':73B ''cyclical'':111B ''disasters'':191B ''during'':24B ''emperors'':43B ''emphasizing'':138B ''empir'':86B,121B,134B,210B ''ending'':66B ''events'':21B,69B ''ever'':215B ''ever-changing'':214B ''external'':150B ''fall'':40B ''fiv'':54B ''for'':99B,204B ''frequent'':80B,140B ''from'':148B,184B ''futur'':180B ''generations'':181B ''highlights'':78B ''historical'':34B,173B ''history'':114B,137B,217B ''ignateous'':13B ''in'':62B,74B,82B,122B,207B ''including'':36B ''instability'':109B ''interest'':206B ''internal'':158B ''intrig'':129B ''invaders'':151B ''it'':77B,199B ''its'':196B ''jaspus'':12B ''key'':33B,165B ''leaders'':166B ''leadership'':83B ''learn'':183B ''maintaining'':119B ''major'':20B ''mistak'':186B ''moments'':35B ''natur'':90B,112B ''numerous'':42B ''oblivion'