INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('blade_of_woe', '
The Blade of Woe, also known as the Night Mother''s Kiss, is a ritualistic dagger tied to Sithis and the Dark Brotherhood. This deadly weapon is said to send the soul of anyone slain by it directly to the Void. The dagger, typically made of Ebony or Daedric material, is capable of instantly killing an unaware target, shrouding the wielder from view, and increasing movement speed for a quick escape. In addition to its lethal capabilities, the Blade of Woe can drain health, magicka, and willpower, and it demoralizes those struck by it. The blood spilled by the blade is also said to become tainted.', '''addition'':76B ''also'':8B,105B ''an'':59B ''and'':23B,67B,89B,91B ''anyon'':37B ''as'':10B ''becom'':108B ''blad'':1A,5B,82B,103B ''blood'':99B ''brotherhood'':26B ''by'':39B,96B,101B ''can'':85B ''capabiliti'':80B ''capabl'':55B ''daedric'':52B ''dagg'':19B,46B ''dark'':25B ''deadly'':28B ''demoraliz'':93B ''directly'':41B ''drain'':86B ''ebony'':50B ''escap'':74B ''for'':71B ''from'':65B ''health'':87B ''in'':75B ''increasing'':68B ''instantly'':57B ''is'':16B,30B,54B,104B ''it'':40B,92B,97B ''its'':78B ''killing'':58B ''kiss'':15B ''known'':9B ''lethal'':79B ''mad'':48B ''magick'':88B ''material'':53B ''moth'':13B ''movement'':69B ''night'':12B ''of'':2A,6B,36B,49B,56B,83B ''or'':51B ''quick'':73B ''ritualistic'':18B ''s'':14B ''said'':31B,106B ''send'':33B ''shrouding'':62B ''sithis'':22B ''slain'':38B ''soul'':35B ''spe'':70B ''spill'':100B ''struck'':95B ''taint'':109B ''target'':61B ''the'':4B,11B,24B,34B,43B,45B,63B,81B,98B,102B ''this'':27B ''thos'':94B ''tied'':20B ''to'':21B,32B,42B,77B,107B ''typically'':47B ''unawar'':60B ''view'':66B ''void'':44B ''weapon'':29B ''wield'':64B ''willpow'':90B ''woe'':3A,7B,84B', 'darkbrotherhood, scholar', '
