INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('moon_sugar', 'Moon Sugar is the unrefined form of skooma, a grainy powder of small white crystals with a silver sheen, harvested from cane grasses along the coasts and estuaries of Elsweyr. Unlike its refined counterpart, skooma, Moon Sugar is not illegal and is sold in apothecaries, though it does have mild magical properties and is known as a potent narcotic. While it is a popular spice in Elsweyr, it can be addictive, with humans being particularly susceptible to its effects. Alchemy effects: Weakness to Fire, Resist Frost, Restore Magicka, and Regenerate Magicka.', '''addictiv'':73B ''alchemy'':82B ''along'':26B ''and'':29B,43B,55B,91B ''apothecari'':47B ''as'':58B ''be'':72B ''being'':76B ''can'':24B,71B ''coasts'':28B ''counterpart'':36B ''crystals'':17B ''does'':50B ''effects'':81B,83B ''elsweyr'':32B,69B ''estuari'':30B ''fir'':86B ''form'':8B ''from'':23B ''frost'':88B ''grainy'':12B ''grass'':25B ''harvest'':22B ''hav'':51B ''humans'':75B ''illegal'':42B ''in'':46B,68B ''is'':5B,40B,44B,56B,64B ''it'':49B,63B,70B ''its'':34B,80B ''known'':57B ''magical'':53B ''magick'':90B,93B ''mild'':52B ''moon'':1A,3B,38B ''narcotic'':61B ''not'':41B ''of'':9B,14B,31B ''particularly'':77B ''popul'':66B ''potent'':60B ''powd'':13B ''properti'':54B ''refin'':35B ''regenerat'':92B ''resist'':87B ''restor'':89B ''she'':21B ''silv'':20B ''skoom'':10B,37B ''small'':15B ''sold'':45B ''spic'':67B ''sug'':2A,4B,39B ''suscept'':78B ''the'':6B,27B ''though'':48B ''to'':79B,85B ''unlik'':33B ''unrefin'':7B ''weakness'':84B ''whil'':62B ''whit'':16B ''with'':18B,74B', 'alchemist, khajiit', 'Moon Sugar is the unrefined form of skooma, a grainy powder of small white crystals with a silver sheen, harvested from cane grasses along the coasts and estuaries of Elsweyr. Unlike its refined counterpart, skooma, Moon Sugar is not illegal and is sold in apothecaries, though it does have mild magical properties and is known as a potent narcotic. While it is a p