INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('balmora_blue', 'Balmora Blue is a highly illicit and rare substance, known for its invigorating effects and its ties to smuggling operations. Its rarity and illegality make it a prized and dangerous commodity.', '''and'':9B,17B,25B,31B ''balmor'':1A,3B ''blu'':2A,4B ''commodity'':33B ''dangerous'':32B ''effects'':16B ''for'':13B ''highly'':7B ''illegality'':26B ''illicit'':8B ''invigorating'':15B ''is'':5B ''it'':28B ''its'':14B,18B,23B ''known'':12B ''mak'':27B ''operations'':22B ''priz'':30B ''rar'':10B ''rarity'':24B ''smuggling'':21B ''substanc'':11B ''ties'':19B ''to'':20B', 'erikur, thief, thievesguild, darkbrotherhood', 'You have heard whispers of Balmora Blue but know nothing specific about its effects or origins.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_alteration', 'This potion enhances the duration of alteration magic, a school of spells that manipulate the physical world and natural properties. Often used by mages for utility and defense. Grants alteration spells a slight improvement, with effects lasting longer as the potion increases in potency. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':59B ''alteration'':3A,10B,33B ''and'':21B,30B,71B ''are'':61B ''as'':42B ''be'':51B ''by'':26B ''can'':50B ''defens'':31B ''draught'':69B ''duration'':8B ''effects'':39B ''elix'':72B ''enhanc'':6B ''for'':28B ''found'':52B ''from'':58B,64B ''grants'':32B ''improvement'':37B ''in'':46B,53B ''incre'':45B ''lasting'':40B ''long'':41B ''loot'':55B ''mag'':27B ''magic'':11B ''manipulat'':17B ''natural'':22B ''of'':2A,9B,14B ''often'':24B ''or'':56B ''philt'':70B ''physical'':19B ''potency'':47B ''potion'':1A,5B,44B,68B ''potions'':49B ''properti'':23B ''purchas'':57B ''random'':54B ''school'':13B ''several'':62B ''slight'':36B ''spells'':15B,34B ''strongest'':67B ''that'':16B ''the'':7B,18B,43B ''ther'':60B ''thes'':48B ''this'':4B ''tiers'':63B ''to'':66B ''used'':25B ''utility'':29B ''weakest'':65B ''with'':38B ''world'':20B', 'mage, alchemist, scholar, collegeofwinterhold, psijic', 'The Potion of Alteration enhances the duration of alteration spells. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_haggling', 'A merchant''s best friend, this potion enhances one''s silver tongue, allowing better negotiation and lower prices for a brief time. Provides a slight advantage in haggling, with greater bargaining power as the potion becomes stronger. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''advantag'':29B ''alchemists'':52B ''allowing'':16B ''and'':19B,64B ''are'':54B ''as'':36B ''bargaining'':34B ''be'':44B ''becom'':39B ''best'':7B ''bett'':17B ''brief'':24B ''can'':43B ''draught'':62B ''elix'':65B ''enhanc'':11B ''for'':22B ''found'':45B ''friend'':8B ''from'':51B,57B ''great'':33B ''haggling'':3A,31B ''in'':30B,46B ''loot'':48B ''low'':20B ''merchant'':5B ''negotiation'':18B ''of'':2A ''one'':12B ''or'':49B ''philt'':63B ''potion'':1A,10B,38B,61B ''potions'':42B ''pow'':35B ''pric'':21B ''provid'':26B ''purchas'':50B ''random'':47B ''s'':6B,13B ''several'':55B ''silv'':14B ''slight'':28B ''strong'':40B ''strongest'':60B ''the'':37B ''ther'':53B ''thes'':41B ''this'':9B ''tiers'':56B ''tim'':25B ''to'':59B ''tong'':15B ''weakest'':58B ''with'':32B', 'merchant, alchemist, noble, bard, traveler', 'The Potion of Haggling improves your ability to negotiate better deals. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_the_defender', 'Favored by warriors and shield-bearers, this potion reinforces defensive techniques, allowing for greater resistance against incoming strikes. Improves blocking techniques slightly, increasing protection with higher-grade potions. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''against'':21B ''alchemists'':46B ''allowing'':17B ''and'':8B,58B ''are'':48B ''be'':38B ''bearers'':11B ''blocking'':25B ''by'':6B ''can'':37B ''defend'':4A ''defensiv'':15B ''draught'':56B ''elix'':59B ''favor'':5B ''for'':18B ''found'':39B ''from'':45B,51B ''grad'':33B ''great'':19B ''high'':32B ''higher-grad'':31B ''improv'':24B ''in'':40B ''incoming'':22B ''increasing'':28B ''loot'':42B ''of'':2A ''or'':43B ''philt'':57B ''potion'':1A,13B,55B ''potions'':34B,36B ''protection'':29B ''purchas'':44B ''random'':41B ''reinforc'':14B ''resistanc'':20B ''several'':49B ''shield'':10B ''shield-bearers'':9B ''slightly'':27B ''strik'':23B ''strongest'':54B ''techniqu'':16B,26B ''the'':3A ''ther'':47B ''thes'':35B ''this'':12B ''tiers'':50B ''to'':53B ''warriors'':7B ''weakest'':52B ''with'':30B', 'warrior, alchemist, companions, guard', 'The Potion of the Defender reinforces defensive techniques, helping to block attacks more effectively. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
