INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('conjurers_potion', 'This potion empowers conjuration magic, extending the duration of summoned allies or bound weapons. It is a staple for necromancers and battle mages alike. Extends conjuration spell durations slightly, with higher tiers providing more substantial enhancements for summoning magic. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':53B ''alik'':26B ''alli'':13B ''and'':23B,65B ''are'':55B ''battl'':24B ''be'':45B ''bound'':15B ''can'':44B ''conjuration'':6B,28B ''conjurers'':1A ''draught'':63B ''duration'':10B ''durations'':30B ''elix'':66B ''empowers'':5B ''enhancements'':38B ''extending'':8B ''extends'':27B ''for'':21B,39B ''found'':46B ''from'':52B,58B ''high'':33B ''in'':47B ''is'':18B ''it'':17B ''loot'':49B ''mag'':25B ''magic'':7B,41B ''mor'':36B ''necromancers'':22B ''of'':11B ''or'':14B,50B ''philt'':64B ''potion'':2A,4B,62B ''potions'':43B ''providing'':35B ''purchas'':51B ''random'':48B ''several'':56B ''slightly'':31B ''spell'':29B ''stapl'':20B ''strongest'':61B ''substantial'':37B ''summon'':12B ''summoning'':40B ''the'':9B ''ther'':54B ''thes'':42B ''this'':3B ''tiers'':34B,57B ''to'':60B ''weakest'':59B ''weapons'':16B ''with'':32B', 'mage, alchemist, scholar, collegeofwinterhold, psijic, witch', 'The Conjurer''s Potion extends the duration of summoned allies or bound weapons. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_destruction', 'Harnessing the raw power of the elements, this potion amplifies destruction magic, ensuring spells strike harder and deal greater damage. Increases destruction spell potency slightly, with stronger potions delivering a greater boost to elemental magic. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':50B ''amplifi'':13B ''and'':20B,62B ''are'':52B ''be'':42B ''boost'':35B ''can'':41B ''damag'':23B ''deal'':21B ''delivering'':32B ''destruction'':3A,14B,25B ''draught'':60B ''elemental'':37B ''elements'':10B ''elix'':63B ''ensuring'':16B ''found'':43B ''from'':49B,55B ''great'':22B,34B ''hard'':19B ''harnessing'':4B ''in'':44B ''incre'':24B ''loot'':46B ''magic'':15B,38B ''of'':2A,8B ''or'':47B ''philt'':61B ''potency'':27B ''potion'':1A,12B,59B ''potions'':31B,40B ''pow'':7B ''purchas'':48B ''random'':45B ''raw'':6B ''several'':53B ''slightly'':28B ''spell'':26B ''spells'':17B ''strik'':18B ''strong'':30B ''strongest'':58B ''the'':5B,9B ''ther'':51B ''thes'':39B ''this'':11B ''tiers'':54B ''to'':36B,57B ''weakest'':56B ''with'':29B', 'mage, alchemist, scholar, collegeofwinterhold, psijic', 'The Potion of Destruction amplifies destruction magic, making elemental spells hit harder. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('enchanters_potion', 'A must-have for aspiring enchanters, this potion enhances the potency of crafted enchantments, imbuing items with greater magical power. Grants a slight increase to enchantment strength, with higher tiers offering more powerful enhancements for magical crafting. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':52B ''and'':64B ''are'':54B ''aspiring'':8B ''be'':44B ''can'':43B ''craft'':16B ''crafting'':40B ''draught'':62B ''elix'':65B ''enchanters'':1A,9B ''enchantment'':29B ''enchantments'':17B ''enhanc'':12B ''enhancements'':37B ''for'':7B,38B ''found'':45B ''from'':51B,57B ''grants'':24B ''great'':21B ''hav'':6B ''high'':32B ''imbuing'':18B ''in'':46B ''incre'':27B ''items'':19B ''loot'':48B ''magical'':22B,39B ''mor'':35B ''must'':5B ''must-hav'':4B ''of'':15B ''offering'':34B ''or'':49B ''philt'':63B ''potency'':14B ''potion'':2A,11B,61B ''potions'':42B ''pow'':23B ''powerful'':36B ''purchas'':50B ''random'':47B ''several'':55B ''slight'':26B ''strength'':30B ''strongest'':60B ''the'':13B ''ther'':53B ''thes'':41B ''this'':10B ''tiers'':33B,56B ''to'':28B,59B ''weakest'':58B ''with'':20B,31B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar, collegeofwinterhold, psijic', 'The Enchanter''s Potion enhances the strength of crafted enchantments. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_the_knight', 'This potion bolsters the wearer''s proficiency in heavy armor, enhancing resilience and durability in combat. Improves heavy armor skills slightly, with stronger potions offering greater boosts to resilience in battle. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':47B ''and'':17B,59B ''are'':49B ''armor'':14B,23B ''battl'':35B ''be'':39B ''bolsters'':7B ''boosts'':31B ''can'':38B ''combat'':20B ''draught'':57B ''durability'':18B ''elix'':60B ''enhancing'':15B ''found'':40B ''from'':46B,52B ''great'':30B ''heavy'':13B,22B ''improv'':21B ''in'':12B,19B,34B,41B ''knight'':4A ''loot'':43B ''of'':2A ''offering'':29B ''or'':44B ''philt'':58B ''potion'':1A,6B,56B ''potions'':28B,37B ''proficiency'':11B ''purchas'':45B ''random'':42B ''resilienc'':16B,33B ''s'':10B ''several'':50B ''skills'':24B ''slightly'':25B ''strong'':27B ''strongest'':55B ''the'':3A,8B ''ther'':48B ''thes'':36B ''this'':5B ''tiers'':51B ''to'':32B,54B ''weakest'':53B ''wear'':9B ''with'':26B', 'warrior, alchemist, companions, guard', 'The Potion of the Knight boosts heavy armor skills, improving resilience in combat. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_illusion', 'A mage''s tool for manipulation, this potion amplifies the effects of illusion magic, making spells of fear, calm, and frenzy more effective. Slightly enhances illusion magic, with higher-grade potions providing significant boosts to manipulation spells. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':53B ''amplifi'':12B ''and'':23B,65B ''are'':55B ''be'':45B ''boosts'':38B ''calm'':22B ''can'':44B ''draught'':63B ''effectiv'':26B ''effects'':14B ''elix'':66B ''enhanc'':28B ''fear'':21B ''for'':8B ''found'':46B ''frenzy'':24B ''from'':52B,58B ''grad'':34B ''high'':33B ''higher-grad'':32B ''illusion'':3A,16B,29B ''in'':47B ''loot'':49B ''mag'':5B ''magic'':17B,30B ''making'':18B ''manipulation'':9B,40B ''mor'':25B ''of'':2A,15B,20B ''or'':50B ''philt'':64B ''potion'':1A,11B,62B ''potions'':35B,43B ''providing'':36B ''purchas'':51B ''random'':48B ''s'':6B ''several'':56B ''significant'':37B ''slightly'':27B ''spells'':19B,41B ''strongest'':61B ''the'':13B ''ther'':54B ''thes'':42B ''this'':10B ''tiers'':57B ''to'':39B,60B ''tool'':7B ''weakest'':59B ''with'':31B', 'mage, alchemist, scholar, collegeofwinterhold, psijic', 'The Potion of Illusion makes manipulation spells like fear and calm more effective. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('firebolt', 'Firebolt is a Destruction spell that hurls a single bolt of fire at a target, dealing immediate fire damage upon impact. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':25B ''apprentic'':26B ''at'':14B ''bolt'':11B ''cast'':30B ''damag'':20B ''dealing'':17B ''destruction'':5B ''fir'':13B,19B ''firebolt'':1A,2B ''hurls'':8B ''immediat'':18B ''impact'':22B ''is'':3B ''it'':23B ''level'':28B ''of'':12B ''requir'':24B ''singl'':10B ''skill'':27B ''spell'':6B ''target'':16B ''that'':7B ''to'':29B ''upon'':21B', 'mage', 'Firebolt is a spell that launches a single bolt of fire at a target, causing immediate fire damage upon impact. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('skirmishers_potion', 'Designed for agile combatants, this potion enhances light armor expertise, improving defensive capabilities without sacrificing mobility. Grants a slight increase to light armor skills, with higher potions offering greater defensive boosts for agile warriors. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''agil'':5B,35B ''alchemists'':48B ''and'':60B ''are'':50B ''armor'':11B,25B ''be'':40B ''boosts'':33B ''can'':39B ''capabiliti'':15B ''combatants'':6B ''defensiv'':14B,32B ''design'':3B ''draught'':58B ''elix'':61B ''enhanc'':9B ''expertis'':12B ''for'':4B,34B ''found'':41B ''from'':47B,53B ''grants'':19B ''great'':31B ''high'':28B ''improving'':13B ''in'':42B ''incre'':22B ''light'':10B,24B ''loot'':44B ''mobility'':18B ''offering'':30B ''or'':45B ''philt'':59B ''potion'':2A,8B,57B ''potions'':29B,38B ''purchas'':46B ''random'':43B ''sacrificing'':17B ''several'':51B ''skills'':26B ''skirmishers'':1A ''slight'':21B ''strongest'':56B ''ther'':49B ''thes'':37B ''this'':7B ''tiers'':52B ''to'':23B,55B ''warriors'':36B ''weakest'':54B ''with'':27B ''without'':16B', 'thief, alchemist, hunter, companions, warrior', 'The Skirmisher''s Potion enhances light armor skills, boosting agility and defense. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_lockpicking', 'A thief''s ally, this potion sharpens focus and dexterity, making locks yield more easily to a skilled hand. Slightly improves lockpicking ease, with higher-tier potions granting significant dexterity boosts. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':47B ''ally'':7B ''and'':12B,59B ''are'':49B ''be'':39B ''boosts'':35B ''can'':38B ''dexterity'':13B,34B ''draught'':57B ''eas'':26B ''easily'':18B ''elix'':60B ''focus'':11B ''found'':40B ''from'':46B,52B ''granting'':32B ''hand'':22B ''high'':29B ''higher-ti'':28B ''improv'':24B ''in'':41B ''lockpicking'':3A,25B ''locks'':15B ''loot'':43B ''making'':14B ''mor'':17B ''of'':2A ''or'':44B ''philt'':58B ''potion'':1A,9B,56B ''potions'':31B,37B ''purchas'':45B ''random'':42B ''s'':6B ''several'':50B ''sharpens'':10B ''significant'':33B ''skill'':21B ''slightly'':23B ''strongest'':55B ''ther'':48B ''thes'':36B ''thief'':5B ''this'':8B ''tier'':30B ''tiers'':51B ''to'':19B,54B ''weakest'':53B ''with'':27B ''yield'':16B', 'thief, alchemist, darkbrotherhood, traveler, bard', 'The Potion of Lockpicking makes opening locks easier for a short time. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_true_shot', 'Beloved by archers, this potion increases bow damage, allowing for more lethal strikes from a distance. Enhances bow damage slightly, with higher tiers enabling more devastating ranged attacks. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':44B ''allowing'':13B ''and'':56B ''archers'':7B ''are'':46B ''attacks'':32B ''be'':36B ''belov'':5B ''bow'':11B,22B ''by'':6B ''can'':35B ''damag'':12B,23B ''devastating'':30B ''distanc'':20B ''draught'':54B ''elix'':57B ''enabling'':28B ''enhanc'':21B ''for'':14B ''found'':37B ''from'':18B,43B,49B ''high'':26B ''in'':38B ''incre'':10B ''lethal'':16B ''loot'':40B ''mor'':15B,29B ''of'':2A ''or'':41B ''philt'':55B ''potion'':1A,9B,53B ''potions'':34B ''purchas'':42B ''random'':39B ''rang'':31B ''several'':47B ''shot'':4A ''slightly'':24B ''strik'':17B ''strongest'':52B ''ther'':45B ''thes'':33B ''this'':8B ''tiers'':27B,48B ''to'':51B ''tru'':3A ''weakest'':50B ''with'':25B', 'archer, alchemist, hunter, companions, thief', 'The Potion of True Shot increases bow damage, making archers more deadly. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_the_warrior', 'This potion empowers warriors with enhanced strength, making strikes with one-handed weapons deal greater damage. Slightly increases one-handed weapon damage, with stronger potions amplifying a warrior''s strikes further. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''alchemists'':49B ''amplifying'':32B ''and'':61B ''are'':51B ''be'':41B ''can'':40B ''damag'':21B,28B ''deal'':19B ''draught'':59B ''elix'':62B ''empowers'':7B ''enhanc'':10B ''found'':42B ''from'':48B,54B ''furth'':37B ''great'':20B ''hand'':17B,26B ''in'':43B ''incre'':23B ''loot'':45B ''making'':12B ''of'':2A ''one'':16B,25B ''one-hand'':15B,24B ''or'':46B ''philt'':60B ''potion'':1A,6B,58B ''potions'':31B,39B ''purchas'':47B ''random'':44B ''s'':35B ''several'':52B ''slightly'':22B ''strength'':11B ''strik'':13B,36B ''strong'':30B ''strongest'':57B ''the'':3A ''ther'':50B ''thes'':38B ''this'':5B ''tiers'':53B ''to'':56B ''warrior'':4A,34B ''warriors'':8B ''weakest'':55B ''weapon'':27B ''weapons'':18B ''with'':9B,14B,29B', 'warrior, alchemist, companions, guard', 'The Potion of the Warrior boosts one-handed weapon damage, enhancing strikes. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
