INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_waterbreathing', 'This potion grants the ability to breathe underwater, a boon for adventurers exploring submerged ruins or evading danger beneath the surface. Allows the user to breathe underwater for a brief duration, with higher-tier potions extending the time significantly. These potions can be found in random loot or purchased from alchemists. There are several tiers: from weakest to strongest: potion, draught, philter, and elixir.', '''ability'':8B ''adventurers'':15B ''alchemists'':55B ''allows'':25B ''and'':67B ''are'':57B ''be'':47B ''beneath'':22B ''boon'':13B ''breath'':10B,29B ''brief'':33B ''can'':46B ''dang'':21B ''draught'':65B ''duration'':34B ''elix'':68B ''evading'':20B ''exploring'':16B ''extending'':40B ''for'':14B,31B ''found'':48B ''from'':54B,60B ''grants'':6B ''high'':37B ''higher-ti'':36B ''in'':49B ''loot'':51B ''of'':2A ''or'':19B,52B ''philt'':66B ''potion'':1A,5B,64B ''potions'':39B,45B ''purchas'':53B ''random'':50B ''ruins'':18B ''several'':58B ''significantly'':43B ''strongest'':63B ''submerg'':17B ''surfac'':24B ''the'':7B,23B,26B,41B ''ther'':56B ''thes'':44B ''this'':4B ''tier'':38B ''tiers'':59B ''tim'':42B ''to'':9B,28B,62B ''underwat'':11B,30B ''user'':27B ''waterbreathing'':3A ''weakest'':61B ''with'':35B', 'alchemist, traveler, hunter, fisherman, sailor', 'The Potion of Waterbreathing allows the user to breathe underwater temporarily. You do not know the full effects or details of this potion. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('cure_poison', 'The Cure Poison potion halts the effects of any active poison. It is an uncommon find and is not typically traded by apothecaries. Certain individuals, such as Elgrim, Nura Snow-Shod, and Mjoll the Lioness, are known to sometimes carry it, and it may occasionally be found on members of the Silver Hand.', '''activ'':12B ''an'':16B ''and'':19B,35B,45B ''any'':11B ''apothecari'':25B ''are'':39B ''as'':29B ''be'':49B ''by'':24B ''carry'':43B ''certain'':26B ''cur'':1A,4B ''effects'':9B ''elgrim'':30B ''find'':18B ''found'':50B ''halts'':7B ''hand'':56B ''individuals'':27B ''is'':15B,20B ''it'':14B,44B,46B ''known'':40B ''lioness'':38B ''may'':47B ''members'':52B ''mjoll'':36B ''not'':21B ''nur'':31B ''occasionally'':48B ''of'':10B,53B ''on'':51B ''poison'':2A,5B,13B ''potion'':6B ''shod'':34B ''silv'':55B ''snow'':33B ''snow-shod'':32B ''sometim'':42B ''such'':28B ''the'':3B,8B,37B,54B ''to'':41B ''trad'':23B ''typically'':22B ''uncommon'':17B', 'elgrim, nura_snow-shod, mjoll_the_lioness, alchemist, scholar', 'You don''t know much about this potion''s origins or availability.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('soul_husk_extract', 'This extract protects against magical attacks and interrupts the soul drain effect within the Soul Cairn. Valerica can craft it in exchange for Soul Husks. Alchemists speculate its properties come from the unique magical environment of the Soul Cairn, where the laws of magic differ from Tamriel.', '''against'':7B ''alchemists'':29B ''and'':10B ''attacks'':9B ''cairn'':19B,42B ''can'':21B ''com'':33B ''craft'':22B ''diff'':48B ''drain'':14B ''effect'':15B ''environment'':38B ''exchang'':25B ''extract'':3A,5B ''for'':26B ''from'':34B,49B ''husk'':2A ''husks'':28B ''in'':24B ''interrupts'':11B ''it'':23B ''its'':31B ''laws'':45B ''magic'':47B ''magical'':8B,37B ''of'':39B,46B ''properti'':32B ''protects'':6B ''soul'':1A,13B,18B,27B,41B ''speculat'':30B ''tamriel'':50B ''the'':12B,17B,35B,40B,44B ''this'':4B ''uniqu'':36B ''valer'':20B ''wher'':43B ''within'':16B', 'valerica, vampire', 'You have heard that it is related to vampires but know nothing more.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_well_being', 'The Potion of Well-being is a restorative elixir that balances the restoration of health, magicka, and stamina. It is highly valued by adventurers in Solstheim and comes in various strengths, ranging from modest to extraordinary. These potions are granted by Elynea Mothren. Tiers include: Minor, Well-being, Plentiful, Vigorous, Extreme, and Ultimate.', '''adventurers'':29B ''and'':22B,32B,58B ''are'':44B ''balanc'':16B ''being'':4A,10B,54B ''by'':28B,46B ''com'':33B ''elix'':14B ''elyne'':47B ''extraordinary'':41B ''extrem'':57B ''from'':38B ''grant'':45B ''health'':20B ''highly'':26B ''in'':30B,34B ''includ'':50B ''is'':11B,25B ''it'':24B ''magick'':21B ''minor'':51B ''modest'':39B ''mothr'':48B ''of'':2A,7B,19B ''plentiful'':55B ''potion'':1A,6B ''potions'':43B ''ranging'':37B ''restoration'':18B ''restorativ'':13B ''solstheim'':31B ''stamin'':23B ''strengths'':36B ''that'':15B ''the'':5B,17B ''thes'':42B ''tiers'':49B ''to'':40B ''ultimat'':59B ''valu'':27B ''various'':35B ''vigorous'':56B ''well'':3A,9B,53B ''well-being'':8B,52B', 'solstheim, elynea_mothren, milore_ienth', 'You know nothing about these potions or their origins, but you have heard the name in connection with residence of Solstheim.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_waterwalking', 'This legandary potion purportedly allows the user to walk across the surface of water for a short duration. Only a few of these potions exist, hidden deep within Raven Rock Mine.', '''across'':13B ''allows'':8B ''deep'':30B ''duration'':21B ''exist'':28B ''few'':24B ''for'':18B ''hidd'':29B ''legandary'':5B ''min'':34B ''of'':2A,16B,25B ''only'':22B ''potion'':1A,6B ''potions'':27B ''purportedly'':7B ''rav'':32B ''rock'':33B ''short'':20B ''surfac'':15B ''the'':9B,14B ''thes'':26B ''this'':4B ''to'':11B ''user'':10B ''walk'':12B ''wat'':17B ''waterwalking'':3A ''within'':31B', 'alchemist', 'You know nothing about this potion or its origin but an alchemist might know more.', '', '', 'items');
