INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_keenshot', 'The Potion of Keenshot increases bow damage and enhances stamina regeneration temporarily. It is available in tiers: potion, draught, philter, elixir, grand elixir, and prime elixir. Rumors suggest it may have something to do with Glover Mallory in Raven Rock, though nothing is confirmed.', '''and'':11B,27B ''avail'':18B ''bow'':9B ''confirm'':47B ''damag'':10B ''do'':37B ''draught'':22B ''elix'':24B,26B,29B ''enhanc'':12B ''glov'':39B ''grand'':25B ''hav'':34B ''in'':19B,41B ''incre'':8B ''is'':17B,46B ''it'':16B,32B ''keenshot'':3A,7B ''mallory'':40B ''may'':33B ''nothing'':45B ''of'':2A,6B ''philt'':23B ''potion'':1A,5B,21B ''prim'':28B ''rav'':42B ''regeneration'':14B ''rock'':43B ''rumors'':30B ''something'':35B ''stamin'':13B ''suggest'':31B ''temporarily'':15B ''the'':4B ''though'':44B ''tiers'':20B ''to'':36B ''with'':38B', 'thievesguild', 'You don''t know anything about this, but it sounds like something the Thieves Guild might find useful by the sound of it.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_escape', 'The Potion of Escape grants invisibility for a short time and restores health. This potion comes in several tiers: potion, draught, philter, elixir, grand elixir, and prime elixir. Rumors suggest it may have something to do with Glover Mallory in Raven Rock, though nothing is confirmed.', '''and'':14B,29B ''com'':19B ''confirm'':49B ''do'':39B ''draught'':24B ''elix'':26B,28B,31B ''escap'':3A,7B ''for'':10B ''glov'':41B ''grand'':27B ''grants'':8B ''hav'':36B ''health'':16B ''in'':20B,43B ''invisibility'':9B ''is'':48B ''it'':34B ''mallory'':42B ''may'':35B ''nothing'':47B ''of'':2A,6B ''philt'':25B ''potion'':1A,5B,18B,23B ''prim'':30B ''rav'':44B ''restor'':15B ''rock'':45B ''rumors'':32B ''several'':21B ''short'':12B ''something'':37B ''suggest'':33B ''the'':4B ''this'':17B ''though'':46B ''tiers'':22B ''tim'':13B ''to'':38B ''with'':40B', 'thievesguild', 'You don''t know anything about this, but it sounds like something the Thieves Guild might find useful by the sound of it.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('philter_of_the_phantom', 'The Philter of the Phantom grants a ghostly appearance to its user for a short time. It is believed to hold the essence of restless spirits, and is rumored to be obtainable only from Shroud Hearth Barrow.', '''and'':31B ''appearanc'':13B ''barrow'':41B ''be'':35B ''believ'':23B ''essenc'':27B ''for'':17B ''from'':38B ''ghostly'':12B ''grants'':10B ''hearth'':40B ''hold'':25B ''is'':22B,32B ''it'':21B ''its'':15B ''obtain'':36B ''of'':2A,7B,28B ''only'':37B ''phantom'':4A,9B ''philt'':1A,6B ''restless'':29B ''rumor'':33B ''short'':19B ''shroud'':39B ''spirits'':30B ''the'':3A,5B,8B,26B ''tim'':20B ''to'':14B,24B,34B ''user'':16B', 'alchemist', 'You know nothing about this potion or its effects. Maybe an alchemist might though.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_health', 'The Potion of Health increases vitality for a short time. It is available in several tiers, each providing greater benefits: Potion, Draught, Solution, Philter, and Elixir of Health. These potions are found throughout Skyrim, with notable appearances in the Thalmor Embassy, House of Clan Cruel-Sea, Potema''s Catacombs, and more.', '''and'':28B,54B ''appearanc'':40B ''are'':34B ''avail'':16B ''benefits'':23B ''catacombs'':53B ''clan'':47B ''cruel'':49B ''cruel-se'':48B ''draught'':25B ''each'':20B ''elix'':29B ''embassy'':44B ''for'':10B ''found'':35B ''great'':22B ''health'':3A,7B,31B ''hous'':45B ''in'':17B,41B ''incre'':8B ''is'':15B ''it'':14B ''mor'':55B ''notabl'':39B ''of'':2A,6B,30B,46B ''philt'':27B ''potem'':51B ''potion'':1A,5B,24B ''potions'':33B ''providing'':21B ''s'':52B ''several'':18B ''short'':12B ''skyrim'':37B ''solution'':26B ''thalmor'':43B ''the'':4B,42B ''thes'':32B ''throughout'':36B ''tiers'':19B ''tim'':13B ''vitality'':9B ''with'':38B', 'alchemist, highelf, scholar', 'You don''t know much about these potions, but they seem to enhance vitality temporarily.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_extra_magicka', 'The Potion of Extra Magicka bolsters a mage''s reserves of magical energy temporarily. Available in tiers from Potion to Elixir of Extra Magicka, these potions are scattered across Skyrim. Notable locations include Ilinalta''s Deep, Silent Moons Camp, Viola Giordano''s House, and the Inner Sanctum.', '''across'':33B ''and'':48B ''are'':31B ''avail'':19B ''bolsters'':10B ''camp'':43B ''deep'':40B ''elix'':25B ''energy'':17B ''extra'':3A,8B,27B ''from'':22B ''giordan'':45B ''hous'':47B ''ilinalt'':38B ''in'':20B ''includ'':37B ''inner'':50B ''locations'':36B ''mag'':12B ''magical'':16B ''magick'':4A,9B,28B ''moons'':42B ''notabl'':35B ''of'':2A,7B,15B,26B ''potion'':1A,6B,23B ''potions'':30B ''reserv'':14B ''s'':13B,39B,46B ''sanctum'':51B ''scatter'':32B ''silent'':41B ''skyrim'':34B ''temporarily'':18B ''the'':5B,49B ''thes'':29B ''tiers'':21B ''to'':24B ''viol'':44B', 'alchemist, scholar', 'You know these potions enhance magicka reserves, but you don''t know much about their crafting or origins.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_enhanced_stamina', 'The Potion of Enhanced Stamina boosts an adventurer''s stamina for a longer duration, making it ideal for prolonged exertion. Found in tiers from Potion to Elixir of Enhanced Stamina, they appear in places like Highmoon Hall, The White Hall, Broken Tower Redoubt, and the Shrine of Akatosh.', '''adventur'':12B ''akatosh'':52B ''an'':11B ''and'':48B ''appe'':36B ''boosts'':10B ''brok'':45B ''duration'':18B ''elix'':31B ''enhanc'':3A,8B,33B ''exertion'':24B ''for'':15B,22B ''found'':25B ''from'':28B ''hall'':41B,44B ''highmoon'':40B ''ideal'':21B ''in'':26B,37B ''it'':20B ''lik'':39B ''long'':17B ''making'':19B ''of'':2A,7B,32B,51B ''plac'':38B ''potion'':1A,6B,29B ''prolong'':23B ''redoubt'':47B ''s'':13B ''shrin'':50B ''stamin'':4A,9B,14B,34B ''the'':5B,42B,49B ''they'':35B ''tiers'':27B ''to'':30B ''tow'':46B ''whit'':43B', 'alchemist, scholar', 'You know these potions improve stamina temporarily but little else about their origin or crafting.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('disguised_invisibility_potion', 'This potion grants invisibility for a brief time but cannot be consumed, as it is marked as a quest item during the events of ''Clear-Headed.'' Its purpose seems tied to unique circumstances, possibly as part of a deceptive scheme.', '''as'':16B,20B,39B ''be'':14B ''brief'':10B ''but'':12B ''cannot'':13B ''circumstanc'':37B ''cle'':29B ''clear-head'':28B ''consum'':15B ''deceptiv'':43B ''disguis'':1A ''during'':24B ''events'':26B ''for'':8B ''grants'':6B ''head'':30B ''invisibility'':2A,7B ''is'':18B ''it'':17B ''item'':23B ''its'':31B ''mark'':19B ''of'':27B,41B ''part'':40B ''possibly'':38B ''potion'':3A,5B ''purpos'':32B ''quest'':22B ''schem'':44B ''seems'':33B ''the'':25B ''this'':4B ''tied'':34B ''tim'':11B ''to'':35B ''uniqu'':36B', 'blocked', 'You have no knowledge of this potion or its purpose.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('elixir_of_resist_magic', 'The Elixir of Resist Magic provides temporary protection against magic, reducing the damage taken from spells. It is a rare potion and not tied to any specific location or vendor. It is likely an advanced creation known to skilled alchemists and scholars studying defensive magic.', '''advanc'':39B ''against'':13B ''alchemists'':44B ''an'':38B ''and'':26B,45B ''any'':30B ''creation'':40B ''damag'':17B ''defensiv'':48B ''elix'':1A,6B ''from'':19B ''is'':22B,36B ''it'':21B,35B ''known'':41B ''likely'':37B ''location'':32B ''magic'':4A,9B,14B,49B ''not'':27B ''of'':2A,7B ''or'':33B ''potion'':25B ''protection'':12B ''provid'':10B ''rar'':24B ''reducing'':15B ''resist'':3A,8B ''scholars'':46B ''skill'':43B ''specific'':31B ''spells'':20B ''studying'':47B ''tak'':18B ''temporary'':11B ''the'':5B,16B ''tied'':28B ''to'':29B,42B ''vendor'':34B', 'alchemist', 'You have heard of potions that protect against magic, but nothing about this specific elixir. Maybe an alchemist might though.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('falmer_blood_elixir', 'An amazing concoction that can grant your every wish. Only available from Brynjolf for a limited time.', '''amazing'':5B ''an'':4B ''avail'':14B ''blood'':2A ''brynjolf'':16B ''can'':8B ''concoction'':6B ''elix'':3A ''every'':11B ''falm'':1A ''for'':17B ''from'':15B ''grant'':9B ''limit'':19B ''only'':13B ''that'':7B ''tim'':20B ''wish'':12B ''your'':10B', 'brynjolf', 'You have only heard rumors of this potion supposedly granting any wish one desires. It is supposedly sold by a persuasive merchant, ''Brynjolf'' if you remember correctly, in Riften.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ice_wraith_essence', 'This potion grants resistance to frost damage and is said to be harvested from Ice Wraiths themselves. Alchemists theorize it contains the frozen essence of these creatures, granting its frost-resistant properties. It is a prized item among adventurers who venture into freezing climates.', '''adventurers'':43B ''alchemists'':21B ''among'':42B ''and'':11B ''be'':15B ''climat'':48B ''contains'':24B ''creatur'':30B ''damag'':10B ''essenc'':3A,27B ''freezing'':47B ''from'':17B ''frost'':9B,34B ''frost-resistant'':33B ''froz'':26B ''granting'':31B ''grants'':6B ''harvest'':16B ''ice'':1A,18B ''into'':46B ''is'':12B,38B ''it'':23B,37B ''item'':41B ''its'':32B ''of'':28B ''potion'':5B ''priz'':40B ''properti'':36B ''resistanc'':7B ''resistant'':35B ''said'':13B ''the'':25B ''themselv'':20B ''theoriz'':22B ''thes'':29B ''this'':4B ''to'':8B,14B ''ventur'':45B ''who'':44B ''wraith'':2A ''wraiths'':19B', 'alchemist, hunter, scholar', 'You know it is tied to Ice Wraiths but have no details on it. Maybe an alchemist or a scholar might though.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('potion_of_blood', 'The Potion of Blood is a unique elixir for vampires, serving as an equivalent to feeding on human blood. It restores health and satisfies a vampire''s hunger in Survival Mode. Found in Volkihar Keep, it is thought to be crafted using ancient vampiric alchemy.', '''alchemy'':48B ''an'':16B ''ancient'':46B ''and'':26B ''as'':15B ''be'':43B ''blood'':3A,7B,22B ''craft'':44B ''elix'':11B ''equivalent'':17B ''feeding'':19B ''for'':12B ''found'':35B ''health'':25B ''hum'':21B ''hung'':31B ''in'':32B,36B ''is'':8B,40B ''it'':23B,39B ''keep'':38B ''mod'':34B ''of'':2A,6B ''on'':20B ''potion'':1A,5B ''restor'':24B ''s'':30B ''satisfi'':27B ''serving'':14B ''survival'':33B ''the'':4B ''thought'':41B ''to'':18B,42B ''uniqu'':10B ''using'':45B ''vampir'':13B,29B ''vampiric'':47B ''volkih'':37B', 'vampire', 'You know little about this potion other than its connection to vampires judging by the name.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('vaerminas_torpor', 'Vaermina''s Torpor is a unique alchemical creation tied to the Daedric Prince Vaermina. It allows the user to enter ''The Dreamstride,'' a state of altered consciousness used in rituals. Its effects are said to transport the user through memories and dreams, making it a powerful but dangerous substance.', '''alchemical'':9B ''allows'':18B ''alter'':28B ''and'':43B ''are'':35B ''but'':49B ''consciousness'':29B ''creation'':10B ''daedric'':14B ''dangerous'':50B ''dreams'':44B ''dreamstrid'':24B ''effects'':34B ''enter'':22B ''in'':31B ''is'':6B ''it'':17B,46B ''its'':33B ''making'':45B ''memori'':42B ''of'':27B ''powerful'':48B ''princ'':15B ''rituals'':32B ''s'':4B ''said'':36B ''stat'':26B ''substanc'':51B ''the'':13B,19B,23B,39B ''through'':41B ''tied'':11B ''to'':12B,21B,37B ''torpor'':2A,5B ''transport'':38B ''uniqu'':8B ''used'':30B ''user'':20B,40B ''vaermin'':1A,3B,16B', 'daedra', 'You know nothing about this potion or its unique effects. The name itself is ominous and suggests terrible things.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('white_phial', 'The White Phial is a legendary alchemical masterpiece created by the alchemist Curalmil. Made of magically infused snow from the Throat of the World, it refills itself with any liquid placed inside. It grants powerful effects such as healing, restoration, or fortification, transcending traditional alchemical principles. The White Phial is central to a unique quest involving Nurelion, a high elf alchemist in Windhelm.', '''alchemical'':9B,47B ''alchemist'':14B,63B ''any'':31B ''as'':40B ''by'':12B ''central'':53B ''creat'':11B ''curalmil'':15B ''effects'':38B ''elf'':62B ''fortification'':44B ''from'':21B ''grants'':36B ''healing'':41B ''high'':61B ''in'':64B ''infus'':19B ''insid'':34B ''involving'':58B ''is'':6B,52B ''it'':27B,35B ''itself'':29B ''legendary'':8B ''liqu'':32B ''mad'':16B ''magically'':18B ''masterpiec'':10B ''nurelion'':59B ''of'':17B,24B ''or'':43B ''phial'':2A,5B,51B ''plac'':33B ''powerful'':37B ''principl'':48B ''quest'':57B ''refills'':28B ''restoration'':42B ''snow'':20B ''such'':39B ''the'':3B,13B,22B,25B,49B ''throat'':23B ''to'':54B ''traditional'':46B ''transcending'':45B ''uniqu'':56B ''whit'':1A,4B,50B ''windhelm'':65B ''with'':30B ''world'':26B', 'alchemist', 'You know of the White Phial as a legendary artifact of incredible alchemical power, but its specifics remain a mystery. You''ve heard a high elf, Nurelion, who runs an alchemy shop by the same name in Windhelm, might know something about it.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('poison', 'Poisons inflict harm, dealing damage to an target''s health over time. The potency increases with each tier, making them versatile tools for combat. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemy'':40B ''an'':8B ''apothecari'':36B ''be'':29B ''can'':28B ''combat'':25B ''craft'':38B ''damag'':6B ''deadly'':46B ''dealing'':5B ''each'':18B ''for'':24B ''found'':30B ''from'':35B ''harm'':4B ''health'':11B ''in'':31B ''incre'':16B ''inflict'':3B ''loot'':33B ''making'':20B ''or'':37B ''over'':12B ''poison'':1A ''poisons'':2B,27B ''potency'':15B ''potent'':44B ''purchas'':34B ''random'':32B ''s'':10B ''standard'':43B ''target'':9B ''the'':14B ''them'':21B ''thes'':26B ''tier'':19B ''tiers'':41B ''tim'':13B ''to'':7B ''tools'':23B ''using'':39B ''versatil'':22B ''virulent'':45B ''weak'':42B ''with'':17B', 'alchemist, thief, darkbrotherhood, hunter, mage, scholar', 'This poison causes harm to the target''s health over time. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('magicka_poison', 'Designed to cripple spellcasters, this poison drains the target''s magicka, preventing them from casting powerful spells. Stronger variants drain more magicka, making them effective against mages. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''against'':28B ''alchemy'':44B ''apothecari'':40B ''be'':33B ''can'':32B ''casting'':17B ''craft'':42B ''crippl'':5B ''deadly'':50B ''design'':3B ''drain'':22B ''drains'':9B ''effectiv'':27B ''found'':34B ''from'':16B,39B ''in'':35B ''loot'':37B ''mag'':29B ''magick'':1A,13B,24B ''making'':25B ''mor'':23B ''or'':41B ''poison'':2A,8B ''poisons'':31B ''potent'':48B ''powerful'':18B ''preventing'':14B ''purchas'':38B ''random'':36B ''s'':12B ''spellcasters'':6B ''spells'':19B ''standard'':47B ''strong'':20B ''target'':11B ''the'':10B ''them'':15B,26B ''thes'':30B ''this'':7B ''tiers'':45B ''to'':4B ''using'':43B ''variants'':21B ''virulent'':49B ''weak'':46B', 'mage, alchemist, scholar, collegeofwinterhold', 'This poison drains magicka, hindering a mage''s ability to cast spells. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('stamina_poison', 'Favored by warriors, this poison saps the target''s stamina, reducing their ability to perform power attacks or block effectively. Higher tiers drain more stamina, debilitating melee combatants. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''ability'':15B ''alchemy'':45B ''apothecari'':41B ''attacks'':19B ''be'':34B ''block'':21B ''by'':4B ''can'':33B ''combatants'':30B ''craft'':43B ''deadly'':51B ''debilitating'':28B ''drain'':25B ''effectively'':22B ''favor'':3B ''found'':35B ''from'':40B ''high'':23B ''in'':36B ''loot'':38B ''mele'':29B ''mor'':26B ''or'':20B,42B ''perform'':17B ''poison'':2A,7B ''poisons'':32B ''potent'':49B ''pow'':18B ''purchas'':39B ''random'':37B ''reducing'':13B ''s'':11B ''saps'':8B ''stamin'':1A,12B,27B ''standard'':48B ''target'':10B ''the'':9B,14B ''thes'':31B ''this'':6B ''tiers'':24B,46B ''to'':16B ''using'':44B ''virulent'':50B ''warriors'':5B ''weak'':47B', 'warrior, alchemist, thief, hunter, companions, darkbrotherhood', 'This poison drains stamina, reducing the effectiveness of melee attacks. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fear_poison', 'A tool for controlling the battlefield, this poison causes creatures and people to flee in fear, giving you time to regroup. Stronger variants affect higher-level targets. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''affect'':26B ''alchemy'':45B ''and'':13B ''apothecari'':41B ''battlefield'':8B ''be'':34B ''can'':33B ''caus'':11B ''controlling'':6B ''craft'':43B ''creatur'':12B ''deadly'':51B ''fear'':1A,18B ''fle'':16B ''for'':5B ''found'':35B ''from'':40B ''giving'':19B ''high'':28B ''higher-level'':27B ''in'':17B,36B ''level'':29B ''loot'':38B ''or'':42B ''peopl'':14B ''poison'':2A,10B ''poisons'':32B ''potent'':49B ''purchas'':39B ''random'':37B ''regroup'':23B ''standard'':48B ''strong'':24B ''targets'':30B ''the'':7B ''thes'':31B ''this'':9B ''tiers'':46B ''tim'':21B ''to'':15B,22B ''tool'':4B ''using'':44B ''variants'':25B ''virulent'':50B ''weak'':47B ''you'':20B', 'alchemist, thief, mage, bard, scholar, darkbrotherhood, witch', 'This poison causes fear in enemies, making them flee temporarily. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('cliff_racer', 'Cliff Racer is a specialty wine crafted by Talen-Jei at The Bee and Barb. A blend of exotic spirits, it is a favorite of those seeking a strong and unique drink.', '''and'':17B,33B ''at'':14B ''barb'':18B ''bee'':16B ''blend'':20B ''by'':10B ''cliff'':1A,3B ''craft'':9B ''drink'':35B ''exotic'':22B ''favorit'':27B ''is'':5B,25B ''it'':24B ''jei'':13B ''of'':21B,28B ''rac'':2A,4B ''seeking'':30B ''specialty'':7B ''spirits'':23B ''strong'':32B ''tal'':12B ''talen-jei'':11B ''the'':15B ''thos'':29B ''uniqu'':34B ''win'':8B', 'talen-jei', 'You have heard of a special wine served at The Bee and Barb but know little about its ingredients or flavor.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frenzy_poison', 'A chaotic choice, this poison induces frenzy, causing targets to attack anything nearby. Higher potency affects stronger enemies. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''affects'':18B ''alchemy'':35B ''anything'':14B ''apothecari'':31B ''attack'':13B ''be'':24B ''can'':23B ''causing'':10B ''chaotic'':4B ''choic'':5B ''craft'':33B ''deadly'':41B ''enemi'':20B ''found'':25B ''frenzy'':1A,9B ''from'':30B ''high'':16B ''in'':26B ''induc'':8B ''loot'':28B ''nearby'':15B ''or'':32B ''poison'':2A,7B ''poisons'':22B ''potency'':17B ''potent'':39B ''purchas'':29B ''random'':27B ''standard'':38B ''strong'':19B ''targets'':11B ''thes'':21B ''this'':6B ''tiers'':36B ''to'':12B ''using'':34B ''virulent'':40B ''weak'':37B', 'alchemist, mage, thief, bard, witch, darkbrotherhood, collegeofwinterhold', 'This poison causes frenzy, making enemies attack randomly. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('paralysis_poison', 'Highly valued by rogues, this poison paralyzes targets for a short duration, rendering them helpless. Stronger poisons increase the paralysis duration. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemy'':38B ''apothecari'':34B ''be'':27B ''by'':5B ''can'':26B ''craft'':36B ''deadly'':44B ''duration'':14B,23B ''for'':11B ''found'':28B ''from'':33B ''helpless'':17B ''highly'':3B ''in'':29B ''incre'':20B ''loot'':31B ''or'':35B ''paralysis'':1A,22B ''paralyz'':9B ''poison'':2A,8B ''poisons'':19B,25B ''potent'':42B ''purchas'':32B ''random'':30B ''rendering'':15B ''rog'':6B ''short'':13B ''standard'':41B ''strong'':18B ''targets'':10B ''the'':21B ''them'':16B ''thes'':24B ''this'':7B ''tiers'':39B ''using'':37B ''valu'':4B ''virulent'':43B ''weak'':40B', 'alchemist, thief, warrior, hunter, companions, darkbrotherhood, mage', 'This poison paralyzes enemies, incapacitating them briefly. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aversion_to_fire', 'This poison exploits a target''s weakness to fire, increasing the damage they take from fire-based attacks. Stronger potions amplify this effect. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemy'':42B ''amplify'':25B ''apothecari'':38B ''attacks'':22B ''aversion'':1A ''bas'':21B ''be'':31B ''can'':30B ''craft'':40B ''damag'':15B ''deadly'':48B ''effect'':27B ''exploits'':6B ''fir'':3A,12B,20B ''fire-bas'':19B ''found'':32B ''from'':18B,37B ''in'':33B ''increasing'':13B ''loot'':35B ''or'':39B ''poison'':5B ''poisons'':29B ''potent'':46B ''potions'':24B ''purchas'':36B ''random'':34B ''s'':9B ''standard'':45B ''strong'':23B ''tak'':17B ''target'':8B ''the'':14B ''thes'':28B ''they'':16B ''this'':4B,26B ''tiers'':43B ''to'':2A,11B ''using'':41B ''virulent'':47B ''weak'':44B ''weakness'':10B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar, witch, psijic, collegeofwinterhold', 'This poison increases a target''s vulnerability to fire. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aversion_to_frost', 'Exposing a target’s vulnerability to frost, this poison increases the damage they take from frost attacks. Higher tiers amplify the effect. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemy'':40B ''amplify'':23B ''apothecari'':36B ''attacks'':20B ''aversion'':1A ''be'':29B ''can'':28B ''craft'':38B ''damag'':15B ''deadly'':46B ''effect'':25B ''exposing'':4B ''found'':30B ''from'':18B,35B ''frost'':3A,10B,19B ''high'':21B ''in'':31B ''incre'':13B ''loot'':33B ''or'':37B ''poison'':12B ''poisons'':27B ''potent'':44B ''purchas'':34B ''random'':32B ''s'':7B ''standard'':43B ''tak'':17B ''target'':6B ''the'':14B,24B ''thes'':26B ''they'':16B ''this'':11B ''tiers'':22B,41B ''to'':2A,9B ''using'':39B ''virulent'':45B ''vulnerability'':8B ''weak'':42B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar, witch, psijic, collegeofwinterhold', 'This poison increases a target''s vulnerability to frost. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frostbite_venom', 'Frostbite Venom is a common poison harvested from Frostbite Spiders. It is known to weaken an enemy’s vitality and endurance by delivering a chilling, debilitating effect. The venom is frequently dropped by Frostbite Spiders and their larger kin, Giant Frostbite Spiders.', '''an'':18B ''and'':22B,38B ''by'':24B,35B ''chilling'':27B ''common'':7B ''debilitating'':28B ''delivering'':25B ''dropp'':34B ''effect'':29B ''enduranc'':23B ''enemy'':19B ''frequently'':33B ''from'':10B ''frostbit'':1A,3B,11B,36B,43B ''giant'':42B ''harvest'':9B ''is'':5B,14B,32B ''it'':13B ''kin'':41B ''known'':15B ''larg'':40B ''poison'':8B ''s'':20B ''spiders'':12B,37B,44B ''the'':30B,39B ''to'':16B ''venom'':2A,4B,31B ''vitality'':21B ''weak'':17B', 'hunter, alchemist, scholar', 'You know that this venom is associated with Frostbite Spiders and may weaken those it infects, but you lack specific details.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aversion_to_magic', 'A general-purpose tool, this poison heightens the target''s vulnerability to all magic, making them susceptible to spells. Stronger poisons amplify this vulnerability. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemy'':43B ''all'':17B ''amplify'':26B ''apothecari'':39B ''aversion'':1A ''be'':32B ''can'':31B ''craft'':41B ''deadly'':49B ''found'':33B ''from'':38B ''general'':6B ''general-purpos'':5B ''heightens'':11B ''in'':34B ''loot'':36B ''magic'':3A,18B ''making'':19B ''or'':40B ''poison'':10B ''poisons'':25B,30B ''potent'':47B ''purchas'':37B ''purpos'':7B ''random'':35B ''s'':14B ''spells'':23B ''standard'':46B ''strong'':24B ''suscept'':21B ''target'':13B ''the'':12B ''them'':20B ''thes'':29B ''this'':9B,27B ''tiers'':44B ''to'':2A,16B,22B ''tool'':8B ''using'':42B ''virulent'':48B ''vulnerability'':15B,28B ''weak'':45B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar, psijic, collegeofwinterhold, daedric', 'This poison increases a target''s vulnerability to all forms of magic. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aversion_to_shock', 'This poison heightens a target''s susceptibility to shock damage, making lightning-based spells and attacks more effective. Higher tiers intensify the effect. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemy'':42B ''and'':19B ''apothecari'':38B ''attacks'':20B ''aversion'':1A ''bas'':17B ''be'':31B ''can'':30B ''craft'':40B ''damag'':13B ''deadly'':48B ''effect'':27B ''effectiv'':22B ''found'':32B ''from'':37B ''heightens'':6B ''high'':23B ''in'':33B ''intensify'':25B ''lightning'':16B ''lightning-bas'':15B ''loot'':35B ''making'':14B ''mor'':21B ''or'':39B ''poison'':5B ''poisons'':29B ''potent'':46B ''purchas'':36B ''random'':34B ''s'':9B ''shock'':3A,12B ''spells'':18B ''standard'':45B ''susceptibility'':10B ''target'':8B ''the'':26B ''thes'':28B ''this'':4B ''tiers'':24B,43B ''to'':2A,11B ''using'':41B ''virulent'':47B ''weak'':44B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar, witch, psijic, collegeofwinterhold', 'This poison increases a target''s vulnerability to shock. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('recovery_poison', 'Recovery Poisons are designed to disrupt a target''s ability to regenerate magicka, making them vulnerable in combat. Tiers include Weak, Magicka, Potent, Malign, and Deadly Recovery Poisons, each lasting longer and becoming more potent with higher grades. Found in rare locations such as Fletcher in Solitude and Myrwatch.', '''ability'':12B ''and'':27B,34B,50B ''are'':5B ''as'':46B ''becoming'':35B ''combat'':20B ''deadly'':28B ''design'':6B ''disrupt'':8B ''each'':31B ''fletch'':47B ''found'':41B ''grad'':40B ''high'':39B ''in'':19B,42B,48B ''includ'':22B ''lasting'':32B ''locations'':44B ''long'':33B ''magick'':15B,24B ''making'':16B ''malign'':26B ''mor'':36B ''myrwatch'':51B ''poison'':2A ''poisons'':4B,30B ''potent'':25B,37B ''rar'':43B ''recovery'':1A,3B,29B ''regenerat'':14B ''s'':11B ''solitud'':49B ''such'':45B ''target'':10B ''them'':17B ''tiers'':21B ''to'':7B,13B ''vulner'':18B ''weak'':23B ''with'':38B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar', 'You know that these poisons disrupt magicka regeneration, but their crafting and full effects remain a mystery.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('vigor_poison', 'Vigor Poisons inhibit stamina regeneration, leaving enemies fatigued and less effective in battle. Tiers include Weak, Vigor, Potent, Malign, and Deadly Vigor Poisons, with increasing potency and duration. They are rarely found in locations like Duskglow Crevice and Japhet''s Folly Towers.', '''and'':11B,22B,29B,40B ''are'':32B ''battl'':15B ''crevic'':39B ''deadly'':23B ''duration'':30B ''duskglow'':38B ''effectiv'':13B ''enemi'':9B ''fatigu'':10B ''folly'':43B ''found'':34B ''in'':14B,35B ''includ'':17B ''increasing'':27B ''inhibit'':5B ''japhet'':41B ''leaving'':8B ''less'':12B ''lik'':37B ''locations'':36B ''malign'':21B ''poison'':2A ''poisons'':4B,25B ''potency'':28B ''potent'':20B ''rarely'':33B ''regeneration'':7B ''s'':42B ''stamin'':6B ''they'':31B ''tiers'':16B ''towers'':44B ''vigor'':1A,3B,19B,24B ''weak'':18B ''with'':26B', 'alchemist, hunter, warrior', 'You know these poisons sap stamina, but details about their creation or uses are unclear.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lingering_poison', 'Lingering Poisons deal damage over time, causing slow but deadly harm to enemies. Tiers include Weak, Lingering, Potent, Malign, and Deadly Lingering Poisons, with increasing severity and duration. Often found in places like Forelhost Stronghold and Volkihar Keep, and sometimes carried by Falmer.', '''and'':22B,29B,38B,41B ''but'':11B ''by'':44B ''carri'':43B ''causing'':9B ''damag'':6B ''deadly'':12B,23B ''deal'':5B ''duration'':30B ''enemi'':15B ''falm'':45B ''forelhost'':36B ''found'':32B ''harm'':13B ''in'':33B ''includ'':17B ''increasing'':27B ''keep'':40B ''lik'':35B ''lingering'':1A,3B,19B,24B ''malign'':21B ''often'':31B ''over'':7B ''plac'':34B ''poison'':2A ''poisons'':4B,25B ''potent'':20B ''severity'':28B ''slow'':10B ''sometim'':42B ''stronghold'':37B ''tiers'':16B ''tim'':8B ''to'':14B ''volkih'':39B ''weak'':18B ''with'':26B', 'alchemist, thief, darkbrotherhood', 'You know these poisons are used to deliver prolonged harm, but you lack specifics about their origins.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lingering_magicka_poison', 'Lingering Magicka Poisons gradually drain a target''s magical reserves, leaving spellcasters vulnerable. Tiers include Lingering, Enduring, Lasting, Persisting, and Unceasing Magicka Poisons, with stronger tiers found in rare locations such as Highpoint Tower and Forsaken Crypt.', '''and'':23B,38B ''as'':35B ''crypt'':40B ''drain'':8B ''enduring'':20B ''forsak'':39B ''found'':30B ''gradually'':7B ''highpoint'':36B ''in'':31B ''includ'':18B ''lasting'':21B ''leaving'':14B ''lingering'':1A,4B,19B ''locations'':33B ''magical'':12B ''magick'':2A,5B,25B ''persisting'':22B ''poison'':3A ''poisons'':6B,26B ''rar'':32B ''reserv'':13B ''s'':11B ''spellcasters'':15B ''strong'':28B ''such'':34B ''target'':10B ''tiers'':17B,29B ''tow'':37B ''unceasing'':24B ''vulner'':16B ''with'':27B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar', 'You know these poisons sap magicka over time, but their creation and sources remain obscure.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lingering_stamina_poison', 'Lingering Stamina Poisons weaken a target''s stamina over time, draining their ability to fight or flee. Tiers include Lingering, Enduring, Lasting, Persisting, and Unceasing Stamina Poisons. Rarely found in locations such as Bloodlet Throne or pickpocketed from individuals like Gissur during ''Diplomatic Immunity.''', '''ability'':16B ''and'':27B ''as'':36B ''bloodlet'':37B ''diplomatic'':46B ''draining'':14B ''during'':45B ''enduring'':24B ''fight'':18B ''fle'':20B ''found'':32B ''from'':41B ''gissur'':44B ''immunity'':47B ''in'':33B ''includ'':22B ''individuals'':42B ''lasting'':25B ''lik'':43B ''lingering'':1A,4B,23B ''locations'':34B ''or'':19B,39B ''over'':12B ''persisting'':26B ''pickpocket'':40B ''poison'':3A ''poisons'':6B,30B ''rarely'':31B ''s'':10B ''stamin'':2A,5B,11B,29B ''such'':35B ''target'':9B ''the'':15B ''thron'':38B ''tiers'':21B ''tim'':13B ''to'':17B ''unceasing'':28B ''weak'':7B', 'alchemist, thief, hunter', 'You know these poisons sap stamina over time, but their crafting and potency are unclear.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ice_wraith_bane', 'Ice Wraith Bane is a potent poison specifically crafted to harm Ice Wraiths. Known to be issued to those joining the Stormcloaks, its formulation is highly effective against these spectral creatures, though its use is limited to such foes.', '''against'':31B ''ban'':3A,6B ''be'':19B ''craft'':12B ''creatur'':34B ''effectiv'':30B ''foes'':42B ''formulation'':27B ''harm'':14B ''highly'':29B ''ice'':1A,4B,15B ''is'':7B,28B,38B ''issu'':20B ''its'':26B,36B ''joining'':23B ''known'':17B ''limit'':39B ''poison'':10B ''potent'':9B ''specifically'':11B ''spectral'':33B ''stormcloaks'':25B ''such'':41B ''the'':24B ''thes'':32B ''thos'':22B ''though'':35B ''to'':13B,18B,21B,40B ''use'':37B ''wraith'':2A,5B ''wraiths'':16B', 'stormcloak, alchemist, scholar', 'You know this poison is meant to combat Ice Wraiths and is tied to the Stormcloak cause, but its details remain unclear.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lotus_extract', 'Lotus Extract is a rare poison that causes lingering harm over time, slowly sapping the vitality of those it infects. It is used by assassins and can be found in select sanctuaries or other hidden locations.', '''and'':28B ''assassins'':27B ''be'':30B ''by'':26B ''can'':29B ''caus'':10B ''extract'':2A,4B ''found'':31B ''harm'':12B ''hidd'':37B ''in'':32B ''infects'':22B ''is'':5B,24B ''it'':21B,23B ''lingering'':11B ''locations'':38B ''lotus'':1A,3B ''of'':19B ''or'':35B ''other'':36B ''over'':13B ''poison'':8B ''rar'':7B ''sanctuari'':34B ''sapping'':16B ''select'':33B ''slowly'':15B ''that'':9B ''the'':17B ''thos'':20B ''tim'':14B ''used'':25B ''vitality'':18B', 'darkbrotherhood, alchemist', 'You have heard of this extract being used in the art of assassination, but its origins and potency are largely unknown.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('nightshade_extract', 'Nightshade Extract is a subtle but deadly poison derived from the nightshade plant. It causes lingering harm and is often used in covert operations or rituals. Some claim to have obtained it from Wuunferth the Unliving or hidden caches in Windhelm.', '''and'':20B ''but'':8B ''cach'':41B ''caus'':17B ''claim'':30B ''covert'':25B ''deadly'':9B ''deriv'':11B ''extract'':2A,4B ''from'':12B,35B ''harm'':19B ''hav'':32B ''hidd'':40B ''in'':24B,42B ''is'':5B,21B ''it'':16B,34B ''lingering'':18B ''nightshad'':1A,3B,14B ''obtain'':33B ''often'':22B ''operations'':26B ''or'':27B,39B ''plant'':15B ''poison'':10B ''rituals'':28B ''som'':29B ''subtl'':7B ''the'':13B,37B ''to'':31B ''unliving'':38B ''used'':23B ''windhelm'':43B ''wuunferth'':36B', 'alchemist, darkelf, mage', 'You know this extract is associated with the poisonous nightshade plant and is occasionally linked to underhanded dealings in Windhelm.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('absorb_health', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction enchantments that drain health from the target and transfer it to the wielder. This effect can be applied through custom enchanting and is also found on enchanted weapons, combining offense and self-healing.', '''absorb'':1A ''also'':32B ''and'':16B,30B,39B ''appli'':26B ''are'':6B ''be'':25B ''can'':24B ''combining'':37B ''custom'':28B ''destruction'':8B ''drain'':11B ''effect'':23B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':35B ''enchanting'':29B ''enchantments'':9B ''found'':33B ''from'':13B ''healing'':42B ''health'':2A,12B ''is'':31B ''it'':18B ''magical'':4B ''offens'':38B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':34B ''self'':41B ''self-healing'':40B ''target'':15B ''that'':10B ''the'':14B,20B ''thes'':3B ''this'':22B ''through'':27B ''to'':19B ''transf'':17B ''weapons'':36B ''wield'':21B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic drains health from an enemy and gives it to the person using the enchantment. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('absorb_magicka', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction enchantments that siphon magicka from the target, replenishing the wielder;s reserves. This effect can be applied through custom enchanting and is also found on enchanted items, making it particularly effective against enemy spellcasters.', '''absorb'':1A ''against'':40B ''also'':31B ''and'':29B ''appli'':25B ''are'':6B ''be'':24B ''can'':23B ''custom'':27B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':22B ''effectiv'':39B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':34B ''enchanting'':28B ''enchantments'':9B ''enemy'':41B ''found'':32B ''from'':13B ''is'':30B ''it'':37B ''items'':35B ''magical'':4B ''magick'':2A,12B ''making'':36B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':33B ''particularly'':38B ''replenishing'':16B ''reserv'':20B ''s'':19B ''siphon'':11B ''spellcasters'':42B ''target'':15B ''that'':10B ''the'':14B,17B ''thes'':3B ''this'':21B ''through'':26B ''wield'':18B', 'mage', 'This effect steals magicka from the target, giving it to whoever is wielding the enchanted item. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('absorb_stamina', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction enchantments that drain stamina from the target, restoring it to the wielder. This effect can be applied through custom enchanting and is also found on enchanted gear, ensuring sustained performance in prolonged physical combat.', '''absorb'':1A ''also'':31B ''and'':29B ''appli'':25B ''are'':6B ''be'':24B ''can'':23B ''combat'':42B ''custom'':27B ''destruction'':8B ''drain'':11B ''effect'':22B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':34B ''enchanting'':28B ''enchantments'':9B ''ensuring'':36B ''found'':32B ''from'':13B ''gear'':35B ''in'':39B ''is'':30B ''it'':17B ''magical'':4B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':33B ''performanc'':38B ''physical'':41B ''prolong'':40B ''restoring'':16B ''stamin'':2A,12B ''sustain'':37B ''target'':15B ''that'':10B ''the'':14B,19B ''thes'':3B ''this'':21B ''through'':26B ''to'':18B ''wield'':20B', 'mage', 'This enchantment takes stamina from an enemy, giving it to the user to keep them fighting longer. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('animal_allegiance', 'Animal Allegiance is a Shout that calls upon the beasts of the wild to fight in your defense, with the three words of power being Raan (Animal), which summons the animals; Mir (Allegiance), which binds them to your cause; and Tah (Pack), which rallies them into a united group to fight alongside you.', '''allegianc'':2A,4B,35B ''alongsid'':54B ''and'':42B ''animal'':1A,3B,29B ''animals'':33B ''beasts'':12B ''being'':27B ''binds'':37B ''calls'':9B ''caus'':41B ''defens'':20B ''fight'':17B,53B ''group'':51B ''in'':18B ''into'':48B ''is'':5B ''mir'':34B ''of'':13B,25B ''pack'':44B ''pow'':26B ''raan'':28B ''ralli'':46B ''shout'':7B ''summons'':31B ''tah'':43B ''that'':8B ''the'':11B,14B,22B,32B ''them'':38B,47B ''thre'':23B ''to'':16B,39B,52B ''unit'':50B ''upon'':10B ''which'':30B,36B,45B ''wild'':15B ''with'':21B ''words'':24B ''you'':55B ''your'':19B,40B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('armor', 'These magical effects are defensive Alteration spells that create barriers around the caster, temporarily increasing their armor rating to reduce incoming physical damage. This effect is only available as a spell, offering a reliable option for mages seeking enhanced protection in combat.', '''alteration'':7B ''are'':5B ''armor'':1A,18B ''around'':12B ''as'':30B ''avail'':29B ''barriers'':11B ''cast'':14B ''combat'':43B ''creat'':10B ''damag'':24B ''defensiv'':6B ''effect'':26B ''effects'':4B ''enhanc'':40B ''for'':37B ''in'':42B ''incoming'':22B ''increasing'':16B ''is'':27B ''mag'':38B ''magical'':3B ''offering'':33B ''only'':28B ''option'':36B ''physical'':23B ''protection'':41B ''rating'':19B ''reduc'':21B ''reliabl'':35B ''seeking'':39B ''spell'':32B ''spells'':8B ''temporarily'':15B ''that'':9B ''the'':13B,17B ''thes'':2B ''this'':25B ''to'':20B', 'mage', 'Spells like this make a person harder to hurt, as if they''re wearing invisible armor. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('arniel''s_convection', 'Arniel''s Convection is a Destruction spell that creates a stream of fire around the caster, dealing fire damage to nearby enemies over time. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':30B ''apprentic'':31B ''arniel'':1A,4B ''around'':17B ''cast'':19B,35B ''convection'':3A,6B ''creat'':12B ''damag'':22B ''dealing'':20B ''destruction'':9B ''enemi'':25B ''fir'':16B,21B ''is'':7B ''it'':28B ''level'':33B ''nearby'':24B ''of'':15B ''over'':26B ''requir'':29B ''s'':2A,5B ''skill'':32B ''spell'':10B ''stream'':14B ''that'':11B ''the'':18B ''tim'':27B ''to'':23B,34B', 'mage', 'Arniel''s Convection is a spell that creates a stream of fire around the caster, dealing fire damage to nearby enemies over time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ash_rune', 'Ash Rune is an Alteration from Solstheim spell that places a rune on a surface, which explodes when triggered, immobilizing targets in a pile of ash for a short duration. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':36B ''alteration'':7B ''an'':6B,35B ''ash'':1A,3B,28B ''cast'':40B ''duration'':32B ''explod'':19B ''for'':29B ''from'':8B ''immobilizing'':22B ''in'':24B ''is'':5B ''it'':33B ''level'':38B ''of'':27B ''on'':15B ''pil'':26B ''plac'':12B ''requir'':34B ''run'':2A,4B,14B ''short'':31B ''skill'':37B ''solstheim'':9B ''spell'':10B ''surfac'':17B ''targets'':23B ''that'':11B ''to'':39B ''trigger'':21B ''when'':20B ''which'':18B', 'mage', 'Ash Rune is a spell that places a rune on the ground, which explodes when triggered, trapping targets in a cloud of ash and holding them still for a short time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ash_shell', 'These magical effects are offensive Alteration spells that encase the target in hardened volcanic ash, immobilizing them completely while rendering them impervious to damage for the duration of the spell. This effect is exclusively available as a spell and highlights the advanced control of skilled Alteration mages.', '''advanc'':44B ''alteration'':8B,48B ''and'':41B ''are'':6B ''as'':38B ''ash'':1A,17B ''avail'':37B ''completely'':20B ''control'':45B ''damag'':26B ''duration'':29B ''effect'':34B ''effects'':5B ''encas'':11B ''exclusively'':36B ''for'':27B ''harden'':15B ''highlights'':42B ''immobilizing'':18B ''impervious'':24B ''in'':14B ''is'':35B ''mag'':49B ''magical'':4B ''of'':30B,46B ''offensiv'':7B ''rendering'':22B ''shell'':2A ''skill'':47B ''spell'':32B,40B ''spells'':9B ''target'':13B ''that'':10B ''the'':12B,28B,31B,43B ''them'':19B,23B ''thes'':3B ''this'':33B ''to'':25B ''volcanic'':16B ''whil'':21B', 'mage', 'This spell traps someone in ash, leaving them stuck but safe from harm for a bit. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ataxia', 'Ataxia is a disease that causes generalized pain, muscle stiffness, paleness, and affects muscle coordination with complex tasks. It can be contracted from slaughterfish, bears, zombies, skeevers, and alit. If left untreated, it weakens the bones and can eventually lead to death, making actions like picking locks and pockets harder.', '''actions'':45B ''affects'':14B ''alit'':30B ''and'':13B,29B,38B,49B ''ataxi'':1A,2B ''be'':22B ''bears'':26B ''bon'':37B ''can'':21B,39B ''caus'':7B ''complex'':18B ''contract'':23B ''coordination'':16B ''death'':43B ''dis'':5B ''eventually'':40B ''from'':24B ''generaliz'':8B ''hard'':51B ''if'':31B ''is'':3B ''it'':20B,34B ''lead'':41B ''left'':32B ''lik'':46B ''locks'':48B ''making'':44B ''muscl'':10B,15B ''pain'':9B ''paleness'':12B ''picking'':47B ''pockets'':50B ''skeevers'':28B ''slaughterfish'':25B ''stiffness'':11B ''tasks'':19B ''that'':6B ''the'':36B ''to'':42B ''untreat'':33B ''weakens'':35B ''with'':17B ''zombi'':27B', 'alchemist', 'Ataxia is a disease that causes generalized pain, muscle stiffness, paleness, and affects muscle coordination with complex tasks. It can be contracted from slaughterfish, bears, zombies, skeevers, and alit. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aura_whisper', 'Aura Whisper is a Shout that is not a traditional shout but a whisper, revealing the life forces of all nearby creatures. The three words of power in this Shout are Laas (Life), which allows you to sense the life forces of those around you; Yah (Seek), which helps you locate them; and Nir (Hunt), which aids in tracking them down.', '''aids'':59B ''all'':22B ''allows'':37B ''and'':55B ''are'':33B ''around'':46B ''aur'':1A,3B ''but'':14B ''creatur'':24B ''down'':63B ''forc'':20B,43B ''helps'':51B ''hunt'':57B ''in'':30B,60B ''is'':5B,9B ''laas'':34B ''lif'':19B,35B,42B ''locat'':53B ''nearby'':23B ''nir'':56B ''not'':10B ''of'':21B,28B,44B ''pow'':29B ''revealing'':17B ''seek'':49B ''sens'':40B ''shout'':7B,13B,32B ''that'':8B ''the'':18B,25B,41B ''them'':54B,62B ''this'':31B ''thos'':45B ''thre'':26B ''to'':39B ''tracking'':61B ''traditional'':12B ''which'':36B,50B,58B ''whisp'':2A,4B,16B ''words'':27B ''yah'':48B ''you'':38B,47B,52B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bane_of_the_undead', 'Bane of the Undead is a Restoration spell that significantly damages undead creatures in the area, while healing the caster if the target is undead. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''an'':32B ''are'':20B ''ban'':1A,5B ''cast'':24B,37B ''creatur'':17B ''damag'':15B ''expert'':33B ''healing'':22B ''if'':25B ''in'':18B ''is'':9B,28B ''it'':30B ''level'':35B ''of'':2A,6B ''requir'':31B ''restoration'':11B ''significantly'':14B ''skill'':34B ''spell'':12B ''target'':27B ''that'':13B ''the'':3A,7B,19B,23B,26B ''to'':36B ''unde'':4A,8B,16B,29B ''whil'':21B', 'mage', '
Bane of the Undead is a spell that significantly damages undead creatures in the area, while healing the caster if the target is undead. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('banish', 'These magical effects are defensive Conjuration spells that forcibly return summoned Daedra to Oblivion, severing their connection to Nirn. This effect is available as a spell and can also be found on enchanted weapons, making it a critical countermeasure against conjured threats.', '''against'':41B ''also'':30B ''and'':28B ''are'':5B ''as'':25B ''avail'':24B ''banish'':1A ''be'':31B ''can'':29B ''conjur'':42B ''conjuration'':7B ''connection'':18B ''countermeasur'':40B ''critical'':39B ''daedr'':13B ''defensiv'':6B ''effect'':22B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':34B ''forcibly'':10B ''found'':32B ''is'':23B ''it'':37B ''magical'':3B ''making'':36B ''nirn'':20B ''oblivion'':15B ''on'':33B ''return'':11B ''severing'':16B ''spell'':27B ''spells'':8B ''summon'':12B ''that'':9B ''the'':17B ''thes'':2B ''this'':21B ''threats'':43B ''to'':14B,19B ''weapons'':35B', 'mage', 'This spell sends summoned Daedra back to where they came from, making them disappear. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('banish_daedra', 'Banish Daedra is a Conjuration spell that sends a summoned Daedra back to Oblivion, effectively dispelling it. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':23B ''an'':22B ''back'':14B ''banish'':1A,3B ''cast'':27B ''conjuration'':7B ''daedr'':2A,4B,13B ''dispelling'':18B ''effectively'':17B ''is'':5B ''it'':19B,20B ''level'':25B ''oblivion'':16B ''requir'':21B ''sends'':10B ''skill'':24B ''spell'':8B ''summon'':12B ''that'':9B ''to'':15B,26B', 'mage', '
Banish Daedra is a spell that sends a summoned Daedra back to Oblivion, banishing it from the caster''s presence. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('battle_furry', 'Battle Fury is a Shout that enchants the weapons of your nearby allies, allowing them to attack faster. The three words of power in this Shout are Mid (Loyal), which strengthens the bond of your allies, Vur (Valor), which imbues them with courage and power, and Shaan (Inspire), which increases their speed and effectiveness in combat.', '''alli'':15B,38B ''allowing'':16B ''and'':46B,48B,55B ''are'':29B ''attack'':19B ''battl'':1A,3B ''bond'':35B ''combat'':58B ''courag'':45B ''effectiveness'':56B ''enchants'':9B ''fast'':20B ''furry'':2A ''fury'':4B ''imbu'':42B ''in'':26B,57B ''incre'':52B ''inspir'':50B ''is'':5B ''loyal'':31B ''mid'':30B ''nearby'':14B ''of'':12B,24B,36B ''pow'':25B,47B ''sha'':49B ''shout'':7B,28B ''spe'':54B ''strengthens'':33B ''that'':8B ''the'':10B,21B,34B,53B ''them'':17B,43B ''this'':27B ''thre'':22B ''to'':18B ''valor'':40B ''vur'':39B ''weapons'':11B ''which'':32B,41B,51B ''with'':44B ''words'':23B ''your'':13B,37B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('become_ethereal', 'Become Ethereal is a Shout that transforms your form to one that cannot harm or be harmed, as it reaches out to the Void. The three words of power in this Shout are Feim (Fade), which allows you to slip from the physical world; Zii (Spirit), which grants you a ghostly form; and Gron (Bind), which anchors you in a state where you are untouchable by physical harm.', '''allows'':39B ''anchors'':59B ''and'':55B ''are'':35B,66B ''as'':20B ''be'':18B ''becom'':1A,3B ''bind'':57B ''by'':68B ''cannot'':15B ''ethereal'':2A,4B ''fad'':37B ''feim'':36B ''form'':11B,54B ''from'':43B ''ghostly'':53B ''grants'':50B ''gron'':56B ''harm'':16B,19B,70B ''in'':32B,61B ''is'':5B ''it'':21B ''of'':30B ''one'':13B ''or'':17B ''out'':23B ''physical'':45B,69B ''pow'':31B ''reach'':22B ''shout'':7B,34B ''slip'':42B ''spirit'':48B ''stat'':63B ''that'':8B,14B ''the'':25B,27B,44B ''this'':33B ''thre'':28B ''to'':12B,24B,41B ''transforms'':9B ''untouch'':67B ''void'':26B ''wher'':64B ''which'':38B,49B,58B ''words'':29B ''world'':46B ''you'':40B,51B,60B,65B ''your'':10B ''zii'':47B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('chaos_damage', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction enchantments that deal randomized elemental damage—fire, frost, or shock—on each strike. This effect can be applied through custom enchanting and is also found on enchanted items, offering versatility in combat.', '''also'':32B ''and'':30B ''appli'':26B ''are'':6B ''be'':25B ''can'':24B ''cha'':1A ''combat'':40B ''custom'':28B ''damag'':2A,14B ''deal'':11B ''destruction'':8B ''each'':20B ''effect'':23B ''effects'':5B ''elemental'':13B ''enchant'':35B ''enchanting'':29B ''enchantments'':9B ''fir'':15B ''found'':33B ''frost'':16B ''in'':39B ''is'':31B ''items'':36B ''magical'':4B ''offensiv'':7B ''offering'':37B ''on'':19B,34B ''or'':17B ''randomiz'':12B ''shock'':18B ''strik'':21B ''that'':10B ''thes'':3B ''this'':22B ''through'':27B ''versatility'':38B', 'mage', 'This enchantment randomly deals fire, frost, or shock damage, making it unpredictable in battle. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bend_will', 'Bend Will is a Shout that allows you to bend the very stones to your will, and as it grows stronger, animals, people, and even dragons are compelled to obey your commands. The three words of power in this Shout are Gol (Earth), which gives you control over the land itself; Hah (Mind), which influences the minds of others; and Dov (Dragon), which allows you to command even dragons to do your bidding.', '''allows'':9B,66B ''and'':19B,26B,62B ''animals'':24B ''are'':29B,43B ''as'':20B ''bend'':1A,3B,12B ''bidding'':75B ''command'':69B ''commands'':34B ''compell'':30B ''control'':49B ''do'':73B ''dov'':63B ''dragon'':64B ''dragons'':28B,71B ''earth'':45B ''even'':27B,70B ''giv'':47B ''gol'':44B ''grows'':22B ''hah'':54B ''in'':40B ''influenc'':57B ''is'':5B ''it'':21B ''itself'':53B ''land'':52B ''mind'':55B ''minds'':59B ''obey'':32B ''of'':38B,60B ''others'':61B ''over'':50B ''peopl'':25B ''pow'':39B ''shout'':7B,42B ''ston'':15B ''strong'':23B ''that'':8B ''the'':13B,35B,51B,58B ''this'':41B ''thre'':36B ''to'':11B,16B,31B,68B,72B ''very'':14B ''which'':46B,56B,65B ''will'':2A,4B,18B ''words'':37B ''you'':10B,48B,67B ''your'':17B,33B,74B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('black_heart_blight', 'Black-Heart Blight is an acute disease that affects strength and endurance, potentially draining the victim''s carry weight. It can be contracted from corprus beasts, other blight monsters, or zombies, allowing the disease to persist even after the end of the Blight in 3E 427. The disease causes lasting effects, weakening the afflicted over time.', '''3e'':49B ''427'':50B ''acut'':10B ''affects'':13B ''afflict'':58B ''after'':42B ''allowing'':36B ''an'':9B ''and'':15B ''be'':26B ''beasts'':30B ''black'':1A,5B ''black-heart'':4B ''blight'':3A,7B,32B,47B ''can'':25B ''carry'':22B ''caus'':53B ''contract'':27B ''corprus'':29B ''dis'':11B,38B,52B ''draining'':18B ''effects'':55B ''end'':44B ''enduranc'':16B ''even'':41B ''from'':28B ''heart'':2A,6B ''in'':48B ''is'':8B ''it'':24B ''lasting'':54B ''monsters'':33B ''of'':45B ''or'':34B ''other'':31B ''over'':59B ''persist'':40B ''potentially'':17B ''s'':21B ''strength'':14B ''that'':12B ''the'':19B,37B,43B,46B,51B,57B ''tim'':60B ''to'':39B ''victim'':20B ''weakening'':56B ''weight'':23B ''zombi'':35B', 'alchemist', 'Black-Heart Blight is an acute disease that affects strength and endurance, potentially draining the victim''s carry weight. It can be contracted from corprus beasts, other blight monsters, or zombies, allowing the disease to persist even after the end of the Blight in 3E 427. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('blizzard', 'Blizzard is a Destruction spell that summons a powerful snowstorm, dealing continuous frost damage to all enemies within its area of effect. It requires a Master skill level to cast.', '''all'':17B ''are'':21B ''blizzard'':1A,2B ''cast'':31B ''continuous'':13B ''damag'':15B ''dealing'':12B ''destruction'':5B ''effect'':23B ''enemi'':18B ''frost'':14B ''is'':3B ''it'':24B ''its'':20B ''level'':29B ''mast'':27B ''of'':22B ''powerful'':10B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''snowstorm'':11B ''spell'':6B ''summons'':8B ''that'':7B ''to'':16B,30B ''within'':19B', 'mage', '
