Bone Break Fever is a disease contracted from rats and bears, causing a loss of strength and stamina. It initially drains your stamina and progresses to more severe stages, draining up to even more stamina at its most crippling. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bound_battleaxe', 'Bound Battleaxe is a Conjuration spell that summons a magical battleaxe made of Daedric energy, serving as a temporary two-handed weapon. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':28B ''apprentic'':29B ''as'':19B ''battleax'':2A,4B,13B ''bound'':1A,3B ''cast'':33B ''conjuration'':7B ''daedric'':16B ''energy'':17B ''hand'':24B ''is'':5B ''it'':26B ''level'':31B ''mad'':14B ''magical'':12B ''of'':15B ''requir'':27B ''serving'':18B ''skill'':30B ''spell'':8B ''summons'':10B ''temporary'':21B ''that'':9B ''to'':32B ''two'':23B ''two-hand'':22B ''weapon'':25B', 'mage', 'Bound Battleaxe is a spell that summons a magical battleaxe made of Daedric energy, providing the caster with a temporary two-handed weapon. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bound_bow', 'Bound Bow is a Conjuration spell that summons a magical bow made of Daedric energy along with a quiver of ethereal arrows, serving as a temporary ranged weapon. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':34B ''along'':18B ''an'':33B ''arrows'':24B ''as'':26B ''bound'':1A,3B ''bow'':2A,4B,13B ''cast'':38B ''conjuration'':7B ''daedric'':16B ''energy'':17B ''ethereal'':23B ''is'':5B ''it'':31B ''level'':36B ''mad'':14B ''magical'':12B ''of'':15B,22B ''quiv'':21B ''rang'':29B ''requir'':32B ''serving'':25B ''skill'':35B ''spell'':8B ''summons'':10B ''temporary'':28B ''that'':9B ''to'':37B ''weapon'':30B ''with'':19B', 'mage', 'Bound Bow is a spell that summons a magical bow made of Daedric energy, along with a quiver of ethereal arrows, providing the caster with a temporary ranged weapon. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bound_dagger', 'Bound Dagger is a Conjuration spell that summons a magical dagger made of Daedric energy, which functions as a temporary weapon. It requires a Novice skill level to cast.', '''as'':20B ''bound'':1A,3B ''cast'':31B ''conjuration'':7B ''daedric'':16B ''dagg'':2A,4B,13B ''energy'':17B ''functions'':19B ''is'':5B ''it'':24B ''level'':29B ''mad'':14B ''magical'':12B ''novic'':27B ''of'':15B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''summons'':10B ''temporary'':22B ''that'':9B ''to'':30B ''weapon'':23B ''which'':18B', 'mage', '
