INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brain_rot', 'Brain Rot is a disease contracted from zombies and hagravens, causing a gradual loss of strength and magicka. As the disease progresses, it severely weakens the victim’s magical abilities and overall physical condition. If left untreated, the disease can lead to debilitating effects, leaving the afflicted unable to effectively use their magicka and becoming significantly weaker.', '''abiliti'':32B ''afflict'':49B ''and'':11B,19B,33B,56B ''as'':21B ''becoming'':57B ''brain'':1A,3B ''can'':42B ''causing'':13B ''condition'':36B ''contract'':8B ''debilitating'':45B ''dis'':7B,23B,41B ''effectively'':52B ''effects'':46B ''from'':9B ''gradual'':15B ''hagravens'':12B ''if'':37B ''is'':5B ''it'':25B ''lead'':43B ''leaving'':47B ''left'':38B ''loss'':16B ''magical'':31B ''magick'':20B,55B ''of'':17B ''overall'':34B ''physical'':35B ''progress'':24B ''rot'':2A,4B ''s'':30B ''severely'':26B ''significantly'':58B ''strength'':18B ''the'':22B,28B,40B,48B,54B ''to'':44B,51B ''unabl'':50B ''untreat'':39B ''use'':53B ''victim'':29B ''weak'':59B ''weakens'':27B ''zombi'':10B', 'alchemist', 'Brain Rot is a disease contracted from zombies and hagravens, causing a gradual loss of strength and magicka. As the disease progresses, it severely weakens the victim’s magical abilities and overall physical condition. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.magicka and becoming significantly weaker.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('briarheart_geis', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction enchantments linked to the Forsworn and their Briarheart warriors. This effect binds life force and magical energy to a harvested briar heart and is available only on enchanted gear, amplifying the wielder;s power.', '''amplifying'':38B ''and'':14B,23B,31B ''are'':6B ''avail'':33B ''binds'':20B ''bri'':29B ''briarheart'':1A,16B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':19B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':36B ''enchantments'':9B ''energy'':25B ''forc'':22B ''forsworn'':13B ''gear'':37B ''geis'':2A ''harvest'':28B ''heart'':30B ''is'':32B ''lif'':21B ''link'':10B ''magical'':4B,24B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':35B ''only'':34B ''pow'':42B ''s'':41B ''the'':12B,15B,39B ''thes'':3B ''this'':18B ''to'':11B,26B ''warriors'':17B ''wield'':40B', 'mage', 'This powerful effect ties someone;s life force to a special heart, making them stronger. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brown_rot', 'Brown Rot is a mild disease that affects a victim''s strength and behavior, causing symptoms such as necrosis and sleeplessness. It can be contracted from draugr and other undead creatures. As the disease progresses, it reduces the effectiveness of light and heavy armor, making it less able to prevent damage, and disrupts sleep, leaving the victim increasingly restless.', '''able'':50B ''affects'':10B ''and'':15B,22B,30B,44B,54B ''armor'':46B ''as'':20B,34B ''be'':26B ''behavior'':16B ''brown'':1A,3B ''can'':25B ''causing'':17B ''contract'':27B ''creatur'':33B ''damag'':53B ''dis'':8B,36B ''disrupts'':55B ''draugr'':29B ''effectiveness'':41B ''from'':28B ''heavy'':45B ''increasingly'':60B ''is'':5B ''it'':24B,38B,48B ''leaving'':57B ''less'':49B ''light'':43B ''making'':47B ''mild'':7B ''necrosis'':21B ''of'':42B ''other'':31B ''prevent'':52B ''progress'':37B ''reduc'':39B ''restless'':61B ''rot'':2A,4B ''s'':13B ''sleep'':56B ''sleeplessness'':23B ''strength'':14B ''such'':19B ''symptoms'':18B ''that'':9B ''the'':35B,40B,58B ''to'':51B ''unde'':32B ''victim'':12B,59B', 'alchemist', 'Brown Rot is a mild disease that affects a victim''s strength and behavior, causing symptoms such as necrosis and sleeplessness. It can be contracted from draugr and other undead creatures. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('call_dragon', 'Call Dragon is a Shout that summons a dragon to aid you in your time of need, specifically calling upon Odahviing. The three words of power in this Shout are Od (Snow), which represents the call to the dragon; Ah (Hunter), which signifies the summoning of a creature of the wild; and Viing (Wing), which invokes the dragon''s wings to bring it forth.', '''ah'':42B ''aid'':13B ''and'':54B ''are'':32B ''bring'':64B ''call'':1A,3B,38B ''calling'':21B ''creatur'':50B ''dragon'':2A,4B,11B,41B,60B ''forth'':66B ''hunt'':43B ''in'':15B,29B ''invok'':58B ''is'':5B ''it'':65B ''need'':19B ''od'':33B ''odahviing'':23B ''of'':18B,27B,48B,51B ''pow'':28B ''represents'':36B ''s'':61B ''shout'':7B,31B ''signifi'':45B ''snow'':34B ''specifically'':20B ''summoning'':47B ''summons'':9B ''that'':8B ''the'':24B,37B,40B,46B,52B,59B ''this'':30B ''thre'':25B ''tim'':17B ''to'':12B,39B,63B ''upon'':22B ''viing'':55B ''which'':35B,44B,57B ''wild'':53B ''wing'':56B ''wings'':62B ''words'':26B ''you'':14B ''your'':16B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('call_of_valour', 'Call of Valor is a Shout that summons the valiant heroes of Sovngarde to aid you, transcending space and time. The three words of power in this Shout are Hun (Hero), which calls upon the brave souls of heroes; Kaal (Champion), which invokes the might of champions; and Zoor (Legend), which summons legendary figures to fight beside you.', '''aid'':18B ''and'':22B,51B ''are'':32B ''besid'':60B ''brav'':39B ''call'':1A,4B ''calls'':36B ''champion'':44B ''champions'':50B ''fight'':59B ''figur'':57B ''her'':14B,34B,42B ''hun'':33B ''in'':29B ''invok'':46B ''is'':7B ''kaal'':43B ''legend'':53B ''legendary'':56B ''might'':48B ''of'':2A,5B,15B,27B,41B,49B ''pow'':28B ''shout'':9B,31B ''souls'':40B ''sovngard'':16B ''spac'':21B ''summons'':11B,55B ''that'':10B ''the'':12B,24B,38B,47B ''this'':30B ''thre'':25B ''tim'':23B ''to'':17B,58B ''transcending'':20B ''upon'':37B ''valiant'':13B ''valor'':6B ''valour'':3A ''which'':35B,45B,54B ''words'':26B ''you'':19B,61B ''zoor'':52B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('call_to_arms', 'Call to Arms is an Illusion spell that boosts the combat abilities of nearby allies, increasing their stamina, health, and attack power for a short period. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''abiliti'':15B ''adept'':33B ''alli'':18B ''an'':8B,32B ''and'':23B ''arms'':3A,6B ''attack'':24B ''boosts'':12B ''call'':1A,4B ''cast'':37B ''combat'':14B ''for'':26B ''health'':22B ''illusion'':9B ''increasing'':19B ''is'':7B ''it'':30B ''level'':35B ''nearby'':17B ''of'':16B ''period'':29B ''pow'':25B ''requir'':31B ''short'':28B ''skill'':34B ''spell'':10B ''stamin'':21B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,20B ''to'':2A,5B,36B', 'mage', 'Call to Arms is a spell that boosts the combat abilities of nearby allies, increasing their stamina, health, and attack power for a short period. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('calm', 'Calm is an Illusion spell that pacifies a target, reducing their hostility and preventing them from attacking. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':4B,21B ''and'':14B ''apprentic'':22B ''attacking'':18B ''calm'':1A,2B ''cast'':26B ''from'':17B ''hostility'':13B ''illusion'':5B ''is'':3B ''it'':19B ''level'':24B ''pacifi'':8B ''preventing'':15B ''reducing'':11B ''requir'':20B ''skill'':23B ''spell'':6B ''target'':10B ''that'':7B ''the'':12B ''them'':16B ''to'':25B', 'mage', 'Calm is a spell that pacifies a target, reducing their hostility and stopping them from attacking. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('circle_of_protection', 'Circle of Protection is a Restoration spell that creates a protective barrier on the ground, which repels undead and daedra from entering the area while healing allies within it. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''alli'':30B ''an'':35B ''and'':22B ''are'':27B ''barri'':15B ''cast'':40B ''circl'':1A,4B ''creat'':12B ''daedr'':23B ''entering'':25B ''expert'':36B ''from'':24B ''ground'':18B ''healing'':29B ''is'':7B ''it'':32B,33B ''level'':38B ''of'':2A,5B ''on'':16B ''protection'':3A,6B ''protectiv'':14B ''repels'':20B ''requir'':34B ''restoration'':9B ''skill'':37B ''spell'':10B ''that'':11B ''the'':17B,26B ''to'':39B ''unde'':21B ''which'':19B ''whil'':28B ''within'':31B', 'mage', 'Circle of Protection is a spell that creates a protective barrier on the ground, repelling undead and daedra from entering the area while healing allies within it. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('clairvoyance', 'Clairvoyance: These magical effects are utility-focused Illusion spells that guide the caster along the correct path to their objective by illuminating a magical trail. This effect is only available as a spell and is commonly used by adventurers to navigate complex terrains or dungeons.', '''adventurers'':41B ''along'':16B ''and'':36B ''are'':6B ''as'':33B ''avail'':32B ''by'':23B,40B ''cast'':15B ''clairvoyanc'':1A,2B ''commonly'':38B ''complex'':44B ''correct'':18B ''dungeons'':47B ''effect'':29B ''effects'':5B ''focus'':9B ''guid'':13B ''illuminating'':24B ''illusion'':10B ''is'':30B,37B ''magical'':4B,26B ''navigat'':43B ''objectiv'':22B ''only'':31B ''or'':46B ''path'':19B ''spell'':35B ''spells'':11B ''terrains'':45B ''that'':12B ''the'':14B,17B,21B ''thes'':3B ''this'':28B ''to'':20B,42B ''trail'':27B ''used'':39B ''utility'':8B ''utility-focus'':7B', 'mage', 'This spell helps you find your way by showing a magical path to your destination. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('clear_skies', 'Clear Skies is a Shout that causes Skyrim itself to yield before the Thu''um, clearing away fog and inclement weather. The three words of power in this Shout are Lok (Sky), which calls upon the power of the heavens; Vah (Spring), which ushers in clear, refreshing weather; and Koor (Summer), which brings warm, clear skies to the land.', '''and'':21B,51B ''are'':32B ''away'':19B ''befor'':14B ''brings'':55B ''calls'':36B ''caus'':9B ''cle'':1A,3B,48B,57B ''clearing'':18B ''fog'':20B ''heavens'':42B ''in'':29B,47B ''inclement'':22B ''is'':5B ''itself'':11B ''koor'':52B ''land'':61B ''lok'':33B ''of'':27B,40B ''pow'':28B,39B ''refreshing'':49B ''shout'':7B,31B ''ski'':2A,4B,58B ''sky'':34B ''skyrim'':10B ''spring'':44B ''summ'':53B ''that'':8B ''the'':15B,24B,38B,41B,60B ''this'':30B ''thre'':25B ''thu'':16B ''to'':12B,59B ''um'':17B ''upon'':37B ''ushers'':46B ''vah'':43B ''warm'':56B ''weath'':23B,50B ''which'':35B,45B,54B ''words'':26B ''yield'':13B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('close_wounds', 'Close Wounds is a Restoration spell that rapidly heals the caster, restoring a significant amount of health. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''amount'':17B ''an'':22B ''cast'':13B,27B ''clos'':1A,3B ''expert'':23B ''heals'':11B ''health'':19B ''is'':5B ''it'':20B ''level'':25B ''of'':18B ''rapidly'':10B ''requir'':21B ''restoration'':7B ''restoring'':14B ''significant'':16B ''skill'':24B ''spell'':8B ''that'':9B ''the'':12B ''to'':26B ''wounds'':2A,4B', 'mage', 'Close Wounds is a spell that rapidly heals the caster, restoring a significant amount of health. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('command', 'These magical effects are offensive Conjuration spells that compel a conjured or summoned entity to obey the caster;s will, overriding its natural behavior. This effect is available as a spell and can also be found on enchanted gear, making it indispensable for skilled conjurers managing Daedric allies.', '''alli'':49B ''also'':35B ''and'':33B ''are'':5B ''as'':30B ''avail'':29B ''be'':36B ''behavior'':25B ''can'':34B ''cast'':19B ''command'':1A ''compel'':10B ''conjur'':12B ''conjuration'':7B ''conjurers'':46B ''daedric'':48B ''effect'':27B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':39B ''entity'':15B ''for'':44B ''found'':37B ''gear'':40B ''indispens'':43B ''is'':28B ''it'':42B ''its'':23B ''magical'':3B ''making'':41B ''managing'':47B ''natural'':24B ''obey'':17B ''offensiv'':6B ''on'':38B ''or'':13B ''overriding'':22B ''s'':20B ''skill'':45B ''spell'':32B ''spells'':8B ''summon'':14B ''that'':9B ''the'':18B ''thes'':2B ''this'':26B ''to'':16B ''will'':21B', 'mage', 'This spell forces a summoned creature to obey the caster, even if it doesn;t want to. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
