INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('dread_zombie', 'Dread Zombie is a Conjuration spell that reanimates a very powerful dead body to fight for the caster for a limited time. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''an'':27B ''body'':15B ''cast'':20B,32B ''conjuration'':7B ''dead'':14B ''dre'':1A,3B ''expert'':28B ''fight'':17B ''for'':18B,21B ''is'':5B ''it'':25B ''level'':30B ''limit'':23B ''powerful'':13B ''reanimat'':10B ''requir'':26B ''skill'':29B ''spell'':8B ''that'':9B ''the'':19B ''tim'':24B ''to'':16B,31B ''very'':12B ''zombi'':2A,4B', 'mage', '
Dread Zombie is a spell that reanimates a very powerful dead body, bringing it back to life to fight for the caster for a short time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('droops', 'Droops is a serious disease that weakens a victim''s strength and ability to use weapons, leading to weak and flaccid muscle tissues. It can be contracted from all forms and stages of kwama, as well as from sheep and ash hoppers. As the disease progresses, it significantly reduces the effectiveness of the afflicted''s combat abilities, particularly with one-handed and two-handed weapons.', '''abiliti'':58B ''ability'':14B ''afflict'':55B ''all'':30B ''and'':13B,21B,32B,41B,64B ''as'':36B,38B,44B ''ash'':42B ''be'':27B ''can'':26B ''combat'':57B ''contract'':28B ''dis'':6B,46B ''droops'':1A,2B ''effectiveness'':52B ''flacc'':22B ''forms'':31B ''from'':29B,39B ''hand'':63B,67B ''hoppers'':43B ''is'':3B ''it'':25B,48B ''kwam'':35B ''leading'':18B ''muscl'':23B ''of'':34B,53B ''one'':62B ''one-hand'':61B ''particularly'':59B ''progress'':47B ''reduc'':50B ''s'':11B,56B ''serious'':5B ''sheep'':40B ''significantly'':49B ''stag'':33B ''strength'':12B ''that'':7B ''the'':45B,51B,54B ''tissu'':24B ''to'':15B,19B ''two'':66B ''two-hand'':65B ''use'':16B ''victim'':10B ''weak'':20B ''weakens'':8B ''weapons'':17B,68B ''well'':37B ''with'':60B', 'alchemist', 'Droops is a serious disease that weakens a victim''s strength and ability to use weapons, leading to weak and flaccid muscle tissues. It can be contracted from all forms and stages of kwama, as well as from sheep and ash hoppers. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('dur_neh_viir', 'Summon Durnehviir is a Shout that calls upon Durnehviir, summoning him from the Soul Cairn to aid you in your time of need. The three words of power in this Shout are Dur (Curse), which invokes the dark power of the Soul Cairn; Neh (Never), which calls Durnehviir from his eternal rest; and Viir (Dying), which brings him forth from the afterlife to fight alongside you.', '''afterlif'':65B ''aid'':20B ''alongsid'':68B ''and'':56B ''are'':35B ''brings'':60B ''cairn'':18B,46B ''calls'':10B,50B ''curs'':37B ''dark'':41B ''dur'':1A,36B ''durnehvi'':5B,12B,51B ''dying'':58B ''eternal'':54B ''fight'':67B ''forth'':62B ''from'':15B,52B,63B ''him'':14B,61B ''his'':53B ''in'':22B,32B ''invok'':39B ''is'':6B ''need'':26B ''neh'':2A,47B ''nev'':48B ''of'':25B,30B,43B ''pow'':31B,42B ''rest'':55B ''shout'':8B,34B ''soul'':17B,45B ''summon'':4B ''summoning'':13B ''that'':9B ''the'':16B,27B,40B,44B,64B ''this'':33B ''thre'':28B ''tim'':24B ''to'':19B,66B ''upon'':11B ''viir'':3A,57B ''which'':38B,49B,59B ''words'':29B ''you'':21B,69B ''your'':23B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ebonyflesh', 'Ebonyflesh is an Alteration spell that greatly increases the caster''s armor rating for a short duration, providing substantial protection. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''alteration'':5B ''an'':4B,24B ''armor'':13B ''cast'':11B,29B ''duration'':18B ''ebonyflesh'':1A,2B ''expert'':25B ''for'':15B ''greatly'':8B ''incre'':9B ''is'':3B ''it'':22B ''level'':27B ''protection'':21B ''providing'':19B ''rating'':14B ''requir'':23B ''s'':12B ''short'':17B ''skill'':26B ''spell'':6B ''substantial'':20B ''that'':7B ''the'':10B ''to'':28B', 'mage', 'Ebonyflesh is a spell that makes the caster’s skin as strong as ebony, offering powerful protection for a short time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('elemental_fury', 'Elemental Fury is a Shout that imbues your arms with the speed of wind, allowing for faster weapon strikes. The three words of power in this Shout are Su (Air), which grants you the swiftness of wind; Grah (Battle), which enhances your combat prowess; and Dun (Grace), which allows for more fluid and rapid attacks.', '''air'':32B ''allowing'':17B ''allows'':51B ''and'':47B,55B ''are'':30B ''arms'':11B ''attacks'':57B ''battl'':41B ''combat'':45B ''dun'':48B ''elemental'':1A,3B ''enhanc'':43B ''fast'':19B ''flu'':54B ''for'':18B,52B ''fury'':2A,4B ''grac'':49B ''grah'':40B ''grants'':34B ''imbu'':9B ''in'':27B ''is'':5B ''mor'':53B ''of'':15B,25B,38B ''pow'':26B ''prowess'':46B ''rap'':56B ''shout'':7B,29B ''spe'':14B ''strik'':21B ''swiftness'':37B ''that'':8B ''the'':13B,22B,36B ''this'':28B ''thre'':23B ''weapon'':20B ''which'':33B,42B,50B ''wind'':16B,39B ''with'':12B ''words'':24B ''you'':35B ''your'':10B,44B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('equilibrium', 'Equilibrium is an Alteration spell that converts the caster''s health into magicka at a steady rate, allowing for sustained casting at the cost of vitality. It requires a Novice skill level to cast.', '''allowing'':19B ''alteration'':5B ''an'':4B ''at'':15B,23B ''cast'':10B,35B ''casting'':22B ''converts'':8B ''cost'':25B ''equilibrium'':1A,2B ''for'':20B ''health'':12B ''into'':13B ''is'':3B ''it'':28B ''level'':33B ''magick'':14B ''novic'':31B ''of'':26B ''rat'':18B ''requir'':29B ''s'':11B ''skill'':32B ''spell'':6B ''steady'':17B ''sustain'':21B ''that'':7B ''the'':9B,24B ''to'':34B ''vitality'':27B', 'mage', 'Equilibrium is a spell that drains the caster''s health to refill their magicka, letting them cast more spells but weakening their body. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('expel_daedra', 'Expel Daedra is a Conjuration spell that banishes a summoned Daedra back to Oblivion and works on more powerful Daedra than the standard banishment spells. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''an'':30B ''and'':17B ''back'':14B ''banish'':10B ''banishment'':26B ''cast'':35B ''conjuration'':7B ''daedr'':2A,4B,13B,22B ''expel'':1A,3B ''expert'':31B ''is'':5B ''it'':28B ''level'':33B ''mor'':20B ''oblivion'':16B ''on'':19B ''powerful'':21B ''requir'':29B ''skill'':32B ''spell'':8B ''spells'':27B ''standard'':25B ''summon'':12B ''than'':23B ''that'':9B ''the'':24B ''to'':15B,34B ''works'':18B', 'mage', 'Expel Daedra is a spell that banishes a summoned Daedra back to Oblivion, and it is effective against more powerful Daedra than the standard banishment spells. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('faas_ru_maar', 'Dismay is a Shout that causes fear, making the weak flee in terror before the power of the Thu''um. The three words of power in this Shout are Faas (Fear), which instills dread in the hearts of enemies; Ru (Run), which compels them to flee in panic; and Maar (Terror), which deepens their fear, causing them to flee in absolute terror.', '''absolut'':64B ''and'':52B ''are'':32B ''befor'':17B ''caus'':9B ''causing'':59B ''compels'':46B ''deepens'':56B ''dismay'':4B ''dre'':37B ''enemi'':42B ''faas'':1A,33B ''fear'':10B,34B,58B ''fle'':14B,49B,62B ''hearts'':40B ''in'':15B,29B,38B,50B,63B ''instills'':36B ''is'':5B ''maar'':3A,53B ''making'':11B ''of'':20B,27B,41B ''panic'':51B ''pow'':19B,28B ''ru'':2A,43B ''run'':44B ''shout'':7B,31B ''terror'':16B,54B,65B ''that'':8B ''the'':12B,18B,21B,24B,39B,57B ''them'':47B,60B ''this'':30B ''thre'':25B ''thu'':22B ''to'':48B,61B ''um'':23B ''weak'':13B ''which'':35B,45B,55B ''words'':26B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fast', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Illusion enchantments that enhance the caster;s speed, allowing for quicker movement and evasion. This effect is available only on enchanted items, making it a rare boon for those prioritizing agility.', '''agility'':39B ''allowing'':17B ''and'':21B ''are'':5B ''avail'':26B ''boon'':35B ''cast'':14B ''effect'':24B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':29B ''enchantments'':10B ''enhanc'':12B ''evasion'':22B ''fast'':1A ''focus'':8B ''for'':18B,36B ''illusion'':9B ''is'':25B ''it'':32B ''items'':30B ''magical'':3B ''making'':31B ''movement'':20B ''on'':28B ''only'':27B ''prioritizing'':38B ''quick'':19B ''rar'':34B ''s'':15B ''spe'':16B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B ''thes'':2B ''this'':23B ''thos'':37B ''utility'':7B ''utility-focus'':6B', 'mage', 'This enchantment makes you faster, helping you move quickly and avoid danger. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fear', 'These magical effects are offensive Illusion spells that cause the target to flee in terror, exploiting their deepest insecurities. This effect is widely available as a spell, can be found in pre-crafted potions, brewed into custom potions, or applied as an enchantment to weapons or armor. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Fear effect: Blue Dartwing, Namira''s Rot, Powdered Mammoth Tusk, Sabre Cat Eye', '''an'':44B ''appli'':42B ''are'':5B ''armor'':49B ''as'':26B,43B ''at'':52B ''avail'':25B ''be'':30B ''blu'':72B ''brew'':37B ''can'':29B ''cat'':81B ''caus'':10B ''combining'':51B ''craft'':35B ''creat'':65B ''custom'':39B ''dartwing'':73B ''deepest'':19B ''effect'':22B,63B,71B ''effects'':4B ''enchantment'':45B ''exploiting'':17B ''eye'':82B ''fear'':1A,70B ''fle'':14B ''following'':57B ''found'':31B ''generally'':50B ''illusion'':7B ''in'':15B,32B ''ingredients'':58B ''insecuriti'':20B ''into'':38B ''is'':23B ''least'':53B ''magical'':3B ''mammoth'':78B ''namir'':74B ''of'':55B ''offensiv'':6B ''or'':41B,48B ''potion'':67B ''potions'':36B,40B ''powder'':77B ''pre'':34B ''pre-craft'':33B ''provid'':59B ''rot'':76B ''s'':75B ''sabr'':80B ''shar'':61B ''spell'':28B ''spells'':8B ''target'':12B ''terror'':16B ''that'':9B ''the'':11B,18B,56B,69B ''thes'':2B ''they'':60B ''this'':21B,62B ''to'':13B,46B ''tusk'':79B ''two'':54B ''weapons'':47B ''widely'':24B ''will'':64B ''with'':68B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This spell makes enemies so scared they run away and won;t fight for a while. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('feim_zii_gron', 'Become Ethereal is a Shout that transforms your form to one that cannot harm or be harmed, as it reaches out to the Void. The three words of power in this Shout are Feim (Fade), which allows you to slip from the physical world; Zii (Spirit), which grants you a ghostly form; and Gron (Bind), which anchors you in a state where you are untouchable by physical harm.', '''allows'':40B ''anchors'':60B ''and'':56B ''are'':36B,67B ''as'':21B ''be'':19B ''becom'':4B ''bind'':58B ''by'':69B ''cannot'':16B ''ethereal'':5B ''fad'':38B ''feim'':1A,37B ''form'':12B,55B ''from'':44B ''ghostly'':54B ''grants'':51B ''gron'':3A,57B ''harm'':17B,20B,71B ''in'':33B,62B ''is'':6B ''it'':22B ''of'':31B ''one'':14B ''or'':18B ''out'':24B ''physical'':46B,70B ''pow'':32B ''reach'':23B ''shout'':8B,35B ''slip'':43B ''spirit'':49B ''stat'':64B ''that'':9B,15B ''the'':26B,28B,45B ''this'':34B ''thre'':29B ''to'':13B,25B,42B ''transforms'':10B ''untouch'':68B ''void'':27B ''wher'':65B ''which'':39B,50B,59B ''words'':30B ''world'':47B ''you'':41B,52B,61B,66B ''your'':11B ''zii'':2A,48B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fiery_soul_trap', 'These magical effects are offensive Conjuration & Destruction enchantments that combine fire damage with the ability to trap a defeated foe;s soul in a soul gem. This effect is available on enchanted weapons and through custom enchanting, bridging the gap between Destruction and Conjuration magic.', '''ability'':18B ''and'':37B,46B ''are'':7B ''avail'':33B ''betw'':44B ''bridging'':41B ''combin'':13B ''conjuration'':9B,47B ''custom'':39B ''damag'':15B ''defeat'':22B ''destruction'':10B,45B ''effect'':31B ''effects'':6B ''enchant'':35B ''enchanting'':40B ''enchantments'':11B ''fiery'':1A ''fir'':14B ''foe'':23B ''gap'':43B ''gem'':29B ''in'':26B ''is'':32B ''magic'':48B ''magical'':5B ''offensiv'':8B ''on'':34B ''s'':24B ''soul'':2A,25B,28B ''that'':12B ''the'':17B,42B ''thes'':4B ''this'':30B ''through'':38B ''to'':19B ''trap'':3A,20B ''weapons'':36B ''with'':16B', 'mage', 'This effect combines fire damage and soul trapping, capturing a soul when the enemy is defeated. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fire_breath', 'Fire Breath is a Shout that allows you to inhale air and exhale a powerful flame, creating an inferno. The three words of power in this Shout are Yol (Fire), which conjures the flames; Toor (Inferno), which intensifies the blaze into a fiery eruption; and Shul (Sun), which amplifies the heat and power of the flames to scorch your enemies.', '''air'':13B ''allows'':9B ''amplifi'':51B ''an'':20B ''and'':14B,47B,54B ''are'':30B ''blaz'':42B ''breath'':2A,4B ''conjur'':34B ''creating'':19B ''enemi'':62B ''eruption'':46B ''exhal'':15B ''fiery'':45B ''fir'':1A,3B,32B ''flam'':18B,36B,58B ''heat'':53B ''in'':27B ''infern'':21B,38B ''inhal'':12B ''intensifi'':40B ''into'':43B ''is'':5B ''of'':25B,56B ''pow'':26B,55B ''powerful'':17B ''scorch'':60B ''shout'':7B,29B ''shul'':48B ''sun'':49B ''that'':8B ''the'':22B,35B,41B,52B,57B ''this'':28B ''thre'':23B ''to'':11B,59B ''toor'':37B ''which'':33B,39B,50B ''words'':24B ''yol'':31B ''you'':10B ''your'':61B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fire_damage', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that deal burning damage over time, reflecting the raw power of flames. This effect is available as a spell, can be applied through custom enchanting, and is also found on enchanted gear, making it a staple for combat mages.', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':37B ''and'':35B ''appli'':31B ''are'':6B ''as'':26B ''avail'':25B ''be'':30B ''burning'':12B ''can'':29B ''combat'':47B ''custom'':33B ''damag'':2A,13B ''deal'':11B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':23B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':40B ''enchanting'':34B ''fir'':1A ''flam'':21B ''for'':46B ''found'':38B ''gear'':41B ''is'':24B,36B ''it'':43B ''mag'':48B ''magical'':4B ''making'':42B ''of'':20B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':39B ''over'':14B ''pow'':19B ''raw'':18B ''reflecting'':16B ''spell'':28B ''stapl'':45B ''that'':10B ''the'':17B ''thes'':3B ''this'':22B ''through'':32B ''tim'':15B', 'mage', 'This spell burns enemies with fire, causing damage over time and making them weaker. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fire_rune', 'Fire Rune is a Destruction spell that places a magical explosive rune on the ground, which detonates when triggered, dealing fire damage to nearby enemies. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':30B ''apprentic'':31B ''cast'':35B ''damag'':24B ''dealing'':22B ''destruction'':7B ''detonat'':19B ''enemi'':27B ''explosiv'':13B ''fir'':1A,3B,23B ''ground'':17B ''is'':5B ''it'':28B ''level'':33B ''magical'':12B ''nearby'':26B ''on'':15B ''plac'':10B ''requir'':29B ''run'':2A,4B,14B ''skill'':32B ''spell'':8B ''that'':9B ''the'':16B ''to'':25B,34B ''trigger'':21B ''when'':20B ''which'':18B', 'mage', 'Fire Rune is a spell that places an explosive rune on the ground, which detonates when triggered, dealing fire damage to nearby enemies. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fire_storm', 'Fire Storm is a Destruction spell that creates a massive explosion of fire, causing intense fire damage over a wide area. It requires a Master skill level to cast.', '''are'':23B ''cast'':31B ''causing'':16B ''creat'':10B ''damag'':19B ''destruction'':7B ''explosion'':13B ''fir'':1A,3B,15B,18B ''intens'':17B ''is'':5B ''it'':24B ''level'':29B ''massiv'':12B ''mast'':27B ''of'':14B ''over'':20B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''storm'':2A,4B ''that'':9B ''to'':30B ''wid'':22B', 'mage', 'Fire Storm is a spell that creates a massive explosion of fire, dealing intense fire damage over a large area. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fo_krah_diin', 'Frost Breath is a Shout that turns your breath into winter, unleashing a blizzard upon your enemies. The three words of power in this Shout are Fo (Frost), which creates the cold winds; Krah (Cold), which deepens the freeze; and Diin (Freeze), which solidifies the freezing effect, encasing foes in ice.', '''and'':43B ''are'':29B ''blizzard'':17B ''breath'':5B,12B ''cold'':35B,38B ''creat'':33B ''deepens'':40B ''diin'':3A,44B ''effect'':50B ''encasing'':51B ''enemi'':20B ''fo'':1A,30B ''foes'':52B ''freez'':42B,45B ''freezing'':49B ''frost'':4B,31B ''ice'':54B ''in'':26B,53B ''into'':13B ''is'':6B ''krah'':2A,37B ''of'':24B ''pow'':25B ''shout'':8B,28B ''solidifi'':47B ''that'':9B ''the'':21B,34B,41B,48B ''this'':27B ''thre'':22B ''turns'':10B ''unleashing'':15B ''upon'':18B ''which'':32B,39B,46B ''winds'':36B ''wint'':14B ''words'':23B ''your'':11B,19B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fortified_combat_healing', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration enchantments that enhance the caster;s ability to regenerate health during combat. This effect is only available on enchanted items, providing warriors with sustained recovery in prolonged battles.', '''ability'':16B ''are'':7B ''avail'':26B ''battl'':37B ''cast'':14B ''combat'':2A,21B ''during'':20B ''effect'':23B ''effects'':6B ''enchant'':28B ''enchantments'':10B ''enhanc'':12B ''fortifi'':1A ''healing'':3A ''health'':19B ''in'':35B ''is'':24B ''items'':29B ''magical'':5B ''on'':27B ''only'':25B ''prolong'':36B ''providing'':30B ''recovery'':34B ''regenerat'':18B ''restoration'':9B ''restorativ'':8B ''s'':15B ''sustain'':33B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B ''thes'':4B ''this'':22B ''to'':17B ''warriors'':31B ''with'':32B', 'mage', 'This enchantment helps you heal faster during fights, keeping you alive longer. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fortify_alchemy', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Restoration enchantments that enhance the potency of crafted potions and poisons, maximizing their effects. This effect is available through custom enchanting and is also found on enchanted gear, making it a favored choice for skilled alchemists.', '''alchemists'':45B ''alchemy'':2A ''also'':33B ''and'':19B,31B ''are'':6B ''avail'':27B ''choic'':42B ''craft'':17B ''custom'':29B ''effect'':25B ''effects'':5B,23B ''enchant'':36B ''enchanting'':30B ''enchantments'':11B ''enhanc'':13B ''favor'':41B ''focus'':9B ''for'':43B ''fortify'':1A ''found'':34B ''gear'':37B ''is'':26B,32B ''it'':39B ''magical'':4B ''making'':38B ''maximizing'':21B ''of'':16B ''on'':35B ''poisons'':20B ''potency'':15B ''potions'':18B ''restoration'':10B ''skill'':44B ''that'':12B ''the'':14B,22B ''thes'':3B ''this'':24B ''through'':28B ''utility'':8B ''utility-focus'':7B', 'mage', 'This enchantment makes potions and poisons you create stronger and more effective. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
