INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fortify_unarmed_damage', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Restoration enchantments that increase the damage dealt with unarmed attacks. This effect is available through custom enchanting and can also be found on enchanted gear, making it highly sought after by brawlers and monks who rely on their fists in combat.', '''after'':40B ''also'':30B ''and'':28B,43B ''are'':7B ''attacks'':20B ''avail'':24B ''be'':31B ''brawlers'':42B ''by'':41B ''can'':29B ''combat'':51B ''custom'':26B ''damag'':3A,16B ''dealt'':17B ''effect'':22B ''effects'':6B ''enchant'':34B ''enchanting'':27B ''enchantments'':12B ''fists'':49B ''focus'':10B ''fortify'':1A ''found'':32B ''gear'':35B ''highly'':38B ''in'':50B ''incre'':14B ''is'':23B ''it'':37B ''magical'':5B ''making'':36B ''monks'':44B ''on'':33B,47B ''rely'':46B ''restoration'':11B ''sought'':39B ''that'':13B ''the'':15B,48B ''thes'':4B ''this'':21B ''through'':25B ''unarm'':2A,19B ''utility'':9B ''utility-focus'':8B ''who'':45B ''with'':18B', 'mage', 'This magic makes unarmed attacks stronger, useful for brawlers who fight with their fists. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('freeze', 'Freeze is an Alteration spell that encases a target in ice, immobilizing them for a brief duration. It requires a Novice skill level to cast.', '''alteration'':5B ''an'':4B ''brief'':17B ''cast'':26B ''duration'':18B ''encas'':8B ''for'':15B ''freez'':1A,2B ''ice'':12B ''immobilizing'':13B ''in'':11B ''is'':3B ''it'':19B ''level'':24B ''novic'':22B ''requir'':20B ''skill'':23B ''spell'':6B ''target'':10B ''that'':7B ''them'':14B ''to'':25B', 'mage', '
Freeze is a spell that encases a target in ice, temporarily immobilizing them. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frenzy', 'These magical effects are offensive Illusion spells that induce uncontrollable aggression in the target, causing them to attack anything nearby. This effect is available as a spell, can be found in pre-crafted potions, brewed into custom potions, and is also found on enchanted items, making it a chaotic choice for combat mages. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Frenzy effect: Blisterwort, Hagraven Claw, Human Heart, Troll Fat', '''aggression'':12B ''also'':43B ''and'':41B ''anything'':20B ''are'':5B ''as'':26B ''at'':58B ''attack'':19B ''avail'':25B ''be'':30B ''blisterwort'':78B ''brew'':37B ''can'':29B ''causing'':16B ''chaotic'':51B ''choic'':52B ''claw'':80B ''combat'':54B ''combining'':57B ''craft'':35B ''creat'':71B ''custom'':39B ''effect'':23B,69B,77B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':46B ''fat'':84B ''following'':63B ''for'':53B ''found'':31B,44B ''frenzy'':1A,76B ''generally'':56B ''hagrav'':79B ''heart'':82B ''hum'':81B ''illusion'':7B ''in'':13B,32B ''induc'':10B ''ingredients'':64B ''into'':38B ''is'':24B,42B ''it'':49B ''items'':47B ''least'':59B ''mag'':55B ''magical'':3B ''making'':48B ''nearby'':21B ''of'':61B ''offensiv'':6B ''on'':45B ''potion'':73B ''potions'':36B,40B ''pre'':34B ''pre-craft'':33B ''provid'':65B ''shar'':67B ''spell'':28B ''spells'':8B ''target'':15B ''that'':9B ''the'':14B,62B,75B ''them'':17B ''thes'':2B ''they'':66B ''this'':22B,68B ''to'':18B ''troll'':83B ''two'':60B ''uncontroll'':11B ''will'':70B ''with'':74B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This spell makes enemies go wild, attacking anything nearby, even their allies. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frenzy_rune', 'Frenzy Rune is an Illusion spell that places a magical rune on the ground, causing any enemy that steps on it to become enraged and attack nearby creatures or people. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':6B,35B ''and'':27B ''any'':18B ''apprentic'':36B ''attack'':28B ''becom'':25B ''cast'':40B ''causing'':17B ''creatur'':30B ''enemy'':19B ''enrag'':26B ''frenzy'':1A,3B ''ground'':16B ''illusion'':7B ''is'':5B ''it'':23B,33B ''level'':38B ''magical'':12B ''nearby'':29B ''on'':14B,22B ''or'':31B ''peopl'':32B ''plac'':10B ''requir'':34B ''run'':2A,4B,13B ''skill'':37B ''spell'':8B ''steps'':21B ''that'':9B,20B ''the'':15B ''to'':24B,39B', 'mage', 'Frenzy Rune is a spell that places a magical rune on the ground, causing any enemy that steps on it to become enraged and attack nearby creatures or people. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frost_breath', 'Frost Breath is a Shout that turns your breath into winter, unleashing a blizzard upon your enemies. The three words of power in this Shout are Fo (Frost), which creates the cold winds; Krah (Cold), which deepens the freeze; and Diin (Freeze), which solidifies the freezing effect, encasing foes in ice.', '''and'':42B ''are'':28B ''blizzard'':16B ''breath'':2A,4B,11B ''cold'':34B,37B ''creat'':32B ''deepens'':39B ''diin'':43B ''effect'':49B ''encasing'':50B ''enemi'':19B ''fo'':29B ''foes'':51B ''freez'':41B,44B ''freezing'':48B ''frost'':1A,3B,30B ''ice'':53B ''in'':25B,52B ''into'':12B ''is'':5B ''krah'':36B ''of'':23B ''pow'':24B ''shout'':7B,27B ''solidifi'':46B ''that'':8B ''the'':20B,33B,40B,47B ''this'':26B ''thre'':21B ''turns'':9B ''unleashing'':14B ''upon'':17B ''which'':31B,38B,45B ''winds'':35B ''wint'':13B ''words'':22B ''your'':10B,18B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frost_cloak', 'Frost Cloak is an Alteration spell that surrounds the caster with a frosty aura, dealing frost damage to nearby enemies and reducing their movement speed. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':31B ''alteration'':7B ''an'':6B,30B ''and'':23B ''aur'':16B ''cast'':12B,35B ''cloak'':2A,4B ''damag'':19B ''dealing'':17B ''enemi'':22B ''frost'':1A,3B,18B ''frosty'':15B ''is'':5B ''it'':28B ''level'':33B ''movement'':26B ''nearby'':21B ''reducing'':24B ''requir'':29B ''skill'':32B ''spe'':27B ''spell'':8B ''surrounds'':10B ''that'':9B ''the'':11B,25B ''to'':20B,34B ''with'':13B', 'mage', '
Frost Cloak is a spell that surrounds the caster with a frosty aura, dealing frost damage to nearby enemies and slowing their movement. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frost_damage', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that inflict cold damage while slowing the target;s movement and attack speed. This effect is available as a spell, can be applied through custom enchanting, and is also found on enchanted items, making it ideal for controlling the battlefield.', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':38B ''and'':20B,36B ''appli'':32B ''are'':6B ''as'':27B ''attack'':21B ''avail'':26B ''battlefield'':49B ''be'':31B ''can'':30B ''cold'':12B ''controlling'':47B ''custom'':34B ''damag'':2A,13B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':24B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':41B ''enchanting'':35B ''for'':46B ''found'':39B ''frost'':1A ''ideal'':45B ''inflict'':11B ''is'':25B,37B ''it'':44B ''items'':42B ''magical'':4B ''making'':43B ''movement'':19B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':40B ''s'':18B ''slowing'':15B ''spe'':22B ''spell'':29B ''target'':17B ''that'':10B ''the'':16B,48B ''thes'':3B ''this'':23B ''through'':33B ''whil'':14B', 'mage', 'This spell freezes enemies, slowing them down and causing them harm with cold magic. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frost_rune', 'Frost Rune is an Alteration spell that places a magical rune on the ground, which explodes in a burst of frost damage when an enemy steps on it. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''alteration'':7B ''an'':6B,26B,33B ''apprentic'':34B ''burst'':21B ''cast'':38B ''damag'':24B ''enemy'':27B ''explod'':18B ''frost'':1A,3B,23B ''ground'':16B ''in'':19B ''is'':5B ''it'':30B,31B ''level'':36B ''magical'':12B ''of'':22B ''on'':14B,29B ''plac'':10B ''requir'':32B ''run'':2A,4B,13B ''skill'':35B ''spell'':8B ''steps'':28B ''that'':9B ''the'':15B ''to'':37B ''when'':25B ''which'':17B', 'mage', 'Frost Rune is a spell that places a magical rune on the ground, which explodes in a burst of frost damage when triggered by an enemy. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frost_thrall', 'Frost Thrall is a Conjuration spell that permanently summons a Frost Atronach to fight for the caster until it is defeated. It requires a Master skill level to cast.', '''atronach'':14B ''cast'':19B,31B ''conjuration'':7B ''defeat'':23B ''fight'':16B ''for'':17B ''frost'':1A,3B,13B ''is'':5B,22B ''it'':21B,24B ''level'':29B ''mast'':27B ''permanently'':10B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''summons'':11B ''that'':9B ''the'':18B ''thrall'':2A,4B ''to'':15B,30B ''until'':20B', 'mage', '
