INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('necromantic_healing', 'Necromantic Healing is a Restoration spell that restores health to the caster or an ally by drawing on the life force of a nearby corpse. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''ally'':17B ''an'':16B,30B ''by'':18B ''cast'':14B,35B ''corps'':27B ''drawing'':19B ''expert'':31B ''forc'':23B ''healing'':2A,4B ''health'':11B ''is'':5B ''it'':28B ''level'':33B ''lif'':22B ''nearby'':26B ''necromantic'':1A,3B ''of'':24B ''on'':20B ''or'':15B ''requir'':29B ''restor'':10B ''restoration'':7B ''skill'':32B ''spell'':8B ''that'':9B ''the'':13B,21B ''to'':12B,34B', 'mage', '
Necromantic Healing is a spell that restores health to the caster or an ally by drawing on the life force of a nearby corpse. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('oakflesh', 'Oakflesh is an Alteration spell that increases the caster''s armor rating for a short duration, providing additional protection. It requires a Novice skill level to cast.', '''additional'':19B ''alteration'':5B ''an'':4B ''armor'':12B ''cast'':10B,28B ''duration'':17B ''for'':14B ''incre'':8B ''is'':3B ''it'':21B ''level'':26B ''novic'':24B ''oakflesh'':1A,2B ''protection'':20B ''providing'':18B ''rating'':13B ''requir'':22B ''s'':11B ''short'':16B ''skill'':25B ''spell'':6B ''that'':7B ''the'':9B ''to'':27B', 'mage', 'Oakflesh is a spell that makes the caster''s skin tougher, like armor, for a little while, helping them take less damage in a fight. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('od_ah_viing', 'Call Dragon is a Shout that summons a dragon to aid you in your time of need, specifically calling upon Odahviing. The three words of power in this Shout are Od (Snow), which represents the call to the dragon; Ah (Hunter), which signifies the summoning of a creature of the wild; and Viing (Wing), which invokes the dragon''s wings to bring it forth.', '''ah'':2A,43B ''aid'':14B ''and'':55B ''are'':33B ''bring'':65B ''call'':4B,39B ''calling'':22B ''creatur'':51B ''dragon'':5B,12B,42B,61B ''forth'':67B ''hunt'':44B ''in'':16B,30B ''invok'':59B ''is'':6B ''it'':66B ''need'':20B ''od'':1A,34B ''odahviing'':24B ''of'':19B,28B,49B,52B ''pow'':29B ''represents'':37B ''s'':62B ''shout'':8B,32B ''signifi'':46B ''snow'':35B ''specifically'':21B ''summoning'':48B ''summons'':10B ''that'':9B ''the'':25B,38B,41B,47B,53B,60B ''this'':31B ''thre'':26B ''tim'':18B ''to'':13B,40B,64B ''upon'':23B ''viing'':3A,56B ''which'':36B,45B,58B ''wild'':54B ''wing'':57B ''wings'':63B ''words'':27B ''you'':15B ''your'':17B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('pacify', 'These magical effects are offensive Illusion spells that calm hostile targets within range, neutralizing aggression and preventing them from attacking. This effect is available as a spell and is also found on enchanted items, making it ideal for resolving conflicts peacefully.', '''aggression'':16B ''also'':31B ''and'':17B,29B ''are'':5B ''as'':26B ''attacking'':21B ''avail'':25B ''calm'':10B ''conflicts'':41B ''effect'':23B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':34B ''for'':39B ''found'':32B ''from'':20B ''hostil'':11B ''ideal'':38B ''illusion'':7B ''is'':24B,30B ''it'':37B ''items'':35B ''magical'':3B ''making'':36B ''neutralizing'':15B ''offensiv'':6B ''on'':33B ''pacify'':1A ''peacefully'':42B ''preventing'':18B ''rang'':14B ''resolving'':40B ''spell'':28B ''spells'':8B ''targets'':12B ''that'':9B ''them'':19B ''thes'':2B ''this'':22B ''within'':13B', 'mage', 'This spell calms angry enemies, making them stop fighting for a while. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('paralyze', 'These magical effects are offensive Alteration spells that immobilize a target completely, rendering them unable to move or act for the spell''s duration. This effect is widely available as a spell, can be found in pre-crafted potions throughout Skyrim, and can also be brewed into custom potions by skilled alchemists. Additionally, this effect can be applied to weapons or armor through enchanting and found on rare enchanted items, making it a versatile tool for crowd control. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Paralyze effect: Briar Heart, Canis Root, Swamp Fungal Pod, Imp Stool, Human Flesh', '''act'':20B ''additionally'':55B ''alchemists'':54B ''also'':46B ''alteration'':7B ''and'':44B,67B ''appli'':60B ''are'':5B ''armor'':64B ''as'':31B ''at'':83B ''avail'':30B ''be'':35B,47B,59B ''brew'':48B ''bri'':103B ''by'':52B ''can'':34B,45B,58B ''canis'':105B ''combining'':82B ''completely'':13B ''control'':80B ''craft'':40B ''creat'':96B ''crowd'':79B ''custom'':50B ''duration'':25B ''effect'':27B,57B,94B,102B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':71B ''enchanting'':66B ''flesh'':113B ''following'':88B ''for'':21B,78B ''found'':36B,68B ''fungal'':108B ''generally'':81B ''heart'':104B ''hum'':112B ''immobiliz'':10B ''imp'':110B ''in'':37B ''ingredients'':89B ''into'':49B ''is'':28B ''it'':74B ''items'':72B ''least'':84B ''magical'':3B ''making'':73B ''mov'':18B ''of'':86B ''offensiv'':6B ''on'':69B ''or'':19B,63B ''paralyz'':1A,101B ''pod'':109B ''potion'':98B ''potions'':41B,51B ''pre'':39B ''pre-craft'':38B ''provid'':90B ''rar'':70B ''rendering'':14B ''root'':106B ''s'':24B ''shar'':92B ''skill'':53B ''skyrim'':43B ''spell'':23B,33B ''spells'':8B ''stool'':111B ''swamp'':107B ''target'':12B ''that'':9B ''the'':22B,87B,100B ''them'':15B ''thes'':2B ''they'':91B ''this'':26B,56B,93B ''through'':65B ''throughout'':42B ''to'':17B,61B ''tool'':77B ''two'':85B ''unabl'':16B ''versatil'':76B ''weapons'':62B ''widely'':29B ''will'':95B ''with'':99B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic freezes someone in place, so they can;t move for a short time. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('poison_damage', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that gradually deplete the target;s health through toxins. This effect is available in pre-crafted poisons, can be brewed into custom potions, and is a favored tool of stealthy adventurers.', '''abiliti'':9B ''adventurers'':41B ''and'':34B ''are'':6B ''avail'':22B ''be'':29B ''brew'':30B ''can'':28B ''craft'':26B ''custom'':32B ''damag'':2A ''deplet'':12B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':20B ''effects'':5B ''favor'':37B ''gradually'':11B ''health'':16B ''in'':23B ''into'':31B ''is'':21B,35B ''magical'':4B ''of'':39B ''offensiv'':7B ''poison'':1A ''poisons'':27B ''potions'':33B ''pre'':25B ''pre-craft'':24B ''s'':15B ''stealthy'':40B ''target'':14B ''that'':10B ''the'':13B ''thes'':3B ''this'':19B ''through'':17B ''tool'':38B ''toxins'':18B', 'mage', 'This effect poisons enemies, slowly draining their health over time. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('poison_rune', 'Poison Rune is an Alteration spell that places a magical rune on the ground, which explodes with a burst of toxic gas, dealing poison damage to any enemies who step on it. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''alteration'':7B ''an'':6B,37B ''any'':29B ''apprentic'':38B ''burst'':21B ''cast'':42B ''damag'':27B ''dealing'':25B ''enemi'':30B ''explod'':18B ''gas'':24B ''ground'':16B ''is'':5B ''it'':34B,35B ''level'':40B ''magical'':12B ''of'':22B ''on'':14B,33B ''plac'':10B ''poison'':1A,3B,26B ''requir'':36B ''run'':2A,4B,13B ''skill'':39B ''spell'':8B ''step'':32B ''that'':9B ''the'':15B ''to'':28B,41B ''toxic'':23B ''which'':17B ''who'':31B ''with'':19B', 'mage', '
Poison Rune is a spell that places a magical rune on the ground, which detonates with toxic gas, dealing poison damage to any enemies who step on it. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('raan_mir_tah', 'Animal Allegiance is a Shout that calls upon the beasts of the wild to fight in your defense, with the three words of power being Raan (Animal), which summons the animals; Mir (Allegiance), which binds them to your cause; and Tah (Pack), which rallies them into a united group to fight alongside you.', '''allegianc'':5B,36B ''alongsid'':55B ''and'':43B ''animal'':4B,30B ''animals'':34B ''beasts'':13B ''being'':28B ''binds'':38B ''calls'':10B ''caus'':42B ''defens'':21B ''fight'':18B,54B ''group'':52B ''in'':19B ''into'':49B ''is'':6B ''mir'':2A,35B ''of'':14B,26B ''pack'':45B ''pow'':27B ''raan'':1A,29B ''ralli'':47B ''shout'':8B ''summons'':32B ''tah'':3A,44B ''that'':9B ''the'':12B,15B,23B,33B ''them'':39B,48B ''thre'':24B ''to'':17B,40B,53B ''unit'':51B ''upon'':11B ''which'':31B,37B,46B ''wild'':16B ''with'':22B ''words'':25B ''you'':56B ''your'':20B,41B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('raise_zombie', 'Raise Zombie is a Conjuration spell that reanimates a weak dead body to fight for the caster for a limited time. It requires a Novice skill level to cast.', '''body'':14B ''cast'':19B,31B ''conjuration'':7B ''dead'':13B ''fight'':16B ''for'':17B,20B ''is'':5B ''it'':24B ''level'':29B ''limit'':22B ''novic'':27B ''rais'':1A,3B ''reanimat'':10B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''that'':9B ''the'':18B ''tim'':23B ''to'':15B,30B ''weak'':12B ''zombi'':2A,4B', 'mage', '
Raise Zombie is a spell that brings a dead body back to life, reanimating it to fight for the caster for a short time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rally', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Illusion spells that bolster the morale and combat abilities of allies within range, increasing their health and stamina. This effect is available as a spell and can also be found on enchanted items, making it a key spell for inspiring groups during battle.', '''abiliti'':17B ''alli'':19B ''also'':36B ''and'':15B,25B,34B ''are'':5B ''as'':31B ''avail'':30B ''battl'':51B ''be'':37B ''bolst'':12B ''can'':35B ''combat'':16B ''during'':50B ''effect'':28B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':40B ''focus'':8B ''for'':47B ''found'':38B ''groups'':49B ''health'':24B ''illusion'':9B ''increasing'':22B ''inspiring'':48B ''is'':29B ''it'':43B ''items'':41B ''key'':45B ''magical'':3B ''making'':42B ''moral'':14B ''of'':18B ''on'':39B ''rally'':1A ''rang'':21B ''spell'':33B,46B ''spells'':10B ''stamin'':26B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,23B ''thes'':2B ''this'':27B ''utility'':7B ''utility-focus'':6B ''within'':20B', 'mage', 'This magic inspires your allies, giving them more energy and strength to fight. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rattles', 'Rattles is a mild disease that affects a victim''s willpower and dexterity, causing muscle spasms, listlessness, and poor stamina. It can be contracted from nix-hounds, zombies, and chaurus. As the disease progresses, it hinders stamina recovery, eventually causing the victim to lose the ability to recover stamina entirely if untreated.', '''ability'':48B ''affects'':8B ''and'':13B,19B,31B ''as'':33B ''be'':24B ''can'':23B ''causing'':15B,42B ''chaurus'':32B ''contract'':25B ''dexterity'':14B ''dis'':6B,35B ''entirely'':52B ''eventually'':41B ''from'':26B ''hinders'':38B ''hounds'':29B ''if'':53B ''is'':3B ''it'':22B,37B ''listlessness'':18B ''los'':46B ''mild'':5B ''muscl'':16B ''nix'':28B ''nix-hounds'':27B ''poor'':20B ''progress'':36B ''rattl'':1A,2B ''recov'':50B ''recovery'':40B ''s'':11B ''spasms'':17B ''stamin'':21B,39B,51B ''that'':7B ''the'':34B,43B,47B ''to'':45B,49B ''untreat'':54B ''victim'':10B,44B ''willpow'':12B ''zombi'':30B', 'alchemist', 'Rattles is a mild disease that affects a victim''s willpower and dexterity, causing muscle spasms, listlessness, and poor stamina. It can be contracted from nix-hounds, zombies, and chaurus. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ravage_health', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that permanently reduce the target;s maximum health, weakening their overall endurance. This effect can only be brewed into custom potions, making it a specialized choice for skilled alchemists. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Ravage Health effect: Cyrodilic Spadetail, Giant Lichen, Jazbay Grapes, Sabre Cat Eye, Scathecraw, Silverside Perch, Skeever Tail', '''abiliti'':9B ''alchemists'':38B ''are'':6B ''at'':41B ''be'':26B ''brew'':27B ''can'':24B ''cat'':69B ''choic'':35B ''combining'':40B ''creat'':54B ''custom'':29B ''cyrodilic'':62B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':23B,52B,61B ''effects'':5B ''enduranc'':21B ''eye'':70B ''following'':46B ''for'':36B ''generally'':39B ''giant'':64B ''grap'':67B ''health'':2A,17B,60B ''ingredients'':47B ''into'':28B ''it'':32B ''jazbay'':66B ''least'':42B ''lich'':65B ''magical'':4B ''making'':31B ''maximum'':16B ''of'':44B ''offensiv'':7B ''only'':25B ''overall'':20B ''perch'':73B ''permanently'':11B ''potion'':56B ''potions'':30B ''provid'':48B ''ravag'':1A,59B ''reduc'':12B ''s'':15B ''sabr'':68B ''scathecraw'':71B ''shar'':50B ''silversid'':72B ''skeev'':74B ''skill'':37B ''spadetail'':63B ''specializ'':34B ''tail'':75B ''target'':14B ''that'':10B ''the'':13B,19B,45B,58B ''thes'':3B ''they'':49B ''this'':22B,51B ''two'':43B ''weakening'':18B ''will'':53B ''with'':57B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This effect permanently lowers an enemy''s health, making them weaker overall. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ravage_magicka', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that permanently reduce the target;s maximum magicka, crippling their ability to cast higher-level spells. This effect can only be brewed into custom potions, making it a tactical tool against mages. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Ravage Magicka effect: Alocasia Fruit, Frost Mirriam, Grass Pod, Lavender, Orange Dartwing, Red Mountain Flower, Scathecraw, Spawn Ash, White Cap', '''abiliti'':9B ''ability'':20B ''against'':41B ''alocasi'':66B ''are'':6B ''ash'':80B ''at'':45B ''be'':31B ''brew'':32B ''can'':29B ''cap'':82B ''cast'':22B ''combining'':44B ''creat'':58B ''crippling'':18B ''custom'':34B ''dartwing'':74B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':28B,56B,65B ''effects'':5B ''flow'':77B ''following'':50B ''frost'':68B ''fruit'':67B ''generally'':43B ''grass'':70B ''high'':24B ''higher-level'':23B ''ingredients'':51B ''into'':33B ''it'':37B ''lavend'':72B ''least'':46B ''level'':25B ''mag'':42B ''magical'':4B ''magick'':2A,17B,64B ''making'':36B ''maximum'':16B ''mirriam'':69B ''mountain'':76B ''of'':48B ''offensiv'':7B ''only'':30B ''orang'':73B ''permanently'':11B ''pod'':71B ''potion'':60B ''potions'':35B ''provid'':52B ''ravag'':1A,63B ''red'':75B ''reduc'':12B ''s'':15B ''scathecraw'':78B ''shar'':54B ''spawn'':79B ''spells'':26B ''tactical'':39B ''target'':14B ''that'':10B ''the'':13B,19B,49B,62B ''thes'':3B ''they'':53B ''this'':27B,55B ''to'':21B ''tool'':40B ''two'':47B ''whit'':81B ''will'':57B ''with'':61B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic reduces how much magicka an enemy can have, making it harder for them to cast spells. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ravage_stamina', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that permanently reduce the target;s maximum stamina, hindering their ability to perform physical actions. This effect can only be brewed into custom potions, providing a significant advantage in prolonged physical combat. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Ravage Stamina effect: Bee, Berit;s Ashes, Bone Meal, Bungler;s Bane, Deathbell, Honeycomb, Scathecraw, Spawn Ash, Thistle Branch', '''abiliti'':9B ''ability'':20B ''actions'':24B ''advantag'':37B ''are'':6B ''ash'':78B ''ashes'':68B ''at'':44B ''ban'':73B ''be'':29B ''bee'':65B ''berit'':66B ''bon'':69B ''branch'':80B ''brew'':30B ''bungl'':71B ''can'':27B ''combat'':41B ''combining'':43B ''creat'':57B ''custom'':32B ''deathbell'':74B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':26B,55B,64B ''effects'':5B ''following'':49B ''generally'':42B ''hindering'':18B ''honeycomb'':75B ''in'':38B ''ingredients'':50B ''into'':31B ''least'':45B ''magical'':4B ''maximum'':16B ''meal'':70B ''of'':47B ''offensiv'':7B ''only'':28B ''perform'':22B ''permanently'':11B ''physical'':23B,40B ''potion'':59B ''potions'':33B ''prolong'':39B ''provid'':51B ''providing'':34B ''ravag'':1A,62B ''reduc'':12B ''s'':15B,67B,72B ''scathecraw'':76B ''shar'':53B ''significant'':36B ''spawn'':77B ''stamin'':2A,17B,63B ''target'':14B ''that'':10B ''the'':13B,19B,48B,61B ''thes'':3B ''they'':52B ''this'':25B,54B ''thistl'':79B ''to'':21B ''two'':46B ''will'':56B ''with'':60B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This effect lowers an enemy''s stamina permanently, making them less effective in combat. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('reanimate', 'These magical effects are offensive Conjuration spells that bring a corpse back to life as a temporary thrall to serve the caster. This effect is available as a spell and can also be found on enchanted gear, reflecting the darker aspects of Conjuration magic.', '''also'':33B ''and'':31B ''are'':5B ''as'':16B,28B ''aspects'':42B ''avail'':27B ''back'':13B ''be'':34B ''bring'':10B ''can'':32B ''cast'':23B ''conjuration'':7B,44B ''corps'':12B ''dark'':41B ''effect'':25B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':37B ''found'':35B ''gear'':38B ''is'':26B ''lif'':15B ''magic'':45B ''magical'':3B ''of'':43B ''offensiv'':6B ''on'':36B ''reanimat'':1A ''reflecting'':39B ''serv'':21B ''spell'':30B ''spells'':8B ''temporary'':18B ''that'':9B ''the'':22B,40B ''thes'':2B ''this'':24B ''thrall'':19B ''to'':14B,20B', 'mage', 'This magic brings a dead body back to life to fight for you, but only for a little while. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('reanimate_corpse', 'Reanimate Corpse is a Conjuration spell that raises a more powerful dead body to fight for the caster for a limited time. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''an'':27B ''apprentic'':28B ''body'':15B ''cast'':20B,32B ''conjuration'':7B ''corps'':2A,4B ''dead'':14B ''fight'':17B ''for'':18B,21B ''is'':5B ''it'':25B ''level'':30B ''limit'':23B ''mor'':12B ''powerful'':13B ''rais'':10B ''reanimat'':1A,3B ''requir'':26B ''skill'':29B ''spell'':8B ''that'':9B ''the'':19B ''tim'':24B ''to'':16B,31B', 'mage', '
Reanimate Corpse is a spell that raises a more powerful dead body, reanimating it to fight for the caster for a short time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('regenerate_health', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration abilities that gradually restore health over time. This effect is available as a spell, in pre-crafted potions, brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items, making it a versatile choice for both mages and adventurers. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Regenerate Health effect: Garlic, Juniper Berries, Luna Moth Wing, Namira''s Rot', '''abiliti'':9B ''adventurers'':49B ''also'':34B ''and'':32B,48B ''appli'':36B ''are'':6B ''as'':20B ''at'':52B ''avail'':19B ''be'':35B ''berri'':75B ''both'':46B ''brew'':28B ''can'':33B ''choic'':44B ''combining'':51B ''craft'':26B ''creat'':65B ''custom'':30B ''effect'':17B,63B,72B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':38B ''following'':57B ''for'':45B ''garlic'':73B ''generally'':50B ''gradually'':11B ''health'':2A,13B,71B ''in'':23B ''ingredients'':58B ''into'':29B ''is'':18B ''it'':41B ''items'':39B ''junip'':74B ''least'':53B ''lun'':76B ''mag'':47B ''magical'':4B ''making'':40B ''moth'':77B ''namir'':79B ''of'':55B ''over'':14B ''potion'':67B ''potions'':27B,31B ''pre'':25B ''pre-craft'':24B ''provid'':59B ''regenerat'':1A,70B ''restor'':12B ''restoration'':8B ''restorativ'':7B ''rot'':81B ''s'':80B ''shar'':61B ''spell'':22B ''that'':10B ''the'':56B,69B ''thes'':3B ''they'':60B ''this'':16B,62B ''tim'':15B ''to'':37B ''two'':54B ''versatil'':43B ''will'':64B ''wing'':78B ''with'':68B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic slowly restores your health over time, helping you recover from injuries. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('restore_health_to_undead', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration spells that uniquely restore vitality to undead creatures, sustaining their unnatural existence. This effect is only available as a spell, reflecting the darker uses of Restoration magic.', '''are'':8B ''as'':28B ''avail'':27B ''creatur'':18B ''dark'':33B ''effect'':24B ''effects'':7B ''existenc'':22B ''health'':2A ''is'':25B ''magic'':37B ''magical'':6B ''of'':35B ''only'':26B ''reflecting'':31B ''restor'':1A,14B ''restoration'':10B,36B ''restorativ'':9B ''spell'':30B ''spells'':11B ''sustaining'':19B ''that'':12B ''the'':20B,32B ''thes'':5B ''this'':23B ''to'':3A,16B ''unde'':4A,17B ''uniquely'':13B ''unnatural'':21B ''uses'':34B ''vitality'':15B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic restores health to undead creatures, keeping them alive and able to fight. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('regenerate_magicka', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration abilities that gradually replenish the caster;s magicka reserves. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items, making it vital for sustained spellcasting. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Regenerate Magicka effect: Ectoplasm, Garlic, Jazbay Grapes, Moon Sugar, Red Mountain Flower, Taproot', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':35B ''and'':33B ''appli'':37B ''are'':6B ''at'':49B ''avail'':21B ''be'':28B,36B ''brew'':29B ''can'':27B,34B ''cast'':14B ''combining'':48B ''craft'':25B ''creat'':62B ''custom'':31B ''ectoplasm'':70B ''effect'':19B,60B,69B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':39B ''flow'':78B ''following'':54B ''for'':44B ''garlic'':71B ''generally'':47B ''gradually'':11B ''grap'':73B ''in'':22B ''ingredients'':55B ''into'':30B ''is'':20B ''it'':42B ''items'':40B ''jazbay'':72B ''least'':50B ''magical'':4B ''magick'':2A,16B,68B ''making'':41B ''moon'':74B ''mountain'':77B ''of'':52B ''potion'':64B ''potions'':26B,32B ''pre'':24B ''pre-craft'':23B ''provid'':56B ''red'':76B ''regenerat'':1A,67B ''replenish'':12B ''reserv'':17B ''restoration'':8B ''restorativ'':7B ''s'':15B ''shar'':58B ''spellcasting'':46B ''sug'':75B ''sustain'':45B ''taproot'':79B ''that'':10B ''the'':13B,53B,66B ''thes'':3B ''they'':57B ''this'':18B,59B ''to'':38B ''two'':51B ''vital'':43B ''will'':61B ''with'':65B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic helps your magicka come back faster, so you can keep casting spells. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('regenerate_stamina', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration abilities that gradually restore stamina over time, allowing for prolonged physical activity. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted gear, making it valuable for warriors and thieves alike. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Regenerate Stamina effect: Bee, Fly Amanita, Mora Tapinella, Scaly Pholiota', '''abiliti'':9B ''activity'':20B ''alik'':51B ''allowing'':16B ''also'':38B ''amanit'':77B ''and'':36B,49B ''appli'':40B ''are'':6B ''at'':54B ''avail'':24B ''be'':31B,39B ''bee'':75B ''brew'':32B ''can'':30B,37B ''combining'':53B ''craft'':28B ''creat'':67B ''custom'':34B ''effect'':22B,65B,74B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':42B ''fly'':76B ''following'':59B ''for'':17B,47B ''gear'':43B ''generally'':52B ''gradually'':11B ''in'':25B ''ingredients'':60B ''into'':33B ''is'':23B ''it'':45B ''least'':55B ''magical'':4B ''making'':44B ''mor'':78B ''of'':57B ''over'':14B ''pholiot'':81B ''physical'':19B ''potion'':69B ''potions'':29B,35B ''pre'':27B ''pre-craft'':26B ''prolong'':18B ''provid'':61B ''regenerat'':1A,72B ''restor'':12B ''restoration'':8B ''restorativ'':7B ''scaly'':80B ''shar'':63B ''stamin'':2A,13B,73B ''tapinell'':79B ''that'':10B ''the'':58B,71B ''thes'':3B ''they'':62B ''thiev'':50B ''this'':21B,64B ''tim'':15B ''to'':41B ''two'':56B ''valuabl'':46B ''warriors'':48B ''will'':66B ''with'':70B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic restores your stamina over time, helping you stay active for longer. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('repel_lesser_undead', 'Repel Lesser Undead is a Restoration spell that causes weaker undead creatures to flee from the caster, temporarily banishing them. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':27B ''an'':26B ''banishing'':22B ''cast'':20B,31B ''caus'':12B ''creatur'':15B ''fle'':17B ''from'':18B ''is'':7B ''it'':24B ''less'':2A,5B ''level'':29B ''repel'':1A,4B ''requir'':25B ''restoration'':9B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':10B ''temporarily'':21B ''that'':11B ''the'':19B ''them'':23B ''to'':16B,30B ''unde'':3A,6B,14B ''weak'':13B', 'mage', 'Repel Lesser Undead is a spell that causes weaker undead creatures to flee from the caster, temporarily banishing them. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('repel_undead', 'Repel Undead is a Restoration spell that forces undead creatures to flee in terror, effectively neutralizing them for a short period. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':27B ''an'':26B ''cast'':31B ''creatur'':12B ''effectively'':17B ''fle'':14B ''for'':20B ''forc'':10B ''in'':15B ''is'':5B ''it'':24B ''level'':29B ''neutralizing'':18B ''period'':23B ''repel'':1A,3B ''requir'':25B ''restoration'':7B ''short'':22B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''terror'':16B ''that'':9B ''them'':19B ''to'':13B,30B ''unde'':2A,4B,11B', 'mage', 'Repel Undead is a spell that forces undead creatures to flee in terror, effectively neutralizing them for a short period. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('resist_disease', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration enchantments that increase resistance to diseases, protecting the caster from harmful infections. This effect can be applied to enchanted gear and is also found on items scattered throughout Skyrim, making it ideal for those exploring dangerous regions.', '''also'':31B ''and'':29B ''appli'':25B ''are'':6B ''be'':24B ''can'':23B ''cast'':17B ''dangerous'':44B ''defensiv'':7B ''dis'':2A,14B ''effect'':22B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':27B ''enchantments'':9B ''exploring'':43B ''for'':41B ''found'':32B ''from'':18B ''gear'':28B ''harmful'':19B ''ideal'':40B ''incre'':11B ''infections'':20B ''is'':30B ''it'':39B ''items'':34B ''magical'':4B ''making'':38B ''on'':33B ''protecting'':15B ''regions'':45B ''resist'':1A ''resistanc'':12B ''restoration'':8B ''scatter'':35B ''skyrim'':37B ''that'':10B ''the'':16B ''thes'':3B ''this'':21B ''thos'':42B ''throughout'':36B ''to'':13B,26B', 'mage', 'This enchantment makes you less likely to get sick, useful for travelers in dangerous areas.  A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('resist_fire', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration abilities that reduce damage taken from fire-based attacks, providing essential protection against dragons and other fiery foes. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Resist Fire effect: Bone Meal, Dragon''s Tongue, Elves Ear, Fire Salts, Snowberries', '''abiliti'':9B ''against'':22B ''also'':45B ''and'':24B,43B ''appli'':47B ''are'':6B ''at'':53B ''attacks'':18B ''avail'':31B ''bas'':17B ''be'':38B,46B ''bon'':74B ''brew'':39B ''can'':37B,44B ''combining'':52B ''craft'':35B ''creat'':66B ''custom'':41B ''damag'':12B ''defensiv'':7B ''dragon'':76B ''dragons'':23B ''ear'':80B ''effect'':29B,64B,73B ''effects'':5B ''elves'':79B ''enchant'':49B ''essential'':20B ''fiery'':26B ''fir'':2A,16B,72B,81B ''fire-bas'':15B ''foes'':27B ''following'':58B ''from'':14B ''generally'':51B ''in'':32B ''ingredients'':59B ''into'':40B ''is'':30B ''items'':50B ''least'':54B ''magical'':4B ''meal'':75B ''of'':56B ''other'':25B ''potion'':68B ''potions'':36B,42B ''pre'':34B ''pre-craft'':33B ''protection'':21B ''provid'':60B ''providing'':19B ''reduc'':11B ''resist'':1A,71B ''restoration'':8B ''s'':77B ''salts'':82B ''shar'':62B ''snowberri'':83B ''tak'':13B ''that'':10B ''the'':57B,70B ''thes'':3B ''they'':61B ''this'':28B,63B ''to'':48B ''tong'':78B ''two'':55B ''will'':65B ''with'':69B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic protects you from fire damage, making it easier to face fiery enemies. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('resist_frost', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration abilities that reduce damage taken from frost-based attacks, offering vital protection in Skyrim;s icy environments. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Resist Frost effect: Frost Mirriam, Frost Salts, Purple Mountain Flower, Snowberries, Thistle Branch', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':44B ''and'':42B ''appli'':46B ''are'':6B ''at'':52B ''attacks'':18B ''avail'':30B ''bas'':17B ''be'':37B,45B ''branch'':82B ''brew'':38B ''can'':36B,43B ''combining'':51B ''craft'':34B ''creat'':65B ''custom'':40B ''damag'':12B ''defensiv'':7B ''effect'':28B,63B,72B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':48B ''environments'':26B ''flow'':79B ''following'':57B ''from'':14B ''frost'':2A,16B,71B,73B,75B ''frost-bas'':15B ''generally'':50B ''icy'':25B ''in'':22B,31B ''ingredients'':58B ''into'':39B ''is'':29B ''items'':49B ''least'':53B ''magical'':4B ''mirriam'':74B ''mountain'':78B ''of'':55B ''offering'':19B ''potion'':67B ''potions'':35B,41B ''pre'':33B ''pre-craft'':32B ''protection'':21B ''provid'':59B ''purpl'':77B ''reduc'':11B ''resist'':1A,70B ''restoration'':8B ''s'':24B ''salts'':76B ''shar'':61B ''skyrim'':23B ''snowberri'':80B ''tak'':13B ''that'':10B ''the'':56B,69B ''thes'':3B ''they'':60B ''this'':27B,62B ''thistl'':81B ''to'':47B ''two'':54B ''vital'':20B ''will'':64B ''with'':68B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic protects you from frost damage, helping you stay safe in icy areas. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('resist_magic', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration abilities that reduce damage taken from all forms of magic, offering broad protection against hostile spells. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Resist Magic effect: Bleeding Crown, Hagraven Claw, Nirnroot, Tundra Cotton', '''abiliti'':9B ''against'':22B ''all'':15B ''also'':42B ''and'':40B ''appli'':44B ''are'':6B ''at'':50B ''avail'':28B ''be'':35B,43B ''bleeding'':71B ''brew'':36B ''bro'':20B ''can'':34B,41B ''claw'':74B ''combining'':49B ''cotton'':77B ''craft'':32B ''creat'':63B ''crown'':72B ''custom'':38B ''damag'':12B ''defensiv'':7B ''effect'':26B,61B,70B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':46B ''following'':55B ''forms'':16B ''from'':14B ''generally'':48B ''hagrav'':73B ''hostil'':23B ''in'':29B ''ingredients'':56B ''into'':37B ''is'':27B ''items'':47B ''least'':51B ''magic'':2A,18B,69B ''magical'':4B ''nirnroot'':75B ''of'':17B,53B ''offering'':19B ''potion'':65B ''potions'':33B,39B ''pre'':31B ''pre-craft'':30B ''protection'':21B ''provid'':57B ''reduc'':11B ''resist'':1A,68B ''restoration'':8B ''shar'':59B ''spells'':24B ''tak'':13B ''that'':10B ''the'':54B,67B ''thes'':3B ''they'':58B ''this'':25B,60B ''to'':45B ''tundr'':76B ''two'':52B ''will'':62B ''with'':66B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic protects you from magical attacks, making spells hurt less. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('resist_poison', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration abilities that reduce the effects of poisons on the caster, providing critical defense against toxic attacks. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items.', '''abiliti'':9B ''against'':22B ''also'':42B ''and'':40B ''appli'':44B ''are'':6B ''attacks'':24B ''avail'':28B ''be'':35B,43B ''brew'':36B ''can'':34B,41B ''cast'':18B ''craft'':32B ''critical'':20B ''custom'':38B ''defens'':21B ''defensiv'':7B ''effect'':26B ''effects'':5B,13B ''enchant'':46B ''in'':29B ''into'':37B ''is'':27B ''items'':47B ''magical'':4B ''of'':14B ''on'':16B ''poison'':2A ''poisons'':15B ''potions'':33B,39B ''pre'':31B ''pre-craft'':30B ''providing'':19B ''reduc'':11B ''resist'':1A ''restoration'':8B ''that'':10B ''the'':12B,17B ''thes'':3B ''this'':25B ''to'':45B ''toxic'':23B', 'mage', 'This enchantment makes poisons less harmful to you, keeping you safe from toxins. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('resist_shock', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration abilities that reduce damage taken from shock-based attacks, shielding the caster from electrical energy. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted items. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Resist Shock effect: Glow Dust, Glowing Mushroom, Hawk Feathers, Snowberries', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':42B ''and'':40B ''appli'':44B ''are'':6B ''at'':50B ''attacks'':18B ''avail'':28B ''bas'':17B ''be'':35B,43B ''brew'':36B ''can'':34B,41B ''cast'':21B ''combining'':49B ''craft'':32B ''creat'':63B ''custom'':38B ''damag'':12B ''defensiv'':7B ''dust'':72B ''effect'':26B,61B,70B ''effects'':5B ''electrical'':23B ''enchant'':46B ''energy'':24B ''feathers'':76B ''following'':55B ''from'':14B,22B ''generally'':48B ''glow'':71B ''glowing'':73B ''hawk'':75B ''in'':29B ''ingredients'':56B ''into'':37B ''is'':27B ''items'':47B ''least'':51B ''magical'':4B ''mushroom'':74B ''of'':53B ''potion'':65B ''potions'':33B,39B ''pre'':31B ''pre-craft'':30B ''provid'':57B ''reduc'':11B ''resist'':1A,68B ''restoration'':8B ''shar'':59B ''shielding'':19B ''shock'':2A,16B,69B ''shock-bas'':15B ''snowberri'':77B ''tak'':13B ''that'':10B ''the'':20B,54B,67B ''thes'':3B ''they'':58B ''this'':25B,60B ''to'':45B ''two'':52B ''will'':62B ''with'':66B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic protects you from shock damage, keeping you safe from lightning attacks. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('restore_health', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration spells that instantly restore lost health to the caster or target. This effect is available as a spell, in pre-crafted potions, and can be brewed into custom potions, making it a foundational ability for adventurers and healers. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Restore Health effect: Blue Dartwing, Blue Mountain Flower, Butterfly Wing, Charred Skeever Hide, Daedra Heart, Eye of Sabre Cat, Imp Stool, Rock Warbler Egg, Swamp Fungal Pod, Wheat', '''ability'':43B ''adventurers'':45B ''and'':32B,46B ''are'':6B ''as'':24B ''at'':50B ''avail'':23B ''be'':34B ''blu'':71B,73B ''brew'':35B ''butterfly'':76B ''can'':33B ''cast'':17B ''cat'':86B ''charr'':78B ''combining'':49B ''craft'':30B ''creat'':63B ''custom'':37B ''daedr'':81B ''dartwing'':72B ''effect'':21B,61B,70B ''effects'':5B ''egg'':91B ''eye'':83B ''flow'':75B ''following'':55B ''for'':44B ''foundational'':42B ''fungal'':93B ''generally'':48B ''healers'':47B ''health'':2A,14B,69B ''heart'':82B ''hid'':80B ''imp'':87B ''in'':27B ''ingredients'':56B ''instantly'':11B ''into'':36B ''is'':22B ''it'':40B ''least'':51B ''lost'':13B ''magical'':4B ''making'':39B ''mountain'':74B ''of'':53B,84B ''or'':18B ''pod'':94B ''potion'':65B ''potions'':31B,38B ''pre'':29B ''pre-craft'':28B ''provid'':57B ''restor'':1A,12B,68B ''restoration'':8B ''restorativ'':7B ''rock'':89B ''sabr'':85B ''shar'':59B ''skeev'':79B ''spell'':26B ''spells'':9B ''stool'':88B ''swamp'':92B ''target'':19B ''that'':10B ''the'':16B,54B,67B ''thes'':3B ''they'':58B ''this'':20B,60B ''to'':15B ''two'':52B ''warbl'':90B ''wheat'':95B ''will'':62B ''wing'':77B ''with'':66B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This spell heals injuries right away, helping you recover quickly during a fight. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('restore_magicka', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration abilities that instantly replenish the caster;s magicka reserves, enabling continued spellcasting. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can also be brewed into custom potions, making it vital for mages in prolonged encounters. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Restore Magicka effect: Briar Heart, Ectoplasm, Elves Ear, Fire Salts, Frost Salts, Garlic, Glow Dust, Grass Pod, Human Flesh, Red Mountain Flower, Taproot, Tundra Cotton, Void Salts', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':32B ''and'':30B ''are'':6B ''at'':48B ''avail'':24B ''be'':33B ''brew'':34B ''bri'':69B ''can'':31B ''cast'':14B ''combining'':47B ''continu'':19B ''cotton'':90B ''craft'':28B ''creat'':61B ''custom'':36B ''dust'':80B ''ear'':73B ''ectoplasm'':71B ''effect'':22B,59B,68B ''effects'':5B ''elves'':72B ''enabling'':18B ''encounters'':45B ''fir'':74B ''flesh'':84B ''flow'':87B ''following'':53B ''for'':41B ''frost'':76B ''garlic'':78B ''generally'':46B ''glow'':79B ''grass'':81B ''heart'':70B ''hum'':83B ''in'':25B,43B ''ingredients'':54B ''instantly'':11B ''into'':35B ''is'':23B ''it'':39B ''least'':49B ''mag'':42B ''magical'':4B ''magick'':2A,16B,67B ''making'':38B ''mountain'':86B ''of'':51B ''pod'':82B ''potion'':63B ''potions'':29B,37B ''pre'':27B ''pre-craft'':26B ''prolong'':44B ''provid'':55B ''red'':85B ''replenish'':12B ''reserv'':17B ''restor'':1A,66B ''restoration'':8B ''restorativ'':7B ''s'':15B ''salts'':75B,77B,92B ''shar'':57B ''spellcasting'':20B ''taproot'':88B ''that'':10B ''the'':13B,52B,65B ''thes'':3B ''they'':56B ''this'':21B,58B ''tundr'':89B ''two'':50B ''vital'':40B ''void'':91B ''will'':60B ''with'':64B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic restores magicka quickly, helping you cast more spells when needed. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('restore_stamina', 'These magical effects are restorative Restoration abilities that instantly restore lost stamina, enabling the target to perform physical actions such as sprinting or power attacks. This effect is available as a spell, in pre-crafted potions, and can also be brewed into custom potions, making it a valuable tool for warriors. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Restore Stamina effect: Bear Claws, Bee, Charred Skeever Hide, Eye of Sabre Cat, Hawk Beak, Honeycomb, Large Antlers, Mudcrab Chitin, Orange Dartwing, Pearl, Pine Thrush Egg, Powdered Mammoth Tusk, Purple Mountain Flower, Sabre Cat Tooth, Silverside Perch, Small Pearl, Torchbug Thorax', '''abiliti'':9B ''actions'':21B ''also'':42B ''and'':40B ''antlers'':92B ''are'':6B ''as'':23B,32B ''at'':57B ''attacks'':27B ''avail'':31B ''be'':43B ''beak'':89B ''bear'':78B ''bee'':80B ''brew'':44B ''can'':41B ''cat'':87B,108B ''charr'':81B ''chitin'':94B ''claws'':79B ''combining'':56B ''craft'':38B ''creat'':70B ''custom'':46B ''dartwing'':96B ''effect'':29B,68B,77B ''effects'':5B ''egg'':100B ''enabling'':15B ''eye'':84B ''flow'':106B ''following'':62B ''for'':53B ''generally'':55B ''hawk'':88B ''hid'':83B ''honeycomb'':90B ''in'':35B ''ingredients'':63B ''instantly'':11B ''into'':45B ''is'':30B ''it'':49B ''larg'':91B ''least'':58B ''lost'':13B ''magical'':4B ''making'':48B ''mammoth'':102B ''mountain'':105B ''mudcrab'':93B ''of'':60B,85B ''or'':25B ''orang'':95B ''pearl'':97B,113B ''perch'':111B ''perform'':19B ''physical'':20B ''pin'':98B ''potion'':72B ''potions'':39B,47B ''pow'':26B ''powder'':101B ''pre'':37B ''pre-craft'':36B ''provid'':64B ''purpl'':104B ''restor'':1A,12B,75B ''restoration'':8B ''restorativ'':7B ''sabr'':86B,107B ''shar'':66B ''silversid'':110B ''skeev'':82B ''small'':112B ''spell'':34B ''sprinting'':24B ''stamin'':2A,14B,76B ''such'':22B ''target'':17B ''that'':10B ''the'':16B,61B,74B ''thes'':3B ''they'':65B ''this'':28B,67B ''thorax'':115B ''thrush'':99B ''to'':18B ''tool'':52B ''tooth'':109B ''torchbug'':114B ''tusk'':103B ''two'':59B ''valuabl'':51B ''warriors'':54B ''will'':69B ''with'':73B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic gives you back stamina, letting you perform actions like sprinting or attacking. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('revenant', 'Revenant is a Conjuration spell that reanimates a more powerful dead body to fight for the caster for a limited time. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':26B ''an'':25B ''body'':13B ''cast'':18B,30B ''conjuration'':5B ''dead'':12B ''fight'':15B ''for'':16B,19B ''is'':3B ''it'':23B ''level'':28B ''limit'':21B ''mor'':10B ''powerful'':11B ''reanimat'':8B ''requir'':24B ''revenant'':1A,2B ''skill'':27B ''spell'':6B ''that'':7B ''the'':17B ''tim'':22B ''to'':14B,29B', 'mage', '
Revenant is a spell that reanimates a more powerful dead body, bringing it back to life to fight for the caster for a short time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rii_vaaz_zol', 'Soul Tear is a Shout that cuts through flesh and shatters the soul, allowing you to command the will of the fallen. The three words of power in this Shout are Rii (Essence), which targets the essence of the foe; Vaaz (Tear), which rends their soul apart; and Zol (Zombie), which raises the fallen to serve you as a zombie under your control.', '''allowing'':17B ''and'':13B,51B ''apart'':50B ''are'':34B ''as'':61B ''command'':20B ''control'':66B ''cuts'':10B ''essenc'':36B,40B ''fall'':25B,57B ''flesh'':12B ''foe'':43B ''in'':31B ''is'':6B ''of'':23B,29B,41B ''pow'':30B ''rais'':55B ''rends'':47B ''rii'':1A,35B ''serv'':59B ''shatters'':14B ''shout'':8B,33B ''soul'':4B,16B,49B ''targets'':38B ''tear'':5B,45B ''that'':9B ''the'':15B,21B,24B,26B,39B,42B,48B,56B ''this'':32B ''thre'':27B ''through'':11B ''to'':19B,58B ''under'':64B ''vaaz'':2A,44B ''which'':37B,46B,54B ''will'':22B ''words'':28B ''you'':18B,60B ''your'':65B ''zol'':3A,52B ''zombi'':53B,63B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rockjoint', 'Rockjoint is an acute disease that affects a victim''s manual dexterity and ability to use melee weapons, causing painful swelling and immobility of the joints. It can be contracted from wolves, alit, zombies, and domesticated guar. As the disease progresses, it severely diminishes the effectiveness of one-handed and two-handed weapon damage, limiting the victim''s combat capabilities.', '''ability'':15B ''acut'':5B ''affects'':8B ''alit'':34B ''an'':4B ''and'':14B,23B,36B,52B ''as'':39B ''be'':30B ''can'':29B ''capabiliti'':63B ''causing'':20B ''combat'':62B ''contract'':31B ''damag'':57B ''dexterity'':13B ''diminish'':45B ''dis'':6B,41B ''domesticat'':37B ''effectiveness'':47B ''from'':32B ''guar'':38B ''hand'':51B,55B ''immobility'':24B ''is'':3B ''it'':28B,43B ''joints'':27B ''limiting'':58B ''manual'':12B ''mele'':18B ''of'':25B,48B ''one'':50B ''one-hand'':49B ''painful'':21B ''progress'':42B ''rockjoint'':1A,2B ''s'':11B,61B ''severely'':44B ''swelling'':22B ''that'':7B ''the'':26B,40B,46B,59B ''to'':16B ''two'':54B ''two-hand'':53B ''use'':17B ''victim'':10B,60B ''weapon'':56B ''weapons'':19B ''wolv'':33B ''zombi'':35B', 'alchemist', 'Rockjoint is an acute disease that affects a victim''s manual dexterity and ability to use melee weapons, causing painful swelling and immobility of the joints. It can be contracted from wolves, alit, zombies, and domesticated guar. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rout', 'Rout is an Illusion spell that causes a target to flee in terror, forcing them to run away from the caster and their allies. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''adept'':29B ''alli'':25B ''an'':4B,28B ''and'':23B ''away'':19B ''cast'':22B,33B ''caus'':8B ''fle'':12B ''forcing'':15B ''from'':20B ''illusion'':5B ''in'':13B ''is'':3B ''it'':26B ''level'':31B ''requir'':27B ''rout'':1A,2B ''run'':18B ''skill'':30B ''spell'':6B ''target'':10B ''terror'':14B ''that'':7B ''the'':21B,24B ''them'':16B ''to'':11B,17B,32B', 'mage', '
Rout is a spell that causes a target to flee in terror, forcing them to run away from the caster and their allies. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rune', 'These magical effects are offensive Alteration, Destruction, Illusion, and Restoration spells that create magical traps on surfaces, detonating when triggered by an enemy and dealing elemental damage such as fire, frost, or shock. This effect is only available as a spell, making it a favorite for mages setting ambushes or protecting key locations.', '''alteration'':7B ''ambush'':50B ''an'':23B ''and'':10B,25B ''are'':5B ''as'':30B,40B ''avail'':39B ''by'':22B ''creat'':14B ''damag'':28B ''dealing'':26B ''destruction'':8B ''detonating'':19B ''effect'':36B ''effects'':4B ''elemental'':27B ''enemy'':24B ''favorit'':46B ''fir'':31B ''for'':47B ''frost'':32B ''illusion'':9B ''is'':37B ''it'':44B ''key'':53B ''locations'':54B ''mag'':48B ''magical'':3B,15B ''making'':43B ''offensiv'':6B ''on'':17B ''only'':38B ''or'':33B,51B ''protecting'':52B ''restoration'':11B ''run'':1A ''setting'':49B ''shock'':34B ''spell'':42B ''spells'':12B ''such'':29B ''surfac'':18B ''that'':13B ''thes'':2B ''this'':35B ''traps'':16B ''trigger'':21B ''when'':20B', 'mage', 'Runes are traps made with magic that explode when someone gets too close. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('sanguinare_vampiris', 'Sanguinare Vampiris is a disease that causes weakness and a peculiar thirst in its victims, eventually transforming them into vampires after a three-day incubation period. During this time, the victim''s health is reduced, and they experience a significant decrease in strength during the day. If not cured within the three days, the disease progresses into full vampirism, which is notoriously difficult to cure.', '''after'':23B ''and'':11B,39B ''caus'':9B ''cur'':52B,68B ''day'':27B,49B ''days'':56B ''decr'':44B ''difficult'':66B ''dis'':7B,58B ''during'':30B,47B ''eventually'':18B ''experienc'':41B ''full'':61B ''health'':36B ''if'':50B ''in'':15B,45B ''incubation'':28B ''into'':21B,60B ''is'':5B,37B,64B ''its'':16B ''not'':51B ''notoriously'':65B ''peculi'':13B ''period'':29B ''progress'':59B ''reduc'':38B ''s'':35B ''sanguinar'':1A,3B ''significant'':43B ''strength'':46B ''that'':8B ''the'':33B,48B,54B,57B ''them'':20B ''they'':40B ''thirst'':14B ''this'':31B ''thre'':26B,55B ''three-day'':25B ''tim'':32B ''to'':67B ''transforming'':19B ''vampir'':22B ''vampiris'':2A,4B ''vampirism'':62B ''victim'':34B ''victims'':17B ''weakness'':10B ''which'':63B ''within'':53B', 'alchemist', 'Sanguinare Vampiris is a disease that causes weakness and a peculiar thirst in its victims, eventually transforming them into vampires after a three-day incubation period. During this time, the victim''s health is reduced, and they experience a significant decrease in strength during the day. You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('shock_damage', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that deal immediate lightning damage and drain magicka from the target. This effect is available as a spell, can be applied through custom enchanting, and is also found on enchanted gear, making it a staple for countering mages.', '''abiliti'':9B ''also'':36B ''and'':15B,34B ''appli'':30B ''are'':6B ''as'':25B ''avail'':24B ''be'':29B ''can'':28B ''countering'':46B ''custom'':32B ''damag'':2A,14B ''deal'':11B ''destruction'':8B ''drain'':16B ''effect'':22B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':39B ''enchanting'':33B ''for'':45B ''found'':37B ''from'':18B ''gear'':40B ''immediat'':12B ''is'':23B,35B ''it'':42B ''lightning'':13B ''mag'':47B ''magical'':4B ''magick'':17B ''making'':41B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':38B ''shock'':1A ''spell'':27B ''stapl'':44B ''target'':20B ''that'':10B ''the'':19B ''thes'':3B ''this'':21B ''through'':31B', 'mage', 'This spell shocks enemies with lightning, hurting them and draining their magicka. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('slow', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that reduce the target;s movement speed, leaving them vulnerable to follow-up attacks. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can be brewed into custom potions, making it a practical choice for crowd control. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Slow effect: Bungler;s Bane, Burnt Spriggan Wood, Deathbell, Large Antlers, Poison Bloom, River Betty, Salt Pile, Trama Root', '''abiliti'':8B ''and'':33B ''antlers'':78B ''are'':5B ''at'':50B ''attacks'':23B ''avail'':27B ''ban'':72B ''be'':35B ''betty'':82B ''bloom'':80B ''brew'':36B ''bungl'':70B ''burnt'':73B ''can'':34B ''choic'':44B ''combining'':49B ''control'':47B ''craft'':31B ''creat'':63B ''crowd'':46B ''custom'':38B ''deathbell'':76B ''destruction'':7B ''effect'':25B,61B,69B ''effects'':4B ''follow'':21B ''follow-up'':20B ''following'':55B ''for'':45B ''generally'':48B ''in'':28B ''ingredients'':56B ''into'':37B ''is'':26B ''it'':41B ''larg'':77B ''least'':51B ''leaving'':16B ''magical'':3B ''making'':40B ''movement'':14B ''of'':53B ''offensiv'':6B ''pil'':84B ''poison'':79B ''potion'':65B ''potions'':32B,39B ''practical'':43B ''pre'':30B ''pre-craft'':29B ''provid'':57B ''reduc'':10B ''riv'':81B ''root'':86B ''s'':13B,71B ''salt'':83B ''shar'':59B ''slow'':1A,68B ''spe'':15B ''sprigg'':74B ''target'':12B ''that'':9B ''the'':11B,54B,67B ''them'':17B ''thes'':2B ''they'':58B ''this'':24B,60B ''to'':19B ''tram'':85B ''two'':52B ''up'':22B ''vulner'':18B ''will'':62B ''with'':66B ''wood'':75B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This effect slows enemies down, making it harder for them to move or escape. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('slow_time', 'Slow Time is a Shout that commands time itself to obey, causing the world around you to stand still while you move at normal speed. The three words of power in this Shout are Tiid (Time), which controls the flow of time; Klo (Sand), which symbolizes the slow passage of time, like grains of sand slipping away; and Ul (Eternity), which extends the effect, allowing time to remain frozen for a longer duration.', '''allowing'':67B ''and'':60B ''are'':36B ''around'':17B ''at'':25B ''away'':59B ''causing'':14B ''commands'':9B ''controls'':40B ''duration'':75B ''effect'':66B ''eternity'':62B ''extends'':64B ''flow'':42B ''for'':72B ''froz'':71B ''grains'':55B ''in'':33B ''is'':5B ''itself'':11B ''klo'':45B ''lik'':54B ''long'':74B ''mov'':24B ''normal'':26B ''obey'':13B ''of'':31B,43B,52B,56B ''passag'':51B ''pow'':32B ''remain'':70B ''sand'':46B,57B ''shout'':7B,35B ''slipping'':58B ''slow'':1A,3B,50B ''spe'':27B ''stand'':20B ''still'':21B ''symboliz'':48B ''that'':8B ''the'':15B,28B,41B,49B,65B ''this'':34B ''thre'':29B ''tiid'':37B ''tim'':2A,4B,10B,38B,44B,53B,68B ''to'':12B,19B,69B ''ul'':61B ''which'':39B,47B,63B ''whil'':22B ''words'':30B ''world'':16B ''you'':18B,23B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('smithing_expertise', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Destruction enchantments that enhance the effectiveness of crafting and improving weapons and armor. This effect is available through custom enchanting and is also found on enchanted gear, making it invaluable to blacksmiths and warriors.', '''also'':32B ''and'':18B,21B,30B,42B ''are'':6B ''armor'':22B ''avail'':26B ''blacksmiths'':41B ''crafting'':17B ''custom'':28B ''destruction'':10B ''effect'':24B ''effectiveness'':15B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':35B ''enchanting'':29B ''enchantments'':11B ''enhanc'':13B ''expertis'':2A ''focus'':9B ''found'':33B ''gear'':36B ''improving'':19B ''invalu'':39B ''is'':25B,31B ''it'':38B ''magical'':4B ''making'':37B ''of'':16B ''on'':34B ''smithing'':1A ''that'':12B ''the'':14B ''thes'':3B ''this'':23B ''through'':27B ''to'':40B ''utility'':8B ''utility-focus'':7B ''warriors'':43B ''weapons'':20B', 'mage', 'This enchantment helps improve weapons and armor, making them stronger and better to use. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('soul_tear', 'Soul Tear is a Shout that cuts through flesh and shatters the soul, allowing you to command the will of the fallen. The three words of power in this Shout are Rii (Essence), which targets the essence of the foe; Vaaz (Tear), which rends their soul apart; and Zol (Zombie), which raises the fallen to serve you as a zombie under your control.', '''allowing'':16B ''and'':12B,50B ''apart'':49B ''are'':33B ''as'':60B ''command'':19B ''control'':65B ''cuts'':9B ''essenc'':35B,39B ''fall'':24B,56B ''flesh'':11B ''foe'':42B ''in'':30B ''is'':5B ''of'':22B,28B,40B ''pow'':29B ''rais'':54B ''rends'':46B ''rii'':34B ''serv'':58B ''shatters'':13B ''shout'':7B,32B ''soul'':1A,3B,15B,48B ''targets'':37B ''tear'':2A,4B,44B ''that'':8B ''the'':14B,20B,23B,25B,38B,41B,47B,55B ''this'':31B ''thre'':26B ''through'':10B ''to'':18B,57B ''under'':63B ''vaaz'':43B ''which'':36B,45B,53B ''will'':21B ''words'':27B ''you'':17B,59B ''your'':64B ''zol'':51B ''zombi'':52B,62B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('soul_trap', 'These magical effects are offensive Conjuration spells that bind the soul of a defeated enemy to a soul gem, allowing it to be used in enchanting or recharging magical items. This effect is widely available as a spell, can be applied through custom enchanting, and is found on enchanted weapons, making it a vital tool for mages.', '''allowing'':22B ''and'':47B ''appli'':43B ''are'':6B ''as'':38B ''avail'':37B ''be'':25B,42B ''bind'':11B ''can'':41B ''conjuration'':8B ''custom'':45B ''defeat'':16B ''effect'':34B ''effects'':5B ''enchant'':51B ''enchanting'':28B,46B ''enemy'':17B ''for'':58B ''found'':49B ''gem'':21B ''in'':27B ''is'':35B,48B ''it'':23B,54B ''items'':32B ''mag'':59B ''magical'':4B,31B ''making'':53B ''of'':14B ''offensiv'':7B ''on'':50B ''or'':29B ''recharging'':30B ''soul'':1A,13B,20B ''spell'':40B ''spells'':9B ''that'':10B ''the'':12B ''thes'':3B ''this'':33B ''through'':44B ''to'':18B,24B ''tool'':57B ''trap'':2A ''used'':26B ''vital'':56B ''weapons'':52B ''widely'':36B', 'mage', 'This spell captures the soul of a defeated enemy, storing it in a soul gem for later use. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('sparks', 'Sparks is a Destruction spell that discharges a stream of electrical energy, dealing shock damage to health and magicka. It requires a Novice skill level to cast.', '''and'':19B ''cast'':28B ''damag'':16B ''dealing'':14B ''destruction'':5B ''discharg'':8B ''electrical'':12B ''energy'':13B ''health'':18B ''is'':3B ''it'':21B ''level'':26B ''magick'':20B ''novic'':24B ''of'':11B ''requir'':22B ''shock'':15B ''skill'':25B ''sparks'':1A,2B ''spell'':6B ''stream'':10B ''that'':7B ''to'':17B,27B', 'mage', 'Sparks is a spell that releases a stream of electrical energy, damaging both the health and magicka of enemies. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('spell_absorption', 'These magical effects are defensive Destruction abilities that absorb incoming spells and convert their energy into magicka for the caster. This effect is rare and not available through standard enchanting or potions, making it a highly coveted ability for mages.', '''abiliti'':9B ''ability'':40B ''absorb'':11B ''absorption'':2A ''and'':14B,27B ''are'':6B ''avail'':29B ''cast'':22B ''convert'':15B ''covet'':39B ''defensiv'':7B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':24B ''effects'':5B ''enchanting'':32B ''energy'':17B ''for'':20B,41B ''highly'':38B ''incoming'':12B ''into'':18B ''is'':25B ''it'':36B ''mag'':42B ''magical'':4B ''magick'':19B ''making'':35B ''not'':28B ''or'':33B ''potions'':34B ''rar'':26B ''spell'':1A ''spells'':13B ''standard'':31B ''that'':10B ''the'':16B,21B ''thes'':3B ''this'':23B ''through'':30B', 'mage', 'This rare magic absorbs incoming spells, turning them into magicka for the user. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('steadfast_ward', 'Steadfast Ward is a Restoration spell that creates a powerful magical barrier around the caster, absorbing a large amount of magic damage. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''absorbing'':18B ''adept'':28B ''amount'':21B ''an'':27B ''around'':15B ''barri'':14B ''cast'':17B,32B ''creat'':10B ''damag'':24B ''is'':5B ''it'':25B ''larg'':20B ''level'':30B ''magic'':23B ''magical'':13B ''of'':22B ''powerful'':12B ''requir'':26B ''restoration'':7B ''skill'':29B ''spell'':8B ''steadfast'':1A,3B ''that'':9B ''the'':16B ''to'':31B ''ward'':2A,4B', 'mage', '
Steadfast Ward is a spell that creates a powerful magical barrier around the caster, absorbing a large amount of magic damage. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('stendarr''s_aura', 'Stendarr''s Aura is a Restoration spell that creates an aura around the caster, dealing damage to nearby undead, daedra, and other enemies while also healing the caster over time. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''also'':28B ''an'':13B,36B ''and'':24B ''around'':15B ''aur'':3A,6B,14B ''cast'':17B,31B,41B ''creat'':12B ''daedr'':23B ''damag'':19B ''dealing'':18B ''enemi'':26B ''expert'':37B ''healing'':29B ''is'':7B ''it'':34B ''level'':39B ''nearby'':21B ''other'':25B ''over'':32B ''requir'':35B ''restoration'':9B ''s'':2A,5B ''skill'':38B ''spell'':10B ''stendarr'':1A,4B ''that'':11B ''the'':16B,30B ''tim'':33B ''to'':20B,40B ''unde'':22B ''whil'':27B', 'mage', 'Stendarr''s Aura is a spell that creates an aura around the caster, dealing damage to nearby undead, daedra, and other enemies, while also healing the caster over time. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('stoneflesh', 'Stoneflesh is an Alteration spell that enhances the caster''s armor rating for a short duration, offering improved protection. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''alteration'':5B ''an'':4B,23B ''apprentic'':24B ''armor'':12B ''cast'':10B,28B ''duration'':17B ''enhanc'':8B ''for'':14B ''improv'':19B ''is'':3B ''it'':21B ''level'':26B ''offering'':18B ''protection'':20B ''rating'':13B ''requir'':22B ''s'':11B ''short'':16B ''skill'':25B ''spell'':6B ''stoneflesh'':1A,2B ''that'':7B ''the'':9B ''to'':27B', 'mage', 'Stoneflesh is a spell that makes the caster’s skin as tough as stone for a short time, providing better protection from attacks. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('storm_call', 'Storm Call is a Shout that summons a destructive storm, calling down lightning to strike your enemies. The three words of power in this Shout are Strun (Storm), which conjures the violent storm; Bah (Wrath), which intensifies the fury of the storm; and Qo (Lightning), which directs the lightning to strike down foes with powerful bolts.', '''and'':45B ''are'':28B ''bah'':36B ''bolts'':58B ''call'':2A,4B ''calling'':13B ''conjur'':32B ''destructiv'':11B ''directs'':49B ''down'':14B,54B ''enemi'':19B ''foes'':55B ''fury'':41B ''in'':25B ''intensifi'':39B ''is'':5B ''lightning'':15B,47B,51B ''of'':23B,42B ''pow'':24B ''powerful'':57B ''qo'':46B ''shout'':7B,27B ''storm'':1A,3B,12B,30B,35B,44B ''strik'':17B,53B ''strun'':29B ''summons'':9B ''that'':8B ''the'':20B,33B,40B,43B,50B ''this'':26B ''thre'':21B ''to'':16B,52B ''violent'':34B ''which'':31B,38B,48B ''with'':56B ''words'':22B ''wrath'':37B ''your'':18B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('storm_thrall', 'Storm Thrall is a Conjuration spell that permanently summons a Storm Atronach to fight for the caster until it is defeated. It requires a Master skill level to cast.', '''atronach'':14B ''cast'':19B,31B ''conjuration'':7B ''defeat'':23B ''fight'':16B ''for'':17B ''is'':5B,22B ''it'':21B,24B ''level'':29B ''mast'':27B ''permanently'':10B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''storm'':1A,3B,13B ''summons'':11B ''that'':9B ''the'':18B ''thrall'':2A,4B ''to'':15B,30B ''until'':20B', 'mage', '
Storm Thrall is a spell that permanently summons a Storm Atronach to fight for the caster until it is defeated. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
