Vampirism changes the appearance of the afflicted significantly. Those transformed develop dark, reddish eyes, pale skin, fangs, and gaunt faces. Certain races have additional physical traits, such as slitted pupils or multiple sets of fangs, and their skin or fur becomes paler. In some instances, vampirism causes even more monstrous features, including bat-like characteristics. Vampires are generally feared and despised, with the most advanced stages of vampirism leading to hostility from others. 

', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ven_gaar_nos', 'Cyclone is a Shout that creates a whirling cyclone, sowing chaos and disrupting your enemies. The three words of power in this Shout are Ven (Wind), which conjures the powerful winds; Gaar (Unleash), which releases the force of the storm; and Nos (Strike), which directs the cyclone to strike down your foes with devastating force.', '''and'':14B,43B ''are'':26B ''cha'':13B ''conjur'':30B ''creat'':8B ''cyclon'':3B,11B,49B ''devastating'':56B ''directs'':47B ''disrupting'':15B ''down'':52B ''enemi'':17B ''foes'':54B ''forc'':39B,57B ''gaar'':2A,34B ''in'':23B ''is'':4B ''of'':21B,40B ''pow'':22B ''powerful'':32B ''rel'':37B ''shout'':6B,25B ''sowing'':12B ''storm'':42B ''strik'':45B,51B ''that'':7B ''the'':18B,31B,38B,41B,48B ''this'':24B ''thre'':19B ''to'':50B ''unleash'':35B ''ven'':1A,27B ''which'':29B,36B,46B ''whirling'':10B ''wind'':28B ''winds'':33B ''with'':55B ''words'':20B ''your'':16B,53B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('vision_of_the_tenth_eye', 'Vision of the Tenth Eye is an Alteration spell that allows the caster to see through solid walls, revealing hidden enemies and objects in their line of sight. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''allows'':16B ''alteration'':13B ''an'':12B,36B ''and'':27B ''cast'':18B,41B ''enemi'':26B ''expert'':37B ''eye'':5A,10B ''hidd'':25B ''in'':29B ''is'':11B ''it'':34B ''level'':39B ''lin'':31B ''objects'':28B ''of'':2A,7B,32B ''requir'':35B ''revealing'':24B ''see'':20B ''sight'':33B ''skill'':38B ''sol'':22B ''spell'':14B ''tenth'':4A,9B ''that'':15B ''the'':3A,8B,17B,30B ''through'':21B ''to'':19B,40B ''vision'':1A,6B ''walls'':23B', 'mage', 'Vision of the Tenth Eye is a spell that allows the caster to see through solid walls, revealing hidden enemies and objects in their line of sight. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wall_of_flames', 'Wall of Flames is a Destruction spell that creates a barrier of fire on the ground, dealing fire damage to any enemies who pass through it. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''an'':32B ''any'':24B ''barri'':14B ''cast'':37B ''creat'':12B ''damag'':22B ''dealing'':20B ''destruction'':9B ''enemi'':25B ''expert'':33B ''fir'':16B,21B ''flam'':3A,6B ''ground'':19B ''is'':7B ''it'':29B,30B ''level'':35B ''of'':2A,5B,15B ''on'':17B ''pass'':27B ''requir'':31B ''skill'':34B ''spell'':10B ''that'':11B ''the'':18B ''through'':28B ''to'':23B,36B ''wall'':1A,4B ''who'':26B', 'mage', '
Wall of Flames is a spell that creates a barrier of fire on the ground, dealing fire damage to any enemies who pass through it. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wall_of_frost', 'Wall of Frost is a Destruction spell that creates a barrier of ice on the ground, dealing frost damage and slowing enemies who pass through it. It requires an Expert skill level to cast.', '''an'':32B ''and'':23B ''barri'':14B ''cast'':37B ''creat'':12B ''damag'':22B ''dealing'':20B ''destruction'':9B ''enemi'':25B ''expert'':33B ''frost'':3A,6B,21B ''ground'':19B ''ice'':16B ''is'':7B ''it'':29B,30B ''level'':35B ''of'':2A,5B,15B ''on'':17B ''pass'':27B ''requir'':31B ''skill'':34B ''slowing'':24B ''spell'':10B ''that'':11B ''the'':18B ''through'':28B ''to'':36B ''wall'':1A,4B ''who'':26B', 'mage', 'Wall of Frost is a spell that creates a barrier of ice on the ground, dealing frost damage and slowing any enemies who pass through it. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ward', 'These magical effects are defensive Restoration spells that project a protective barrier, absorbing incoming spells and reducing physical damage. This effect is available as a spell and can also be found on enchanted gear, offering versatile defense for mages.', '''absorbing'':14B ''also'':30B ''and'':17B,28B ''are'':5B ''as'':25B ''avail'':24B ''barri'':13B ''be'':31B ''can'':29B ''damag'':20B ''defens'':38B ''defensiv'':6B ''effect'':22B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':34B ''for'':39B ''found'':32B ''gear'':35B ''incoming'':15B ''is'':23B ''mag'':40B ''magical'':3B ''offering'':36B ''on'':33B ''physical'':19B ''project'':10B ''protectiv'':12B ''reducing'':18B ''restoration'':7B ''spell'':27B ''spells'':8B,16B ''that'':9B ''thes'':2B ''this'':21B ''versatil'':37B ''ward'':1A', 'mage', 'This magic creates a shield that blocks damage and absorbs incoming spells. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('waterbreathing', 'These magical effects are defensive Alteration spells that grant the ability to breathe underwater for a limited time. This effect is available as a spell, can be found in pre-crafted potions, brewed into custom potions, and applied to enchanted items, making it essential for exploring submerged ruins and retrieving sunken treasures. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Waterbreathing effect: Chicken''s Egg, Histcarp, Nordic Barnacle, Slaughterfish Egg, Slaughterfish Scales', '''ability'':12B ''alteration'':7B ''and'':39B,51B ''appli'':40B ''are'':5B ''as'':24B ''at'':57B ''avail'':23B ''barnacl'':82B ''be'':28B ''breath'':14B ''brew'':35B ''can'':27B ''chick'':77B ''combining'':56B ''craft'':33B ''creat'':70B ''custom'':37B ''defensiv'':6B ''effect'':21B,68B,76B ''effects'':4B ''egg'':79B,84B ''enchant'':42B ''essential'':46B ''exploring'':48B ''following'':62B ''for'':16B,47B ''found'':29B ''generally'':55B ''grant'':10B ''histcarp'':80B ''in'':30B ''ingredients'':63B ''into'':36B ''is'':22B ''it'':45B ''items'':43B ''least'':58B ''limit'':18B ''magical'':3B ''making'':44B ''nordic'':81B ''of'':60B ''potion'':72B ''potions'':34B,38B ''pre'':32B ''pre-craft'':31B ''provid'':64B ''retrieving'':52B ''ruins'':50B ''s'':78B ''scal'':86B ''shar'':66B ''slaughterfish'':83B,85B ''spell'':26B ''spells'':8B ''submerg'':49B ''sunk'':53B ''that'':9B ''the'':11B,61B,74B ''thes'':2B ''they'':65B ''this'':20B,67B ''tim'':19B ''to'':13B,41B ''treasur'':54B ''two'':59B ''underwat'':15B ''waterbreathing'':1A,75B ''will'':69B ''with'':73B', 'alchemist, mage', 'With this spell, you can breathe underwater, so you don;t have to worry about drowning. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('waterwalking', 'These magical effects are defensive Alteration abilities that allow the caster to traverse water surfaces as if they were solid ground. This effect can be found in pre-crafted potions or on enchanted items, offering adventurers a practical alternative to swimming.', '''abiliti'':8B ''adventurers'':38B ''allow'':10B ''alteration'':7B ''alternativ'':41B ''are'':5B ''as'':17B ''be'':26B ''can'':25B ''cast'':12B ''craft'':31B ''defensiv'':6B ''effect'':24B ''effects'':4B ''enchant'':35B ''found'':27B ''ground'':22B ''if'':18B ''in'':28B ''items'':36B ''magical'':3B ''offering'':37B ''on'':34B ''or'':33B ''potions'':32B ''practical'':40B ''pre'':30B ''pre-craft'':29B ''sol'':21B ''surfac'':16B ''swimming'':43B ''that'':9B ''the'':11B ''thes'':2B ''they'':19B ''this'':23B ''to'':13B,42B ''trav'':14B ''wat'':15B ''waterwalking'':1A ''wer'':20B', 'mage', 'This magic lets you walk on water like it;s solid ground, so you don;t have to swim. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('direfish', 'Direfish are a large red fish found in underground fishing spots. They can be eaten with a rather iron taste.', '''are'':3B ''be'':15B ''can'':14B ''direfish'':1A,2B ''eat'':16B ''fish'':7B ''fishing'':11B ''found'':8B ''in'':9B ''iron'':20B ''larg'':5B ''rath'':19B ''red'':6B ''spots'':12B ''tast'':21B ''they'':13B ''underground'':10B ''with'':17B', 'fisher', 'Direfish are a large red fish found in underground fishing spots. They can be eaten with a rather iron taste. You do not know much more about the fish, but a fisher would.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('weakness_to_fire', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that increase the target;s vulnerability to fire damage, amplifying the effects of fire-based attacks. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can be brewed into custom potions, making it a powerful complement to fire magic. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Weakness to Fire effect: Bleeding Crown, Burnt Spriggan Wood, Frost Salts, Ice Wraith Teeth, Juniper Berries, Moon Sugar, Powdered Mammoth Tusk', '''abiliti'':10B ''amplifying'':20B ''and'':37B ''are'':7B ''at'':54B ''attacks'':27B ''avail'':31B ''bas'':26B ''be'':39B ''berri'':87B ''bleeding'':76B ''brew'':40B ''burnt'':78B ''can'':38B ''combining'':53B ''complement'':48B ''craft'':35B ''creat'':67B ''crown'':77B ''custom'':42B ''damag'':19B ''destruction'':9B ''effect'':29B,65B,75B ''effects'':6B,22B ''fir'':3A,18B,25B,50B,74B ''fire-bas'':24B ''following'':59B ''frost'':81B ''generally'':52B ''ice'':83B ''in'':32B ''incre'':12B ''ingredients'':60B ''into'':41B ''is'':30B ''it'':45B ''junip'':86B ''least'':55B ''magic'':51B ''magical'':5B ''making'':44B ''mammoth'':91B ''moon'':88B ''of'':23B,57B ''offensiv'':8B ''potion'':69B ''potions'':36B,43B ''powder'':90B ''powerful'':47B ''pre'':34B ''pre-craft'':33B ''provid'':61B ''s'':15B ''salts'':82B ''shar'':63B ''sprigg'':79B ''sug'':89B ''target'':14B ''teeth'':85B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,21B,58B,71B ''thes'':4B ''they'':62B ''this'':28B,64B ''to'':2A,17B,49B,73B ''tusk'':92B ''two'':56B ''vulnerability'':16B ''weakness'':1A,72B ''will'':66B ''with'':70B ''wood'':80B ''wraith'':84B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic makes enemies take more damage from fire attacks, making fire spells stronger. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('weakness_to_frost', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that increase the target;s susceptibility to frost damage, amplifying the effects of cold-based attacks. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can be brewed into custom potions, offering an edge in icy battles. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Weakness to Frost effect: Abecean Longfin, Ash Hopper Jelly, Elves Ear, Fire Salts, Ice Wraith Teeth, White Cap', '''abec'':74B ''abiliti'':10B ''amplifying'':20B ''an'':45B ''and'':37B ''are'':7B ''ash'':76B ''at'':52B ''attacks'':27B ''avail'':31B ''bas'':26B ''battl'':49B ''be'':39B ''brew'':40B ''can'':38B ''cap'':87B ''cold'':25B ''cold-bas'':24B ''combining'':51B ''craft'':35B ''creat'':65B ''custom'':42B ''damag'':19B ''destruction'':9B ''ear'':80B ''edge'':46B ''effect'':29B,63B,73B ''effects'':6B,22B ''elves'':79B ''fir'':81B ''following'':57B ''frost'':3A,18B,72B ''generally'':50B ''hopp'':77B ''ice'':83B ''icy'':48B ''in'':32B,47B ''incre'':12B ''ingredients'':58B ''into'':41B ''is'':30B ''jelly'':78B ''least'':53B ''longfin'':75B ''magical'':5B ''of'':23B,55B ''offensiv'':8B ''offering'':44B ''potion'':67B ''potions'':36B,43B ''pre'':34B ''pre-craft'':33B ''provid'':59B ''s'':15B ''salts'':82B ''shar'':61B ''susceptibility'':16B ''target'':14B ''teeth'':85B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,21B,56B,69B ''thes'':4B ''they'':60B ''this'':28B,62B ''to'':2A,17B,71B ''two'':54B ''weakness'':1A,70B ''whit'':86B ''will'':64B ''with'':68B ''wraith'':84B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This effect makes enemies weaker to frost magic, so cold-based attacks hurt them more. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('weakness_to_magic', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that reduce the target;s resistance to all forms of magic, leaving them vulnerable to spells. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can be brewed into custom potions, making it highly versatile for mages. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Weakness to Magic effect: Briar Heart, Hagraven Claw, Human Flesh, Void Salts', '''abiliti'':10B ''all'':18B ''and'':36B ''are'':7B ''at'':51B ''avail'':30B ''be'':38B ''brew'':39B ''bri'':73B ''can'':37B ''claw'':76B ''combining'':50B ''craft'':34B ''creat'':64B ''custom'':41B ''destruction'':9B ''effect'':28B,62B,72B ''effects'':6B ''flesh'':78B ''following'':56B ''for'':47B ''forms'':19B ''generally'':49B ''hagrav'':75B ''heart'':74B ''highly'':45B ''hum'':77B ''in'':31B ''ingredients'':57B ''into'':40B ''is'':29B ''it'':44B ''least'':52B ''leaving'':22B ''mag'':48B ''magic'':3A,21B,71B ''magical'':5B ''making'':43B ''of'':20B,54B ''offensiv'':8B ''potion'':66B ''potions'':35B,42B ''pre'':33B ''pre-craft'':32B ''provid'':58B ''reduc'':12B ''resistanc'':16B ''s'':15B ''salts'':80B ''shar'':60B ''spells'':26B ''target'':14B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,55B,68B ''them'':23B ''thes'':4B ''they'':59B ''this'':27B,61B ''to'':2A,17B,25B,70B ''two'':53B ''versatil'':46B ''void'':79B ''vulner'':24B ''weakness'':1A,69B ''will'':63B ''with'':67B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This effect makes enemies vulnerable to all magic, so spells of any kind are more effective. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('weakness_to_poison', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that decrease the target;s resistance to toxins, enhancing the potency of applied poisons. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can be brewed into custom potions, making it a crucial tool for alchemists and poisoners. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Weakness to Poison effect: Abecean Longfin, Deathbell, Giant Lichen, Pine Thrush Egg', '''abec'':74B ''abiliti'':10B ''alchemists'':47B ''and'':34B,48B ''appli'':23B ''are'':7B ''at'':52B ''avail'':28B ''be'':36B ''brew'':37B ''can'':35B ''combining'':51B ''craft'':32B ''creat'':65B ''crucial'':44B ''custom'':39B ''deathbell'':76B ''decr'':12B ''destruction'':9B ''effect'':26B,63B,73B ''effects'':6B ''egg'':81B ''enhancing'':19B ''following'':57B ''for'':46B ''generally'':50B ''giant'':77B ''in'':29B ''ingredients'':58B ''into'':38B ''is'':27B ''it'':42B ''least'':53B ''lich'':78B ''longfin'':75B ''magical'':5B ''making'':41B ''of'':22B,55B ''offensiv'':8B ''pin'':79B ''poison'':3A,72B ''poisoners'':49B ''poisons'':24B ''potency'':21B ''potion'':67B ''potions'':33B,40B ''pre'':31B ''pre-craft'':30B ''provid'':59B ''resistanc'':16B ''s'':15B ''shar'':61B ''target'':14B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,20B,56B,69B ''thes'':4B ''they'':60B ''this'':25B,62B ''thrush'':80B ''to'':2A,17B,71B ''tool'':45B ''toxins'':18B ''two'':54B ''weakness'':1A,70B ''will'':64B ''with'':68B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This effect weakens enemies against poisons, making the toxins more deadly. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('angler_larvae', 'Angler Larvae are very small pink fish covered in a translucent embryo commonly found in freezing waters. When used as an ingredient for potion making, they offer effects such as Lingering Damage Health, Regenerate Stamina, Waterbreathing and Fortify Two-Handed.', '''an'':23B ''and'':39B ''angler'':1A,3B ''are'':5B ''as'':22B,32B ''commonly'':15B ''cover'':10B ''damag'':34B ''effects'':30B ''embryo'':14B ''fish'':9B ''for'':25B ''fortify'':40B ''found'':16B ''freezing'':18B ''hand'':43B ''health'':35B ''in'':11B,17B ''ingredient'':24B ''larva'':2A,4B ''lingering'':33B ''making'':27B ''offer'':29B ''pink'':8B ''potion'':26B ''regenerat'':36B ''small'':7B ''stamin'':37B ''such'':31B ''they'':28B ''translucent'':13B ''two'':42B ''two-hand'':41B ''used'':21B ''very'':6B ''waterbreathing'':38B ''waters'':19B ''when'':20B', 'fisher', 'Angler Larvae are very small pink fish covered in a translucent embryo .You do not know much more about the fish, but a fisher would. You do not know much more about the fish, but a fisher would.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('weakness_to_shock', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction abilities that increase the target;s vulnerability to shock damage, amplifying the destructive power of lightning-based attacks. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions and can also be brewed into custom potions, making it an effective choice against enemies weak to electricity. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Weakness to Shock effect: Glow Dust, Glowing Mushroom, Hanging Moss, Hagraven Feathers, Void Salts', '''abiliti'':10B ''against'':51B ''also'':40B ''amplifying'':20B ''an'':48B ''and'':38B ''are'':7B ''at'':58B ''attacks'':28B ''avail'':32B ''bas'':27B ''be'':41B ''brew'':42B ''can'':39B ''choic'':50B ''combining'':57B ''craft'':36B ''creat'':71B ''custom'':44B ''damag'':19B ''destruction'':9B ''destructiv'':22B ''dust'':81B ''effect'':30B,69B,79B ''effectiv'':49B ''effects'':6B ''electricity'':55B ''enemi'':52B ''feathers'':87B ''following'':63B ''generally'':56B ''glow'':80B ''glowing'':82B ''hagrav'':86B ''hanging'':84B ''in'':33B ''incre'':12B ''ingredients'':64B ''into'':43B ''is'':31B ''it'':47B ''least'':59B ''lightning'':26B ''lightning-bas'':25B ''magical'':5B ''making'':46B ''moss'':85B ''mushroom'':83B ''of'':24B,61B ''offensiv'':8B ''potion'':73B ''potions'':37B,45B ''pow'':23B ''pre'':35B ''pre-craft'':34B ''provid'':65B ''s'':15B ''salts'':89B ''shar'':67B ''shock'':3A,18B,78B ''target'':14B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,21B,62B,75B ''thes'':4B ''they'':66B ''this'':29B,68B ''to'':2A,17B,54B,77B ''two'':60B ''void'':88B ''vulnerability'':16B ''weak'':53B ''weakness'':1A,76B ''will'':70B ''with'':74B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic makes enemies more vulnerable to shock damage, so lightning attacks hurt more. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('whirlwind_cloak', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction spells that surround the caster with a vortex of wind, repelling enemies and creating a protective barrier. This effect is only available as a spell, making it a defensive tool for combat-focused mages.', '''and'':21B ''are'':6B ''as'':31B ''avail'':30B ''barri'':25B ''cast'':13B ''cloak'':2A ''combat'':41B ''combat-focus'':40B ''creating'':22B ''defensiv'':37B ''destruction'':8B ''effect'':27B ''effects'':5B ''enemi'':20B ''focus'':42B ''for'':39B ''is'':28B ''it'':35B ''mag'':43B ''magical'':4B ''making'':34B ''of'':17B ''offensiv'':7B ''only'':29B ''protectiv'':24B ''repelling'':19B ''spell'':33B ''spells'':9B ''surround'':11B ''that'':10B ''the'':12B ''thes'':3B ''this'':26B ''tool'':38B ''vortex'':16B ''whirlwind'':1A ''wind'':18B ''with'':14B', 'mage', 'This spell surrounds the caster with wind, pushing enemies away and keeping them at a distance. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('whirlwind_sprint', 'Whirlwind Sprint is a Shout that propels you forward with the speed of a tempest, allowing you to rush ahead in the blink of an eye. The three words of power in this Shout are Wuld (Whirlwind), which summons the rushing wind; Nah (Fury), which intensifies the speed and force of the wind; and Kest (Tempest), which carries you swiftly forward, like a powerful storm.', '''ahe'':22B ''allowing'':18B ''an'':27B ''and'':51B,56B ''are'':37B ''blink'':25B ''carri'':60B ''eye'':28B ''forc'':52B ''forward'':11B,63B ''fury'':46B ''in'':23B,34B ''intensifi'':48B ''is'':5B ''kest'':57B ''lik'':64B ''nah'':45B ''of'':15B,26B,32B,53B ''pow'':33B ''powerful'':66B ''propels'':9B ''rush'':21B ''rushing'':43B ''shout'':7B,36B ''spe'':14B,50B ''sprint'':2A,4B ''storm'':67B ''summons'':41B ''swiftly'':62B ''tempest'':17B,58B ''that'':8B ''the'':13B,24B,29B,42B,49B,54B ''this'':35B ''thre'':30B ''to'':20B ''which'':40B,47B,59B ''whirlwind'':1A,3B,39B ''wind'':44B,55B ''with'':12B ''words'':31B ''wuld'':38B ''you'':10B,19B,61B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('witbane', 'Witbane is an acute disease that affects a victim''s memory, thought processes, and ability to regenerate magicka, causing symptoms like memory loss and disorientation. It can be contracted from dogs, sabre cats, and rats. As the disease progresses, it severely impairs magicka recovery, eventually preventing the victim from recovering magicka altogether if left untreated.', '''ability'':16B ''acut'':5B ''affects'':8B ''altogeth'':53B ''an'':4B ''and'':15B,25B,35B ''as'':37B ''be'':29B ''can'':28B ''cats'':34B ''causing'':20B ''contract'':30B ''dis'':6B,39B ''disorientation'':26B ''dogs'':32B ''eventually'':46B ''from'':31B,50B ''if'':54B ''impairs'':43B ''is'':3B ''it'':27B,41B ''left'':55B ''lik'':22B ''loss'':24B ''magick'':19B,44B,52B ''memory'':12B,23B ''preventing'':47B ''process'':14B ''progress'':40B ''rats'':36B ''recovering'':51B ''recovery'':45B ''regenerat'':18B ''s'':11B ''sabr'':33B ''severely'':42B ''symptoms'':21B ''that'':7B ''the'':38B,48B ''thought'':13B ''to'':17B ''untreat'':56B ''victim'':10B,49B ''witban'':1A,2B', 'alchemist', 'Witbane is an acute disease that affects a victim''s memory, thought processes, and ability to regenerate magicka, causing symptoms like memory loss and disorientation. It can be contracted from dogs, sabre cats, and rats.You do not know much else about this disease, but an alchemist would.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wuld_nah_kest', 'Whirlwind Sprint is a Shout that propels you forward with the speed of a tempest, allowing you to rush ahead in the blink of an eye. The three words of power in this Shout are Wuld (Whirlwind), which summons the rushing wind; Nah (Fury), which intensifies the speed and force of the wind; and Kest (Tempest), which carries you swiftly forward, like a powerful storm.', '''ahe'':23B ''allowing'':19B ''an'':28B ''and'':52B,57B ''are'':38B ''blink'':26B ''carri'':61B ''eye'':29B ''forc'':53B ''forward'':12B,64B ''fury'':47B ''in'':24B,35B ''intensifi'':49B ''is'':6B ''kest'':3A,58B ''lik'':65B ''nah'':2A,46B ''of'':16B,27B,33B,54B ''pow'':34B ''powerful'':67B ''propels'':10B ''rush'':22B ''rushing'':44B ''shout'':8B,37B ''spe'':15B,51B ''sprint'':5B ''storm'':68B ''summons'':42B ''swiftly'':63B ''tempest'':18B,59B ''that'':9B ''the'':14B,25B,30B,43B,50B,55B ''this'':36B ''thre'':31B ''to'':21B ''which'':41B,48B,60B ''whirlwind'':4B,40B ''wind'':45B,56B ''with'':13B ''words'':32B ''wuld'':1A,39B ''you'':11B,20B,62B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('yol_toor_shul', 'Fire Breath is a Shout that allows you to inhale air and exhale a powerful flame, creating an inferno. The three words of power in this Shout are Yol (Fire), which conjures the flames; Toor (Inferno), which intensifies the blaze into a fiery eruption; and Shul (Sun), which amplifies the heat and power of the flames to scorch your enemies.', '''air'':14B ''allows'':10B ''amplifi'':52B ''an'':21B ''and'':15B,48B,55B ''are'':31B ''blaz'':43B ''breath'':5B ''conjur'':35B ''creating'':20B ''enemi'':63B ''eruption'':47B ''exhal'':16B ''fiery'':46B ''fir'':4B,33B ''flam'':19B,37B,59B ''heat'':54B ''in'':28B ''infern'':22B,39B ''inhal'':13B ''intensifi'':41B ''into'':44B ''is'':6B ''of'':26B,57B ''pow'':27B,56B ''powerful'':18B ''scorch'':61B ''shout'':8B,30B ''shul'':3A,49B ''sun'':50B ''that'':9B ''the'':23B,36B,42B,53B,58B ''this'':29B ''thre'':24B ''to'':12B,60B ''toor'':2A,38B ''which'':34B,40B,51B ''words'':25B ''yol'':1A,32B ''you'':11B ''your'':62B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('glass_catfish', 'Glass Catfish are large translucent fish found in underground fishing spots. They can be eaten with a rather stale taste.', '''are'':5B ''be'':16B ''can'':15B ''catfish'':2A,4B ''eat'':17B ''fish'':8B ''fishing'':12B ''found'':9B ''glass'':1A,3B ''in'':10B ''larg'':6B ''rath'':20B ''spots'':13B ''stal'':21B ''tast'':22B ''they'':14B ''translucent'':7B ''underground'':11B ''with'':18B', 'fisher', 'Glass Catfish are large translucent fish. They can be eaten with a rather stale taste. You do not know much more about the fish, but a fisher would.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('zul_mey_gut', 'Throw Voice is a Shout that allows your voice to be heard from an unknown source, tricking enemies into seeking it out. The three words of power in this Shout are Zul (Voice), which produces the sound of your voice; Mey (Fool), which deceives the listener, making them believe the voice is coming from a different location; and Gut (Far), which projects the sound over a great distance, drawing enemies away from their position.', '''allows'':10B ''an'':17B ''and'':61B ''are'':34B ''away'':74B ''be'':14B ''believ'':52B ''coming'':56B ''deceiv'':47B ''different'':59B ''distanc'':71B ''drawing'':72B ''enemi'':21B,73B ''far'':63B ''fool'':45B ''from'':16B,57B,75B ''great'':70B ''gut'':3A,62B ''heard'':15B ''in'':31B ''into'':22B ''is'':6B,55B ''it'':24B ''listen'':49B ''location'':60B ''making'':50B ''mey'':2A,44B ''of'':29B,41B ''out'':25B ''over'':68B ''position'':77B ''pow'':30B ''produc'':38B ''projects'':65B ''seeking'':23B ''shout'':8B,33B ''sound'':40B,67B ''sourc'':19B ''that'':9B ''the'':26B,39B,48B,53B,66B,76B ''them'':51B ''this'':32B ''thre'':27B ''throw'':4B ''to'':13B ''tricking'':20B ''unknown'':18B ''voic'':5B,12B,36B,43B,54B ''which'':37B,46B,64B ''words'':28B ''your'':11B,42B ''zul'':1A,35B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('zun_haal_viik', 'Disarm is a Shout that defies steel, ripping the weapon from an opponent''s grasp. The three words of power in this Shout are Zun (Weapon), which targets the weapon of your foe; Haal (Hand), which pries it from their grip; and Viik (Defeat), which ensures their weapon is taken away in defeat.', '''an'':15B ''and'':45B ''are'':27B ''away'':54B ''defeat'':47B,56B ''defi'':9B ''disarm'':4B ''ensur'':49B ''foe'':36B ''from'':14B,42B ''grasp'':18B ''grip'':44B ''haal'':2A,37B ''hand'':38B ''in'':24B,55B ''is'':5B,52B ''it'':41B ''of'':22B,34B ''opponent'':16B ''pow'':23B ''pri'':40B ''ripping'':11B ''s'':17B ''shout'':7B,26B ''steel'':10B ''tak'':53B ''targets'':31B ''that'':8B ''the'':12B,19B,32B,43B,50B ''this'':25B ''thre'':20B ''viik'':3A,46B ''weapon'':13B,29B,33B,51B ''which'':30B,39B,48B ''words'':21B ''your'':35B ''zun'':1A,28B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('vampire', 'Vampires are preternatural beings in Tamriel, often regarded as undead creatures that feed on the blood of the living. This condition arises from the curse of vampirism, which can make individuals into feared and misunderstood abominations. While some vampires view their state as a curse, others might perceive it as a blessing, struggling with their primal instincts or seeking to overcome the disease that has transformed them. Despite their potential for power and agility, they are widely hunted and despised by society, especially in Imperial culture, which labels them as destructive monsters.', '''abominations'':37B ''agility'':75B ''and'':35B,74B,80B ''are'':3B,77B ''aris'':23B ''as'':10B,44B,51B,91B ''beings'':5B ''blessing'':53B ''blood'':17B ''by'':82B ''can'':30B ''condition'':22B ''creatur'':12B ''cultur'':87B ''curs'':26B,46B ''despis'':81B ''despit'':69B ''destructiv'':92B ''dis'':64B ''especially'':84B ''fear'':34B ''feed'':14B ''for'':72B ''from'':24B ''hunt'':79B ''imperial'':86B ''in'':6B,85B ''individuals'':32B ''instincts'':58B ''into'':33B ''it'':50B ''labels'':89B ''living'':20B ''mak'':31B ''might'':48B ''misunderstood'':36B ''monsters'':93B ''of'':18B,27B ''often'':8B ''on'':15B ''or'':59B ''others'':47B ''overcom'':62B ''perceiv'':49B ''potential'':71B ''pow'':73B ''preternatural'':4B ''primal'':57B ''regard'':9B ''seeking'':60B ''society'':83B ''som'':39B ''stat'':43B ''struggling'':54B ''tamriel'':7B ''that'':13B,65B ''the'':16B,19B,25B,42B,56B,63B,70B ''them'':68B,90B ''they'':76B ''this'':21B ''to'':61B ''transform'':67B ''unde'':11B ''vampir'':1A,2B,40B ''vampirism'':28B ''view'':41B ''which'':29B,88B ''whil'':38B ''widely'':78B ''with'':55B', 'vampire, dawnguard, priest, snowelf', 'Vampires are preternatural beings in Tamriel, often regarded as undead creatures that feed on the blood of the living. Despite their potential for power and agility, they are widely hunted and despised by society, especially in Imperial culture, which labels them as destructive monsters.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('werewolf', 'Werewolves are fearsome, wolf-like creatures that inhabit the wilds of Skyrim. They are larger and more powerful than ordinary humans and elves, capable of moving bipedally or sprinting on all fours. While they possess significant strength and speed, they are vulnerable to silver weapons, which can injure them significantly. Unlike ordinary mortals, werewolves are immune to diseases and paralysis effects, which makes them formidable adversaries.', '''adversari'':68B ''all'':33B ''and'':18B,24B,40B,61B ''are'':3B,16B,43B,57B ''bipedally'':29B ''can'':49B ''capabl'':26B ''creatur'':8B ''dis'':60B ''effects'':63B ''elves'':25B ''fearsom'':4B ''formid'':67B ''fours'':34B ''humans'':23B ''immun'':58B ''inhabit'':10B ''injur'':50B ''larg'':17B ''lik'':7B ''mak'':65B ''mor'':19B ''mortals'':55B ''moving'':28B ''of'':13B,27B ''on'':32B ''or'':30B ''ordinary'':22B,54B ''paralysis'':62B ''possess'':37B ''powerful'':20B ''significant'':38B ''significantly'':52B ''silv'':46B ''skyrim'':14B ''spe'':41B ''sprinting'':31B ''strength'':39B ''than'':21B ''that'':9B ''the'':11B ''them'':51B,66B ''they'':15B,36B,42B ''to'':45B,59B ''unlik'':53B ''vulner'':44B ''weapons'':47B ''werewolf'':1A ''werewolv'':2B,56B ''which'':48B,64B ''whil'':35B ''wilds'':12B ''wolf'':6B ''wolf-lik'':5B', 'werewolf, companions', 'Werewolves are  rumoured to be fearsome, wolf-like creatures that inhabit the wilds of Skyrim. ', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('slaughterfish', 'Slaughterfish are aggressive predatory fish found in diverse aquatic environments across Nirn. Known for their sharp teeth and swift, lethal attacks, they form dense schools and grow exceptionally large when well-fed. Variants such as the Rumare Slaughterfish, Blind Slaughterfish, and the legendary Crab-Slaughter-Crane highlight their adaptability. While their bites can cause severe injuries and transmit diseases like Greenspore, slaughterfish are valuable for their alchemical properties, crafting materials, and culinary uses. Regions like Vvardenfell consume their dried scales as treats, while Nords favor stone-cooked slaughterfish as a delicacy. Their prevalence has spurred preventative measures, such as enchanted bobbers and repellents, reflecting their dual role as both a threat and a resource in Tamrielic life.', '''across'':12B ''adaptability'':52B ''aggressiv'':4B ''alchemical'':70B ''and'':19B,27B,43B,60B,74B,106B,116B ''aquatic'':10B ''are'':3B,66B ''as'':37B,84B,93B,103B,112B ''attacks'':22B ''bit'':55B ''blind'':41B ''bobbers'':105B ''both'':113B ''can'':56B ''caus'':57B ''consum'':80B ''cook'':91B ''crab'':47B ''crab-slaughter-cran'':46B ''crafting'':72B ''cran'':49B ''culinary'':75B ''delicacy'':95B ''dens'':25B ''dis'':62B ''div'':9B ''dri'':82B ''dual'':110B ''enchant'':104B ''environments'':11B ''exceptionally'':29B ''favor'':88B ''fed'':34B ''fish'':6B ''for'':15B,68B ''form'':24B ''found'':7B ''greenspor'':64B ''grow'':28B ''highlight'':50B ''in'':8B,119B ''injuri'':59B ''known'':14B ''larg'':30B ''legendary'':45B ''lethal'':21B ''lif'':121B ''lik'':63B,78B ''materials'':73B ''measur'':101B ''nirn'':13B ''nords'':87B ''predatory'':5B ''prevalenc'':97B ''preventativ'':100B ''properti'':71B ''reflecting'':108B ''regions'':77B ''repellents'':107B ''resourc'':118B ''rol'':111B ''rumar'':39B ''scal'':83B ''schools'':26B ''sever'':58B ''sharp'':17B ''slaught'':48B ''slaughterfish'':1A,2B,40B,42B,65B,92B ''spurr'':99B ''ston'':90B ''stone-cook'':89B ''such'':36B,102B ''swift'':20B ''tamrielic'':120B ''teeth'':18B ''the'':16B,38B,44B,51B,54B,69B,81B,96B,109B ''they'':23B ''threat'':115B ''transmit'':61B ''treats'':85B ''uses'':76B ''valuabl'':67B ''variants'':35B ''vvardenfell'':79B ''well'':33B ''well-f'':32B ''when'':31B ''whil'':53B,86B', 'hunter', 'Slaughterfish are small, aggressive aquatic predators found in nearly all waters of Nirn. Recognizable by their razor-sharp teeth, these fish often swim in large groups, quickly overwhelming and attacking unsuspecting prey.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mudcrab', 'Mudcrabs are a common species of crab found throughout Tamriel, recognizable by their ability to camouflage as small rocks along shores and waterways. Generally non-aggressive, mudcrabs will only attack when provoked or cornered. However, once they acquire a taste for meat, they may become predatory, posing a threat to livestock. They rely on their pincers and burrowing abilities for defense and can strip a corpse to its bones within days, a feat that lesser crabs take weeks to accomplish. Some mudcrabs can reach enormous sizes, and rare albino variants are known to exist. They can be harvested for their meat and chitin.', '''abiliti'':61B ''ability'':15B ''accomplish'':82B ''acquir'':40B ''aggressiv'':28B ''albin'':91B ''along'':21B ''and'':23B,59B,64B,89B,104B ''are'':3B,93B ''as'':18B ''attack'':32B ''be'':99B ''becom'':47B ''bon'':71B ''burrowing'':60B ''by'':13B ''camouflag'':17B ''can'':65B,85B,98B ''chitin'':105B ''common'':5B ''corner'':36B ''corps'':68B ''crab'':8B ''crabs'':78B ''days'':73B ''defens'':63B ''enormous'':87B ''exist'':96B ''feat'':75B ''for'':43B,62B,101B ''found'':9B ''generally'':25B ''harvest'':100B ''howev'':37B ''its'':70B ''known'':94B ''less'':77B ''livestock'':53B ''may'':46B ''meat'':44B,103B ''mudcrab'':1A ''mudcrabs'':2B,29B,84B ''non'':27B ''non-aggressiv'':26B ''of'':7B ''on'':56B ''once'':38B ''only'':31B ''or'':35B ''pincers'':58B ''posing'':49B ''predatory'':48B ''provok'':34B ''rar'':90B ''reach'':86B ''recogniz'':12B ''rely'':55B ''rocks'':20B ''shor'':22B ''siz'':88B ''small'':19B ''som'':83B ''speci'':6B ''strip'':66B ''tak'':79B ''tamriel'':11B ''tast'':42B ''that'':76B ''the'':14B,57B,102B ''they'':39B,45B,54B,97B ''threat'':51B ''throughout'':10B ''to'':16B,52B,69B,81B,95B ''variants'':92B ''waterways'':24B ''weeks'':80B ''when'':33B ''will'':30B ''within'':72B', 'hunter', 'Mudcrabs are a common species of crab found throughout Tamriel, recognizable by their ability to camouflage as small rocks along shores and waterways. Generally non-aggressive, mudcrabs will only attack when provoked or cornered.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ash_spawn', 'Ash Spawn are eerie, undead-like creatures that inhabit the Ashlands of southern Solstheim. These beings are formed from the remains of the deceased, specifically bones buried beneath the ashen terrain, which are animated by Heart Stones and infused with the ash of Red Mountain. Notably, Ash Spawn exhibit immunity to poison and possess a strong resistance to fire, though they do not have any specific weaknesses. ', '''and'':41B,56B ''animat'':37B ''any'':68B ''are'':5B,20B,36B ''ash'':1A,3B,45B,50B ''ashen'':33B ''ashlands'':14B ''beings'':19B ''beneath'':31B ''bon'':29B ''buri'':30B ''by'':38B ''creatur'':10B ''deceas'':27B ''do'':65B ''eeri'':6B ''exhibit'':52B ''fir'':62B ''form'':21B ''from'':22B ''hav'':67B ''heart'':39B ''immunity'':53B ''infus'':42B ''inhabit'':12B ''lik'':9B ''mountain'':48B ''not'':66B ''notably'':49B ''of'':15B,25B,46B ''poison'':55B ''possess'':57B ''red'':47B ''remains'':24B ''resistanc'':60B ''solstheim'':17B ''southern'':16B ''spawn'':2A,4B,51B ''specific'':69B ''specifically'':28B ''ston'':40B ''strong'':59B ''terrain'':34B ''that'':11B ''the'':13B,23B,26B,32B,44B ''thes'':18B ''they'':64B ''though'':63B ''to'':54B,61B ''unde'':8B ''undead-lik'':7B ''weakness'':70B ''which'':35B ''with'':43B', 'solstheim', 'Ash Spawn are eerie, undead-like creatures that inhabit Solstheim. ', '', '', 'creatures');
