INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bear', 'Bears are large, aggressive creatures found in the wilderness or caves, attacking if their territory is threatened. They carry the disease Bone Break Fever, which reduces stamina, but they typically growl or roar before attacking, making them easy to avoid. Standard, cave, and snow bears are found in Skyrim and Solstheim, with snow bears living in high altitudes. Bear carcasses can be harvested for pelts and claws.', '''aggressiv'':5B ''altitud'':59B ''and'':44B,51B,67B ''are'':3B,47B ''attacking'':13B,36B ''avo'':41B ''be'':63B ''bear'':1A,60B ''bears'':2B,46B,55B ''befor'':35B ''bon'':23B ''break'':24B ''but'':29B ''can'':62B ''carcass'':61B ''carry'':20B ''cav'':12B,43B ''claws'':68B ''creatur'':6B ''dis'':22B ''easy'':39B ''fev'':25B ''for'':65B ''found'':7B,48B ''growl'':32B ''harvest'':64B ''high'':58B ''if'':14B ''in'':8B,49B,57B ''is'':17B ''larg'':4B ''living'':56B ''making'':37B ''or'':11B,33B ''pelts'':66B ''reduc'':27B ''roar'':34B ''skyrim'':50B ''snow'':45B,54B ''solstheim'':52B ''stamin'':28B ''standard'':42B ''territory'':16B ''the'':9B,15B,21B ''them'':38B ''they'':19B,30B ''threaten'':18B ''to'':40B ''typically'':31B ''which'':26B ''wilderness'':10B ''with'':53B', 'hunter', 'Bears are large, aggressive creatures found in the wilderness or caves, attacking if their territory is threatened.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('deer', 'Deer are non-aggressive animals found throughout Skyrim, known for their shyness and tendency to flee when approached. However, they can become hostile if influenced by a spriggan. Deer are hunted for their venison, hide, and antlers, with two species found: "Deer," which resemble caribou or reindeer, and "Elk," which resemble the extinct Megaloceros. When hunting, it''s best to kill them with one shot, as they are quick and evasive. Deer pelts found at hunter''s camps cannot be tanned into leather.', '''aggressiv'':6B ''and'':15B,38B,50B,72B ''animals'':7B ''antlers'':39B ''approach'':20B ''are'':3B,32B,70B ''as'':68B ''at'':77B ''be'':82B ''becom'':24B ''best'':61B ''by'':28B ''camps'':80B ''can'':23B ''cannot'':81B ''caribou'':47B ''deer'':1A,2B,31B,44B,74B ''elk'':51B ''evasiv'':73B ''extinct'':55B ''fle'':18B ''for'':12B,34B ''found'':8B,43B,76B ''hid'':37B ''hostil'':25B ''howev'':21B ''hunt'':33B,78B ''hunting'':58B ''if'':26B ''influenc'':27B ''into'':84B ''it'':59B ''kill'':63B ''known'':11B ''leath'':85B ''megalocer'':56B ''non'':5B ''non-aggressiv'':4B ''one'':66B ''or'':48B ''pelts'':75B ''quick'':71B ''reind'':49B ''resembl'':46B,53B ''s'':60B,79B ''shot'':67B ''shyness'':14B ''skyrim'':10B ''speci'':42B ''sprigg'':30B ''tann'':83B ''tendency'':16B ''the'':13B,35B,54B ''them'':64B ''they'':22B,69B ''throughout'':9B ''to'':17B,62B ''two'':41B ''venison'':36B ''when'':19B,57B ''which'':45B,52B ''with'':40B,65B', 'hunter', 'Deer are non-aggressive animals found throughout Skyrim, known for their shyness and tendency to flee when approached.', '', '', 'creatures');
