INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('goat', '
Goats are non-aggressive animals found on mountain slopes in Skyrim. Goats are hunted for their hides, meat, and horns.', '''aggressiv'':6B ''and'':21B ''animals'':7B ''are'':3B,15B ''for'':17B ''found'':8B ''goat'':1A ''goats'':2B,14B ''hid'':19B ''horns'':22B ''hunt'':16B ''in'':12B ''meat'':20B ''mountain'':10B ''non'':5B ''non-aggressiv'':4B ''on'':9B ''skyrim'':13B ''slop'':11B ''the'':18B', 'hunter', 'Goats are non-aggressive animals found on mountain slopes in Skyrim.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('horker', 'Horkers are sea animals resembling walruses, commonly found in packs near rivers and icy shores in northern Skyrim. They are slow and easy to avoid on land but become faster and harder to outrun in water. If provoked, horkers will become hostile. Looting their bodies may yield horker meat, tusks, and occasionally small amounts of gold or gems.', '''amounts'':55B ''and'':14B,23B,32B,52B ''animals'':5B ''are'':3B,21B ''avo'':26B ''becom'':30B,42B ''bodi'':46B ''but'':29B ''commonly'':8B ''easy'':24B ''fast'':31B ''found'':9B ''gems'':59B ''gold'':57B ''hard'':33B ''hork'':1A,49B ''horkers'':2B,40B ''hostil'':43B ''icy'':15B ''if'':38B ''in'':10B,17B,36B ''land'':28B ''looting'':44B ''may'':47B ''meat'':50B ''near'':12B ''northern'':18B ''occasionally'':53B ''of'':56B ''on'':27B ''or'':58B ''outrun'':35B ''packs'':11B ''provok'':39B ''resembling'':6B ''rivers'':13B ''shor'':16B ''skyrim'':19B ''slow'':22B ''small'':54B ''the'':45B ''they'':20B ''to'':25B,34B ''tusks'':51B ''walrus'':7B ''wat'':37B ''will'':41B ''yield'':48B', 'hunter', 'Horkers are sea animals resembling walruses, commonly found in packs near rivers and icy shores in northern Skyrim. They are slow and easy to avoid on land but become faster and harder to outrun in water.', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mammoth', '
Mammoths are massive creatures found in the tundra of Skyrim, often seen alongside giants or traveling under their protection. They have long tusks, with tame mammoths having engraved tusks, while wild ones have plain tusks. Mammoths will defend themselves if attacked, with the herding giant rushing to protect them, but will turn passive if the giant is killed. They avoid water and can get stuck behind obstacles, making them easier to evade or attack from a distance.', '''alongsid'':14B ''and'':63B ''are'':3B ''attack'':42B,75B ''avo'':61B ''behind'':67B ''but'':51B ''can'':64B ''creatur'':5B ''defend'':39B ''distanc'':78B ''easi'':71B ''engrav'':29B ''evad'':73B ''found'':6B ''from'':76B ''get'':65B ''giant'':46B,57B ''giants'':15B ''hav'':22B,34B ''having'':28B ''herding'':45B ''if'':41B,55B ''in'':7B ''is'':58B ''kill'':59B ''long'':23B ''making'':69B ''mammoth'':1A ''mammoths'':2B,27B,37B ''massiv'':4B ''obstacl'':68B ''of'':10B ''often'':12B ''ones'':33B ''or'':16B,74B ''passiv'':54B ''plain'':35B ''protect'':49B ''protection'':20B ''rushing'':47B ''seen'':13B ''skyrim'':11B ''stuck'':66B ''tam'':26B ''the'':8B,19B,44B,56B ''them'':50B,70B ''themselv'':40B ''they'':21B,60B ''to'':48B,72B ''traveling'':17B ''tundr'':9B ''turn'':53B ''tusks'':24B,30B,36B ''under'':18B ''wat'':62B ''whil'':31B ''wild'':32B ''will'':38B,52B ''with'':25B,43B', 'hunter', 'Mammoths are massive creatures  with long tusks found in the tundra of Skyrim, often seen alongside giants or traveling under their protection. ', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rabbit', 'Rabbits are small, non-hostile animals that quickly flee when approached. They are often hunted by larger predators like foxes. Due to their small size and speed, they can be difficult to catch. They can be harvested for their legs which taste good.', '''and'':28B ''animals'':8B ''approach'':13B ''are'':3B,15B ''be'':32B,38B ''by'':18B ''can'':31B,37B ''catch'':35B ''difficult'':33B ''due'':23B ''fle'':11B ''for'':40B ''fox'':22B ''good'':45B ''harvest'':39B ''hostil'':7B ''hunt'':17B ''larg'':19B ''legs'':42B ''lik'':21B ''non'':6B ''non-hostil'':5B ''often'':16B ''predators'':20B ''quickly'':10B ''rabbit'':1A ''rabbits'':2B ''siz'':27B ''small'':4B,26B ''spe'':29B ''tast'':44B ''that'':9B ''the'':25B,41B ''they'':14B,30B,36B ''to'':24B,34B ''when'':12B ''which'':43B', 'hunter', '', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('sabre_cat', '
Sabre Cats are large, fast, and powerful felines found in the wilds of Skyrim. Known for their sharp front teeth, they are aggressive hunters that will attack on sight. Sabre cats can carry Witbane, a disease that reduces magicka regeneration. They are stealthy and quick, but can be outmaneuvered by dodging, and dislike water, which can be used to evade them. They can be harvested for their pelt for tanning, and eyes for alchemy.', '''aggressiv'':25B ''alchemy'':76B ''and'':8B,46B,54B,73B ''are'':5B,24B,44B ''attack'':29B ''be'':50B,59B,66B ''but'':48B ''by'':52B ''can'':34B,49B,58B,65B ''carry'':35B ''cat'':2A ''cats'':4B,33B ''dis'':38B ''dislik'':55B ''dodging'':53B ''evad'':62B ''eyes'':74B ''fast'':7B ''felin'':10B ''for'':18B,68B,71B,75B ''found'':11B ''front'':21B ''harvest'':67B ''hunters'':26B ''in'':12B ''known'':17B ''larg'':6B ''magick'':41B ''of'':15B ''on'':30B ''outmaneuver'':51B ''pelt'':70B ''powerful'':9B ''quick'':47B ''reduc'':40B ''regeneration'':42B ''sabr'':1A,3B,32B ''sharp'':20B ''sight'':31B ''skyrim'':16B ''stealthy'':45B ''tanning'':72B ''teeth'':22B ''that'':27B,39B ''the'':13B,19B,69B ''them'':63B ''they'':23B,43B,64B ''to'':61B ''used'':60B ''wat'':56B ''which'':57B ''wilds'':14B ''will'':28B ''witban'':36B', 'hunter', 'Sabre Cats are large, fast, and powerful felines found in the wilds of Skyrim. Known for their sharp front teeth, they are aggressive hunters that will attack on sight. ', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('skeever', '
Skeevers are small, aggressive, rat-like creatures found in dark areas like caves or dungeons, as well as the wilderness of Skyrim. While they are generally considered weak enemies, they can carry the disease Ataxia, which reduces Lockpicking and Pickpocket skills.', '''aggressiv'':5B ''and'':41B ''are'':3B,13B,27B ''as'':18B,20B ''ataxi'':37B ''can'':33B ''carry'':34B ''cav'':15B ''consider'':29B ''creatur'':9B ''dark'':12B ''dis'':36B ''dungeons'':17B ''enemi'':31B ''found'':10B ''generally'':28B ''in'':11B ''lik'':8B,14B ''lockpicking'':40B ''of'':23B ''or'':16B ''pickpocket'':42B ''rat'':7B ''rat-lik'':6B ''reduc'':39B ''skeev'':1A ''skeevers'':2B ''skills'':43B ''skyrim'':24B ''small'':4B ''the'':21B,35B ''they'':26B,32B ''weak'':30B ''well'':19B ''which'':38B ''whil'':25B ''wilderness'':22B', 'hunter', 'Skeevers are small, aggressive, rat-like creatures found in dark areas like caves or dungeons, as well as the wilderness of Skyrim. ', '', '', 'creatures');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wind_stone', 'The Water Stone is one of the All-Maker Stones located on Solstheim, positioned north of Raven Rock and west of Fahlbtharz. This sacred site holds profound importance to the Skaal people, reflecting their spiritual connection to the natural elements and their worship of the All-Maker.', '''all'':11B,50B ''all-mak'':10B,49B ''and'':22B,44B ''connection'':39B ''elements'':43B ''fahlbtharz'':25B ''holds'':29B ''importanc'':31B ''is'':6B ''locat'':14B ''mak'':12B,51B ''natural'':42B ''north'':18B ''of'':8B,19B,24B,47B ''on'':15B ''one'':7B ''peopl'':35B ''position'':17B ''profound'':30B ''rav'':20B ''reflecting'':36B ''rock'':21B ''sacr'':27B ''sit'':28B ''skaal'':34B ''solstheim'':16B ''spiritual'':38B ''ston'':2A,5B,13B ''the'':3B,9B,33B,37B,41B,45B,48B ''this'':26B ''to'':32B,40B ''wat'':4B ''west'':23B ''wind'':1A ''worship'':46B', 'solstheim', 'You do not know anything about this area.', '', '', 'solstheim');
