Dragonsreach, perched in the Cloud District of Whiterun, is the grand palace of the Jarl and the heart of Whiterun Hold’s political power. Dragonsreach is not just a residence but a historic landmark, said to be built around a dragon trap used by Olaf One-Eye. ', '', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('whiterun_stables', 'Whiterun Stables is a small but essential location just outside the gates of Whiterun, providing lodging for horses and a place for travelers to acquire mounts. Owned by Lillith Maiden-Loom and operated by Skulvar Sable-Hilt, the stables are also home to Skulvar and his son Jervar, who live within the residence attached to the facility.', '''acquir'':27B ''also'':45B ''and'':21B,35B,49B ''are'':44B ''attach'':58B ''but'':8B ''by'':30B,37B ''essential'':9B ''facility'':61B ''for'':19B,24B ''gat'':14B ''hilt'':41B ''his'':50B ''hom'':46B ''hors'':20B ''is'':5B ''jerv'':52B ''just'':11B ''lillith'':31B ''liv'':54B ''location'':10B ''lodging'':18B ''loom'':34B ''maid'':33B ''maiden-loom'':32B ''mounts'':28B ''of'':15B ''operat'':36B ''outsid'':12B ''owned'':29B ''plac'':23B ''providing'':17B ''residenc'':57B ''sabl'':40B ''sable-hilt'':39B ''skulv'':38B,48B ''small'':7B ''stabl'':2A,4B,43B ''the'':13B,42B,56B,60B ''to'':26B,47B,59B ''travelers'':25B ''whiterun'':1A,3B,16B ''who'':53B ''within'':55B', 'whiterun', 'Whiterun Stables is a small but essential location just outside the gates of Whiterun, providing lodging for horses and a place for travelers to acquire mounts. You do not know who owns or work the stables. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('riverwood', 'Riverwood is a small milling town in southern Whiterun Hold, nestled at the foot of the Throat of the World and situated along the banks of the White River. Located just south of Whiterun and east of Bleak Falls Barrow.

Despite its modest size, Riverwood offers essential facilities, including a sawmill, a general goods store known as the Riverwood Trader, and the Sleeping Giant Inn, a cozy tavern ideal for rest and socializing.', '''along'':24B ''and'':22B,36B,62B,73B ''as'':58B ''at'':13B ''banks'':26B ''barrow'':41B ''bleak'':39B ''cozy'':68B ''despit'':42B ''east'':37B ''essential'':48B ''faciliti'':49B ''falls'':40B ''foot'':15B ''for'':71B ''general'':54B ''giant'':65B ''goods'':55B ''hold'':11B ''ideal'':70B ''in'':8B ''including'':50B ''inn'':66B ''is'':3B ''its'':43B ''just'':32B ''known'':57B ''locat'':31B ''milling'':6B ''modest'':44B ''nestl'':12B ''of'':16B,19B,27B,34B,38B ''offers'':47B ''rest'':72B ''riv'':30B ''riverwood'':1A,2B,46B,60B ''sawmill'':52B ''situat'':23B ''siz'':45B ''sleeping'':64B ''small'':5B ''socializing'':74B ''south'':33B ''southern'':9B ''stor'':56B ''tavern'':69B ''the'':14B,17B,20B,25B,28B,59B,63B ''throat'':18B ''town'':7B ''trad'':61B ''whit'':29B ''whiterun'':10B,35B ''world'':21B', 'whiterun', 'Riverwood is a small milling town in southern Whiterun Hold, nestled at the foot of the Throat of the World and situated along the banks of the White River. Located just south of Whiterun and east of Bleak Falls Barrow.You do not know anything else about this area.', '', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rorikstead', 'Rorikstead is a small farming town in western Whiterun Hold, located west of Swindler''s Den and east-southeast of Bleakwind Bluff. The town is named after Rorik, a noble who resides in the local "manor" and plays a central role in its community. Despite its living namesake, Rorikstead’s name and origins appear much older, being referenced in the Merethic or First Era text Holdings of Jarl Gjalund as "Rorik''s Steading" and in the Second Era text Atlas of Dragons. It is also immortalized in the bard''s song Ragnar the Red, which describes it as "ole Rorikstead," hinting at the existence of an ancient settlement that preceded the current town.


Frostfruit Inn, owned by Mralki, is located here. Known for its abundant crop fields, Rorikstead boasts a reputation for bountiful harvests, with residents proudly claiming they have not suffered a bad season in years. ', '''abundant'':127B ''after'':29B ''also'':87B ''an'':108B ''ancient'':109B ''and'':18B,39B,54B,76B ''appe'':56B ''as'':72B,100B ''at'':104B ''atlas'':82B ''bad'':146B ''bard'':91B ''being'':59B ''bleakwind'':23B ''bluff'':24B ''boasts'':131B ''bountiful'':135B ''by'':119B ''central'':42B ''claiming'':140B ''community'':46B ''crop'':128B ''current'':114B ''den'':17B ''describ'':98B ''despit'':47B ''dragons'':84B ''east'':20B ''east-southeast'':19B ''existenc'':106B ''farming'':6B ''fields'':129B ''first'':65B ''for'':125B,134B ''frostfruit'':116B ''gjalund'':71B ''harvests'':136B ''hav'':142B ''her'':123B ''hinting'':103B ''hold'':11B ''holdings'':68B ''immortaliz'':88B ''in'':8B,35B,44B,61B,77B,89B,148B ''inn'':117B ''is'':3B,27B,86B,121B ''it'':85B,99B ''its'':45B,48B,126B ''jarl'':70B ''known'':124B ''living'':49B ''local'':37B ''locat'':12B,122B ''manor'':38B ''merethic'':63B ''mralki'':120B ''much'':57B ''nam'':28B,53B ''namesak'':50B ''nobl'':32B ''not'':143B ''of'':14B,22B,69B,83B,107B ''older'':58B ''ole'':101B ''or'':64B ''origins'':55B ''owned'':118B ''plays'':40B ''preced'':112B ''proudly'':139B ''ragn'':94B ''red'':96B ''referenc'':60B ''reputation'':133B ''resid'':34B ''residents'':138B ''rol'':43B ''rorik'':30B,73B ''rorikst'':1A,2B,51B,102B,130B ''s'':16B,52B,74B,92B ''season'':147B ''second'':79B ''settlement'':110B ''small'':5B ''song'':93B ''southeast'':21B ''steading'':75B ''suffer'':144B ''swindl'':15B ''text'':67B,81B ''that'':111B ''the'':25B,36B,62B,78B,90B,95B,105B,113B ''they'':141B ''town'':7B,26B,115B ''west'':13B ''western'':9B ''which'':97B ''whiterun'':10B ''who'':33B ''with'':137B ''years'':149B', 'whiterun', 'Rorikstead is a small farming town in western Whiterun Hold, located west of Swindler''s Den and east-southeast of Bleakwind Bluff. Frostfruit Inn is situtated here,  but you do not know who owns it.You do not know anything else about this area.', '', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('honningbrew_meadery', 'Honningbrew Meadery, owned by Sabjorn, is a bustling meadery located southeast of Whiterun and north-northeast of Riverwood, nestled within the fertile plains of Whiterun Hold. Renowned for its production of Honningbrew Mead, it stands as a proud competitor to the famous Black-Briar Meadery of Riften.

The meadery consists of two buildings: the main brewing hall, Honningbrew Meadery, and the adjacent Honningbrew Boilery. Its strategic location near Whiterun makes it a hub for trade and a popular supplier of mead throughout Skyrim. The rich aroma of fermenting honey and the sounds of activity within are a testament to its thriving operation and its ambition to carve a name for itself among the land’s most cherished brewers.', '''activity'':98B ''adjacent'':66B ''ambition'':109B ''among'':116B ''and'':16B,64B,80B,94B,107B ''are'':100B ''arom'':90B ''as'':39B ''black'':47B ''black-bri'':46B ''boilery'':68B ''brewers'':122B ''brewing'':60B ''bri'':48B ''buildings'':57B ''bustling'':10B ''by'':6B ''carv'':111B ''cherish'':121B ''competitor'':42B ''consists'':54B ''famous'':45B ''fermenting'':92B ''fertil'':25B ''for'':31B,78B,114B ''hall'':61B ''hold'':29B ''honey'':93B ''honningbrew'':1A,3B,35B,62B,67B ''hub'':77B ''is'':8B ''it'':37B,75B ''its'':32B,69B,104B,108B ''itself'':115B ''land'':118B ''locat'':12B ''location'':71B ''main'':59B ''mak'':74B ''mead'':36B,85B ''meadery'':2A,4B,11B,49B,53B,63B ''most'':120B ''nam'':113B ''near'':72B ''nestl'':22B ''north'':18B ''north-northeast'':17B ''northeast'':19B ''of'':14B,20B,27B,34B,50B,55B,84B,91B,97B ''operation'':106B ''owned'':5B ''plains'':26B ''popul'':82B ''production'':33B ''proud'':41B ''renown'':30B ''rich'':89B ''rift'':51B ''riverwood'':21B ''s'':119B ''sabjorn'':7B ''skyrim'':87B ''sounds'':96B ''southeast'':13B ''stands'':38B ''strategic'':70B ''suppli'':83B ''testament'':102B ''the'':24B,44B,52B,58B,65B,88B,95B,117B ''thriving'':105B ''throughout'':86B ''to'':43B,103B,110B ''trad'':79B ''two'':56B ''whiterun'':15B,28B,73B ''within'':23B,99B', 'whiterun', 'Honningbrew Meadery is a bustling meadery located southeast of Whiterun and north-northeast of Riverwood, nestled within the fertile plains of Whiterun Hold. Renowned for its production of Honningbrew Mead, it stands as a proud competitor to the famous Black-Briar Meadery of Riften. You do not know who owns the meadery.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lunds_hut', 'Lund''s Hut is a modest shack situated northwest of Rorikstead and east of Bleakwind Bluff, nestled within the rugged plains of Whiterun Hold. It is rumored that the place has been overan by skeevers who have ruined the place.', '''and'':14B ''been'':34B ''bleakwind'':17B ''bluff'':18B ''by'':36B ''east'':15B ''hav'':39B ''hold'':26B ''hut'':2A,5B ''is'':6B,28B ''it'':27B ''lund'':3B ''lunds'':1A ''modest'':8B ''nestl'':19B ''northwest'':11B ''of'':12B,16B,24B ''over'':35B ''plac'':32B,42B ''plains'':23B ''rorikst'':13B ''rugg'':22B ''ruin'':40B ''rumor'':29B ''s'':4B ''shack'':9B ''situat'':10B ''skeevers'':37B ''that'':30B ''the'':21B,31B,41B ''whiterun'':25B ''who'':38B ''within'':20B', 'whiterun', 'Lund''s Hut is a modest shack situated northwest of Rorikstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('chillfurrow_farm', 'Chillfurrow Farm is a modest agricultural holding located just east of Whiterun, south of Battle-Born Farm, nestled within the fertile lands of Whiterun Hold. Owned by the affluent but often absent Nazeem, the farm''s daily operations are entrusted to Wilmuth, a hardworking caretaker who resides in the farmhouse.

Despite Nazeem’s lack of presence, Chillfurrow Farm is well-maintained, with a Whiterun Guard stationed on-site to ensure its security. Another guard regularly patrols the yard, reflecting its importance as part of the region''s agricultural network. The farm stands as a quiet yet vital contributor to the prosperity of Whiterun Hold, its fields and farmhouse embodying the steady rhythm of Skyrim’s agrarian life.', '''absent'':35B ''affluent'':32B ''agrari'':121B ''agricultural'':8B,93B ''and'':112B ''anoth'':78B ''are'':42B ''as'':87B,98B ''battl'':18B ''battle-born'':17B ''born'':19B ''but'':33B ''by'':30B ''caretak'':48B ''chillfurrow'':1A,3B,60B ''contributor'':103B ''daily'':40B ''despit'':54B ''east'':12B ''embodying'':114B ''ensur'':75B ''entrust'':43B ''farm'':2A,4B,20B,38B,61B,96B ''farmhous'':53B,113B ''fertil'':24B ''fields'':111B ''guard'':69B,79B ''hardworking'':47B ''hold'':28B,109B ''holding'':9B ''importanc'':86B ''in'':51B ''is'':5B,62B ''its'':76B,85B,110B ''just'':11B ''lack'':57B ''lands'':25B ''lif'':122B ''locat'':10B ''maintain'':65B ''modest'':7B ''nazeem'':36B,55B ''nestl'':21B ''network'':94B ''of'':13B,16B,26B,58B,89B,107B,118B ''often'':34B ''on'':72B ''on-sit'':71B ''operations'':41B ''owned'':29B ''part'':88B ''patrols'':81B ''presenc'':59B ''prosperity'':106B ''quiet'':100B ''reflecting'':84B ''region'':91B ''regularly'':80B ''resid'':50B ''rhythm'':117B ''s'':39B,56B,92B,120B ''security'':77B ''sit'':73B ''skyrim'':119B ''south'':15B ''stands'':97B ''station'':70B ''steady'':116B ''the'':23B,31B,37B,52B,82B,90B,95B,105B,115B ''to'':44B,74B,104B ''vital'':102B ''well'':64B ''well-maintain'':63B ''whiterun'':14B,27B,68B,108B ''who'':49B ''wilmuth'':45B ''with'':66B ''within'':22B ''yard'':83B ''yet'':101B', 'whiterun', 'Chillfurrow Farm is a modest agricultural holding located just east of Whiterun.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('battle-born_farm', 'Battle-Born Farm is a productive homestead located just east of Whiterun and north of Chillfurrow Farm, nestled in the rolling fields of Whiterun Hold. Owned by the influential Battle-Born clan, the farm is tended by Alfhild and Gwendolyn, who diligently manage its fertile fields and livestock.

The farm boasts expansive fields planted with leeks, gourds, and wheat, along with a penned cow and free-roaming chickens. ', '''alfhild'':44B ''along'':66B ''and'':18B,45B,53B,64B,71B ''battl'':2A,6B,36B ''battle-born'':1A,5B,35B ''boasts'':57B ''born'':3A,7B,37B ''by'':32B,43B ''chickens'':75B ''chillfurrow'':21B ''clan'':38B ''cow'':70B ''diligently'':48B ''east'':15B ''expansiv'':58B ''farm'':4A,8B,22B,40B,56B ''fertil'':51B ''fields'':27B,52B,59B ''fre'':73B ''free-roaming'':72B ''gourds'':63B ''gwendolyn'':46B ''hold'':30B ''homest'':12B ''in'':24B ''influential'':34B ''is'':9B,41B ''its'':50B ''just'':14B ''leeks'':62B ''livestock'':54B ''locat'':13B ''manag'':49B ''nestl'':23B ''north'':19B ''of'':16B,20B,28B ''owned'':31B ''penn'':69B ''plant'':60B ''productiv'':11B ''roaming'':74B ''rolling'':26B ''tend'':42B ''the'':25B,33B,39B,55B ''wheat'':65B ''whiterun'':17B,29B ''who'':47B ''with'':61B,67B', 'whiterun', 'Battle-Born Farm is a productive homestead located just east of Whiterun.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('pelagia_farm', 'Pelagia Farm is a large and thriving homestead located south of Whiterun Stables and west of Honningbrew Meadery in the fertile plains of Whiterun Hold. Owned by Severio Pelagia, the farm is a bustling agricultural hub, managed by his workers Nimriel and Gloth, who live on-site while Severio resides in Whiterun.

The farm is characterized by its sprawling fields of vegetables, enclosed by stone walls and fences, where Severio often works alongside his laborers during the day. A grain mill stands to the east of the farmhouse, and the property includes various outbuildings and storage sheds. To the west, a penned cow grazes peacefully, while chickens nest near the farmhouse entrance.', '''agricultural'':37B ''alongsid'':76B ''and'':8B,16B,44B,70B,92B,98B ''bustling'':36B ''by'':29B,40B,60B,67B ''characteriz'':59B ''chickens'':110B ''cow'':106B ''day'':81B ''during'':79B ''east'':88B ''enclos'':66B ''entranc'':115B ''farm'':2A,4B,33B,57B ''farmhous'':91B,114B ''fenc'':71B ''fertil'':23B ''fields'':63B ''gloth'':45B ''grain'':83B ''graz'':107B ''his'':41B,77B ''hold'':27B ''homest'':10B ''honningbrew'':19B ''hub'':38B ''in'':21B,54B ''includ'':95B ''is'':5B,34B,58B ''its'':61B ''laborers'':78B ''larg'':7B ''liv'':47B ''locat'':11B ''manag'':39B ''meadery'':20B ''mill'':84B ''near'':112B ''nest'':111B ''nimriel'':43B ''of'':13B,18B,25B,64B,89B ''often'':74B ''on'':49B ''on-sit'':48B ''outbuildings'':97B ''owned'':28B ''peacefully'':108B ''pelagi'':1A,3B,31B ''penn'':105B ''plains'':24B ''property'':94B ''resid'':53B ''severi'':30B,52B,73B ''sheds'':100B ''sit'':50B ''south'':12B ''sprawling'':62B ''stabl'':15B ''stands'':85B ''ston'':68B ''storag'':99B ''the'':22B,32B,56B,80B,87B,90B,93B,102B,113B ''thriving'':9B ''to'':86B,101B ''various'':96B ''veget'':65B ''walls'':69B ''west'':17B,103B ''wher'':72B ''whil'':51B,109B ''whiterun'':14B,26B,55B ''who'':46B ''workers'':42B ''works'':75B', 'whiterun', 'Pelagia Farm is a large and thriving homestead located south of Whiterun Stables.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bleakwind_basin', 'Bleakwind Basin is a giants camp located west of Whiterun and north of the Western Watchtower, set against the wide, open plains of Whiterun Hold. The camp is home to a small group of giants and their mammoths, who roam peacefully amidst the sparse vegetation and scattered boulders characteristic of the region.

Marked by a large central fire pit and the towering figures of its inhabitants, Bleakwind Basin serves as a tranquil yet imposing presence in the Hold. ', '''against'':20B ''amidst'':44B ''and'':13B,38B,48B,62B ''as'':72B ''basin'':2A,4B,70B ''bleakwind'':1A,3B,69B ''boulders'':50B ''by'':56B ''camp'':8B,29B ''central'':59B ''characteristic'':51B ''figur'':65B ''fir'':60B ''giants'':7B,37B ''group'':35B ''hold'':27B,80B ''hom'':31B ''imposing'':76B ''in'':78B ''inhabitants'':68B ''is'':5B,30B ''its'':67B ''larg'':58B ''locat'':9B ''mammoths'':40B ''mark'':55B ''north'':14B ''of'':11B,15B,25B,36B,52B,66B ''open'':23B ''peacefully'':43B ''pit'':61B ''plains'':24B ''presenc'':77B ''region'':54B ''roam'':42B ''scatter'':49B ''serv'':71B ''set'':19B ''small'':34B ''spars'':46B ''the'':16B,21B,28B,39B,45B,53B,63B,79B ''to'':32B ''towering'':64B ''tranquil'':74B ''vegetation'':47B ''watchtow'':18B ''west'':10B ''western'':17B ''whiterun'':12B,26B ''who'':41B ''wid'':22B ''yet'':75B', 'whiterun', 'Bleakwind Basin is a giants camp located west of Whiterun. The camp is home to a small group of giants and their mammoths.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('guldun_rock', 'Guldun Rock is a secluded giant camp located east of Whiterun and south of Valtheim Towers, nestled along the road that traces the White River toward Fort Amol. A marked path, distinguished by a stone cairn surrounded by tundra cotton and vibrant mountain flowers, leads to the camp, winding up to a plateau where the giants dwell.

The camp is home to a few giants who guard their territory amid scattered mammoth cheese bowls, bones, and skulls. Painted stones and frost mirriam bundles decorate the area, giving it an air of primal ritual. The campfire, set atop a ruined stone structure near the entrance to Guldun Rock Cave, offers a commanding view of the surrounding plains to the north. ', '''air'':92B ''along'':20B ''amid'':72B ''amol'':30B ''an'':91B ''and'':14B,43B,78B,82B ''are'':88B ''atop'':99B ''bon'':77B ''bowls'':76B ''bundl'':85B ''by'':35B,40B ''cairn'':38B ''camp'':9B,50B,61B ''campfir'':97B ''cav'':110B ''chees'':75B ''commanding'':113B ''cotton'':42B ''decorat'':86B ''distinguish'':34B ''dwell'':59B ''east'':11B ''entranc'':106B ''few'':66B ''flowers'':46B ''fort'':29B ''frost'':83B ''giant'':8B ''giants'':58B,67B ''giving'':89B ''guard'':69B ''guldun'':1A,3B,108B ''hom'':63B ''is'':5B,62B ''it'':90B ''leads'':47B ''locat'':10B ''mammoth'':74B ''mark'':32B ''mirriam'':84B ''mountain'':45B ''near'':104B ''nestl'':19B ''north'':121B ''of'':12B,16B,93B,115B ''offers'':111B ''paint'':80B ''path'':33B ''plains'':118B ''plateau'':55B ''primal'':94B ''ritual'':95B ''riv'':27B ''road'':22B ''rock'':2A,4B,109B ''ruin'':101B ''scatter'':73B ''seclud'':7B ''set'':98B ''skulls'':79B ''south'':15B ''ston'':37B,81B,102B ''structur'':103B ''surround'':39B ''surrounding'':117B ''territory'':71B ''that'':23B ''the'':21B,25B,49B,57B,60B,70B,87B,96B,105B,116B,120B ''to'':48B,53B,64B,107B,119B ''toward'':28B ''towers'':18B ''trac'':24B ''tundr'':41B ''up'':52B ''valtheim'':17B ''vibrant'':44B ''view'':114B ''wher'':56B ''whit'':26B ''whiterun'':13B ''who'':68B ''winding'':51B', 'whiterun', 'Guldun Rock is a secluded giant camp located east of Whiterun.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('halted_stream_camp', 'Halted Stream Camp is a fortified bandit camp and iron mine located north of Whiterun and east of Silent Moons Camp, nestled against a rocky hillside. Surrounded by a palisade wall, the camp is accessible through a southern gate or an eastern gap marked by bone chimes, which serve as a crude alarm system. The bandits who occupy the camp are poachers, as evidenced by the presence of a mammoth skeleton and a butchery shack filled with mammoth remains.

The camp is guarded by bandits stationed on raised platforms around the perimeter.', '''access'':38B ''against'':26B ''alarm'':56B ''an'':44B ''and'':12B,19B,75B ''are'':64B ''around'':93B ''as'':53B,66B ''bandit'':10B ''bandits'':59B,88B ''bon'':49B ''butchery'':77B ''by'':31B,48B,68B,87B ''camp'':3A,6B,11B,24B,36B,63B,84B ''chim'':50B ''crud'':55B ''east'':20B ''eastern'':45B ''evidenc'':67B ''fill'':79B ''fortifi'':9B ''gap'':46B ''gat'':42B ''guard'':86B ''halt'':1A,4B ''hillsid'':29B ''iron'':13B ''is'':7B,37B,85B ''locat'':15B ''mammoth'':73B,81B ''mark'':47B ''min'':14B ''moons'':23B ''nestl'':25B ''north'':16B ''occupy'':61B ''of'':17B,21B,71B ''on'':90B ''or'':43B ''palisad'':33B ''perimet'':95B ''platforms'':92B ''poachers'':65B ''presenc'':70B ''rais'':91B ''remains'':82B ''rocky'':28B ''serv'':52B ''shack'':78B ''silent'':22B ''skeleton'':74B ''southern'':41B ''station'':89B ''stream'':2A,5B ''surround'':30B ''system'':57B ''the'':35B,58B,62B,69B,83B,94B ''through'':39B ''wall'':34B ''which'':51B ''whiterun'':18B ''who'':60B ''with'':80B', 'whiterun', 'Halted Stream Camp is a fortified bandit camp and iron mine located north of Whiterun.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('serpents_bluff_redoubt', 'Serpent''s Bluff Redoubt is a Forsworn camp and ancient ruin located atop a steep incline southwest of Rorikstead and east of the Old Hroldan Inn. The redoubt serves as a fortified refuge for the Forsworn and their hagraven matriarch, with a camp sprawling across the lower levels and a ruin hidden farther uphill.', '''across'':48B ''ancient'':13B ''and'':12B,23B,40B,52B ''as'':33B ''atop'':16B ''bluff'':2A,6B ''camp'':11B,46B ''east'':24B ''farth'':56B ''for'':37B ''forsworn'':10B,39B ''fortifi'':35B ''hagrav'':42B ''hidd'':55B ''hrold'':28B ''inclin'':19B ''inn'':29B ''is'':8B ''levels'':51B ''locat'':15B ''low'':50B ''matriarch'':43B ''of'':21B,25B ''old'':27B ''redoubt'':3A,7B,31B ''refug'':36B ''rorikst'':22B ''ruin'':14B,54B ''s'':5B ''serpent'':4B ''serpents'':1A ''serv'':32B ''southwest'':20B ''sprawling'':47B ''steep'':18B ''the'':26B,30B,38B,41B,49B ''uphill'':57B ''with'':44B', 'whiterun, forsworn', 'Serpent''s Bluff Redoubt is a Forsworn camp and ancient ruin located atop a steep incline southwest of Rorikstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('sleeping_tree_camp', 'Sleeping Tree Camp is a remote giant camp located west of Whiterun and east of Broken Fang Cave, nestled amidst the open plains of Whiterun Hold. The camp is centered around the mysterious Sleeping Tree, which grows from a glowing pool. The tree emits a soft, otherworldly purple light, and its sap is said to possess strange properties, enhancing health but causing slowed movement and blurred vision.

The camp is home to giants and mammoths who fiercely protect their territory, warning intruders before attacking if their warnings go unheeded.', '''amidst'':23B ''and'':16B,53B,68B,77B ''around'':34B ''attacking'':87B ''befor'':86B ''blurr'':69B ''brok'':19B ''but'':64B ''camp'':3A,6B,11B,31B,72B ''causing'':65B ''cav'':21B ''center'':33B ''east'':17B ''emits'':47B ''enhancing'':62B ''fang'':20B ''fiercely'':80B ''from'':41B ''giant'':10B ''giants'':76B ''glowing'':43B ''go'':91B ''grows'':40B ''health'':63B ''hold'':29B ''hom'':74B ''if'':88B ''intruders'':85B ''is'':7B,32B,56B,73B ''its'':54B ''light'':52B ''locat'':12B ''mammoths'':78B ''movement'':67B ''mysterious'':36B ''nestl'':22B ''of'':14B,18B,27B ''open'':25B ''otherworldly'':50B ''plains'':26B ''pool'':44B ''possess'':59B ''properti'':61B ''protect'':81B ''purpl'':51B ''remot'':9B ''said'':57B ''sap'':55B ''sleeping'':1A,4B,37B ''slow'':66B ''soft'':49B ''strang'':60B ''territory'':83B ''the'':24B,30B,35B,45B,71B,82B,89B ''to'':58B,75B ''tre'':2A,5B,38B,46B ''unheed'':92B ''vision'':70B ''warning'':84B ''warnings'':90B ''west'':13B ''which'':39B ''whiterun'':15B,28B ''who'':79B', 'whiterun', 'Sleeping Tree Camp is a remote giant camp located west of Whiterun.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('whiterun_imperial_camp', 'The Whiterun Imperial Camp is a temporary military outpost established in Whiterun Hold, east of Rorikstead and far west of Whiterun, amidst the rugged plains of the region. Commanded by Legate Quentin Cipius, the camp serves as a strategic base for the Imperial Legion during times of conflict. 
', '''amidst'':25B ''and'':20B ''as'':40B ''bas'':43B ''by'':33B ''camp'':3A,7B,38B ''cipius'':36B ''command'':32B ''conflict'':51B ''during'':48B ''east'':17B ''establish'':13B ''far'':21B ''for'':44B ''hold'':16B ''imperial'':2A,6B,46B ''in'':14B ''is'':8B ''legat'':34B ''legion'':47B ''military'':11B ''of'':18B,23B,29B,50B ''outpost'':12B ''plains'':28B ''quentin'':35B ''region'':31B ''rorikst'':19B ''rugg'':27B ''serv'':39B ''strategic'':42B ''temporary'':10B ''the'':4B,26B,30B,37B,45B ''tim'':49B ''west'':22B ''whiterun'':1A,5B,15B,24B', 'whiterun, legion', 'The Whiterun Imperial Camp is a temporary military outpost established in Whiterun Hold, east of Rorikstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('whiterun_stormcloak_camp', 'The Whiterun Stormcloak Camp is a rugged military encampment in Whiterun Hold, located south of the Ritual Stone and east of White River Watch. Commanded by Hjornskar Head-Smasher, the camp serves as a strategic outpost for the Stormcloak rebellion during their efforts to wrest control of Whiterun from Imperial forces.', '''and'':22B ''as'':37B ''by'':29B ''camp'':3A,7B,35B ''command'':28B ''control'':50B ''during'':45B ''east'':23B ''efforts'':47B ''encampment'':12B ''for'':41B ''forc'':55B ''from'':53B ''head'':32B ''head-smash'':31B ''hjornsk'':30B ''hold'':15B ''imperial'':54B ''in'':13B ''is'':8B ''locat'':16B ''military'':11B ''of'':18B,24B,51B ''outpost'':40B ''rebellion'':44B ''ritual'':20B ''riv'':26B ''rugg'':10B ''serv'':36B ''smash'':33B ''south'':17B ''ston'':21B ''stormcloak'':2A,6B,43B ''strategic'':39B ''the'':4B,19B,34B,42B,46B ''to'':48B ''watch'':27B ''whit'':25B ''whiterun'':1A,5B,14B,52B ''wrest'':49B', 'whiterun, stormcloak', 'The Whiterun Stormcloak Camp is a rugged military encampment in  the eastern part of Whiterun Hold.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('horker_island', 'Horker Island is a large, icy island located east of Skaal Village and northeast of Bujold''s Retreat on Solstheim. True to its name, the island is primarily inhabited by horkers, the lumbering aquatic creatures that thrive along the frigid coastlines of the region.', '''along'':40B ''and'':15B ''aquatic'':36B ''bujold'':18B ''by'':32B ''coastlin'':43B ''creatur'':37B ''east'':11B ''frig'':42B ''hork'':1A,3B ''horkers'':33B ''icy'':8B ''inhabit'':31B ''is'':5B,29B ''island'':2A,4B,9B,28B ''its'':25B ''larg'':7B ''locat'':10B ''lumbering'':35B ''nam'':26B ''northeast'':16B ''of'':12B,17B,44B ''on'':21B ''primarily'':30B ''region'':46B ''retreat'':20B ''s'':19B ''skaal'':13B ''solstheim'':22B ''that'':38B ''the'':27B,34B,41B,45B ''thriv'':39B ''to'':24B ''tru'':23B ''villag'':14B', 'solstheim', 'You do not know anything about this area.', '', '', 'solstheim');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('drelas_cottage', 'Drelas'' Cottage is an isolated dwelling nestled at the foot of a mountain in northern Whiterun Hold, south of Morthal and northwest of Dustman’s Cairn. Surrounded by rugged terrain and far from any settlements, the cottage exudes an air of quiet seclusion.

