INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frostfruit_inn', 'Frostfruit Inn is a modest, welcoming establishment in Rorikstead, a quiet farming village located in the western part of Whiterun Hold. The inn is located at the edge of the village, near the main road that connects to Whiterun and Hjaalmarch. This makes it a common stop for merchants, adventurers, and anyone passing through the area. It''s a small but vital part of Rorikstead''s hospitality, offering food, drink, and a warm bed. It is run by Mralki and his sone Erik.', '''adventurers'':52B ''and'':42B,53B,73B,82B ''anyon'':54B ''are'':58B ''at'':28B ''bed'':76B ''but'':63B ''by'':80B ''common'':48B ''connects'':39B ''drink'':72B ''edge'':30B ''erik'':85B ''establishment'':9B ''farming'':14B ''food'':71B ''for'':50B ''frostfruit'':1A,3B ''his'':83B ''hjaalmarch'':43B ''hold'':23B ''hospitality'':69B ''in'':10B,17B ''inn'':2A,4B,25B ''is'':5B,26B,78B ''it'':46B,59B,77B ''locat'':16B,27B ''main'':36B ''mak'':45B ''merchants'':51B ''modest'':7B ''mralki'':81B ''near'':34B ''of'':21B,31B,66B ''offering'':70B ''part'':20B,65B ''passing'':55B ''quiet'':13B ''road'':37B ''rorikst'':11B,67B ''run'':79B ''s'':60B,68B ''small'':62B ''son'':84B ''stop'':49B ''that'':38B ''the'':18B,24B,29B,32B,35B,57B ''this'':44B ''through'':56B ''to'':40B ''villag'':15B,33B ''vital'':64B ''warm'':75B ''welcoming'':8B ''western'':19B ''whiterun'':22B,41B', 'whiterun, hjaalmarch', 'Frostfruit Inn is a modest, welcoming establishment in Rorikstead You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', '');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('guldun_rock_cave', 'Guldun Rock Cave is a cave located at Guldun Rock in Whiterun Hold. There are two giants leading up to the cave, but there are none inside. It appears that the giants use the cave as a storage area.', '''appears'':32B ''are'':18B,28B,42B ''as'':39B ''at'':11B ''but'':26B ''cav'':3A,6B,9B,25B,38B ''giants'':20B,35B ''guldun'':1A,4B,12B ''hold'':16B ''in'':14B ''insid'':30B ''is'':7B ''it'':31B ''leading'':21B ''locat'':10B ''non'':29B ''rock'':2A,5B,13B ''storag'':41B ''that'':33B ''the'':24B,34B,37B ''ther'':17B,27B ''to'':23B ''two'':19B ''up'':22B ''use'':36B ''whiterun'':15B', 'whiterun', 'Guldun Rock Cave is near Guldun Rock in Whiterun. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', '');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lemkils_farm', 'Lemkil''s Farm is a farm located in the town of Rorikstead. It is farmed by Lemkil with help from Erik. Lemkil has two daughters, Sissel and Britte, who, much to his chagrin, do not help with the farm. When he is not working on his farm, Lemkil can be found in the tavern complaining about his daughters.', '''about'':58B ''and'':29B ''be'':52B ''britt'':30B ''by'':18B ''can'':51B ''chagrin'':35B ''complaining'':57B ''daughters'':27B,60B ''do'':36B ''erik'':23B ''farm'':2A,5B,8B,17B,41B,49B ''found'':53B ''from'':22B ''help'':21B,38B ''his'':34B,48B,59B ''in'':10B,54B ''is'':6B,16B,44B ''it'':15B ''lemkil'':3B,19B,24B,50B ''lemkils'':1A ''locat'':9B ''much'':32B ''not'':37B,45B ''of'':13B ''on'':47B ''rorikst'':14B ''s'':4B ''sissel'':28B ''tavern'':56B ''the'':11B,40B,55B ''to'':33B ''town'':12B ''two'':26B ''when'':42B ''who'':31B ''with'':20B,39B ''working'':46B', 'whiterun', 'Lemkil''s Farm is a farm located in the town of Rorikstead. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', '');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('puzzling_pillar_ruins', 'On the rough path leading toward Sleeping Tree Camp is a group of standing stones and three Nordic Puzzle Pillars. Next to the puzzle is a closed grate on top of a caved-in ruin.  No one knows what lies within', '''and'':19B ''camp'':12B ''cav'':37B ''caved-in'':36B ''clos'':30B ''grat'':31B ''group'':15B ''in'':38B ''is'':13B,28B ''knows'':42B ''leading'':8B ''lies'':44B ''next'':24B ''nordic'':21B ''of'':16B,34B ''on'':4B,32B ''one'':41B ''path'':7B ''pill'':2A ''pillars'':23B ''puzzl'':22B,27B ''puzzling'':1A ''rough'':6B ''ruin'':39B ''ruins'':3A ''sleeping'':10B ''standing'':17B ''ston'':18B ''the'':5B,26B ''thre'':20B ''to'':25B ''top'':33B ''toward'':9B ''tre'':11B ''what'':43B ''within'':45B', 'whiterun', 'On the rough path leading toward Sleeping Tree Camp is a group of standing stones and three Nordic Puzzle Pillars. No one knows what lies within You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', '');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aerin''s_house', 'Aerin''s House is a small two-story home with a basement located near the main entrance of Riften, situated between Bolli''s House and Snow-Shod Manor. It serves as the residence of Aerin and Mjoll the Lioness, the latter being a well-known adventurer and champion of justice in the city.', '''adventur'':52B ''aerin'':1A,4B,40B ''and'':29B,41B,53B ''as'':36B ''basement'':16B ''being'':47B ''betw'':25B ''bolli'':26B ''champion'':54B ''city'':59B ''entranc'':21B ''hom'':13B ''hous'':3A,6B,28B ''in'':57B ''is'':7B ''it'':34B ''justic'':56B ''known'':51B ''latt'':46B ''lioness'':44B ''locat'':17B ''main'':20B ''manor'':33B ''mjoll'':42B ''near'':18B ''of'':22B,39B,55B ''residenc'':38B ''rift'':23B ''s'':2A,5B,27B ''serv'':35B ''shod'':32B ''situat'':24B ''small'':9B ''snow'':31B ''snow-shod'':30B ''story'':12B ''the'':19B,37B,43B,45B,58B ''two'':11B ''two-story'':10B ''well'':50B ''well-known'':49B ''with'':14B', 'rift', 'Aerin''s House is a small two-story home with a basement located near the main entrance of Riften, situated between Bolli''s House and Snow-Shod Manor. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aetherium_forge', 'The Aetherium Forge is an ancient Dwemer forge located southeast of Ivarstead and east of the Rift Imperial Camp in the Rift. It is rumoured that the mighty forge can be used to craft Aetherium items, powerful Dwemer Relics. 

Aetherium is a rare, blue, luminescent crystal found exclusively in Dwemer city ruins, originally discovered by Dwemer miners in the vast underground expanse of Blackreach. ', '''aetherium'':1A,4B,37B,42B ''an'':7B ''ancient'':8B ''and'':15B ''be'':33B ''blackreach'':66B ''blu'':46B ''by'':57B ''camp'':21B ''can'':32B ''city'':53B ''craft'':36B ''crystal'':48B ''discover'':56B ''dwem'':9B,40B,52B,58B ''east'':16B ''exclusively'':50B ''expans'':64B ''forg'':2A,5B,10B,31B ''found'':49B ''imperial'':20B ''in'':22B,51B,60B ''is'':6B,26B,43B ''it'':25B ''items'':38B ''ivarst'':14B ''locat'':11B ''luminescent'':47B ''mighty'':30B ''miners'':59B ''of'':13B,17B,65B ''originally'':55B ''powerful'':39B ''rar'':45B ''relics'':41B ''rift'':19B,24B ''ruins'':54B ''rumour'':27B ''southeast'':12B ''that'':28B ''the'':3B,18B,23B,29B,61B ''to'':35B ''underground'':63B ''used'':34B ''vast'':62B', 'katriah', 'The Aetherium Forge is a rumor of an ancient Dwemer forge that is hidden somewhere in the Rift. But you do not know where.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'rift', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('alchemist''s_shack', 'The Alchemist''s Shack is a small, secluded dwelling located south of Ivarstead and east of Haemar''s Shame in the Rift. The humble shack is surrounded by nature, making it an ideal spot for gathering alchemical ingredients.', '''alchemical'':40B ''alchemist'':1A,5B ''an'':35B ''and'':17B ''by'':31B ''dwelling'':12B ''east'':18B ''for'':38B ''gathering'':39B ''haem'':20B ''humbl'':27B ''ideal'':36B ''in'':23B ''ingredients'':41B ''is'':8B,29B ''it'':34B ''ivarst'':16B ''locat'':13B ''making'':33B ''natur'':32B ''of'':15B,19B ''rift'':25B ''s'':2A,6B,21B ''seclud'':11B ''shack'':3A,7B,28B ''sham'':22B ''small'':10B ''south'':14B ''spot'':37B ''surround'':30B ''the'':4B,24B,26B', 'rift', 'The Alchemist''s Shack is a small, secluded dwelling located south of IvarsteadYou do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('angarvunde', 'Angarvunde is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located west of Riften and south of Treva''s Watch in the Rift. The ruin is inhabited by draugr.', '''and'':14B ''angarvund'':1A,2B ''by'':27B ''draugr'':28B ''in'':20B ''inhabit'':26B ''is'':3B,25B ''locat'':10B ''medium'':6B ''medium-siz'':5B ''nordic'':8B ''of'':12B,16B ''rift'':13B,22B ''ruin'':9B,24B ''s'':18B ''siz'':7B ''south'':15B ''the'':21B,23B ''trev'':17B ''watch'':19B ''west'':11B', 'rift', 'Angarvunde is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located west of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('arcwind_point', 'Arcwind Point is a small Nordic ruin located south of Ivarstead and west of the Rift Imperial Camp in the Rift. This open-air site comprises several separate ruins scattered across the area. ', '''across'':34B ''air'':27B ''and'':14B ''arcwind'':1A,3B ''are'':36B ''camp'':20B ''compris'':29B ''imperial'':19B ''in'':21B ''is'':5B ''ivarst'':13B ''locat'':10B ''nordic'':8B ''of'':12B,16B ''open'':26B ''open-'':25B ''point'':2A,4B ''rift'':18B,23B ''ruin'':9B ''ruins'':32B ''scatter'':33B ''separat'':31B ''several'':30B ''sit'':28B ''small'':7B ''south'':11B ''the'':17B,22B,35B ''this'':24B ''west'':15B', 'rift', 'Arcwind Point is a small Nordic ruin located south of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('autumnshade_clearing', 'Autumnshade Clearing is a tranquil circular glade in the Rift, located north of Goldenglow Estate and southwest of Shor''s Stone. There are many plants and trees surronding the area. However that are rumors that the place is dangerous and should be avoided at all costs. As anyone who enters never leaves alive.', '''aliv'':55B ''all'':47B ''and'':18B,28B,42B ''anyon'':50B ''are'':25B,32B,35B ''as'':49B ''at'':46B ''autumnshad'':1A,3B ''avoid'':45B ''be'':44B ''circul'':8B ''clearing'':2A,4B ''costs'':48B ''dangerous'':41B ''enters'':52B ''estat'':17B ''glad'':9B ''goldenglow'':16B ''howev'':33B ''in'':10B ''is'':5B,40B ''leav'':54B ''locat'':13B ''many'':26B ''nev'':53B ''north'':14B ''of'':15B,20B ''plac'':39B ''plants'':27B ''rift'':12B ''rumors'':36B ''s'':22B ''shor'':21B ''should'':43B ''southwest'':19B ''ston'':23B ''surronding'':30B ''that'':34B,37B ''the'':11B,31B,38B ''ther'':24B ''tranquil'':7B ''tre'':29B ''who'':51B', 'rift', 'Autumnshade Clearing is a tranquil circular glade in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('autumnwatch_tower', 'Autumnwatch Tower is a dragon lair located south of Ivarstead and west of Froki''s Shack in the Rift. The site consists of two abandoned towers connected by a stone bridge.', '''abandon'':27B ''and'':13B ''autumnwatch'':1A,3B ''bridg'':33B ''by'':30B ''connect'':29B ''consists'':24B ''dragon'':7B ''froki'':16B ''in'':19B ''is'':5B ''ivarst'':12B ''lair'':8B ''locat'':9B ''of'':11B,15B,25B ''rift'':21B ''s'':17B ''shack'':18B ''sit'':23B ''south'':10B ''ston'':32B ''the'':20B,22B ''tow'':2A,4B ''towers'':28B ''two'':26B ''west'':14B', 'rift, dragon', 'Autumnwatch Tower is a dragon lair located south of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('beggar''s_row', 'Beggar''s Row is a small section of Riften''s sewer system that has been repurposed as a refuge for the homeless. Located in lower Riften by the canal, it lies opposite Elgrim''s Elixirs and near the northern stairs leading down from upper Riften. ', '''and'':39B ''as'':20B ''been'':18B ''begg'':1A,4B ''by'':30B ''canal'':32B ''down'':45B ''elgrim'':36B ''elixirs'':38B ''for'':23B ''from'':46B ''homeless'':25B ''in'':27B ''is'':7B ''it'':33B ''leading'':44B ''lies'':34B ''locat'':26B ''low'':28B ''near'':40B ''northern'':42B ''of'':11B ''opposit'':35B ''refug'':22B ''repurp'':19B ''rift'':12B,29B,48B ''row'':3A,6B ''s'':2A,5B,13B,37B ''section'':10B ''sew'':14B ''small'':9B ''stairs'':43B ''system'':15B ''that'':16B ''the'':24B,31B,41B ''upper'':47B', 'rift', 'Beggar''s Row is a small section of Riften''s sewer system that has been repurposed as a refuge for the homeless.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('black_briar_lodge', 'Black-Briar Lodge is a large, secluded estate located east of Riften in the Rift, south of Lost Prospect Mine. Owned by the influential Black-Briar family, the lodge is guarded by hostile Black-Briar Mercenaries.', '''black'':1A,5B,30B,40B ''black-bri'':4B,29B,39B ''bri'':2A,6B,31B,41B ''by'':26B,37B ''east'':14B ''estat'':12B ''family'':32B ''guard'':36B ''hostil'':38B ''in'':17B ''influential'':28B ''is'':8B,35B ''larg'':10B ''locat'':13B ''lodg'':3A,7B,34B ''lost'':22B ''mercenari'':42B ''min'':24B ''of'':15B,21B ''owned'':25B ''prospect'':23B ''rift'':16B,19B ''seclud'':11B ''south'':20B ''the'':18B,27B,33B', 'rift, noble', 'Black-Briar Lodge is a large, secluded estate located east of Riften in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('black-briar_manor', '
Black-Briar Manor is the opulent residence of the powerful Black-Briar family in Riften. It is home to Maven Black-Briar, her son Hemming, her daughter Ingun, and her housecarl, Maul. Ingun spends most of her day at Elgrim''s Elixirs, returning to the manor only to sleep at night, leaving the house often unoccupied during the day.

