INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('elgrim''s_elixirs', 'Elgrim''s Elixirs is a damp alchemist''s shop situated on the lower level of Riften, next to the canal that runs through the city''s center. Owned and operated by Elgrim and his wife, Hafjorg, the shop specializes in alchemical supplies and potions. It is conveniently located opposite the entrance to Beggar''s Row and near the northern watergate leading to Lake Honrich.', '''alchemical'':44B ''alchemist'':10B ''and'':32B,36B,46B,59B ''begg'':56B ''by'':34B ''canal'':23B ''cent'':30B ''city'':28B ''conveniently'':50B ''damp'':9B ''elgrim'':1A,4B,35B ''elixirs'':3A,6B ''entranc'':54B ''hafjorg'':39B ''his'':37B ''honrich'':67B ''in'':43B ''is'':7B,49B ''it'':48B ''lak'':66B ''leading'':64B ''level'':17B ''locat'':51B ''low'':16B ''near'':60B ''next'':20B ''northern'':62B ''of'':18B ''on'':14B ''operat'':33B ''opposit'':52B ''owned'':31B ''potions'':47B ''rift'':19B ''row'':58B ''runs'':25B ''s'':2A,5B,11B,29B,57B ''shop'':12B,41B ''situat'':13B ''specializ'':42B ''suppli'':45B ''that'':24B ''the'':15B,22B,27B,40B,53B,61B ''through'':26B ''to'':21B,55B,65B ''watergat'':63B ''wif'':38B', 'rift', 'Elgrim''s Elixirs is a damp alchemist''s shop situated in Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('faldar''s_tooth', 'Faldar''s Tooth is a medium-sized, crumbling fort located west of Riften and east of Heartwood Mill in the Rift. The fort is occupied by bandits who force wolves to fight in a central pit for entertainment and gambling.', '''and'':18B,43B ''bandits'':31B ''by'':30B ''central'':39B ''crumbling'':12B ''east'':19B ''entertainment'':42B ''fald'':1A,4B ''fight'':36B ''for'':41B ''forc'':33B ''fort'':13B,27B ''gambling'':44B ''heartwood'':21B ''in'':23B,37B ''is'':7B,28B ''locat'':14B ''medium'':10B ''medium-siz'':9B ''mill'':22B ''occupi'':29B ''of'':16B,20B ''pit'':40B ''rift'':17B,25B ''s'':2A,5B ''siz'':11B ''the'':24B,26B ''to'':35B ''tooth'':3A,6B ''west'':15B ''who'':32B ''wolv'':34B', 'rift', 'Faldar''s Tooth is a medium-sized, crumbling fort located west of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fallowstone_cave', 'Fallowstone Cave is a small cave located northeast of Riften and northwest of Lost Prospect Mine in the Rift. Rumours of giants living in the cave.', '''and'':13B ''cav'':2A,4B,8B,28B ''fallowston'':1A,3B ''giants'':24B ''in'':19B,26B ''is'':5B ''living'':25B ''locat'':9B ''lost'':16B ''min'':18B ''northeast'':10B ''northwest'':14B ''of'':11B,15B,23B ''prospect'':17B ''rift'':12B,21B ''rumours'':22B ''small'':7B ''the'':20B,27B', 'rift', 'Fallowstone Cave is a small cave located northeast of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('forelhost', 'Forelhost is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located southeast of Riften and west of Stendarr''s Beacon in the Rift. It is home to a large amount of draugr. Rumours of a Dragon Priest live in the ruins.', '''amount'':29B ''and'':14B ''beacon'':19B ''dragon'':35B ''draugr'':31B ''forelhost'':1A,2B ''hom'':25B ''in'':20B,38B ''is'':3B,24B ''it'':23B ''larg'':28B ''liv'':37B ''locat'':10B ''medium'':6B ''medium-siz'':5B ''nordic'':8B ''of'':12B,16B,30B,33B ''priest'':36B ''rift'':13B,22B ''ruin'':9B ''ruins'':40B ''rumours'':32B ''s'':18B ''siz'':7B ''southeast'':11B ''stendarr'':17B ''the'':21B,39B ''to'':26B ''west'':15B', 'rift', 'Forelhost is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located southeast of Riften and west of Stendarr''s Beacon in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fort_dawnguard', 'Fort Dawnguard is a large, ancient fort located southeast of Riften near Stendarr''s Beacon, serving as the headquarters for the Dawnguard, an order of vampire hunters dedicated to protecting Skyrim from the Volkihar clan. The fort is hidden in the eastern Rift and can only be accessed through Dayspring Canyon.

Built in the Second Era by the Jarl of Riften to contain his son, who had contracted vampirism, the fort was guarded by the mercenary band that became the Dawnguard. Over time, the threat of vampires faded, and the fort fell into disuse. Isran now leads efforts to rebuild the Dawnguard and combat the rising vampire menace, restoring the fort to its former purpose as a bastion against darkness.', '''access'':50B ''against'':121B ''an'':25B ''ancient'':8B ''and'':46B,91B,105B ''as'':19B,118B ''band'':79B ''bastion'':120B ''be'':49B ''beacon'':17B ''becam'':81B ''built'':54B ''by'':59B,76B ''can'':47B ''canyon'':53B ''clan'':37B ''combat'':106B ''contain'':65B ''contract'':70B ''darkness'':122B ''dawnguard'':2A,4B,24B,83B,104B ''dayspring'':52B ''dedicat'':30B ''disus'':96B ''eastern'':44B ''efforts'':100B ''fad'':90B ''fell'':94B ''for'':22B ''form'':116B ''fort'':1A,3B,9B,39B,73B,93B,113B ''from'':34B ''guard'':75B ''had'':69B ''headquarters'':21B ''hidd'':41B ''his'':66B ''hunters'':29B ''in'':42B,55B ''into'':95B ''is'':5B,40B ''isran'':97B ''its'':115B ''jarl'':61B ''larg'':7B ''leads'':99B ''locat'':10B ''menac'':110B ''mercenary'':78B ''near'':14B ''now'':98B ''of'':12B,27B,62B,88B ''only'':48B ''order'':26B ''over'':84B ''protecting'':32B ''purpos'':117B ''rebuild'':102B ''restoring'':111B ''rift'':13B,45B,63B ''rising'':108B ''s'':16B ''second'':57B ''serving'':18B ''skyrim'':33B ''southeast'':11B ''stendarr'':15B ''that'':80B ''the'':20B,23B,35B,38B,43B,56B,60B,72B,77B,82B,86B,92B,103B,107B,112B ''threat'':87B ''through'':51B ''tim'':85B ''to'':31B,64B,101B,114B ''vampir'':28B,89B,109B ''vampirism'':71B ''volkih'':36B ''was'':74B ''who'':68B', 'rift, dawnguard, vampire, volkihar', 'Fort Dawnguard is a large, ancient fort located southeast of Riften near Stendarr''s Beacon, serving as the headquarters for the Dawnguard, an order of vampire hunters dedicated to protecting Skyrim from the Volkihar clan.You do not know anything else about this area.', '', '', 'ri