INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fort_greenwall', 'Fort Greenwall is a large, strategically located fort north-northwest of Riften and south-southeast of Shor''s Stone in the Rift. It is well known that the fort has been taken over by bandits, blocking trade northwards. However both the Imperial Legion and Stormcloaks are planning to take the fort.', '''and'':16B,48B ''are'':50B ''bandits'':39B ''been'':35B ''blocking'':40B ''both'':44B ''by'':38B ''fort'':1A,3B,10B,33B,55B ''greenwall'':2A,4B ''howev'':43B ''imperial'':46B ''in'':24B ''is'':5B,28B ''it'':27B ''known'':30B ''larg'':7B ''legion'':47B ''locat'':9B ''north'':12B ''north-northwest'':11B ''northwards'':42B ''northwest'':13B ''of'':14B,20B ''over'':37B ''planning'':51B ''rift'':15B,26B ''s'':22B ''shor'':21B ''south'':18B ''south-southeast'':17B ''southeast'':19B ''ston'':23B ''stormcloaks'':49B ''strategically'':8B ''tak'':36B,53B ''that'':31B ''the'':25B,32B,45B,54B ''to'':52B ''trad'':41B ''well'':29B', 'rift, legion, stormcloak', 'Fort Greenwall is a large, strategically located fort north-northwest of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('froki''s_shack', 'Froki''s Shack is a small, rustic dwelling located southeast of Ivarstead and east of Autumnwatch Tower in the Rift. Home to the Nord hunter Froki Whetted-Blade and his grandson Haming, a survivor of Helgen.', '''and'':16B,33B ''autumnwatch'':19B ''blad'':32B ''dwelling'':11B ''east'':17B ''froki'':1A,4B,29B ''grandson'':35B ''haming'':36B ''helg'':40B ''his'':34B ''hom'':24B ''hunt'':28B ''in'':21B ''is'':7B ''ivarst'':15B ''locat'':12B ''nord'':27B ''of'':14B,18B,39B ''rift'':23B ''rustic'':10B ''s'':2A,5B ''shack'':3A,6B ''small'':9B ''southeast'':13B ''survivor'':38B ''the'':22B,26B ''to'':25B ''tow'':20B ''whett'':31B ''whetted-blad'':30B', 'rift', 'Froki''s Shack is a small, rustic dwelling located southeast of IvarsteadYou do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('geirmund''s_hall', 'Geirmund''s Hall is a small Nordic ruin located on an island in the middle of Lake Geir, east of Ivarstead and west-southwest of Nilheim in the Rift. ', '''an'':14B ''and'':25B ''east'':22B ''geir'':21B ''geirmund'':1A,4B ''hall'':3A,6B ''in'':16B,31B ''is'':7B ''island'':15B ''ivarst'':24B ''lak'':20B ''locat'':12B ''middl'':18B ''nilheim'':30B ''nordic'':10B ''of'':19B,23B,29B ''on'':13B ''rift'':33B ''ruin'':11B ''s'':2A,5B ''small'':9B ''southwest'':28B ''the'':17B,32B ''west'':27B ''west-southwest'':26B', 'rift', 'Geirmund''s Hall is a small Nordic ruin located on an island in the middle of Lake Geir. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('giant''s_grove', 'Giant''s Grove is a secluded grove accessed through Fallowstone Cave, serving as the home of a giant tribe that has defiled a shrine of Malacath. ', '''access'':11B ''as'':16B ''cav'':14B ''defil'':25B ''fallowston'':13B ''giant'':1A,4B,21B ''grov'':3A,6B,10B ''hom'':18B ''is'':7B ''malacath'':29B ''of'':19B,28B ''s'':2A,5B ''seclud'':9B ''serving'':15B ''shrin'':27B ''that'':23B ''the'':17B ''through'':12B ''trib'':22B', 'rift', 'Giant''s Grove is a secluded grove with a hidden entrance.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('goldenglow_estate', 'Goldenglow Estate is a secluded honey farm located west of Riften in the Rift, southeast of Faldar''s Tooth. Situated on three small islands in Lake Honrich and connected by footbridges, the estate consists of a house, an apiary, docks, and the Goldenglow Estate Sewer. Guarded by hostile mercenaries and infested with skeevers, the property is owned by Aringoth.', '''an'':40B ''and'':30B,43B,52B ''apiary'':41B ''aringoth'':61B ''by'':32B,49B,60B ''connect'':31B ''consists'':36B ''docks'':42B ''estat'':2A,4B,35B,46B ''fald'':19B ''farm'':9B ''footbridg'':33B ''goldenglow'':1A,3B,45B ''guard'':48B ''honey'':8B ''honrich'':29B ''hostil'':50B ''hous'':39B ''in'':14B,27B ''infest'':53B ''is'':5B,58B ''islands'':26B ''lak'':28B ''locat'':10B ''mercenari'':51B ''of'':12B,18B,37B ''on'':23B ''owned'':59B ''property'':57B ''rift'':13B,16B ''s'':20B ''seclud'':7B ''sew'':47B ''situat'':22B ''skeevers'':55B ''small'':25B ''southeast'':17B ''the'':15B,34B,44B,56B ''thre'':24B ''tooth'':21B ''west'':11B ''with'':54B', 'rift, noble', 'Goldenglow Estate is a secluded honey farm located west of Riften in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('haelga''s_bunkhouse', 'Haelga''s Bunkhouse is a boarding house located in Riften, operated by Haelga. It serves as a residence for several of Riften''s citizens, providing a place to stay for those seeking shelter in the city. The bunkhouse is the first building on the right when entering Riften through the main northern gate.', '''as'':19B ''boarding'':9B ''building'':45B ''bunkhous'':3A,6B,41B ''by'':15B ''citizens'':27B ''city'':39B ''entering'':50B ''first'':44B ''for'':22B,33B ''gat'':56B ''haelg'':1A,4B,16B ''hous'':10B ''in'':12B,37B ''is'':7B,42B ''it'':17B ''locat'':11B ''main'':54B ''northern'':55B ''of'':24B ''on'':46B ''operat'':14B ''plac'':30B ''providing'':28B ''residenc'':21B ''rift'':13B,25B,51B ''right'':48B ''s'':2A,5B,26B ''seeking'':35B ''serv'':18B ''several'':23B ''shelt'':36B ''stay'':32B ''the'':38B,40B,43B,47B,53B ''thos'':34B ''through'':52B ''to'':31B ''when'':49B', 'rift', 'Haelga''s Bunkhouse is a boarding house located in Riften, operated by Haelga.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('heartwood_mill', 'Heartwood Mill is a small, struggling lumber mill located on the shores of Lake Honrich at the mouth of the Treva River, west of Goldenglow Estate in the Rift. The mill is operated by Grosta, who has been left to run it alone after the disappearance of her husband, Leifnarr. She is assisted by their young son, Gralnach, who helps as much as he can.', '''after'':46B ''alon'':45B ''as'':63B,65B ''assist'':55B ''at'':18B ''been'':40B ''by'':36B,56B ''can'':67B ''disappearanc'':48B ''estat'':28B ''goldenglow'':27B ''gralnach'':60B ''grost'':37B ''heartwood'':1A,3B ''helps'':62B ''her'':50B ''honrich'':17B ''husband'':51B ''in'':29B ''is'':5B,34B,54B ''it'':44B ''lak'':16B ''left'':41B ''leifnarr'':52B ''locat'':11B ''lumb'':9B ''mill'':2A,4B,10B,33B ''mouth'':20B ''much'':64B ''of'':15B,21B,26B,49B ''on'':12B ''operat'':35B ''rift'':31B ''riv'':24B ''run'':43B ''she'':53B ''shor'':14B ''small'':7B ''struggling'':8B ''the'':13B,19B,22B,30B,32B,47B,57B ''to'':42B ''trev'':23B ''west'':25B ''who'':38B,61B ''young'':58B', 'rift', 'Heartwood Mill is a small, struggling lumber mill located on the shores of Lake Honrich at the mouth of the Treva River.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('honeyside', 'Honeyside is a cozy two-story home located in the northwest corner of Riften, offering access both from within the city and from the docks outside. It can be purchased from the steward, Anuriel.', '''access'':18B ''and'':24B ''anuriel'':36B ''be'':31B ''both'':19B ''can'':30B ''city'':23B ''corn'':14B ''cozy'':5B ''docks'':27B ''from'':20B,25B,33B ''hom'':9B ''honeysid'':1A,2B ''in'':11B ''is'':3B ''it'':29B ''locat'':10B ''northwest'':13B ''of'':15B ''offering'':17B ''outsid'':28B ''purchas'':32B ''rift'':16B ''steward'':35B ''story'':8B ''the'':12B,22B,26B,34B ''two'':7B ''two-story'':6B ''within'':21B', 'rift', 'Honeyside is a cozy two-story home located in Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('honeystrand_cave', 'Honeystrand Cave is a small cave located south of Ivarstead and northeast of the Alchemist''s Shack in the Rift. There are rumours of a bear that lives here.', '''alchemist'':17B ''and'':13B ''are'':24B ''bear'':28B ''cav'':2A,4B,8B ''her'':31B ''honeystrand'':1A,3B ''in'':20B ''is'':5B ''ivarst'':12B ''liv'':30B ''locat'':9B ''northeast'':14B ''of'':11B,15B,26B ''rift'':22B ''rumours'':25B ''s'':18B ''shack'':19B ''small'':7B ''south'':10B ''that'':29B ''the'':16B,21B ''ther'':23B', 'rift', 'Honeystrand Cave is a small cave located south of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('honorhall_orphanage', 'Honorhall Orphanage is located in the southern part of Riften and consists of a single interior zone. It serves as a home for four orphans under the strict and widely disliked care of its headmistress, Grelod the Kind, who is actually known to be an awful person. Constance Michel, Grelod''s timid assistant, also resides in the orphanage and provides a more nurturing presence for the children.', '''actually'':43B ''also'':56B ''an'':47B ''and'':13B,31B,61B ''as'':22B ''assistant'':55B ''awful'':48B ''be'':46B ''car'':34B ''childr'':69B ''consists'':14B ''constanc'':50B ''dislik'':33B ''for'':25B,67B ''four'':26B ''grelod'':38B,52B ''headmistress'':37B ''hom'':24B ''honorhall'':1A,3B ''in'':7B,58B ''interior'':18B ''is'':5B,42B ''it'':20B ''its'':36B ''kind'':40B ''known'':44B ''locat'':6B ''michel'':51B ''mor'':64B ''nurturing'':65B ''of'':11B,15B,35B ''orphanag'':2A,4B,60B ''orphans'':27B ''part'':10B ''person'':49B ''presenc'':66B ''provid'':62B ''resid'':57B ''rift'':12B ''s'':53B ''serv'':21B ''singl'':17B ''southern'':9B ''strict'':30B ''the'':8B,29B,39B,59B,68B ''tim'':54B ''to'':45B ''under'':28B ''who'':41B ''widely'':32B ''zon'':19B', 'rift, darkbrotherhood', 'Honorhall Orphanage is located in the southern part of Riften and consists of a single interior zone.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ivarstead', 'Ivarstead is a small milling town at the western edge of the Rift, nestled at the base of the Throat of the World near the path to High Hrothgar. Located on the shores of Lake Geir, the town is powered by a fork of the Darkwater River, which drives Temba Wide-Arm''s sawmill. The settlement consists of five buildings, including Vilemyr Inn, run by Wilhelm, and the haunted Shroud Hearth Barrow looming to the east.

Once a stop for travelers and pilgrims, Ivarstead has fallen into decline due to the barrow''s haunting, causing many residents to leave for Riften or consider moving away. Notable locations include Fellstar Farm, Klimmek''s house, and Narfi''s ruined home across the river. Despite its struggles, Ivarstead remains an essential waypoint for those making the pilgrimage up the "7,000 Steps" to High Hrothgar.', '''000'':140B ''7'':139B ''across'':121B ''an'':129B ''and'':69B,84B,116B ''arm'':54B ''at'':8B,16B ''away'':107B ''barrow'':74B,94B ''bas'':18B ''buildings'':62B ''by'':42B,67B ''causing'':97B ''consid'':105B ''consists'':59B ''darkwat'':47B ''declin'':90B ''despit'':124B ''driv'':50B ''due'':91B ''east'':78B ''edge'':11B ''essential'':130B ''fall'':88B ''farm'':112B ''fellst'':111B ''fiv'':61B ''for'':82B,102B,132B ''fork'':44B ''geir'':37B ''haunt'':71B ''haunting'':96B ''hearth'':73B ''high'':29B,143B ''hom'':120B ''hous'':115B ''hrothg'':30B,144B ''includ'':110B ''including'':63B ''inn'':65B ''into'':89B ''is'':3B,40B ''its'':125B ''ivarst'':1A,2B,86B,127B ''klimmek'':113B ''lak'':36B ''leav'':101B ''locat'':31B ''locations'':109B ''looming'':75B ''making'':134B ''many'':98B ''milling'':6B ''moving'':106B ''narfi'':117B ''near'':25B ''nestl'':15B ''notabl'':108B ''of'':12B,19B,22B,35B,45B,60B ''on'':32B ''once'':79B ''or'':104B ''path'':27B ''pilgrimag'':136B ''pilgrims'':85B ''power'':41B ''remains'':128B ''residents'':99B ''rift'':14B,103B ''riv'':48B,123B ''ruin'':119B ''run'':66B ''s'':55B,95B,114B,118B ''sawmill'':56B ''settlement'':58B ''shor'':34B ''shroud'':72B ''small'':5B ''steps'':141B ''stop'':81B ''struggl'':126B ''temb'':51B ''the'':9B,13B,17B,20B,23B,26B,33B,38B,46B,57B,70B,77B,93B,122B,135B,138B ''thos'':133B ''throat'':21B ''to'':28B,76B,92B,100B,142B ''town'':7B,39B ''travelers'':83B ''up'':137B ''vilemyr'':64B ''waypoint'':131B ''western'':10B ''which'':49B ''wid'':53B ''wide-arm'':52B ''wilhelm'':68B ''world'':24B', 'rift', 'Ivarstead is a small milling town at the western edge of the Rift, nestled at the base of the Throat of the World near the path to High Hrothgar. It is essential waypoint for those making the pilgrimage up the "7,000 Steps" to High Hrothgar.', '', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lake_geir', 'Lake Geir is a picturesque lake located in the western part of the Rift, with the village of Ivarstead situated along its shores. At the center of the lake lies an island that is home to Geirmund''s Hall, a Nordic ruin steeped in history and intrigue. Geographically, the lake is fed by the Treva River and drained by the Darkwater River, forming a key part of the region''s waterway network.', '''along'':23B ''an'':33B ''and'':48B,59B ''at'':26B ''by'':55B,61B ''cent'':28B ''darkwat'':63B ''drain'':60B ''fed'':54B ''forming'':65B ''geir'':2A,4B ''geirmund'':39B ''geographically'':50B ''hall'':41B ''history'':47B ''hom'':37B ''in'':10B,46B ''intrig'':49B ''is'':5B,36B,53B ''island'':34B ''its'':24B ''ivarst'':21B ''key'':67B ''lak'':1A,3B,8B,31B,52B ''lies'':32B ''locat'':9B ''network'':74B ''nordic'':43B ''of'':14B,20B,29B,69B ''part'':13B,68B ''picturesqu'':7B ''region'':71B ''rift'':16B ''riv'':58B,64B ''ruin'':44B ''s'':40B,72B ''shor'':25B ''situat'':22B ''steep'':45B ''that'':35B ''the'':11B,15B,18B,27B,30B,51B,56B,62B,70B ''to'':38B ''trev'':57B ''villag'':19B ''waterway'':73B ''western'':12B ''with'':17B', 'rift', 'Lake Geir is a picturesque lake located in the western part of the Rift, with the village of Ivarstead situated along its shores. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lake_honrich', 'Lake Honrich is a sprawling lake in the eastern Rift, located immediately southwest of Riften. Known as Lake Honnith during the First Era, it is a prominent natural feature of the region. The lake is drained by the Treva River and is home to Goldenglow Estate, which occupies a cluster of islands at its center.

Popular among fishermen from across Skyrim, Lake Honrich provides ample opportunities for fishing and is supported by a fishery located on Riften''s eastern shores. ', '''across'':62B ''among'':59B ''ample'':67B ''and'':43B,71B ''as'':19B ''at'':55B ''by'':39B,74B ''cent'':57B ''clust'':52B ''drain'':38B ''during'':22B ''eastern'':11B,81B ''estat'':48B ''featur'':31B ''first'':24B ''fisherm'':60B ''fishery'':76B ''fishing'':70B ''for'':69B ''from'':61B ''goldenglow'':47B ''hom'':45B ''honnith'':21B ''honrich'':2A,4B,65B ''immediately'':14B ''in'':9B ''is'':5B,27B,37B,44B,72B ''islands'':54B ''it'':26B ''its'':56B ''known'':18B ''lak'':1A,3B,8B,20B,36B,64B ''locat'':13B,77B ''natural'':30B ''occupi'':50B ''of'':16B,32B,53B ''on'':78B ''opportuniti'':68B ''popul'':58B ''prominent'':29B ''provid'':66B ''region'':34B ''rift'':12B,17B,79B ''riv'':42B ''s'':80B ''shor'':82B ''skyrim'':63B ''southwest'':15B ''sprawling'':7B ''support'':73B ''the'':10B,23B,33B,35B,40B ''to'':46B ''trev'':41B ''which'':49B', 'rift', 'Lake Honrich is a sprawling lake in the eastern Rift, located immediately southwest of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('largashbur', 'Largashbur is an accursed Orc stronghold in the southeast of Skyrim, located west-southwest of Riften in the Rift. Besieged by giants, the stronghold contains two zones: Largashbur Longhouse and Largashbur Cellar. Unlike other Orc strongholds, Largashbur lacks a mine and has sent two of its workers to assist Narzulbur, which has a mine but is short on labor. 

The stronghold features a makeshift altar to Malacath, adorned with Orcish armor and weapons. It is rumoured that the god Malacath is not pleased with this tribe and have cursed it.', '''accurs'':5B ''adorn'':70B ''altar'':67B ''an'':4B ''and'':32B,43B,74B,89B ''armor'':73B ''assist'':51B ''besieg'':22B ''but'':57B ''by'':23B ''cell'':34B ''contains'':27B ''curs'':91B ''featur'':64B ''giants'':24B ''god'':81B ''hav'':90B ''in'':8B,19B ''is'':3B,58B,77B,83B ''it'':76B,92B ''its'':48B ''labor'':61B ''lacks'':40B ''largashbur'':1A,2B,30B,33B,39B ''locat'':13B ''longhous'':31B ''makeshift'':66B ''malacath'':69B,82B ''min'':42B,56B ''narzulbur'':52B ''not'':84B ''of'':11B,17B,47B ''on'':60B ''orc'':6B,37B ''orcish'':72B ''other'':36B ''pleas'':85B ''rift'':18B,21B ''rumour'':78B ''sent'':45B ''short'':59B ''skyrim'':12B ''southeast'':10B ''southwest'':16B ''stronghold'':7B,26B,63B ''strongholds'':38B ''that'':79B ''the'':9B,20B,25B,62B,80B ''this'':87B ''to'':50B,68B ''trib'':88B ''two'':28B,46B ''unlik'':35B ''weapons'':75B ''west'':15B ''west-southwest'':14B ''which'':53B ''with'':71B,86B ''workers'':49B ''zon'':29B', 'rift, orc', 'Largashbur is an accursed Orc stronghold in the southeast of Skyrim.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('last_vigil', 'Last Vigil is a small, secluded camp located northeast of Riften and southeast of Ruunvald Excavation. It is rumoured that one day a great battle will take place here, between two warriors who have reached the end of their quest.', '''and'':14B ''battl'':27B ''betw'':32B ''camp'':9B ''day'':24B ''end'':39B ''excavation'':18B ''great'':26B ''hav'':36B ''her'':31B ''is'':5B,20B ''it'':19B ''last'':1A,3B ''locat'':10B ''northeast'':11B ''of'':12B,16B,40B ''one'':23B ''plac'':30B ''quest'':42B ''reach'':37B ''rift'':13B ''rumour'':21B ''ruunvald'':17B ''seclud'':8B ''small'':7B ''southeast'':15B ''tak'':29B ''that'':22B ''the'':38B,41B ''two'':33B ''vigil'':2A,4B ''warriors'':34B ''who'':35B ''will'':28B', 'rift', 'Last Vigil is a small, secluded camp located northeast of Riften. It is rumoured that one day a great battle will take place here, between two warriors who have reached the end of their quest.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lost_prospect_mine', 'Lost Prospect Mine is a small, seemingly depleted gold mine located east-northeast of Riften and southeast of Fallowstone Cave in the Rift. It is believed to be barren.', '''and'':20B ''barr'':33B ''be'':32B ''believ'':30B ''cav'':24B ''deplet'':11B ''east'':16B ''east-northeast'':15B ''fallowston'':23B ''gold'':12B ''in'':25B ''is'':7B,29B ''it'':28B ''locat'':14B ''lost'':1A,4B ''min'':3A,6B,13B ''northeast'':17B ''of'':18B,22B ''prospect'':2A,5B ''rift'':19B,27B ''seemingly'':10B ''small'':9B ''southeast'':21B ''the'':26B ''to'':31B', 'rift', 'Lost Prospect Mine is a small, seemingly depleted gold mine located east-northeast of Riften .You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('lost_tongue_overlook', 'Lost Tongue Overlook is a dragon lair located south of Riften and east-southeast of Crystaldrift Cave. The path to the lair begins just past Snow-Shod Farm and winds south, passing a dragon mound and climbing several flights of stairs marked by piles of rocks.', '''and'':15B,34B,41B ''begins'':27B ''by'':48B ''cav'':21B ''climbing'':42B ''crystaldrift'':20B ''dragon'':9B,39B ''east'':17B ''east-southeast'':16B ''farm'':33B ''flights'':44B ''is'':7B ''just'':28B ''lair'':10B,26B ''locat'':11B ''lost'':1A,4B ''mark'':47B ''mound'':40B ''of'':13B,19B,45B,50B ''overlook'':3A,6B ''passing'':37B ''past'':29B ''path'':23B ''pil'':49B ''rift'':14B ''rocks'':51B ''several'':43B ''shod'':32B ''snow'':31B ''snow-shod'':30B ''south'':12B,36B ''southeast'':18B ''stairs'':46B ''the'':22B,25B ''to'':24B ''tong'':2A,5B ''winds'':35B', 'rift, dragon', 'Lost Tongue Overlook is a dragon lair located south of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('marise_aravel''s_house', 'Marise Aravel''s House is a modest residence located on the lower level of Riften, near the canal that runs through the city''s center. It is the first house on the left when approaching from Elgrim''s Elixirs. Positioned below the Temple of Mara and east of the entrance to the Ratway.', '''and'':50B ''approaching'':39B ''aravel'':2A,6B ''below'':45B ''canal'':22B ''cent'':29B ''city'':27B ''east'':51B ''elgrim'':41B ''elixirs'':43B ''entranc'':54B ''first'':33B ''from'':40B ''hous'':4A,8B,34B ''is'':9B,31B ''it'':30B ''left'':37B ''level'':17B ''locat'':13B ''low'':16B ''mar'':49B ''maris'':1A,5B ''modest'':11B ''near'':20B ''of'':18B,48B,52B ''on'':14B,35B ''position'':44B ''ratway'':57B ''residenc'':12B ''rift'':19B ''runs'':24B ''s'':3A,7B,28B,42B ''templ'':47B ''that'':23B ''the'':15B,21B,26B,32B,36B,46B,53B,56B ''through'':25B ''to'':55B ''when'':38B', 'rift', 'Marise Aravel''s House is a modest residence located on the lower level of Riften, near the canal that runs through the city''s center. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('merryfair_farm', 'Merryfair Farm is a modest, struggling farm located northwest of Riften, just west of Riften Stables on the north shore of Lake Honrich. Owned and operated by Dravin Llanith and his wife Synda, the couple make a meager living growing wheat, cabbages, and gourds, with a single cow providing milk. Dravin can often be seen milling wheat for their bread.

There are rumours that the farm has recently been burglarized with a valuable bow being stolen.', '''and'':27B,32B,45B ''are'':64B ''be'':56B ''been'':71B ''being'':77B ''bow'':76B ''bre'':62B ''burglariz'':72B ''by'':29B ''cabbag'':44B ''can'':54B ''coupl'':37B ''cow'':50B ''dravin'':30B,53B ''farm'':2A,4B,9B,68B ''for'':60B ''gourds'':46B ''growing'':42B ''his'':33B ''honrich'':25B ''is'':5B ''just'':14B ''lak'':24B ''living'':41B ''llanith'':31B ''locat'':10B ''mak'':38B ''meag'':40B ''merryf'':1A,3B ''milk'':52B ''milling'':58B ''modest'':7B ''north'':21B ''northwest'':11B ''of'':12B,16B,23B ''often'':55B ''on'':19B ''operat'':28B ''owned'':26B ''providing'':51B ''recently'':70B ''rift'':13B,17B ''rumours'':65B ''seen'':57B ''shor'':22B ''singl'':49B ''stabl'':18B ''stol'':78B ''struggling'':8B ''synda'':35B ''that'':66B ''the'':20B,36B,61B,67B ''ther'':63B ''valuabl'':75B ''west'':15B ''wheat'':43B,59B ''wif'':34B ''with'':47B,73B', 'rift', 'Merryfair Farm is a modest, struggling farm located northwest of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ruunvald', 'Ruunvald Excavation is a medium-sized cave east of Shor''s Stone and northeast of Fort Greenwall, nestled high in the eastern mountains. It is rumoured that it was established by Vigilants of Stendarr led by Moric Sidrey.', '''and'':15B ''by'':33B,38B ''cav'':9B ''east'':10B ''eastern'':24B ''establish'':32B ''excavation'':3B ''fort'':18B ''greenwall'':19B ''high'':21B ''in'':22B ''is'':4B,27B ''it'':26B,30B ''led'':37B ''medium'':7B ''medium-siz'':6B ''moric'':39B ''mountains'':25B ''nestl'':20B ''northeast'':16B ''of'':11B,17B,35B ''rumour'':28B ''ruunvald'':1A,2B ''s'':13B ''shor'':12B ''sidrey'':40B ''siz'':8B ''stendarr'':36B ''ston'':14B ''that'':29B ''the'':23B ''vigilants'':34B ''was'':31B', 'rift', 'Ruunvald Excavation is a medium-sized cave east of Shor''s Stone and northeast of Fort Greenwall.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mistveil_keep', 'Mistveil Keep is a grand castle located at the southern end of Riften, its stone walls standing in stark contrast to the city''s wooden buildings and walkways. Serving as an extra layer of protection during times of conflict, the keep is the seat of power for the Rift. Mistveil Keep is home to Jarl Laila Law-Giver and her sons, Harrald and Saerlund. The steward, Anuriel, and the eccentric court wizard, Wylandriah, also reside here, assisting in the governance of the hold.', '''also'':77B ''an'':33B ''and'':29B,62B,66B,71B ''anuriel'':70B ''as'':32B ''assisting'':80B ''at'':10B ''buildings'':28B ''castl'':8B ''city'':25B ''conflict'':41B ''contrast'':22B ''court'':74B ''during'':38B ''eccentric'':73B ''end'':13B ''extra'':34B ''for'':49B ''giv'':61B ''governanc'':83B ''grand'':7B ''harrald'':65B ''her'':63B,79B ''hold'':86B ''hom'':55B ''in'':20B,81B ''is'':5B,44B,54B ''its'':16B ''jarl'':57B ''keep'':2A,4B,43B,53B ''lail'':58B ''law'':60B ''law-giv'':59B ''lay'':35B ''locat'':9B ''mistveil'':1A,3B,52B ''of'':14B,36B,40B,47B,84B ''pow'':48B ''protection'':37B ''resid'':78B ''rift'':15B,51B ''s'':26B ''saerlund'':67B ''seat'':46B ''serving'':31B ''sons'':64B ''southern'':12B ''standing'':19B ''stark'':21B ''steward'':69B ''ston'':17B ''the'':11B,24B,42B,45B,50B,68B,72B,82B,85B ''tim'':39B ''to'':23B,56B ''walkways'':30B ''walls'':18B ''wizard'':75B ''wood'':27B ''wylandriah'':76B', 'rift, noble', 'Mistveil Keep is a grand castle located at the southern end of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mossy_glen_cave', 'Mossy Glen Cave is a small,bear den located within Dayspring Canyon, accessible only via the canyon itself. The natural cave is adorned with stone pillars and plants.', '''access'':16B ''adorn'':26B ''and'':30B ''bear'':10B ''canyon'':15B,20B ''cav'':3A,6B,24B ''dayspring'':14B ''den'':11B ''glen'':2A,5B ''is'':7B,25B ''itself'':21B ''locat'':12B ''mossy'':1A,4B ''natural'':23B ''only'':17B ''pillars'':29B ''plants'':31B ''small'':9B ''ston'':28B ''the'':19B,22B ''via'':18B ''with'':27B ''within'':13B', 'rift', 'Mossy Glen Cave is a small,bear den located within Dayspring Canyon.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ashfallow_citadel', 'Ashfallow Citadel is a small, abandoned Imperial fort located east of Highpoint Tower and northwest of the Sun Stone on Solstheim. The fort, once a symbol of Imperial authority, has fallen into disrepair and is now used as a base of operations by the Morag Tong, a secretive and deadly assassins'' guild with ties to Morrowind.', '''abandon'':8B ''and'':16B,36B,51B ''as'':40B ''ashfallow'':1A,3B ''assassins'':53B ''authority'':31B ''bas'':42B ''by'':45B ''citadel'':2A,4B ''deadly'':52B ''disrep'':35B ''east'':12B ''fall'':33B ''fort'':10B,25B ''guild'':54B ''highpoint'':14B ''imperial'':9B,30B ''into'':34B ''is'':5B,37B ''locat'':11B ''morag'':47B ''morrowind'':58B ''northwest'':17B ''now'':38B ''of'':13B,18B,29B,43B ''on'':22B ''once'':26B ''operations'':44B ''secretiv'':50B ''small'':7B ''solstheim'':23B ''ston'':21B ''sun'':20B ''symbol'':28B ''the'':19B,24B,46B ''ties'':56B ''to'':57B ''tong'':48B ''tow'':15B ''used'':39B ''with'':55B', 'solstheim', 'You do not know anything about this area.', '', '', 'solstheim');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('nightingale_hall', 'Nightingale Hall is the secret home of the Nightingales, located directly south of Riften near the Shadow Stone. The entrance is accessed via a steep, narrow path illuminated by ceiling fissures and adorned with Nightingale sigil banners. Inside, the hall opens into a grand cavern with a waterfall and a rushing stream, crossed by a wooden bridge leading to the living quarters.', '''access'':24B ''adorn'':35B ''and'':34B,51B ''banners'':39B ''bridg'':59B ''by'':31B,56B ''cavern'':47B ''ceiling'':32B ''cross'':55B ''directly'':13B ''entranc'':22B ''fissur'':33B ''grand'':46B ''hall'':2A,4B,42B ''hom'':8B ''illuminat'':30B ''insid'':40B ''into'':44B ''is'':5B,23B ''leading'':60B ''living'':63B ''locat'':12B ''narrow'':28B ''near'':17B ''nightingal'':1A,3B,11B,37B ''of'':9B,15B ''opens'':43B ''path'':29B ''quarters'':64B ''rift'':16B ''rushing'':53B ''secret'':7B ''shadow'':19B ''sigil'':38B ''south'':14B ''steep'':27B ''ston'':20B ''stream'':54B ''the'':6B,10B,18B,21B,41B,62B ''to'':61B ''via'':25B ''waterfall'':50B ''with'':36B,48B ''wood'':58B', 'karliah', 'Nightingale Hall is the secret home of the Nightingales, located somewhere in Riften but you do not know where. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath, rift', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('nilheim', 'Nilheim is a small, ruined Nordic tower located east-northeast of Ivarstead and northwest of Sarethi Farm in the Rift. It is known that the local Guard have taken control of this area, however they can barely be seen patroling outside the location.', '''and'':15B ''are'':35B ''barely'':39B ''be'':40B ''can'':38B ''control'':32B ''east'':11B ''east-northeast'':10B ''farm'':19B ''guard'':29B ''hav'':30B ''howev'':36B ''in'':20B ''is'':3B,24B ''it'':23B ''ivarst'':14B ''known'':25B ''local'':28B ''locat'':9B ''location'':45B ''nilheim'':1A,2B ''nordic'':7B ''northeast'':12B ''northwest'':16B ''of'':13B,17B,33B ''outsid'':43B ''patroling'':42B ''rift'':22B ''ruin'':6B ''sarethi'':18B ''seen'':41B ''small'':5B ''tak'':31B ''that'':26B ''the'':21B,27B,44B ''they'':37B ''this'':34B ''tow'':8B', 'rift', 'Nilheim is a small, ruined Nordic tower located east-northeast of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('northwind_mine', 'Northwind Mine is a small iron mine located northwest of Shor''s Stone and southeast of Mistwatch in the Rift. Inhabited by skeletons, the mine consists of a single zone and offers adventurers an opportunity to collect iron ore while facing minimal resistance.

To reach the mine, follow the path north from Shor''s Stone, passing Shor''s Watchtower on the right. A set of steps on the left leads up to the mine entrance.', '''adventurers'':35B ''an'':36B ''and'':16B,33B ''by'':24B ''collect'':39B ''consists'':28B ''entranc'':77B ''facing'':43B ''follow'':50B ''from'':54B ''in'':20B ''inhabit'':23B ''iron'':8B,40B ''is'':5B ''leads'':72B ''left'':71B ''locat'':10B ''min'':2A,4B,9B,27B,49B,76B ''minimal'':44B ''mistwatch'':19B ''north'':53B ''northwest'':11B ''northwind'':1A,3B ''of'':12B,18B,29B,67B ''offers'':34B ''on'':62B,69B ''opportunity'':37B ''ore'':41B ''passing'':58B ''path'':52B ''reach'':47B ''resistanc'':45B ''rift'':22B ''right'':64B ''s'':14B,56B,60B ''set'':66B ''shor'':13B,55B,59B ''singl'':31B ''skeletons'':25B ''small'':7B ''southeast'':17B ''steps'':68B ''ston'':15B,57B ''the'':21B,26B,48B,51B,63B,70B,75B ''to'':38B,46B,74B ''up'':73B ''watchtow'':61B ''whil'':42B ''zon'':32B', 'rift', 'Northwind Mine is a small iron mine located northwest of Shor''s Stone.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_ratway', 'The Ratway is a network of sewer tunnels running beneath Riften, serving as the home base for the Thieves Guild.  The Ratway serves as both a passageway and a hidden underbelly of Riften, where the guild operates out of sight from the city''s authorities.', '''and'':30B ''as'':15B,26B ''authoriti'':47B ''bas'':18B ''beneath'':12B ''both'':27B ''city'':45B ''for'':19B ''from'':43B ''guild'':22B,38B ''hidd'':32B ''hom'':17B ''is'':5B ''network'':7B ''of'':8B,34B,41B ''operat'':39B ''out'':40B ''passageway'':29B ''ratway'':2A,4B,24B ''rift'':13B,35B ''running'':11B ''s'':46B ''serv'':25B ''serving'':14B ''sew'':9B ''sight'':42B ''the'':1A,3B,16B,20B,23B,37B,44B ''thiev'':21B ''tunnels'':10B ''underbelly'':33B ''wher'':36B', 'thievesguild', 'The Ratway is a network of sewer tunnels running beneath Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'rift', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('northwind_summit', 'Northwind Summit is a mountaintop dragon lair northwest of Shor''s Stone and north-northwest of Riften, situated on the highest point in the Rift. The summit can be accessed either by traveling through Northwind Mine on the mountain''s northern side or by climbing from Shor''s Stone via a gentler slope south of the path. There are rumours that hunters have made camp at the summit, but they have not been seen since.', '''access'':33B ''and'':15B ''are'':62B ''at'':69B ''be'':32B ''been'':76B ''but'':72B ''by'':35B,47B ''camp'':68B ''can'':31B ''climbing'':48B ''dragon'':8B ''eith'':34B ''from'':49B ''gentl'':55B ''hav'':66B,74B ''highest'':24B ''hunters'':65B ''in'':26B ''is'':5B ''lair'':9B ''mad'':67B ''min'':39B ''mountain'':42B ''mountaintop'':7B ''north'':17B ''north-northwest'':16B ''northern'':44B ''northwest'':10B,18B ''northwind'':1A,3B,38B ''not'':75B ''of'':11B,19B,58B ''on'':22B,40B ''or'':46B ''path'':60B ''point'':25B ''rift'':20B,28B ''rumours'':63B ''s'':13B,43B,51B ''seen'':77B ''shor'':12B,50B ''sid'':45B ''sinc'':78B ''situat'':21B ''slop'':56B ''south'':57B ''ston'':14B,52B ''summit'':2A,4B,30B,71B ''that'':64B ''the'':23B,27B,29B,41B,59B,70B ''ther'':61B ''they'':73B ''through'':37B ''traveling'':36B ''via'':53B', 'rift, dragon', 'Northwind Summit is a mountaintop northwest of Shor''s Stone and north-northwest of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('pinepeak_cavern', 'Pinepeak Cavern is a small cave north of Ivarstead, situated on the shore opposite the town across the Treva River. To find it, follow the road north from Ivarstead, cross the river as if heading to the "7,000 Steps," and turn north at the start of the climb. There are rumours that some local hunters have headed to this cave, but have not returned.', '''000'':41B ''7'':40B ''across'':19B ''and'':43B ''are'':53B ''as'':35B ''at'':46B ''but'':64B ''cav'':8B,63B ''cavern'':2A,4B ''climb'':51B ''cross'':32B ''find'':24B ''follow'':26B ''from'':30B ''hav'':59B,65B ''head'':60B ''heading'':37B ''hunters'':58B ''if'':36B ''is'':5B ''it'':25B ''ivarst'':11B,31B ''local'':57B ''north'':9B,29B,45B ''not'':66B ''of'':10B,49B ''on'':13B ''opposit'':16B ''pinepeak'':1A,3B ''return'':67B ''riv'':22B,34B ''road'':28B ''rumours'':54B ''shor'':15B ''situat'':12B ''small'':7B ''som'':56B ''start'':48B ''steps'':42B ''that'':55B ''the'':14B,17B,20B,27B,33B,39B,47B,50B ''ther'':52B ''this'':62B ''to'':23B,38B,61B ''town'':18B ''trev'':21B ''turn'':44B', 'rift', 'Pinepeak Cavern is a small cave north of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('redbelly_mine', 'Redbelly Mine is a small ebony mine located in the village of Shor''s Stone in the Rift. The mine, which serves as the lifeblood of the settlement, initially becomes infested with frostbite spiders.  It consists of a single zone and is a valuable resource for ebony ore.

The mine gets its name from the eerie red mist that flows through it, with a sulfurous smell reminiscent of the volcanic tundra. ', '''and'':43B ''as'':25B ''becom'':32B ''consists'':38B ''ebony'':8B,49B ''eeri'':58B ''flows'':62B ''for'':48B ''from'':56B ''frostbit'':35B ''gets'':53B ''in'':11B,18B ''infest'':33B ''initially'':31B ''is'':5B,44B ''it'':37B,64B ''its'':54B ''lifeblood'':27B ''locat'':10B ''min'':2A,4B,9B,22B,52B ''mist'':60B ''nam'':55B ''of'':14B,28B,39B,70B ''ore'':50B ''red'':59B ''redbelly'':1A,3B ''reminiscent'':69B ''resourc'':47B ''rift'':20B ''s'':16B ''serv'':24B ''settlement'':30B ''shor'':15B ''singl'':41B ''small'':7B ''smell'':68B ''spiders'':36B ''ston'':17B ''sulfurous'':67B ''that'':61B ''the'':12B,19B,21B,26B,29B,51B,57B,71B ''through'':63B ''tundr'':73B ''valuabl'':46B ''villag'':13B ''volcanic'':72B ''which'':23B ''with'':34B,65B ''zon'':42B', 'rift', 'Redbelly Mine is a small ebony mine located in the village of Shor''s Stone in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('redwater_den', 'Redwater Den is a dilapidated shack located northwest of Riften and west of Autumnshade Clearing in the Rift. While it initially appears to be a simple drug den supplying Redwater skooma, which you heard has a unique taste compared to regular Skooma.', '''and'':13B ''appears'':24B ''autumnshad'':16B ''be'':26B ''clearing'':17B ''compar'':41B ''den'':2A,4B,30B ''dilapidat'':7B ''drug'':29B ''heard'':36B ''in'':18B ''initially'':23B ''is'':5B ''it'':22B ''locat'':9B ''northwest'':10B ''of'':11B,15B ''redwat'':1A,3B,32B ''regul'':43B ''rift'':12B,20B ''shack'':8B ''simpl'':28B ''skoom'':33B,44B ''supplying'':31B ''tast'':40B ''the'':19B ''to'':25B,42B ''uniqu'':39B ''west'':14B ''which'':34B ''whil'':21B ''you'':35B', 'rift', 'Redwater Den is a dilapidated shack located northwest of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rift', 'The Rift is a hold in southeast Skyrim, with its capital in Riften,  aligned with the Stormcloaks. Nestled on a vast plateau bordered by the Jerall and Velothi Mountains, the Rift connects Skyrim to Morrowind and Cyrodiil and is renowned for its vibrant autumnal forests, aspen trees, and rich alchemical resources like mountain flowers, scaly pholiota, and canis root.', '''alchemical'':51B ''align'':15B ''and'':28B,37B,39B,49B,58B ''aspen'':47B ''autumnal'':45B ''border'':24B ''by'':25B ''canis'':59B ''capital'':12B ''connects'':33B ''cyrodiil'':38B ''flowers'':55B ''for'':42B ''forests'':46B ''hold'':6B ''in'':7B,13B ''is'':4B,40B ''its'':11B,43B ''jerall'':27B ''lik'':53B ''morrowind'':36B ''mountain'':54B ''mountains'':30B ''nestl'':19B ''on'':20B ''pholiot'':57B ''plateau'':23B ''renown'':41B ''resourc'':52B ''rich'':50B ''rift'':1A,3B,14B,32B ''root'':60B ''scaly'':56B ''skyrim'':9B,34B ''southeast'':8B ''stormcloaks'':18B ''the'':2B,17B,26B,31B ''to'':35B ''tre'':48B ''vast'':22B ''velothi'':29B ''vibrant'':44B ''with'':10B,16B', 'rift, noble, scholar', 'The Rift is a hold in southeast Skyrim, with its capital in Riften,  aligned with the Stormcloaks. Nestled on a vast plateau bordered by the Jerall and Velothi Mountains, the Rift connects Skyrim to Morrowind and Cyrodiil and is renowned for its vibrant autumnal forests, aspen trees, and rich alchemical resources like mountain flowers, scaly pholiota, and canis root.', '', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rift_imperial_camp', 'The Rift Imperial Camp is an Imperial military outpost in the Rift, situated south of Ivarstead and west of the Ruins of Bthalft. Typically commanded by Legate Fasendi. It serves as a strategic base for the Imperial Legion''s operations in the region.', '''an'':9B ''and'':20B ''as'':34B ''bas'':37B ''bthalft'':26B ''by'':29B ''camp'':3A,7B ''command'':28B ''fasendi'':31B ''for'':38B ''imperial'':2A,6B,10B,40B ''in'':13B,44B ''is'':8B ''it'':32B ''ivarst'':19B ''legat'':30B ''legion'':41B ''military'':11B ''of'':18B,22B,25B ''operations'':43B ''outpost'':12B ''region'':46B ''rift'':1A,5B,15B ''ruins'':24B ''s'':42B ''serv'':33B ''situat'':16B ''south'':17B ''strategic'':36B ''the'':4B,14B,23B,39B,45B ''typically'':27B ''west'':21B', 'rift, legion', 'The Rift Imperial Camp is an Imperial military outpost in the Rift, situated south of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('rift_stormcloak_camp', 'The Rift Stormcloak Camp is a Stormcloak military encampment in the Rift, located northeast of Sarethi Farm and west of the Rift Watchtower.  Commanded by Gonnar Oath-Giver. ', '''and'':21B ''by'':28B ''camp'':3A,7B ''command'':27B ''encampment'':12B ''farm'':20B ''giv'':32B ''gonn'':29B ''in'':13B ''is'':8B ''locat'':16B ''military'':11B ''northeast'':17B ''oath'':31B ''oath-giv'':30B ''of'':18B,23B ''rift'':1A,5B,15B,25B ''sarethi'':19B ''stormcloak'':2A,6B,10B ''the'':4B,14B,24B ''watchtow'':26B ''west'':22B', 'rift, stormcloak', 'The Rift Stormcloak Camp is a Stormcloak military encampment in the Rift, located west of the Rift Watchtower.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('riften', 'Riften, the capital of the Rift in southeast Skyrim, lies near the borders of Morrowind and Cyrodiil. Known for its ties to the Thieves Guild, which operates from the Ratway beneath the city, Riften is also home to Honorhall Orphanage and the influential Black-Briar family. Maven Black-Briar, the feared matriarch, owns the Black-Briar Meadery and is rumoured to holds sway over the Thieves Guild and the Dark Brotherhood. 

The bustling Riften Grand Plaza features a vibrant market with merchants like Madesi, an Argonian jeweler; Grelka, an expert Light Armor trainer; and Brand-Shei, a Dunmer raised by Argonians. Other notable establishments include Elgrim''s Elixirs, Balimund''s forge, the Pawned Prawn, the Temple of Mara and The Bee and Barb inn. With its shadowy underworld and political intrigue, Riften is a city of opportunity and danger for those bold enough to explore it.', '''also'':37B ''an'':89B,93B ''and'':17B,42B,62B,72B,98B,124B,127B,134B,143B ''argoni'':90B ''argonians'':106B ''armor'':96B ''balimund'':114B ''barb'':128B ''bee'':126B ''beneath'':32B ''black'':46B,51B,59B ''black-bri'':45B,50B,58B ''bold'':147B ''borders'':14B ''brand'':100B ''brand-shei'':99B ''bri'':47B,52B,60B ''brotherhood'':75B ''bustling'':77B ''by'':105B ''capital'':4B ''city'':34B,140B ''cyrodiil'':18B ''dang'':144B ''dark'':74B ''dunm'':103B ''elgrim'':111B ''elixirs'':113B ''enough'':148B ''establishments'':109B ''expert'':94B ''explor'':150B ''family'':48B ''fear'':54B ''featur'':81B ''for'':20B,145B ''forg'':116B ''from'':29B ''grand'':79B ''grelk'':92B ''guild'':26B,71B ''holds'':66B ''hom'':38B ''honorhall'':40B ''in'':8B ''includ'':110B ''influential'':44B ''inn'':129B ''intrig'':136B ''is'':36B,63B,138B ''it'':151B ''its'':21B,131B ''jewel'':91B ''known'':19B ''lies'':11B ''light'':95B ''lik'':87B ''madesi'':88B ''mar'':123B ''market'':84B ''matriarch'':55B ''mav'':49B ''meadery'':61B ''merchants'':86B ''morrowind'':16B ''near'':12B ''notabl'':108B ''of'':5B,15B,122B,141B ''operat'':28B ''opportunity'':142B ''orphanag'':41B ''other'':107B ''over'':68B ''owns'':56B ''pawn'':118B ''plaz'':80B ''political'':135B ''prawn'':119B ''rais'':104B ''ratway'':31B ''rift'':1A,2B,7B,35B,78B,137B ''rumour'':64B ''s'':112B,115B ''shadowy'':132B ''shei'':101B ''skyrim'':10B ''southeast'':9B ''sway'':67B ''templ'':121B ''the'':3B,6B,13B,24B,30B,33B,43B,53B,57B,69B,73B,76B,117B,120B,125B ''thiev'':25B,70B ''thos'':146B ''ties'':22B ''to'':23B,39B,65B,149B ''train'':97B ''underworld'':133B ''vibrant'':83B ''which'':27B ''with'':85B,130B', 'rift, noble, scholar', 'Riften, the capital of the Rift in southeast Skyrim, lies near the borders of Morrowind and Cyrodiil. Known for its ties to the Thieves Guild, which operates from the Ratway beneath the city, Riften is also home to Honorhall Orphanage and the influential Black-Briar family. Maven Black-Briar, the feared matriarch, owns the Black-Briar Meadery and is rumoured to holds sway over the Thieves Guild and the Dark Brotherhood.  Other notable establishments include the Temple of Mara.', '', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('talking_stone_camp', 'Talking Stone Camp is a giant camp located northeast of Rorikstead and south of Orotheim in Hjaalmarch. The camp is home to giants and their mammoths, with the typical features of a giant camp, including a large bonfire and scattered mammoth bones.', '''and'':15B,27B,42B ''bon'':45B ''bonfir'':41B ''camp'':3A,6B,10B,22B,37B ''featur'':33B ''giant'':9B,36B ''giants'':26B ''hjaalmarch'':20B ''hom'':24B ''in'':19B ''including'':38B ''is'':7B,23B ''larg'':40B ''locat'':11B ''mammoth'':44B ''mammoths'':29B ''northeast'':12B ''of'':13B,17B,34B ''orotheim'':18B ''rorikst'':14B ''scatter'':43B ''south'':16B ''ston'':2A,5B ''talking'':1A,4B ''the'':21B,28B,31B ''to'':25B ''typical'':32B ''with'':30B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Talking Stone Camp is a giant camp located northeast of Rorikstead in Hjaalmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('riften_fishery', 'Riften Fishery is a bustling facility located just outside the city of Riften, down by the docks. Owned by Bolli, the fishery serves as a vital part of Riften''s economy, providing fresh fish and employment opportunities for the local population. Its strategic location on the docks makes it a key hub for fishing and trade within the Rift.', '''and'':37B,57B ''as'':26B ''bolli'':22B ''bustling'':7B ''by'':17B,21B ''city'':13B ''docks'':19B,49B ''down'':16B ''economy'':33B ''employment'':38B ''facility'':8B ''fish'':36B ''fishery'':2A,4B,24B ''fishing'':56B ''for'':40B,55B ''fresh'':35B ''hub'':54B ''is'':5B ''it'':51B ''its'':44B ''just'':10B ''key'':53B ''local'':42B ''locat'':9B ''location'':46B ''mak'':50B ''of'':14B,30B ''on'':47B ''opportuniti'':39B ''outsid'':11B ''owned'':20B ''part'':29B ''population'':43B ''providing'':34B ''rift'':1A,3B,15B,31B,61B ''s'':32B ''serv'':25B ''strategic'':45B ''the'':12B,18B,23B,41B,48B,60B ''trad'':58B ''vital'':28B ''within'':59B', 'rift, fisher', 'Riften Fishery is a bustling facility located just outside the city of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('riften_jail', 'Riften Jail is located beneath Mistveil Keep, serving as the city''s detention facility. Accessible via an entrance to the right of the main doors to Mistveil Keep, the jail is a secure area where criminals and wrongdoers are held.', '''access'':17B ''an'':19B ''and'':39B ''are'':36B,41B ''as'':11B ''beneath'':7B ''city'':13B ''criminals'':38B ''detention'':15B ''doors'':27B ''entranc'':20B ''facility'':16B ''held'':42B ''is'':5B,33B ''jail'':2A,4B,32B ''keep'':9B,30B ''locat'':6B ''main'':26B ''mistveil'':8B,29B ''of'':24B ''rift'':1A,3B ''right'':23B ''s'':14B ''secur'':35B ''serving'':10B ''the'':12B,22B,25B,31B ''to'':21B,28B ''via'':18B ''wher'':37B ''wrongdoers'':40B', 'rift', 'Riften Jail is located beneath Mistveil Keep.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('riften_stables', 'Riften Stables is located just outside the northern entrance to Riften. Owned and operated by Hofgrir Horse-Crusher, with assistance from Shadr, the stables provide horse rentals and sales for travelers and adventurers.', '''adventurers'':36B ''and'':15B,31B,35B ''assistanc'':23B ''by'':17B ''crush'':21B ''entranc'':11B ''for'':33B ''from'':24B ''hofgr'':18B ''hors'':20B,29B ''horse-crush'':19B ''is'':5B ''just'':7B ''locat'':6B ''northern'':10B ''operat'':16B ''outsid'':8B ''owned'':14B ''provid'':28B ''rentals'':30B ''rift'':1A,3B,13B ''sal'':32B ''shadr'':25B ''stabl'':2A,4B,27B ''the'':9B,26B ''to'':12B ''travelers'':34B ''with'':22B', 'rift', 'Riften Stables is located just outside the northern entrance to Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('romlyn_dreth''s_house', 'Romlyn Dreth''s House is a modest dwelling located in the lower part of Riften, adjacent to the canal that flows through the city. The house is situated near the stairs leading down to the canal from the area in front of Honorhall Orphanage.', '''adjacent'':20B ''are'':43B ''canal'':23B,40B ''city'':28B ''down'':37B ''dreth'':2A,6B ''dwelling'':12B ''flows'':25B ''from'':41B ''front'':45B ''honorhall'':47B ''hous'':4A,8B,30B ''in'':14B,44B ''is'':9B,31B ''leading'':36B ''locat'':13B ''low'':16B ''modest'':11B ''near'':33B ''of'':18B,46B ''orphanag'':48B ''part'':17B ''rift'':19B ''romlyn'':1A,5B ''s'':3A,7B ''situat'':32B ''stairs'':35B ''that'':24B ''the'':15B,22B,27B,29B,34B,39B,42B ''through'':26B ''to'':21B,38B', 'rift', 'Romlyn Dreth''s House is a dwelling located in the lower part of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ruins_of_bthalft', 'The Ruins of Bthalft are a small Dwarven ruin located south of Ivarstead in the Rift. It is known to be occupied by bandits, who seem to be searching for something here.', '''are'':8B ''bandits'':27B ''be'':24B,31B ''bthalft'':3A,7B ''by'':26B ''dwarv'':11B ''for'':33B ''her'':35B ''in'':17B ''is'':21B ''it'':20B ''ivarst'':16B ''known'':22B ''locat'':13B ''occupi'':25B ''of'':2A,6B,15B ''rift'':19B ''ruin'':12B ''ruins'':1A,5B ''searching'':32B ''seem'':29B ''small'':10B ''something'':34B ''south'':14B ''the'':4B,18B ''to'':23B,30B ''who'':28B', 'rift, dwemer', 'The Ruins of Bthalft are a small Dwarven ruin located south of Ivarstead in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ruins_of_rkund', 'The Ruins of Rkund are a small, eerie Dwarven ruin nestled in the mountains southwest of Riften and southeast of Darklight Tower in the Rift. The ruins, accessible by passing through the Darklight Tower and continuing southeast, are sparsely scattered with broken pillars and collapsed structures. ', '''access'':31B ''and'':21B,38B,47B ''are'':8B,41B ''brok'':45B ''by'':32B ''collaps'':48B ''continuing'':39B ''darklight'':24B,36B ''dwarv'':12B ''eeri'':11B ''in'':15B,26B ''mountains'':17B ''nestl'':14B ''of'':2A,6B,19B,23B ''passing'':33B ''pillars'':46B ''rift'':20B,28B ''rkund'':3A,7B ''ruin'':13B ''ruins'':1A,5B,30B ''scatter'':43B ''small'':10B ''southeast'':22B,40B ''southwest'':18B ''sparsely'':42B ''structur'':49B ''the'':4B,16B,27B,29B,35B ''through'':34B ''tow'':25B,37B ''with'':44B', 'rift', 'The Ruins of Rkund are a small, eerie Dwarven ruin nestled in the mountains southwest of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('sarethi_farm', 'Sarethi Farm is a unique farm located between Ivarstead and Shor''s Stone in the Rift, known for its successful cultivation of nirnroot. The Sarethi family founded the farm after fleeing the eruption of the Red Mountain. Avrusa Sarethi, who once apprenticed under Sinderion in Skingrad, learned the secrets of nirnroot cultivation from him when he set up a research lab on the farm.', '''after'':32B ''and'':12B ''apprentic'':44B ''avrus'':40B ''betw'':10B ''cultivation'':23B,54B ''eruption'':35B ''family'':28B ''farm'':2A,4B,8B,31B,66B ''fleeing'':33B ''for'':20B ''found'':29B ''from'':55B ''him'':56B ''in'':16B,47B ''is'':5B ''its'':21B ''ivarst'':11B ''known'':19B ''lab'':63B ''learn'':49B ''locat'':9B ''mountain'':39B ''nirnroot'':25B,53B ''of'':24B,36B,52B ''on'':64B ''once'':43B ''red'':38B ''research'':62B ''rift'':18B ''s'':14B ''sarethi'':1A,3B,27B,41B ''secrets'':51B ''set'':59B ''shor'':13B ''sinderion'':46B ''skingr'':48B ''ston'':15B ''successful'':22B ''the'':17B,26B,30B,34B,37B,50B,65B ''under'':45B ''uniqu'':7B ''up'':60B ''when'':57B ''who'':42B', 'rift', 'Sarethi Farm is a unique farm located between Ivarstead and Shor''s Stone in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('shor''s_stone
', 'Shor''s Stone is a small mining town located along the main road in the pass between the Rift and Eastmarch, north-northwest of Riften and south-southeast of Windhelm. Named after the Nordic god Shor, the town is centered around Redbelly Mine, known for its ebony deposits. However, the mine has been plagued by frostbite spiders, creating significant trouble for the local residents. ', '''after'':37B ''along'':13B ''and'':23B,30B ''around'':46B ''been'':58B ''betw'':20B ''by'':60B ''center'':45B ''creating'':63B ''deposits'':53B ''eastmarch'':24B ''ebony'':52B ''for'':50B,66B ''frostbit'':61B ''god'':40B ''howev'':54B ''in'':17B ''is'':7B,44B ''its'':51B ''known'':49B ''local'':68B ''locat'':12B ''main'':15B ''min'':48B,56B ''mining'':10B ''nam'':36B ''nordic'':39B ''north'':26B ''north-northwest'':25B ''northwest'':27B ''of'':28B,34B ''pass'':19B ''plagu'':59B ''redbelly'':47B ''residents'':69B ''rift'':22B,29B ''road'':16B ''s'':2A,5B ''shor'':1A,4B,41B ''significant'':64B ''small'':9B ''south'':32B ''south-southeast'':31B ''southeast'':33B ''spiders'':62B ''ston'':3A,6B ''the'':14B,18B,21B,38B,42B,55B,67B ''town'':11B,43B ''troubl'':65B ''windhelm'':35B', 'rift', 'Shor''s Stone is a small mining town located along the main road in the pass between the Rift and EastmarchYou do not know anything else about this area.', '', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('shor''s_watchtower', 'Shor''s Watchtower is a small, crumbling tower located north-northeast of Shor''s Stone and south of Cragslane Cavern in the Rift. Though its strategic position once made it a valuable outpost, the tower now stands in a state of disrepair, serving as a notable landmark for travelers navigating the area.', '''and'':20B ''are'':56B ''as'':48B ''cavern'':24B ''cragslan'':23B ''crumbling'':10B ''disrep'':46B ''for'':52B ''in'':25B,42B ''is'':7B ''it'':34B ''its'':29B ''landmark'':51B ''locat'':12B ''mad'':33B ''navigating'':54B ''north'':14B ''north-northeast'':13B ''northeast'':15B ''notabl'':50B ''now'':40B ''of'':16B,22B,45B ''once'':32B ''outpost'':37B ''position'':31B ''rift'':27B ''s'':2A,5B,18B ''serving'':47B ''shor'':1A,4B,17B ''small'':9B ''south'':21B ''stands'':41B ''stat'':44B ''ston'':19B ''strategic'':30B ''the'':26B,38B,55B ''though'':28B ''tow'':11B,39B ''travelers'':53B ''valuabl'':36B ''watchtow'':3A,6B', 'rift', 'Shor''s Watchtower is a small, crumbling tower located north-northeast of Shor''s Stone.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('shroud_hearth_barrow', 'Shroud Hearth Barrow is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located east of Ivarstead in the Rift. It is home to draugr and skeletons, and is steeped in local superstition as the residents of Ivarstead believe it to be haunted. There is the story of Wyndelius Gatharian, an adventurer who entered the ruin a year prior and never returned. ', '''adventur'':52B ''an'':51B ''and'':26B,28B,60B ''as'':34B ''barrow'':3A,6B ''be'':42B ''believ'':39B ''draugr'':25B ''east'':15B ''enter'':54B ''gathari'':50B ''haunt'':43B ''hearth'':2A,5B ''hom'':23B ''in'':18B,31B ''is'':7B,22B,29B,45B ''it'':21B,40B ''ivarst'':17B,38B ''local'':32B ''locat'':14B ''medium'':10B ''medium-siz'':9B ''nev'':61B ''nordic'':12B ''of'':16B,37B,48B ''prior'':59B ''residents'':36B ''return'':62B ''rift'':20B ''ruin'':13B,56B ''shroud'':1A,4B ''siz'':11B ''skeletons'':27B ''steep'':30B ''story'':47B ''superstition'':33B ''the'':19B,35B,46B,55B ''ther'':44B ''to'':24B,41B ''who'':53B ''wyndelius'':49B ''year'':58B', 'rift', 'Shroud Hearth Barrow is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located east of Ivarstead in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('snow-shod_farm', 'Snow-Shod Farm is a small farm located south of Riften and west of Nightingale Hall in the Rift. Owned by Vulwulf Snow-Shod, the farm is managed by Addvild and Leonara Arius. The property includes a farmhouse and a windmill, along with fields of crops and livestock.

The farm produces wheat, leeks, and potatoes, with Addvild offering payment for gathering these items. The livestock includes chickens and cows.', '''addvild'':36B,63B ''along'':48B ''and'':17B,37B,45B,53B,60B,74B ''arius'':39B ''by'':26B,35B ''chickens'':73B ''cows'':75B ''crops'':52B ''farm'':4A,8B,12B,32B,56B ''farmhous'':44B ''fields'':50B ''for'':66B ''gathering'':67B ''hall'':21B ''in'':22B ''includ'':42B,72B ''is'':9B,33B ''items'':69B ''leeks'':59B ''leon'':38B ''livestock'':54B,71B ''locat'':13B ''manag'':34B ''nightingal'':20B ''of'':15B,19B,51B ''offering'':64B ''owned'':25B ''payment'':65B ''potat'':61B ''produc'':57B ''property'':41B ''rift'':16B,24B ''shod'':3A,7B,30B ''small'':11B ''snow'':2A,6B,29B ''snow-shod'':1A,5B,28B ''south'':14B ''the'':23B,31B,40B,55B,70B ''thes'':68B ''vulwulf'':27B ''west'':18B ''wheat'':58B ''windmill'':47B ''with'':49B,62B', 'rift', 'Snow-Shod Farm is a small farm located south of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('snow-shod_manor', 'Snow-Shod Manor is a large and prominent residence in the northeastern part of Riften, home to the influential Snow-Shod clan. Situated between Aerin''s House and Riftweald Manor, the manor reflects the status and wealth of the family within Riften''s social hierarchy.', '''aerin'':31B ''and'':12B,34B,42B ''betw'':30B ''clan'':28B ''family'':46B ''hierarchy'':51B ''hom'':21B ''hous'':33B ''in'':15B ''influential'':24B ''is'':9B ''larg'':11B ''manor'':4A,8B,36B,38B ''northeastern'':17B ''of'':19B,44B ''part'':18B ''prominent'':13B ''reflects'':39B ''residenc'':14B ''rift'':20B,48B ''riftweald'':35B ''s'':32B,49B ''shod'':3A,7B,27B ''situat'':29B ''snow'':2A,6B,26B ''snow-shod'':1A,5B,25B ''social'':50B ''status'':41B ''the'':16B,23B,37B,40B,45B ''to'':22B ''wealth'':43B ''within'':47B', 'rift', 'Snow-Shod Manor is a large and prominent residence in the northeastern part of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fort_frostmoth', 'Fort Frostmoth is a small Imperial fort located south of Highpoint Tower and northeast of Hrodulf''s House on Solstheim. Once a bastion of Imperial presence on the island, the fort has since been overrun by ash spawn, hostile creatures tied to Solstheim''s volatile volcanic environment.', '''and'':15B ''ash'':39B ''bastion'':25B ''been'':36B ''by'':38B ''creatur'':42B ''environment'':49B ''fort'':1A,3B,9B,33B ''frostmoth'':2A,4B ''highpoint'':13B ''hostil'':41B ''hous'':20B ''hrodulf'':18B ''imperial'':8B,27B ''is'':5B ''island'':31B ''locat'':10B ''northeast'':16B ''of'':12B,17B,26B ''on'':21B,29B ''once'':23B ''overrun'':37B ''presenc'':28B ''s'':19B,46B ''sinc'':35B ''small'':7B ''solstheim'':22B,45B ''south'':11B ''spawn'':40B ''the'':30B,32B ''tied'':43B ''to'':44B ''tow'':14B ''volatil'':47B ''volcanic'':48B', 'solstheim, legion', 'You do not know anything about this area.', '', '', 'solstheim');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('stendarr''s_beacon', 'Stendarr''s Beacon is a small tower southeast of Riften and south of Black-Briar Lodge in the Rift. The path to the beacon branches off the main road southeast of Riften, opposite the path leading to Black-Briar Lodge. It passes by the route to Broken Helm Hollow and winds south, then east, before climbing north to the beacon.

Outside the tower, the resident Vigilants of Stendarr have set up a makeshift camp.', '''and'':14B,55B ''beacon'':3A,6B,28B,65B ''befor'':60B ''black'':18B,43B ''black-bri'':17B,42B ''branch'':29B ''bri'':19B,44B ''brok'':52B ''by'':48B ''camp'':79B ''climbing'':61B ''east'':59B ''hav'':74B ''helm'':53B ''hollow'':54B ''in'':21B ''is'':7B ''it'':46B ''leading'':40B ''lodg'':20B,45B ''main'':32B ''makeshift'':78B ''north'':62B ''of'':12B,16B,35B,72B ''off'':30B ''opposit'':37B ''outsid'':66B ''pass'':47B ''path'':25B,39B ''resident'':70B ''rift'':13B,23B,36B ''road'':33B ''rout'':50B ''s'':2A,5B ''set'':75B ''small'':9B ''south'':15B,57B ''southeast'':11B,34B ''stendarr'':1A,4B,73B ''the'':22B,24B,27B,31B,38B,49B,64B,67B,69B ''then'':58B ''to'':26B,41B,51B,63B ''tow'':10B,68B ''up'':76B ''vigilants'':71B ''winds'':56B', 'rift, dawnguard, vampire, volkihar', 'Stendarr''s Beacon is a small tower southeast of Riften and south of Black-Briar Lodge in the Rift.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('windhelm', 'Windhelm is a major city in northeastern Skyrim, located near the Dunmeth Pass to Morrowind and serving as the capital of Eastmarch. Situated near the northern coast, the city experiences extreme cold and frequent blizzards. Windhelm is ruled by Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak, the leader of the Stormcloak Rebellion, who resides in the Palace of the Kings. Known for its open defiance of the Imperial ban on Talos worship, Windhelm features a prominent Temple of Talos. However, the city is also infamous for its anti-foreigner sentiment, particularly toward its sizable population of Dark Elves, who live in the cramped Gray Quarter, and Argonians, who are confined to the docks outside the city walls.

The city''s layout reflects its rich history. The Stone Quarter houses the marketplace, where traders like Aval Atheron and Niranye run stalls selling goods. Valunstrad, or "Avenue of Valor," contains the oldest parts of Windhelm, including the palace and notable residences like Hjerim. Candlehearth Hall serves as a hub for travelers, providing food, drink, and lodging. Windhelm''s proximity to Morrowind has made it a refuge for Dunmer displaced by the eruption of Red Mountain, though they face suspicion and neglect from the local Nords. Despite this, figures like Brunwulf Free-Winter advocate for the rights of the Dunmer and Argonians, challenging the city''s entrenched prejudices.', '''advocat'':210B ''also'':81B ''and'':17B,34B,104B,135B,155B,171B,196B,217B ''anti'':86B ''anti-foreign'':85B ''are'':107B ''argonians'':105B,218B ''as'':19B,163B ''atheron'':134B ''aval'':133B ''avenu'':143B ''ban'':66B ''blizzards'':36B ''brunwulf'':206B ''by'':40B,186B ''candlehearth'':160B ''capital'':21B ''challenging'':219B ''city'':6B,30B,79B,114B,117B,221B ''coast'':28B ''cold'':33B ''confin'':108B ''contains'':146B ''cramp'':101B ''dark'':95B ''defianc'':62B ''despit'':202B ''displac'':185B ''docks'':111B ''drink'':170B ''dunm'':184B,216B ''dunmeth'':13B ''eastmarch'':23B ''elves'':96B ''entrench'':223B ''eruption'':188B ''experienc'':31B ''extrem'':32B ''fac'':194B ''featur'':71B ''figur'':204B ''food'':169B ''for'':59B,83B,166B,183B,211B ''foreign'':87B ''fre'':208B ''free-wint'':207B ''frequent'':35B ''from'':198B ''goods'':140B ''gray'':102B ''hall'':161B ''history'':123B ''hjerim'':159B ''hous'':127B ''howev'':77B ''hub'':165B ''imperial'':65B ''in'':7B,52B,99B ''including'':152B ''infamous'':82B ''is'':3B,38B,80B ''it'':180B ''its'':60B,84B,91B,121B ''jarl'':41B ''kings'':57B ''known'':58B ''layout'':119B ''lead'':45B ''lik'':132B,158B,205B ''liv'':98B ''local'':200B ''locat'':10B ''lodging'':172B ''mad'':179B ''major'':5B ''marketplac'':129B ''morrowind'':16B,177B ''mo