Windhelm is a major city in northeastern Skyrim, serving as the capital of Eastmarch and located near the Dunmeth Pass to Morrowind. The city experiences extreme cold and frequent blizzards, and is ruled by Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak, leader of the Stormcloak Rebellion. Known for defying the Imperial ban on Talos worship, Windhelm houses a prominent Temple of Talos. However, the city has a history of anti-foreigner sentiment, with Dark Elves living in the cramped Gray Quarter and Argonians confined to the docks outside the city. You do not know who runs the shops or who lives in the area.', '', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('temple_of_mara', 'The Temple of Mara is a sacred temple in Riften dedicated to Mara, the Aedric goddess of love, compassion, and understanding. It serves as a spiritual center for worshippers of Mara and those seeking her blessings, including marriage rites.

The temple is home to three Priests of Mara: Briehl, Dinya Balu, and Maramal. Alessandra, a Priestess of Arkay who tends to Riften''s Hall of the Dead, also resides here. As a beacon of Mara''s teachings, the temple is a place of solace and guidance for Riften''s residents and travelers alike.', '''aedric'':18B ''alessandr'':57B ''alik'':96B ''also'':71B ''and'':23B,35B,55B,88B,94B ''arkay'':61B ''as'':27B,74B ''balu'':54B ''beacon'':76B ''blessings'':39B ''briehl'':52B ''cent'':30B ''compassion'':22B ''dead'':70B ''dedicat'':14B ''diny'':53B ''for'':31B,90B ''goddess'':19B ''guidanc'':89B ''hall'':67B ''her'':38B,73B ''hom'':46B ''in'':12B ''including'':40B ''is'':8B,45B,83B ''it'':25B ''lov'':21B ''mar'':3A,7B,16B,34B,51B,78B ''maramal'':56B ''marriag'':41B ''of'':2A,6B,20B,33B,50B,60B,68B,77B,86B ''plac'':85B ''priestess'':59B ''priests'':49B ''resid'':72B ''residents'':93B ''rift'':13B,65B,91B ''rit'':42B ''s'':66B,79B,92B ''sacr'':10B ''seeking'':37B ''serv'':26B ''solac'':87B ''spiritual'':29B ''teachings'':80B ''templ'':1A,5B,11B,44B,82B ''tends'':63B ''the'':4B,17B,43B,69B,81B ''thos'':36B ''thre'':48B ''to'':15B,47B,64B ''travelers'':95B ''understanding'':24B ''who'':62B ''worshippers'':32B', 'rift, priest', 'The Temple of Mara is a sacred temple in Riften dedicated to Mara, the Aedric goddess of love, compassion, and understanding.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_bee_and_barb', 'The Bee and Barb is a lively inn located in the heart of Riften, next to the bustling marketplace. Owned and operated by Keerava, with her husband Talen-Jei, an Argonian bartender, the inn is a popular gathering spot for both locals and travelers.

Marcurio, a mercenary for hire, can often be found sitting in the southwest corner of the inn, relaxing on a wooden bench. ', '''an'':35B ''and'':3A,7B,25B,48B ''argoni'':36B ''barb'':4A,8B ''bartend'':37B ''be'':57B ''bee'':2A,6B ''bench'':71B ''both'':46B ''bustling'':22B ''by'':27B ''can'':55B ''corn'':63B ''for'':45B,53B ''found'':58B ''gathering'':43B ''heart'':16B ''her'':30B ''hir'':54B ''husband'':31B ''in'':14B,60B ''inn'':12B,39B,66B ''is'':9B,40B ''jei'':34B ''keerav'':28B ''lively'':11B ''locals'':47B ''locat'':13B ''marcuri'':50B ''marketplac'':23B ''mercenary'':52B ''next'':19B ''of'':17B,64B ''often'':56B ''on'':68B ''operat'':26B ''owned'':24B ''popul'':42B ''relaxing'':67B ''rift'':18B ''sitting'':59B ''southwest'':62B ''spot'':44B ''tal'':33B ''talen-jei'':32B ''the'':1A,5B,15B,21B,38B,61B,65B ''to'':20B ''travelers'':49B ''with'':29B ''wood'':70B', 'rift, traveler, innkeeper', 'The Bee and Barb is a lively inn located in the heart of Riften. You do not know who owns the inn.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_pawned_prawn', 'The Pawned Prawn is a general goods store located in the heart of Riften, next door to Black-Briar Meadery and to the west of The Bee and Barb. Owned and operated by Bersi Honey-Hand, the store offers a variety of items for sale, ranging from goods and supplies to more unusual wares.', '''and'':25B,32B,35B,54B ''barb'':33B ''bee'':31B ''bersi'':38B ''black'':22B ''black-bri'':21B ''bri'':23B ''by'':37B ''door'':19B ''for'':49B ''from'':52B ''general'':9B ''goods'':10B,53B ''hand'':41B ''heart'':15B ''honey'':40B ''honey-hand'':39B ''in'':13B ''is'':7B ''items'':48B ''locat'':12B ''meadery'':24B ''mor'':57B ''next'':18B ''of'':16B,29B,47B ''offers'':44B ''operat'':36B ''owned'':34B ''pawn'':2A,5B ''prawn'':3A,6B ''ranging'':51B ''rift'':17B ''sal'':50B ''stor'':11B,43B ''suppli'':55B ''the'':1A,4B,14B,27B,30B,42B ''to'':20B,26B,56B ''unusual'':58B ''variety'':46B ''war'':59B ''west'':28B', 'rift', 'The Pawned Prawn is a general goods store located in the heart of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_ragged_flagon', 'The Ragged Flagon is a tavern located within the Thieves Guild''s headquarters in Riften, situated in the city''s old sewer network. It can be accessed through the Ratway, though after joining the Thieves Guild, quicker access is available through a secret entrance behind the Hall of the Dead, leading directly into the Ragged Flagon - Cistern.

The tavern is run by Vekel the Man, though Dirge, the bouncer, takes over bartender duties if anything happens to Vekel. Tonilia, the Thieves Guild''s first fence, is always present at the bar.', '''access'':30B,41B ''after'':35B ''always'':90B ''anything'':78B ''at'':92B ''avail'':43B ''bar'':94B ''bartend'':75B ''be'':29B ''behind'':48B ''bounc'':72B ''by'':65B ''can'':28B ''cistern'':60B ''city'':22B ''dead'':53B ''directly'':55B ''dirg'':70B ''duti'':76B ''entranc'':47B ''fenc'':88B ''first'':87B ''flagon'':3A,6B,59B ''guild'':14B,39B,85B ''hall'':50B ''happens'':79B ''headquarters'':16B ''if'':77B ''in'':17B,20B ''into'':56B ''is'':7B,42B,63B,89B ''it'':27B ''joining'':36B ''leading'':54B ''locat'':10B ''man'':68B ''network'':26B ''of'':51B ''old'':24B ''over'':74B ''present'':91B ''quick'':40B ''ragg'':2A,5B,58B ''ratway'':33B ''rift'':18B ''run'':64B ''s'':15B,23B,86B ''secret'':46B ''sew'':25B ''situat'':19B ''tak'':73B ''tavern'':9B,62B ''the'':1A,4B,12B,21B,32B,37B,49B,52B,57B,61B,67B,71B,83B,93B ''thiev'':13B,38B,84B ''though'':34B,69B ''through'':31B,44B ''to'':80B ''tonili'':82B ''vekel'':66B,81B ''within'':11B', 'thievesguild', 'The Ragged Flagon is a tavern located within the Thieves Guild''s headquarters in Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'rift', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_rift', 'The Rift is a hold in southeast Skyrim, with its capital in Riften,  aligned with the Stormcloaks. Nestled on a vast plateau bordered by the Jerall and Velothi Mountains, the Rift connects Skyrim to Morrowind and Cyrodiil and is renowned for its vibrant autumnal forests, aspen trees, and rich alchemical resources like mountain flowers, scaly pholiota, and canis root.', '''alchemical'':52B ''align'':16B ''and'':29B,38B,40B,50B,59B ''aspen'':48B ''autumnal'':46B ''border'':25B ''by'':26B ''canis'':60B ''capital'':13B ''connects'':34B ''cyrodiil'':39B ''flowers'':56B ''for'':43B ''forests'':47B ''hold'':7B ''in'':8B,14B ''is'':5B,41B ''its'':12B,44B ''jerall'':28B ''lik'':54B ''morrowind'':37B ''mountain'':55B ''mountains'':31B ''nestl'':20B ''on'':21B ''pholiot'':58B ''plateau'':24B ''renown'':42B ''resourc'':53B ''rich'':51B ''rift'':2A,4B,15B,33B ''root'':61B ''scaly'':57B ''skyrim'':10B,35B ''southeast'':9B ''stormcloaks'':19B ''the'':1A,3B,18B,27B,32B ''to'':36B ''tre'':49B ''vast'':23B ''velothi'':30B ''vibrant'':45B ''with'':11B,17B', 'rift, noble, scholar', 'The Rift is a hold in southeast Skyrim, with its capital in Riften,  aligned with the Stormcloaks. Nestled on a vast plateau bordered by the Jerall and Velothi Mountains, the Rift connects Skyrim to Morrowind and Cyrodiil and is renowned for its vibrant autumnal forests, aspen trees, and rich alchemical resources like mountain flowers, scaly pholiota, and canis root.', '', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_scorched_hammer', 'The Scorched Hammer, located to the west of the main marketplace, sits between the canal below and the exit to the docks, is the blacksmith shop in Riften, run by Balimund, a skilled smith, and his adopted son Asbjorn Fire-Tamer, whom he is training in the craft. If anything happens to Balimund, Asbjorn will take over running the shop.', '''adopt'':40B ''and'':20B,38B ''anything'':54B ''asbjorn'':42B,58B ''balimund'':34B,57B ''below'':19B ''betw'':16B ''blacksmith'':28B ''by'':33B ''canal'':18B ''craft'':52B ''docks'':25B ''exit'':22B ''fir'':44B ''fire-tam'':43B ''hamm'':3A,6B ''happens'':55B ''his'':39B ''if'':53B ''in'':30B,50B ''is'':26B,48B ''locat'':7B ''main'':13B ''marketplac'':14B ''of'':11B ''over'':61B ''rift'':31B ''run'':32B ''running'':62B ''scorch'':2A,5B ''shop'':29B,64B ''sits'':15B ''skill'':36B ''smith'':37B ''tak'':60B ''tam'':45B ''the'':1A,4B,9B,12B,17B,21B,24B,27B,51B,63B ''to'':8B,23B,56B ''training'':49B ''west'':10B ''whom'':46B ''will'':59B', 'rift', 'The Scorched Hammer, is the blacksmith shop in Riften. You do not know who owns the shop.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_shadow_stone', 'The Shadow Stone is one of Skyrim''s thirteen Standing Stones, located south of Riften, east of Snow-Shod Farm, and near Nightingale Hall in the Rift. Activating the stone grants the unique ability to become invisible instantly once per day, providing a quick escape or stealth advantage in critical situations.', '''ability'':38B ''activating'':32B ''advantag'':52B ''and'':25B ''becom'':40B ''critical'':54B ''day'':45B ''east'':19B ''escap'':49B ''farm'':24B ''grants'':35B ''hall'':28B ''in'':29B,53B ''instantly'':42B ''invis'':41B ''is'':7B ''locat'':15B ''near'':26B ''nightingal'':27B ''of'':9B,17B,20B ''once'':43B ''one'':8B ''or'':50B ''per'':44B ''providing'':46B ''quick'':48B ''rift'':18B,31B ''s'':11B ''shadow'':2A,5B ''shod'':23B ''situations'':55B ''skyrim'':10B ''snow'':22B ''snow-shod'':21B ''south'':16B ''standing'':13B ''stealth'':51B ''ston'':3A,6B,14B,34B ''the'':1A,4B,30B,33B,36B ''thirt'':12B ''to'':39B ''uniqu'':37B', 'rift, scholar, traveler', 'The Shadow Stone is one of Skyrim''s thirteen Standing Stones, located south of Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('tolvald''s_cave', 'Tolvald''s Cave is a large cavern complex located in the Velothi Mountains, northeast of Shor''s Stone and south-southeast of Ansilvund in the Rift. Rumours of Falmer have been seen coming out the cave late at night.', '''and'':22B ''ansilvund'':27B ''at'':42B ''been'':35B ''cav'':3A,6B,40B ''cavern'':10B ''coming'':37B ''complex'':11B ''falm'':33B ''hav'':34B ''in'':13B,28B ''is'':7B ''larg'':9B ''lat'':41B ''locat'':12B ''mountains'':16B ''night'':43B ''northeast'':17B ''of'':18B,26B,32B ''out'':38B ''rift'':30B ''rumours'':31B ''s'':2A,5B,20B ''seen'':36B ''shor'':19B ''south'':24B ''south-southeast'':23B ''southeast'':25B ''ston'':21B ''the'':14B,29B,39B ''tolvald'':1A,4B ''velothi'':15B', 'rift', 'Tolvald''s Cave is a large cavern complex located in the Velothi Mountains, northeast of Shor''s Stone.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('treva''s_watch', 'Treva''s Watch is a medium-sized fort southeast of Ivarstead and north of Angarvunde, located along the north shore of the Treva River.  Bandits defend the fort heavily, with archers firing from the walls. It is rumoured that fort belonged to someone called Stalleo, and now he wants it back.', '''along'':21B ''and'':16B,50B ''angarvund'':19B ''archers'':35B ''back'':55B ''bandits'':29B ''belong'':45B ''call'':48B ''defend'':30B ''firing'':36B ''fort'':12B,32B,44B ''from'':37B ''heavily'':33B ''is'':7B,41B ''it'':40B,54B ''ivarst'':15B ''locat'':20B ''medium'':10B ''medium-siz'':9B ''north'':17B,23B ''now'':51B ''of'':14B,18B,25B ''riv'':28B ''rumour'':42B ''s'':2A,5B ''shor'':24B ''siz'':11B ''someon'':47B ''southeast'':13B ''stalle'':49B ''that'':43B ''the'':22B,26B,31B,38B ''to'':46B ''trev'':1A,4B,27B ''walls'':39B ''wants'':53B ''watch'':3A,6B ''with'':34B', 'rift, legion, stormcloak', 'Treva''s Watch is a medium-sized fort southeast of Ivarstead.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('valindor''s_house', 'Valindor''s House is a residence located on the lower levels of Riften, situated alongside the canal that runs through the city. It is next door to Marise Aravel''s House and lies directly below the Temple of Mara. The house belongs to Valindor, who is a WoodElf who works at the local fishery.', '''alongsid'':18B ''and'':35B ''aravel'':32B ''at'':54B ''belongs'':45B ''below'':38B ''canal'':20B ''city'':25B ''directly'':37B ''door'':29B ''fishery'':57B ''hous'':3A,6B,34B,44B ''is'':7B,27B,49B ''it'':26B ''levels'':14B ''lies'':36B ''local'':56B ''locat'':10B ''low'':13B ''mar'':42B ''maris'':31B ''next'':28B ''of'':15B,41B ''on'':11B ''residenc'':9B ''rift'':16B ''runs'':22B ''s'':2A,5B,33B ''situat'':17B ''templ'':40B ''that'':21B ''the'':12B,19B,24B,39B,43B,55B ''through'':23B ''to'':30B,46B ''valindor'':1A,4B,47B ''who'':48B,52B ''woodelf'':51B ''works'':53B', 'rift', 'Valindor''s House is a residence located in Riften.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, falkreath', '', 'rift');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('eastmarch', 'Eastmarch is a hold in eastern Skyrim, with its capital in Windhelm, located in the northeastern corner of the province. It is bordered by Winterhold to the northwest, the Pale and Whiterun Hold to the west, the Throat of the World to the southwest, and the Rift to the south. The eastern border connects to Morrowind via the Velothi Mountain passes, making Eastmarch an important gateway for trade and migration. Since the Red Year, the hold has seen an increased presence of Dunmer, especially in Windhelm.

The hold is home to Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak, leader of the Stormcloak rebellion. Eastmarch''s diverse landscape includes sulfur pools and rocky crags in the central and southern regions, bordered by the Velothi Mountains, while the northern parts feature snowy tundra and icy terrain. The Darkwater and White Rivers carve through the hold, converging at Windhelm before flowing into the Sea of Ghosts.

Flora and fauna in Eastmarch reflect its varied geography. The sulfur pools are home to creatures like giants, sabre cats, and Jazbay grapes, while the snowy regions feature frost trolls, snowy sabre cats, and snowberry bushes. Pine forests and shrublands surrounding the pools host thistle, mountain flowers, and mora tapinella. Key roads form a north-south loop skirting the sulfur pools, with branches leading to the Rift, Whiterun, and beyond. Eastmarch''s harsh beauty, rich resources, and strategic position make it a vital and contested region in Skyrim.', '''an'':65B,80B ''and'':32B,46B,70B,108B,114B,129B,134B,152B,171B,184B,189B,198B,220B,228B,235B ''are'':163B ''at'':142B ''beauty'':225B ''befor'':144B ''beyond'':221B ''bord'':54B ''border'':24B,117B ''branch'':214B ''bush'':186B ''by'':25B,118B ''capital'':11B ''carv'':137B ''cats'':170B,183B ''central'':113B ''connects'':55B ''contest'':236B ''converging'':141B ''corn'':18B ''crags'':110B ''creatur'':166B ''darkwat'':133B ''div'':103B ''dunm'':84B ''eastern'':7B,53B ''eastmarch'':1A,2B,64B,101B,155B,222B ''especially'':85B ''faun'':153B ''featur'':126B,178B ''flor'':151B ''flowers'':197B ''flowing'':145B ''for'':68B ''forests'':188B ''form'':203B ''frost'':179B ''gateway'':67B ''geography'':159B ''ghosts'':150B ''giants'':168B ''grap'':173B ''harsh'':224B ''hold'':5B,34B,77B,89B,140B ''hom'':91B,164B ''host'':194B ''icy'':130B ''important'':66B ''in'':6B,12B,15B,86B,111B,154B,238B ''includ'':105B ''increas'':81B ''into'':146B ''is'':3B,23B,90B ''it'':22B,232B ''its'':10B,157B ''jarl'':93B ''jazbay'':172B ''key'':201B ''landscap'':104B ''lead'':96B ''leading'':215B ''lik'':167B ''locat'':14B ''loop'':208B ''mak'':231B ''making'':63B ''migration'':71B ''mor'':199B ''morrowind'':57B ''mountain'':61B,196B ''mountains'':121B ''north'':206B ''north-south'':205B ''northeastern'':17B ''northern'':124B ''northwest'':29B ''of'':19B,40B,83B,97B,149B ''pal'':31B ''parts'':125B ''pass'':62B ''pin'':187B ''pools'':107B,162B,193B,212B ''position'':230B ''presenc'':82B ''provinc'':21B ''rebellion'':100B ''red'':74B ''reflect'':156B ''region'':237B ''regions'':116B,177B ''resourc'':227B ''rich'':226B ''rift'':48B,218B ''rivers'':136B ''roads'':202B ''rocky'':109B ''s'':102B,223B ''sabr'':169B,182B ''seen'':79B ''shrublands'':190B ''sinc'':72B ''skirting'':209B ''skyrim'':8B,239B ''snowberry'':185B ''snowy'':127B,176B,181B ''south'':51B,207B ''southern'':115B ''southwest'':45B ''stormcloak'':95B,99B ''strategic'':229B ''sulfur'':106B,161B,211B ''surrounding'':191B ''tapinell'':200B ''terrain'':131B ''the'':16B,20B,28B,30B,36B,38B,41B,44B,47B,50B,52B,59B,73B,76B,88B,98B,112B,119B,123B,132B,139B,147B,160B,175B,192B,210B,217B ''thistl'':195B ''throat'':39B ''through'':138B ''to'':27B,35B,43B,49B,56B,92B,165B,216B ''trad'':69B ''trolls'':180B ''tundr'':128B ''ulfric'':94B ''vari'':158B ''velothi'':60B,120B ''via'':58B ''vital'':234B ''west'':37B ''whil'':122B,174B ''whit'':135B ''whiterun'':33B,219B ''windhelm'':13B,87B,143B ''winterhold'':26B ''with'':9B,213B ''world'':42B ''year'':75B', 'eastmarch, noble, scholar', 'Eastmarch is a hold in northeastern Skyrim, with Windhelm as its capital. It borders Winterhold to the northwest, the Pale and Whiterun Hold to the west, the Throat of the World to the southwest, and the Rift to the south. Its eastern border connects to Morrowind, making it a key area for trade and migration, especially after the Red Year when the presence of Dunmer increased, particularly in Windhelm.

The landscape of Eastmarch is diverse, featuring sulfur pools, rocky crags, and snowy tundra. The region is home to Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak and is traversed by the Darkwater and White Rivers, which converge at Windhelm before flowing into the Sea of Ghosts. Eastmarch''s wildlife includes giants, sabre cats, frost trolls, and snowberry bushes. The roads connect key areas, including the Rift and Whiterun, highlighting Eastmarch’s strategic importance in Skyrim.', '', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('skuldafn', 'Skuldafn is a vast Nordic ruin located in Eastmarch, notable for containing a portal to Sovngarde. Guarded by powerful draugr, dragons, and the formidable dragon priest Nahkriin, it is a site of immense historical and mythical significance. ', '''and'':23B,36B ''by'':19B ''containing'':13B ''dragon'':26B ''dragons'':22B ''draugr'':21B ''eastmarch'':10B ''for'':12B ''formid'':25B ''guard'':18B ''historical'':35B ''immens'':34B ''in'':9B ''is'':3B,30B ''it'':29B ''locat'':8B ''mythical'':37B ''nahkriin'':28B ''nordic'':6B ''notabl'':11B ''of'':33B ''portal'':15B ''powerful'':20B ''priest'':27B ''ruin'':7B ''significanc'':38B ''sit'':32B ''skuldafn'':1A,2B ''sovngard'':17B ''the'':24B ''to'':16B ''vast'':5B', 'eastmarch', 'Skuldafn is a vast Nordic ruin located in Eastmarch, notable for containing a portal to Sovngarde. It is umreachable by normal means.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('palace_of_the_kings', 'The Palace of the Kings is a grand castle located at the far end of the Valunstrad district in Windhelm, serving as the residence of Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak and the headquarters of the Stormcloak movement. The palace is a symbol of the city''s ancient history, as Windhelm was one of the first human settlements in Tamriel and the capital of Ysgramor''s first empire. It remains one of the last surviving structures from that era.', '''ancient'':49B ''and'':33B,62B ''as'':26B,51B ''at'':15B ''capital'':64B ''castl'':13B ''city'':47B ''district'':22B ''empir'':69B ''end'':18B ''far'':17B ''first'':57B,68B ''from'':78B ''grand'':12B ''headquarters'':35B ''history'':50B ''hum'':58B ''in'':23B,60B ''is'':10B,42B ''it'':70B ''jarl'':30B ''kings'':4A,9B ''last'':75B ''locat'':14B ''movement'':39B ''of'':2A,7B,19B,29B,36B,45B,55B,65B,73B ''one'':54B,72B ''palac'':1A,6B,41B ''remains'':71B ''residenc'':28B ''s'':48B,67B ''serving'':25B ''settlements'':59B ''stormcloak'':32B,38B ''structur'':77B ''surviving'':76B ''symbol'':44B ''tamriel'':61B ''that'':79B ''the'':3A,5B,8B,16B,20B,27B,34B,37B,40B,46B,56B,63B,74B ''ulfric'':31B ''valunstr'':21B ''was'':53B ''windhelm'':24B,52B ''ysgramor'':66B', 'eastmarch, noble', 'The Palace of the Kings is a grand castle located at the far end of the Valunstrad district in Windhelm. It serves as the residence of Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak and the headquarters of the Stormcloak movement. As a symbol of Windhelm''s ancient history, the palace stands as one of the last surviving structures from Ysgramor''s first empire, making it a significant reminder of the city''s early role in Tamriel''s history.', '', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('windhelm_stables', 'Windhelm Stables is located just outside the city of Windhelm in Eastmarch. Accessible by two flights of stairs—one from the stony path leading to the city and another from the nearby carriage stop—the stables feature a small, stony yard in front of the stable house.', '''access'':15B ''and'':30B ''anoth'':31B ''by'':16B ''carriag'':35B ''city'':10B,29B ''eastmarch'':14B ''featur'':39B ''flights'':18B ''from'':22B,32B ''front'':45B ''hous'':49B ''in'':13B,44B ''is'':5B ''just'':7B ''leading'':26B ''locat'':6B ''nearby'':34B ''of'':11B,19B,46B ''one'':21B ''outsid'':8B ''path'':25B ''small'':41B ''stabl'':2A,4B,38B,48B ''stairs'':20B ''stony'':24B,42B ''stop'':36B ''the'':9B,23B,28B,33B,37B,47B ''to'':27B ''two'':17B ''windhelm'':1A,3B,12B ''yard'':43B', 'eastmarch', 'Windhelm Stables is located just outside the city of Windhelm in Eastmarch.  You do not know who runs the stables.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('kynesgrove', 'Kynesgrove is a small settlement located south of Windhelm and west of Narzulbur in Eastmarch. Originally intended as a lumber mill by Ganna and Gemma Uriel, the settlement shifted to mining malachite after the grove''s trees were found to be sacred to Kyne. The Uriels now work in Steamscorch Mine, often arguing about their lost life in Cyrodiil. Kjeld manages the settlement and buys malachite ore, while Dravynea the Stoneweaver ensures the mine''s safety using potions crafted from frost salts. The Braidwood Inn, run by Iddra, serves as the central gathering spot for residents and travelers.

The settlement consists of the Braidwood Inn, Steamscorch Mine, and a miner''s camp. There is also a dragon mound to the east of it.', '''about'':55B ''after'':34B ''also'':116B ''and'':11B,25B,65B,98B,109B ''arguing'':54B ''as'':19B,91B ''be'':42B ''braidwood'':85B,105B ''buys'':66B ''by'':23B,88B ''camp'':113B ''central'':93B ''consists'':102B ''craft'':80B ''cyrodiil'':60B ''dragon'':118B ''dravyne'':70B ''east'':122B ''eastmarch'':16B ''ensur'':73B ''for'':96B ''found'':40B ''from'':81B ''frost'':82B ''gann'':24B ''gathering'':94B ''gemm'':26B ''grov'':36B ''iddra'':89B ''in'':15B,50B,59B ''inn'':86B,106B ''intend'':18B ''is'':3B,115B ''it'':124B ''kjeld'':61B ''kyne'':45B ''kynesgrov'':1A,2B ''lif'':58B ''locat'':7B ''lost'':57B ''lumb'':21B ''malachit'':33B,67B ''manag'':62B ''mill'':22B ''min'':52B,75B,108B,111B ''mining'':32B ''mound'':119B ''narzulbur'':14B ''now'':48B ''of'':9B,13B,103B,123B ''often'':53B ''ore'':68B ''originally'':17B ''potions'':79B ''residents'':97B ''run'':87B ''s'':37B,76B,112B ''sacr'':43B ''safety'':77B ''salts'':83B ''serv'':90B ''settlement'':6B,29B,64B,101B ''shift'':30B ''small'':5B ''south'':8B ''spot'':95B ''steamscorch'':51B,107B ''stoneweav'':72B ''the'':28B,35B,46B,56B,63B,71B,74B,84B,92B,100B,104B,121B ''ther'':114B ''to'':31B,41B,44B,120B ''travelers'':99B ''tre'':38B ''uriel'':27B ''uriels'':47B ''using'':78B ''wer'':39B ''west'':12B ''whil'':69B ''windhelm'':10B ''work'':49B', 'eastmarch', 'Kynesgrove is a small settlement located south of Windhelm and west of Narzulbur in Eastmarch. Originally intended as a lumber mill by Ganna and Gemma Uriel, the settlement shifted to mining malachite after the grove''s trees were found to be sacred to Kyne. You do not know anything else about this area.', '', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brandy-mug_farm', 'Brandy-Mug Farm is a modest wheat farm located a short distance east of Windhelm Stables in Eastmarch. The farmhouse is a simple single-room dwelling and serves as the home of Bolfrida Brandy-Mug. The farm consists of two zones: the exterior, where wheat is cultivated, and the cozy interior of the farmhouse.', '''and'':33B,55B ''as'':35B ''bolfr'':39B ''brandy'':2A,6B,41B ''brandy-mug'':1A,5B,40B ''consists'':45B ''cozy'':57B ''cultivat'':54B ''distanc'':17B ''dwelling'':32B ''east'':18B ''eastmarch'':23B ''exterior'':50B ''farm'':4A,8B,13B,44B ''farmhous'':25B,61B ''hom'':37B ''in'':22B ''interior'':58B ''is'':9B,26B,53B ''locat'':14B ''modest'':11B ''mug'':3A,7B,42B ''of'':19B,38B,46B,59B ''room'':31B ''serv'':34B ''short'':16B ''simpl'':28B ''singl'':30B ''single-room'':29B ''stabl'':21B ''the'':24B,36B,43B,49B,56B,60B ''two'':47B ''wheat'':12B,52B ''wher'':51B ''windhelm'':20B ''zon'':48B', 'eastmarch', 'Brandy-Mug Farm is a modest wheat farm located a short distance east of Windhelm Stables in Eastmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hlaalu_farm', 'Hlaalu Farm is a small agricultural property located east of Windhelm, northeast of Windhelm Stables, and west of Hollyfrost Farm in Eastmarch. Owned by Belyn Hlaalu, a Dunmer who resides in Windhelm, the farm is managed and worked by Adisla, a Nord woman who lives in the single-room farmhouse on the property.', '''adisl'':42B ''agricultural'':8B ''and'':18B,39B ''belyn'':27B ''by'':26B,41B ''dunm'':30B ''east'':11B ''eastmarch'':24B ''farm'':2A,4B,22B,36B ''farmhous'':53B ''hlaalu'':1A,3B,28B ''hollyfrost'':21B ''in'':23B,33B,48B ''is'':5B,37B ''liv'':47B ''locat'':10B ''manag'':38B ''nord'':44B ''northeast'':14B ''of'':12B,15B,20B ''on'':54B ''owned'':25B ''property'':9B,56B ''resid'':32B ''room'':52B ''singl'':51B ''single-room'':50B ''small'':7B ''stabl'':17B ''the'':35B,49B,55B ''west'':19B ''who'':31B,46B ''windhelm'':13B,16B,34B ''wom'':45B ''work'':40B', 'eastmarch', 'Hlaalu Farm is a small agricultural property located east of Windhelm. You do not know who runs the farm.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hollyfrost_farm', 'Hollyfrost Farm is a large agricultural property located east of Windhelm, east of Hlaalu Farm, and northeast of Windhelm Stables in Eastmarch. The farm is owned by Torsten Cruel-Sea but is primarily worked by Tulvur, who resides on the property along with his two loyal dogs, Tiber and Ysgramor.', '''agricultural'':8B ''along'':45B ''and'':18B,52B ''but'':34B ''by'':29B,38B ''cruel'':32B ''cruel-se'':31B ''dogs'':50B ''east'':11B,14B ''eastmarch'':24B ''farm'':2A,4B,17B,26B ''his'':47B ''hlaalu'':16B ''hollyfrost'':1A,3B ''in'':23B ''is'':5B,27B,35B ''larg'':7B ''locat'':10B ''loyal'':49B ''northeast'':19B ''of'':12B,15B,20B ''on'':42B ''owned'':28B ''primarily'':36B ''property'':9B,44B ''resid'':41B ''stabl'':22B ''the'':25B,43B ''tib'':51B ''torst'':30B ''tulvur'':39B ''two'':48B ''who'':40B ''windhelm'':13B,21B ''with'':46B ''work'':37B ''ysgramor'':53B', 'eastmarch', 'Hollyfrost Farm is a large agricultural property located east of Windhelm. You do not know who runs the farm.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mixwater_mill', 'Mixwater Mill is a modest lumber mill located along the White River in Eastmarch, southwest of Windhelm and southeast of Gallows Rock. The mill is owned and operated by Gilfre, who has lived and worked there alone since her five employees left to join the ongoing civil war.', '''alon'':39B ''along'':11B ''and'':20B,29B,36B ''by'':31B ''civil'':49B ''eastmarch'':16B ''employ'':43B ''fiv'':42B ''gallows'':23B ''gilfr'':32B ''her'':41B ''in'':15B ''is'':5B,27B ''join'':46B ''left'':44B ''liv'':35B ''locat'':10B ''lumb'':8B ''mill'':2A,4B,9B,26B ''mixwat'':1A,3B ''modest'':7B ''of'':18B,22B ''ongoing'':48B ''operat'':30B ''owned'':28B ''riv'':14B ''rock'':24B ''sinc'':40B ''southeast'':21B ''southwest'':17B ''the'':12B,25B,47B ''ther'':38B ''to'':45B ''war'':50B ''whit'':13B ''who'':33B ''windhelm'':19B ''work'':37B', 'eastmarch', 'Mixwater Mill is a modest lumber mill located along the White River in Eastmarch. You do not know who runs the mill.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('darkwater_crossing', 'Darkwater Crossing is a small mining settlement located south of Windhelm and west of Mistwatch in Eastmarch. Established by Annekke Crag-Jumper and her husband Verner Rock-Chucker, the settlement grew around Goldenrock Mine, which they founded after discovering a vein of corundum ore. The couple built a modest house, planted crops, and raised livestock, creating a home that has since attracted additional miners who camp near the mine''s entrance. However, concerns about the mine''s dwindling ore supply weigh heavily on the residents.', '''about'':78B ''additional'':67B ''after'':42B ''and'':14B,26B,57B ''annekk'':22B ''around'':36B ''attract'':66B ''built'':51B ''by'':21B ''camp'':70B ''chuck'':32B ''concerns'':77B ''corundum'':47B ''coupl'':50B ''crag'':24B ''crag-jump'':23B ''creating'':60B ''crops'':56B ''crossing'':2A,4B ''darkwat'':1A,3B ''discovering'':43B ''dwindling'':82B ''eastmarch'':19B ''entranc'':75B ''establish'':20B ''found'':41B ''goldenrock'':37B ''grew'':35B ''heavily'':86B ''her'':27B ''hom'':62B ''hous'':54B ''howev'':76B ''husband'':28B ''in'':18B ''is'':5B ''jump'':25B ''livestock'':59B ''locat'':10B ''min'':38B,73B,80B ''miners'':68B ''mining'':8B ''mistwatch'':17B ''modest'':53B ''near'':71B ''of'':12B,16B,46B ''on'':87B ''ore'':48B,83B ''plant'':55B ''rais'':58B ''residents'':89B ''rock'':31B ''rock-chuck'':30B ''s'':74B,81B ''settlement'':9B,34B ''sinc'':65B ''small'':7B ''south'':11B ''supply'':84B ''that'':63B ''the'':33B,49B,72B,79B,88B ''they'':40B ''vein'':45B ''vern'':29B ''weigh'':85B ''west'':15B ''which'':39B ''who'':69B ''windhelm'':13B', 'eastmarch', 'Darkwater Crossing is a small mining settlement located south of Windhelm and west of Mistwatch in Eastmarch. You do not know who runs the mine.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('gloombound_mine', 'Gloombound Mine is a small but productive ebony and iron mine located within the Orc stronghold of Narzulbur in Eastmarch. Owned and operated by the Orcs of Narzulbur, the mine also employs workers from the Orc stronghold of Largashbur to support its operations. ', '''also'':33B ''and'':11B,24B ''but'':8B ''by'':26B ''eastmarch'':22B ''ebony'':10B ''employs'':34B ''from'':36B ''gloombound'':1A,3B ''in'':21B ''iron'':12B ''is'':5B ''its'':44B ''largashbur'':41B ''locat'':14B ''min'':2A,4B,13B,32B ''narzulbur'':20B,30B ''of'':19B,29B,40B ''operat'':25B ''operations'':45B ''orc'':17B,38B ''orcs'':28B ''owned'':23B ''productiv'':9B ''small'':7B ''stronghold'':18B,39B ''support'':43B ''the'':16B,27B,31B,37B ''to'':42B ''within'':15B ''workers'':35B', 'eastmarch', 'loombound Mine is a small but productive ebony and iron mine located within the Orc stronghold of Narzulbur in Eastmarch.  You do not know about the orcs who work here.You do not know anything else about this area.
', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('narzulbur', 'Narzulbur is an Orc stronghold located in the northeast of Skyrim, southeast of Windhelm. The stronghold is led by a sentimental chief with no wives and serves as the home of an Orc tribe that operates the nearby Gloombound Mine. The mine is a rich resource, containing sixteen ebony ore veins and six iron ore veins, making Narzulbur a significant contributor to Skyrim''s supply of ebony.', '''an'':4B,33B ''and'':27B,53B ''as'':29B ''by'':20B ''chief'':23B ''containing'':48B ''contributor'':62B ''ebony'':50B,68B ''gloombound'':40B ''hom'':31B ''in'':8B ''iron'':55B ''is'':3B,18B,44B ''led'':19B ''locat'':7B ''making'':58B ''min'':41B,43B ''narzulbur'':1A,2B,59B ''nearby'':39B ''northeast'':10B ''of'':11B,14B,32B,67B ''operat'':37B ''orc'':5B,34B ''ore'':51B,56B ''resourc'':47B ''rich'':46B ''s'':65B ''sentimental'':22B ''serv'':28B ''significant'':61B ''six'':54B ''sixt'':49B ''skyrim'':12B,64B ''southeast'':13B ''stronghold'':6B,17B ''supply'':66B ''that'':36B ''the'':9B,16B,30B,38B,42B ''to'':63B ''trib'':35B ''veins'':52B,57B ''windhelm'':15B ''with'':24B ''wiv'':26B', 'eastmarch, orc', 'Narzulbur is an Orc stronghold located in the northeast of Skyrim, southeast of Windhelm in Eastmarch.  You do not know about the orcs who live here.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('broken_limb_camp', 'Broken Limb Camp is a giant camp located north-northwest of Darkwater Crossing and south of Mixwater Mill in Eastmarch. The camp serves as a home for giants and their mammoths, featuring the typical large bonfires and scattered mammoth bones associated with such locations. ', '''and'':18B,33B,41B ''as'':28B ''associat'':45B ''bon'':44B ''bonfir'':40B ''brok'':1A,4B ''camp'':3A,6B,10B,26B ''crossing'':17B ''darkwat'':16B ''eastmarch'':24B ''featuring'':36B ''for'':31B ''giant'':9B ''giants'':32B ''hom'':30B ''in'':23B ''is'':7B ''larg'':39B ''limb'':2A,5B ''locat'':11B ''locations'':48B ''mammoth'':43B ''mammoths'':35B ''mill'':22B ''mixwat'':21B ''north'':13B ''north-northwest'':12B ''northwest'':14B ''of'':15B,20B ''scatter'':42B ''serv'':27B ''south'':19B ''such'':47B ''the'':25B,34B,37B ''typical'':38B ''with'':46B', 'eastmarch', 'Broken Limb Camp is a giant camp located north-northwest of Darkwater Crossing in Eastmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hunter''s_rest', 'Hunter''s Rest is a small shack located in the hills west of Half-Moon Mill, roughly midway between Falkreath and Rorikstead in Falkreath Hold. The shelter is near Moss Mother Cavern and serves as a home for hunters who poach game in the surrounding wilderness.', '''and'':25B,37B ''as'':39B ''betw'':23B ''cavern'':36B ''falkreath'':24B,28B ''for'':42B ''gam'':46B ''half'':18B ''half-moon'':17B ''hills'':14B ''hold'':29B ''hom'':41B ''hunt'':1A,4B ''hunters'':43B ''in'':12B,27B,47B ''is'':7B,32B ''locat'':11B ''midway'':22B ''mill'':20B ''moon'':19B ''moss'':34B ''moth'':35B ''near'':33B ''of'':16B ''poach'':45B ''rest'':3A,6B ''rorikst'':26B ''roughly'':21B ''s'':2A,5B ''serv'':38B ''shack'':10B ''shelt'':31B ''small'':9B ''surrounding'':49B ''the'':13B,30B,48B ''west'':15B ''who'':44B ''wilderness'':50B', 'falkreath', 'Hunter''s Rest is a small shack located roughly midway between Falkreath and Rorikstead in Falkreath Hold. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, rift reach', '', 'falkreath');
