INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('grey_quarter', 'The Gray Quarter is a district in Windhelm, home to the city''s sizable population of Dark Elves, or Dunmer, who sought refuge in Skyrim after the eruption of Red Mountain. Once known as the Snow Quarter, it is a cramped and impoverished area, where the Dunmer face suspicion and xenophobia from the Nords, who view them with disdain. Although they are not openly persecuted, the Dunmer live in difficult conditions, with little support from Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak, who largely ignores their plight.

