INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hjaalmarch', 'Hjaalmarch is a hold in northern Skyrim, with its capital in Morthal, located east of Solitude and south of the Pale. Despite its proximity to Skyrim''s capital, Hjaalmarch is remote and isolated, dominated by a vast, fog-shrouded swamp in the north and bordered by snowy mountains in the south. The ancient ruins of Labyrinthian block potential trade routes to Whiterun Hold, adding to its seclusion.  It is ruled by Jarl Idgrod Ravencrone.

Hjaalmarch’s salt marshes, stretching from Fort Snowhawk in the west to Ustengrav in the east, are rich in flora, including deathbell, swamp fungal pods, and giant lichen, as well as rare blue mountain flowers around Morthal. The swamps are teeming with dangerous creatures like frostbite spiders, trolls, and even chaurus, while mudcrabs, fish, and dragonflies populate the waterways. The southern regions are snowy and mountainous, with bears, sabre cats, and deer roaming the rugged terrain. A single paved road connects Dragon Bridge in the west to Morthal.', '''adding'':66B ''ancient'':55B ''and'':18B,33B,46B,102B,125B,131B,141B,147B ''are'':93B,116B,139B ''around'':112B ''as'':105B,107B ''bears'':144B ''block'':59B ''blu'':109B ''border'':47B ''bridg'':159B ''by'':36B,48B,73B ''capital'':11B,29B ''cats'':146B ''chaurus'':127B ''connects'':157B ''creatur'':120B ''dangerous'':119B ''deathbell'':98B ''deer'':148B ''despit'':23B ''dominat'':35B ''dragon'':158B ''dragonfli'':132B ''east'':15B,92B ''even'':126B ''fish'':130B ''flor'':96B ''flowers'':111B ''fog'':40B ''fog-shroud'':39B ''fort'':83B ''from'':82B ''frostbit'':122B ''fungal'':100B ''giant'':103B ''hjaalmarch'':1A,2B,30B,77B ''hold'':5B,65B ''idgrod'':75B ''in'':6B,12B,43B,51B,85B,90B,95B,160B ''including'':97B ''is'':3B,31B,71B ''isolat'':34B ''it'':70B ''its'':10B,24B,68B ''jarl'':74B ''labyrinthi'':58B ''lich'':104B ''lik'':121B ''locat'':14B ''marsh'':80B ''morthal'':13B,113B,164B ''mountain'':110B ''mountainous'':142B ''mountains'':50B ''mudcrabs'':129B ''north'':45B ''northern'':7B ''of'':16B,20B,57B ''pal'':22B ''pav'':155B ''pods'':101B ''populat'':133B ''potential'':60B ''proximity'':25B ''rar'':108B ''ravencron'':76B ''regions'':138B ''remot'':32B ''rich'':94B ''road'':156B ''roaming'':149B ''rout'':62B ''rugg'':151B ''ruins'':56B ''rul'':72B ''s'':28B,78B ''sabr'':145B ''salt'':79B ''seclusion'':69B ''shroud'':41B ''singl'':154B ''skyrim'':8B,27B ''snowhawk'':84B ''snowy'':49B,140B ''solitud'':17B ''south'':19B,53B ''southern'':137B ''spiders'':123B ''stretching'':81B ''swamp'':42B,99B ''swamps'':115B ''teeming'':117B ''terrain'':152B ''the'':21B,44B,52B,54B,86B,91B,114B,134B,136B,150B,161B ''to'':26B,63B,67B,88B,163B ''trad'':61B ''trolls'':124B ''ustengrav'':89B ''vast'':38B ''waterways'':135B ''well'':106B ''west'':87B,162B ''whil'':128B ''whiterun'':64B ''with'':9B,118B,143B', 'hjaalmarch, noble, scholar', 'Hjaalmarch is a hold in northern Skyrim, with its capital in Morthal, located east of Solitude and south of the Pale. Despite its proximity to Skyrim''s capital, Hjaalmarch is remote and isolated, dominated by a vast, fog-shrouded swamp in the north and bordered by snowy mountains in the south. The ancient ruins of Labyrinthian block potential trade routes to Whiterun Hold, adding to its seclusion.  It is ruled by Jarl Idgrod Ravencrone.

Hjaalmarch’s salt marshes, stretching from Fort Snowhawk in the west to Ustengrav in the east, are rich in flora.', '', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('morthal', 'Morthal is a small city in northern Skyrim and the capital of Hjaalmarch, located on the southern edge of the Drajkmyr marsh. Initially aligned with the Empire, Jarl Idgrod Ravencrone’s mystical and reclusive nature has led to perceptions of her as an ineffective ruler. She often speaks of sensing larger forces at play, which has distanced her from her citizens, many of whom worry about the war bringing outsiders and prefer their isolated way of life.

The city is a humble settlement with little economic or strategic value, supported only by a small lumber mill, an apothecary (Thaumaturgist''s Hut), and an inn (Moorside Inn). Morthal’s surroundings are often shrouded in thick fog, with twisted trees and glowing torches creating a haunting atmosphere. The swampy lands are rich in deathbells, swamp fungal pods, and giant lichen, but are also dangerous at night, with creatures such as trolls and occasionally chaurus lurking nearby.', '''about'':67B ''align'':25B ''also'':142B ''an'':44B,98B,104B ''and'':10B,34B,72B,103B,120B,137B,151B ''apothecary'':99B ''are'':111B,130B,141B ''as'':43B,149B ''at'':54B,144B ''atmospher'':126B ''bringing'':70B ''but'':140B ''by'':93B ''capital'':12B ''chaurus'':153B ''citizens'':62B ''city'':6B,80B ''creating'':123B ''creatur'':147B ''dangerous'':143B ''deathbells'':133B ''distanc'':58B ''drajkmyr'':22B ''economic'':87B ''edge'':19B ''empir'':28B ''fog'':116B ''forc'':53B ''from'':60B ''fungal'':135B ''giant'':138B ''glowing'':121B ''haunting'':125B ''her'':42B,59B,61B ''hjaalmarch'':14B ''humbl'':83B ''hut'':102B ''idgrod'':30B ''in'':7B,114B,132B ''ineffectiv'':45B ''initially'':24B ''inn'':105B,107B ''is'':3B,81B ''isolat'':75B ''jarl'':29B ''lands'':129B ''larg'':52B ''led'':38B ''lich'':139B ''lif'':78B ''littl'':86B ''locat'':15B ''lumb'':96B ''lurking'':154B ''many'':63B ''marsh'':23B ''mill'':97B ''moorsid'':106B ''morthal'':1A,2B,108B ''mystical'':33B ''natur'':36B ''nearby'':155B ''night'':145B ''northern'':8B ''occasionally'':152B ''of'':13B,20B,41B,50B,64B,77B ''often'':48B,112B ''on'':16B ''only'':92B ''or'':88B ''outsiders'':71B ''perceptions'':40B ''play'':55B ''pods'':136B ''pref'':73B ''ravencron'':31B ''reclusiv'':35B ''rich'':131B ''rul'':46B ''s'':32B,101B,109B ''sensing'':51B ''settlement'':84B ''she'':47B ''shroud'':113B ''skyrim'':9B ''small'':5B,95B ''southern'':18B ''speaks'':49B ''strategic'':89B ''such'':148B ''support'':91B ''surroundings'':110B ''swamp'':134B ''swampy'':128B ''thaumaturgist'':100B ''the'':11B,17B,21B,27B,68B,74B,79B,127B ''thick'':115B ''to'':39B ''torch'':122B ''tre'':119B ''trolls'':150B ''twist'':118B ''valu'':90B ''war'':69B ''way'':76B ''which'':56B ''whom'':65B ''with'':26B,85B,117B,146B ''worry'':66B', 'hjaalmarch, noble, scholar', 'Morthal is a small city in northern Skyrim and the capital of Hjaalmarch, located on the southern edge of the Drajkmyr marsh. Initially aligned with the Empire, Jarl Idgrod Ravencrone’s mystical and reclusive nature has led to perceptions of her as an ineffective ruler. 

The city is a humble settlement with little economic or strategic value, supported only by a small lumber mill, an apothecary (Thaumaturgist''s Hut), and an inn (Moorside Inn). Morthal’s surroundings are often shrouded in thick fog, with twisted trees and glowing torches creating a haunting atmosphere. The swampy lands are rich in deathbells, swamp fungal pods, and giant lichen, but are also dangerous at night, with creatures such as trolls and occasionally chaurus lurking nearby.', '', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('stonehills', 'Stonehills is a small mining settlement located east of Morthal and west of Dimhollow Crypt in Hjaalmarch. It serves as the encampment for workers at Rockwallow Mine, which is owned by Thane Bryling of Solitude. The mine is managed by Sorli the Builder and her husband, Pactur, who live in a house near the mine with their son, Sirgar.', '''and'':12B,45B ''as'':21B ''at'':26B ''bryling'':34B ''build'':44B ''by'':32B,41B ''crypt'':16B ''dimhollow'':15B ''east'':9B ''encampment'':23B ''for'':24B ''her'':46B ''hjaalmarch'':18B ''hous'':53B ''husband'':47B ''in'':17B,51B ''is'':3B,30B,39B ''it'':19B ''liv'':50B ''locat'':8B ''manag'':40B ''min'':28B,38B,56B ''mining'':6B ''morthal'':11B ''near'':54B ''of'':10B,14B,35B ''owned'':31B ''pactur'':48B ''rockwallow'':27B ''serv'':20B ''settlement'':7B ''sirg'':60B ''small'':5B ''solitud'':36B ''sorli'':42B ''stonehills'':1A,2B ''than'':33B ''the'':22B,37B,43B,55B,58B ''west'':13B ''which'':29B ''who'':49B ''with'':57B ''workers'':25B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Stonehills is a small mining settlement located east of Morthal.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hjaalmarch_imperial_camp', 'Hjaalmarch Imperial Camp is an Imperial military encampment located south of Ustengrav and northwest of Stonehills in Hjaalmarch. Commanded by Legate Taurinus Duilis.', '''an'':8B ''and'':16B ''by'':23B ''camp'':3A,6B ''command'':22B ''duilis'':26B ''encampment'':11B ''hjaalmarch'':1A,4B,21B ''imperial'':2A,5B,9B ''in'':20B ''is'':7B ''legat'':24B ''locat'':12B ''military'':10B ''northwest'':17B ''of'':14B,18B ''south'':13B ''stonehills'':19B ''taurinus'':25B ''ustengrav'':15B', 'hjaalmarch, legion', 'Hjaalmarch Imperial Camp is an Imperial military encampment located southeast of Morthal.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hjaalmarch_stormcloak_camp', 'Hjaalmarch Stormcloak Camp is a Stormcloak military encampment located east of Ustengrav and west of Mzinchaleft in Hjaalmarch. The camp serves as a base of operations for the Stormcloaks in their campaign to gain control of the region.

The camp is typically commanded by Arrald Frozen-Heart.', '''and'':16B ''arrald'':48B ''as'':25B ''bas'':27B ''by'':47B ''camp'':3A,6B,23B,43B ''campaign'':35B ''command'':46B ''control'':38B ''east'':13B ''encampment'':11B ''for'':30B ''froz'':50B ''frozen-heart'':49B ''gain'':37B ''heart'':51B ''hjaalmarch'':1A,4B,21B ''in'':20B,33B ''is'':7B,44B ''locat'':12B ''military'':10B ''mzinchaleft'':19B ''of'':14B,18B,28B,39B ''operations'':29B ''region'':41B ''serv'':24B ''stormcloak'':2A,5B,9B ''stormcloaks'':32B ''the'':22B,31B,34B,40B,42B ''to'':36B ''typically'':45B ''ustengrav'':15B ''west'':17B', 'hjaalmarch, stormcloak', 'Hjaalmarch Stormcloak Camp is a Stormcloak military encampment located east of Morthal in Hjaalmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brood_cavern', 'Brood Cavern is a small cave located southwest of Morthal and southeast of Dead Men''s Respite in Hjaalmarch. The cavern is inhabited by dagnerous animals.', '''and'':13B ''animals'':28B ''brood'':1A,3B ''by'':26B ''cav'':8B ''cavern'':2A,4B,23B ''dagnerous'':27B ''dead'':16B ''hjaalmarch'':21B ''in'':20B ''inhabit'':25B ''is'':5B,24B ''locat'':9B ''men'':17B ''morthal'':12B ''of'':11B,15B ''respit'':19B ''s'':18B ''small'':7B ''southeast'':14B ''southwest'':10B ''the'':22B', 'hjaalmarch, vampire', 'Brood Cavern is a small cave located southwest of Morthal in HjaalmarchYou do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('robber''s_gorge', 'Robber''s Gorge is a small bandit camp and cave located west-southwest of Morthal and east-northeast of Broken Tower Redoubt in Hjaalmarch. The camp spans a road connecting Rorikstead to Dragon Bridge, with a bridge controlled by the bandits crossing the River Hjaal.', '''and'':12B,20B ''bandit'':10B ''bandits'':46B ''bridg'':39B,42B ''brok'':25B ''by'':44B ''camp'':11B,31B ''cav'':13B ''connecting'':35B ''controll'':43B ''crossing'':47B ''dragon'':38B ''east'':22B ''east-northeast'':21B ''gorg'':3A,6B ''hjaal'':50B ''hjaalmarch'':29B ''in'':28B ''is'':7B ''locat'':14B ''morthal'':19B ''northeast'':23B ''of'':18B,24B ''redoubt'':27B ''riv'':49B ''road'':34B ''robb'':1A,4B ''rorikst'':36B ''s'':2A,5B ''small'':9B ''southwest'':17B ''spans'':32B ''the'':30B,45B,48B ''to'':37B ''tow'':26B ''west'':16B ''west-southwest'':15B ''with'':40B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Robber''s Gorge is a small bandit camp and cave located west-southwest of Morthal in Hjaalmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('abandoned_shack', 'The Abandoned Shack is an isolated house located east-southeast of Solitude in Hjaalmarch. It is the location where Dark Brotherhood iniates are taken to see if have the heart to kill', '''abandon'':1A,4B ''an'':7B ''are'':26B ''brotherhood'':24B ''dark'':23B ''east'':12B ''east-southeast'':11B ''hav'':31B ''heart'':33B ''hjaalmarch'':17B ''hous'':9B ''if'':30B ''in'':16B ''iniat'':25B ''is'':6B,19B ''isolat'':8B ''it'':18B ''kill'':35B ''locat'':10B ''location'':21B ''of'':14B ''see'':29B ''shack'':2A,5B ''solitud'':15B ''southeast'':13B ''tak'':27B ''the'':3B,20B,32B ''to'':28B,34B ''wher'':22B', 'darkbrotherhood', 'The Abandoned Shack is an isolated house located east-southeast of Solitude in Hjaalmarch. No one really knows who the shack belonged to, or what purpose it had. However it is rumored to be haunted and best stayed away from.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'hjaalmarch', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('crabber''s_shanty', 'Crabber''s Shanty is a small, run-down shack located on the banks of the River Hjaal, southwest of Morthal. This modest dwelling is home to a lone fisherman who makes a simple living by the water.', '''banks'':17B ''by'':39B ''crabb'':1A,4B ''down'':12B ''dwelling'':27B ''fisherm'':33B ''hjaal'':21B ''hom'':29B ''is'':7B,28B ''living'':38B ''locat'':14B ''lon'':32B ''mak'':35B ''modest'':26B ''morthal'':24B ''of'':18B,23B ''on'':15B ''riv'':20B ''run'':11B ''run-down'':10B ''s'':2A,5B ''shack'':13B ''shanty'':3A,6B ''simpl'':37B ''small'':9B ''southwest'':22B ''the'':16B,19B,40B ''this'':25B ''to'':30B ''wat'':41B ''who'':34B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Crabber''s Shanty is a small, run-down shack located on the banks of the River Hjaal, southwest of Morthal.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('meeko''s_shack', 'Meeko''s Shack is a dwelling located on the edge of the Hjaalmarch marshlands, west-northwest of Morthal and Fort Snowhawk. It sits a short distance from the road connecting Morthal to Dragon Bridge. It is rumored that the owner of the house, a Nord who you do not know the name of, has not been heard from in weeks.', '''and'':23B ''been'':60B ''bridg'':38B ''connecting'':34B ''distanc'':30B ''do'':52B ''dragon'':37B ''dwelling'':9B ''edge'':13B ''fort'':24B ''from'':31B,62B ''heard'':61B ''hjaalmarch'':16B ''hous'':47B ''in'':63B ''is'':7B,40B ''it'':26B,39B ''know'':54B ''locat'':10B ''marshlands'':17B ''meek'':1A,4B ''morthal'':22B,35B ''nam'':56B ''nord'':49B ''northwest'':20B ''not'':53B,59B ''of'':14B,21B,45B,57B ''on'':11B ''owner'':44B ''road'':33B ''rumor'':41B ''s'':2A,5B ''shack'':3A,6B ''short'':29B ''sits'':27B ''snowhawk'':25B ''that'':42B ''the'':12B,15B,32B,43B,46B,55B ''to'':36B ''weeks'':64B ''west'':19B ''west-northwest'':18B ''who'':50B ''you'':51B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Meeko''s Shack is a dwelling located on the edge of the Hjaalmarch marshlands, west-northwest of Morthal. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
