INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('alva''s_house', 'Alva''s House is a small residence located in Morthal, home to Alva and her husband, Hroggar. The house is situated along the jetty, just next to the Guardhouse.', '''along'':25B ''alva'':1A,4B,16B ''and'':17B ''guardhous'':32B ''her'':18B ''hom'':14B ''hous'':3A,6B,22B ''hrogg'':20B ''husband'':19B ''in'':12B ''is'':7B,23B ''jetty'':27B ''just'':28B ''locat'':11B ''morthal'':13B ''next'':29B ''residenc'':10B ''s'':2A,5B ''situat'':24B ''small'':9B ''the'':21B,26B,31B ''to'':15B,30B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Alva''s House is a small residence located in Morthal, home to Alva, who you do not know.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('falion''s_house', 'Falion''s House is the residence and shop of the town wizard, Falion, in Morthal. Located along the jetty, it sits behind the Thaumaturgist''s Hut and is situated on the edge of the water, just a short distance from Alva''s house. Falion lives there with his child apprentice, Agni.', '''agni'':54B ''along'':20B ''alva'':44B ''and'':10B,30B ''apprentic'':53B ''behind'':25B ''child'':52B ''distanc'':42B ''edge'':35B ''falion'':1A,4B,16B,47B ''from'':43B ''his'':51B ''hous'':3A,6B,46B ''hut'':29B ''in'':17B ''is'':7B,31B ''it'':23B ''jetty'':22B ''just'':39B ''liv'':48B ''locat'':19B ''morthal'':18B ''of'':12B,36B ''on'':33B ''residenc'':9B ''s'':2A,5B,28B,45B ''shop'':11B ''short'':41B ''sits'':24B ''situat'':32B ''thaumaturgist'':27B ''the'':8B,13B,21B,26B,34B,37B ''ther'':49B ''town'':14B ''wat'':38B ''with'':50B ''wizard'':15B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Falion''s House is the residence in Morthal. You do not know who Falion is.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('deepwood_redoubt', 'Deepwood Redoubt is a large Nordic ruin located west of Dragon Bridge and east of Mor Khazgur in The Reach. The ruin is inhabited by Forsworn, the fierce and rebellious natives of the Reach, who occupy the site as part of their struggle against outsiders.', '''against'':46B ''and'':15B,31B ''as'':41B ''bridg'':14B ''by'':27B ''deepwood'':1A,3B ''dragon'':13B ''east'':16B ''fierc'':30B ''forsworn'':28B ''in'':20B ''inhabit'':26B ''is'':5B,25B ''khazgur'':19B ''larg'':7B ''locat'':10B ''mor'':18B ''nativ'':33B ''nordic'':8B ''occupy'':38B ''of'':12B,17B,34B,43B ''outsiders'':47B ''part'':42B ''reach'':22B,36B ''rebellious'':32B ''redoubt'':2A,4B ''ruin'':9B,24B ''sit'':40B ''struggl'':45B ''the'':21B,23B,29B,35B,39B,44B ''west'':11B ''who'':37B', 'haafingar', 'Deepwood Redoubt is a large Nordic ruin located west of Dragon Bridge in The Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, reach, hjaalmarch', '', 'haafingar');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('highmoon_hall', 'Highmoon Hall is the residence of Idgrod Ravencrone, the Jarl of Hjaalmarch, located in the town of Morthal. This grand hall serves as the administrative center for the region, where Jarl Idgrod Ravencrone oversees the affairs of her hold.

The hall is also home to several key figures in Hjaalmarch''s governance, including Aslfur, the steward, Legate Taurinus Duilis, the military advisor, and Gorm, the housecarl. Despite Jarl Idgrod’s reclusive nature and mystical tendencies, Highmoon Hall remains a focal point for the people of Morthal and the surrounding areas.', '''administrativ'':27B ''advisor'':64B ''affairs'':38B ''also'':45B ''and'':65B,75B,89B ''are'':92B ''as'':25B ''aslfur'':56B ''cent'':28B ''despit'':69B ''duilis'':61B ''figur'':50B ''focal'':82B ''for'':29B,84B ''gorm'':66B ''governanc'':54B ''grand'':22B ''hall'':2A,4B,23B,43B,79B ''her'':40B ''highmoon'':1A,3B,78B ''hjaalmarch'':14B,52B ''hold'':41B ''hom'':46B ''housecarl'':68B ''idgrod'':9B,34B,71B ''in'':16B,51B ''including'':55B ''is'':5B,44B ''jarl'':12B,33B,70B ''key'':49B ''legat'':59B ''locat'':15B ''military'':63B ''morthal'':20B,88B ''mystical'':76B ''natur'':74B ''of'':8B,13B,19B,39B,87B ''overs'':36B ''peopl'':86B ''point'':83B ''ravencron'':10B,35B ''reclusiv'':73B ''region'':31B ''remains'':80B ''residenc'':7B ''s'':53B,72B ''serv'':24B ''several'':48B ''steward'':58B ''surrounding'':91B ''taurinus'':60B ''tendenci'':77B ''the'':6B,11B,17B,26B,30B,37B,42B,57B,62B,67B,85B,90B ''this'':21B ''to'':47B ''town'':18B ''wher'':32B', 'hjaalmarch, noble', 'Highmoon Hall is the residence of Idgrod Ravencrone, the Jarl of Hjaalmarch, located in the town of Morthal. This grand hall serves as the administrative center for the region, where Jarl Idgrod Ravencrone oversees the affairs of her hold. You do not know any of the other servants who work here.
You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('moorside_inn', 'Moorside Inn is the inn in Morthal, owned and operated by Jonna. Located in the heart of the town. Lurbuk serves as the inn''s bard, though his performances are not particularly well-received, and business at the inn seems slow. Jonna often mentions that the front door sees little traffic. ', '''and'':11B,38B ''are'':32B ''as'':24B ''at'':40B ''bard'':28B ''business'':39B ''by'':13B ''door'':51B ''front'':50B ''heart'':18B ''his'':30B ''in'':8B,16B ''inn'':2A,4B,7B,26B,42B ''is'':5B ''jonn'':14B,45B ''littl'':53B ''locat'':15B ''lurbuk'':22B ''mentions'':47B ''moorsid'':1A,3B ''morthal'':9B ''not'':33B ''of'':19B ''often'':46B ''operat'':12B ''owned'':10B ''particularly'':34B ''performanc'':31B ''receiv'':37B ''s'':27B ''seems'':43B ''sees'':52B ''serv'':23B ''slow'':44B ''that'':48B ''the'':6B,17B,20B,25B,41B,49B ''though'':29B ''town'':21B ''traffic'':54B ''well'':36B ''well-receiv'':35B', 'hjaalmarch, innkeeper, traveler', 'Moorside Inn is the inn in Morthal. You do not know who runs the Inn.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('thaumaturgist''s_hut', 'The Thaumaturgist''s Hut is an alchemy shop located across from Highmoon Hall in Morthal. The shop is run by Lami, who manages the business during normal hours from 8 AM to 8 PM. ', '''8'':33B,36B ''across'':13B ''alchemy'':10B ''am'':34B ''an'':9B ''business'':28B ''by'':23B ''during'':29B ''from'':14B,32B ''hall'':16B ''highmoon'':15B ''hours'':31B ''hut'':3A,7B ''in'':17B ''is'':8B,21B ''lami'':24B ''locat'':12B ''manag'':26B ''morthal'':18B ''normal'':30B ''pm'':37B ''run'':22B ''s'':2A,6B ''shop'':11B,20B ''thaumaturgist'':1A,5B ''the'':4B,19B,27B ''to'':35B ''who'':25B', 'hjaalmarch', 'The Thaumaturgist''s Hut is an alchemy shop located in Morthal. You do not know who runs the shop.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('thonnir''s_house', 'Thonnir''s House is the residence of Thonnir and his son Virkmund, located in Morthal. Thonnir, a Nord lumberjack, lives with his son, who is a young child.', '''and'':12B ''child'':31B ''his'':13B,25B ''hous'':3A,6B ''in'':17B ''is'':7B,28B ''liv'':23B ''locat'':16B ''lumberjack'':22B ''morthal'':18B ''nord'':21B ''of'':10B ''residenc'':9B ''s'':2A,5B ''the'':8B ''thonn'':1A,4B,11B,19B ''virkmund'':15B ''who'':27B ''with'':24B ''young'':30B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Thonnir''s House is the residence of Thonnir located in Morthal. You do not know who Thonnir is.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('haafingar', 'Haafingar is a location at the northwestern edge of Skyrim, home to the provincial capital, Solitude. The hold serves as the center of Imperial rule in Skyrim.

Haafingar is defined by a large ridge that stretches across the hold, with pine forests and meadows covering the southern slopes down to the Karth River. The northern areas are colder, with mountains and a frozen coastline. Solitude itself is perched on a massive natural archway over the mouth of the Karth River. The region''s coastline is rich in resources like nordic barnacles and clams, while the land supports plants like canis root and spiky grass. Near Solitude, you can enjoy fishing by the Solitude Sawmill, where dragonflies hover over the water. The hold is home to various flora, including nightshade, mora tapinella, and thistles, while the snow-covered Druadach Mountains only allow snowberries and scattered mountain flowers to grow. Jarl Elisif the Fair governs the region.', '''across'':38B ''allow'':143B ''and'':44B,62B,93B,103B,133B,145B ''archway'':74B ''are'':57B,58B ''as'':21B ''at'':6B ''barnacl'':92B ''by'':32B,112B ''can'':109B ''canis'':101B ''capital'':16B ''cent'':23B ''clams'':94B ''coastlin'':65B,85B ''cold'':59B ''cover'':139B ''covering'':46B ''defin'':31B ''down'':50B ''dragonfli'':117B ''druadach'':140B ''edge'':9B ''elisif'':152B ''enjoy'':110B ''fair'':154B ''fishing'':111B ''flor'':128B ''flowers'':148B ''forests'':43B ''froz'':64B ''governs'':155B ''grass'':105B ''grow'':150B ''haafing'':1A,2B,29B ''hold'':19B,40B,123B ''hom'':12B,125B ''hov'':118B ''imperial'':25B ''in'':27B,88B ''including'':129B ''is'':3B,30B,68B,86B,124B ''itself'':67B ''jarl'':151B ''karth'':53B,80B ''land'':97B ''larg'':34B ''lik'':90B,100B ''location'':5B ''massiv'':72B ''meadows'':45B ''mor'':131B ''mountain'':147B ''mountains'':61B,141B ''mouth'':77B ''natural'':73B ''near'':106B ''nightshad'':130B ''nordic'':91B ''northern'':56B ''northwestern'':8B ''of'':10B,24B,78B ''on'':70B ''only'':142B ''over'':75B,119B ''perch'':69B ''pin'':42B ''plants'':99B ''provincial'':15B ''region'':83B,157B ''resourc'':89B ''rich'':87B ''ridg'':35B ''riv'':54B,81B ''root'':102B ''