INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('erikur''s_house', 'Erikur''s House is a large mansion located just northwest of the Blue Palace in Solitude. It is the last building on the right before the Blue Palace, across from the Bards College and Bryling''s House. The mansion is the residence of Erikur, a Nord warrior and Thane of Solitude, who oversees local businesses and engages in trade, notably importing low-quality elven weapons from Black Marsh to sell at inflated prices to the Imperial army.

The house is also home to Gisli, a Nord ranger and Erikur''s sister, who is known for being discouraged and disillusioned, in contrast to her arrogant brother. Additionally, the mansion houses Melaran, a High Elf mage, who likely brings his magical expertise to the household. The mansion''s central location and notable inhabitants make it a significant location in Solitude''s upper social circle.', '''across'':32B ''additionally'':110B ''also'':85B ''and'':37B,51B,59B,92B,102B,133B ''army'':81B ''arrogant'':108B ''at'':75B ''bards'':35B ''befor'':28B ''being'':100B ''black'':71B ''blu'':16B,30B ''brings'':121B ''broth'':109B ''bryling'':38B ''building'':24B ''business'':58B ''central'':131B ''circl'':146B ''colleg'':36B ''contrast'':105B ''discourag'':101B ''disillusion'':103B ''elf'':117B ''elven'':68B ''engag'':60B ''erikur'':1A,4B,47B,93B ''expertis'':124B ''for'':99B ''from'':33B,70B ''gisli'':88B ''her'':107B ''high'':116B ''his'':122B ''hom'':86B ''hous'':3A,6B,40B,83B,113B ''household'':127B ''imperial'':80B ''importing'':64B ''in'':18B,61B,104B,141B ''inflat'':76B ''inhabitants'':135B ''is'':7B,21B,43B,84B,97B ''it'':20B,137B ''just'':12B ''known'':98B ''larg'':9B ''last'':23B ''likely'':120B ''local'':57B ''locat'':11B ''location'':132B,140B ''low'':66B ''low-quality'':65B ''mag'':118B ''magical'':123B ''mak'':136B ''mansion'':10B,42B,112B,129B ''marsh'':72B ''mel'':114B ''nord'':49B,90B ''northwest'':13B ''notabl'':134B ''notably'':63B ''of'':14B,46B,53B ''on'':25B ''overs'':56B ''palac'':17B,31B ''pric'':77B ''quality'':67B ''rang'':91B ''residenc'':45B ''right'':27B ''s'':2A,5B,39B,94B,130B,143B ''sell'':74B ''significant'':139B ''sist'':95B ''social'':145B ''solitud'':19B,54B,142B ''than'':52B ''the'':15B,22B,26B,29B,34B,41B,44B,79B,82B,111B,126B,128B ''to'':73B,78B,87B,106B,125B ''trad'':62B ''upper'':144B ''warrior'':50B ''weapons'':69B ''who'':55B,96B,119B', 'haafingar', 'Erikur''s House is a large mansion located just northwest of the Blue Palace in