INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('silus_vesuius''s_house', 'Silus Vesuius''s House is a residence in Dawnstar that doubles as a museum dedicated to the Mythic Dawn, a secretive cult infamous for worshipping the Daedric Prince of Destruction, Mehrunes Dagon. The Mythic Dawn, led by Mankar Camoran, orchestrated the assassination of Emperor Uriel Septim VII and his heirs in 3E 433, a plot that triggered the Oblivion Crisis and the end of the Third Era.

Silus''s museum preserves artifacts and history from this dark chapter of Tamriel''s past, offering visitors a chance to learn about the Mythic Dawn''s deeds and their catastrophic legacy. It is a controversial location due to the subject matter. ', '''3e'':56B ''433'':57B ''about'':93B ''and'':52B,65B,77B,99B ''artifacts'':76B ''as'':16B ''assassination'':46B ''by'':41B ''camor'':43B ''catastrophic'':101B ''chanc'':90B ''chapt'':82B ''controversial'':106B ''crisis'':64B ''cult'':26B ''daedric'':31B ''dagon'':36B ''dark'':81B ''dawn'':23B,39B,96B ''dawnst'':13B ''dedicat'':19B ''deeds'':98B ''destruction'':34B ''doubl'':15B ''due'':108B ''emperor'':48B ''end'':67B ''for'':28B ''from'':79B ''heirs'':54B ''his'':53B ''history'':78B ''hous'':4A,8B ''in'':12B,55B ''infamous'':27B ''is'':9B,104B ''it'':103B ''learn'':92B ''led'':40B ''legacy'':102B ''location'':107B ''mank'':42B ''matt'':112B ''mehrun'':35B ''museum'':18B,74B ''mythic'':22B,38B,95B ''oblivion'':63B ''of'':33B,47B,68B,83B ''offering'':87B ''orchestrat'':44B ''past'':86B ''plot'':59B ''preserv'':75B ''princ'':32B ''residenc'':11B ''s'':3A,7B,73B,85B,97B ''secretiv'':25B ''septim'':50B ''silus'':1A,5B,72B ''subject'':111B ''tamriel'':84B ''that'':14B,60B ''the'':21B,30B,37B,45B,62B,66B,69B,94B,100B,110B ''third'':70B ''this'':80B ''to'':20B,91B,109B ''trigger'':61B ''uriel'':49B ''vesuius'':2A,6B ''vii'':51B ''visitors'':88B ''worshipping'':29B', 'pale', 'Silus Vesuius''s House is a residence in Dawnstar that doubles as a museum dedicated to the Mythic Dawn, a secretive cult infamous for worshipping the Daedric Prince of Destruction, Mehrunes Dagon. The Mythic Dawn, led by Mankar Camoran, orchestrated the assassination of Emperor Uriel Septim VII and his heirs in 3E 433, a plot that triggered the Oblivion Crisis and the end of the Third Era.

Silus''s museum preserves artifacts and history from this dark chapter of Tamriel''s past, offering visitors a chance to learn about the Mythic Dawn''s deeds and their catastrophic legacy. It is a controversial location due to the subject matter. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, winterhold, whiterun, hjaalmarch', '', 'pale');
