INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('understone_keep', 'Understone Keep is an ancient Dwarven structure built into the mountainside on the second tier, western side of Markarth. It serves as the seat of power for the Jarl of Markarth, combining the functionality of a palace with the mystique of Dwemer craftsmanship. Upon entering, the keep appears as a cave, but it quickly opens into a sprawling palace, featuring the Jarl''s throne room, The Mournful Throne, living quarters, a personal blacksmith, the war room, and the palace kitchen.

The keep houses notable areas accessible only through its confines, including Nchuand-Zel, the Dwemer Museum, Calcelmo’s Laboratory, and Calcelmo’s Tower. It also provides access to Markarth Wizards'' Balcony and connects to the Hall of the Dead, which has its own separate entrance. The museum is guarded, and access requires permission from Calcelmo, the court wizard and an authority on Dwemer lore.

The current Jarl, Igmund, is supported by his Steward Raerek, Housecarl Faleen, and Legate Emmanuel Admand, reflecting his alignment with the Imperial Legion. ', '''access'':88B,110B,134B ''admand'':163B ''alignment'':166B ''also'':108B ''an'':6B,143B ''ancient'':7B ''and'':79B,103B,115B,133B,142B,160B ''appears'':50B ''are'':87B ''as'':24B,51B ''authority'':144B ''balcony'':114B ''blacksmith'':75B ''built'':10B ''but'':54B ''by'':154B ''calcelm'':100B,104B,138B ''cav'':53B ''combining'':34B ''confin'':92B ''connects'':116B ''court'':140B ''craftsmanship'':45B ''current'':149B ''dead'':122B ''dwarv'':8B ''dwem'':44B,98B,146B ''emmanuel'':162B ''entering'':47B ''entranc'':128B ''fal'':159B ''featuring'':62B ''for'':29B ''from'':137B ''functionality'':36B ''guard'':132B ''hall'':119B ''his'':155B,165B ''hous'':85B ''housecarl'':158B ''igmund'':151B ''imperial'':169B ''including'':93B ''into'':11B,58B ''is'':5B,131B,152B ''it'':22B,55B,107B ''its'':91B,125B ''jarl'':31B,64B,150B ''keep'':2A,4B,49B,84B ''kitch'':82B ''laboratory'':102B ''legat'':161B ''legion'':170B ''living'':71B ''lor'':147B ''markarth'':21B,33B,112B ''mountainsid'':13B ''mournful'':69B ''museum'':99B,130B ''mystiqu'':42B ''nchuand'':95B ''nchuand-zel'':94B ''notabl'':86B ''of'':20B,27B,32B,37B,43B,120B ''on'':14B,145B ''only'':89B ''opens'':57B ''own'':126B ''palac'':39B,61B,81B ''permission'':136B ''personal'':74B ''pow'':28B ''provid'':109B ''quarters'':72B ''quickly'':56B ''raerek'':157B ''reflecting'':164B ''requir'':135B ''room'':67B,78B ''s'':65B,101B,105B ''seat'':26B ''second'':16B ''separat'':127B ''serv'':23B ''sid'':19B ''sprawling'':60B ''steward'':156B ''structur'':9B ''support'':153B ''the'':12B,15B,25B,30B,35B,41B,48B,63B,68B,76B,80B,83B,97B,118B,121B,129B,139B,148B,168B ''thron'':66B,70B ''through'':90B ''tier'':17B ''to'':111B,117B ''tow'':106B ''underston'':1A,3B ''upon'':46B ''war'':77B ''western'':18B ''which'':123B ''with'':40B,167B ''wizard'':141B ''wizards'':113B ''zel'':96B', 