INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('karthwasten', 'Karthwasten is a small mining town located in the Reach, east of the Shrine to Peryite and north of Blind Cliff Cave. The town is notable for being one of the few mining settlements in the Reach not owned by a Nord, with Ainethach, a Reachman, holding ownership of both surrounding silver mines: Sanuarach Mine and Fenn''s Gulch Mine.

The town consists of three buildings: Karthwasten Hall, where Ainethach resides; Enmon''s house, home to Enmon, his wife Mena, and daughter Fjotra; and the miner''s barracks, housing Belchimac, Lash gra-Dushnikh, and Ragnar. Amenities include a tanning rack near Karthwasten Hall and a grindstone on the deck of the miner’s barracks.

Sanuarach Mine, the main silver mine, is located north of Karthwasten Hall, with a smelter and silver ore nearby. Fenn’s Gulch Mine lies at the town’s northwestern edge and also features a smelter, along with silver ingots and ore near its entrance. ', '''ainethach'':45B,71B ''along'':152B ''also'':148B ''ameniti'':98B ''and'':18B,57B,82B,85B,96B,106B,132B,147B,156B ''at'':141B ''barracks'':89B,116B ''being'':29B ''belchimac'':91B ''blind'':21B ''both'':51B ''buildings'':67B ''by'':41B ''cav'':23B ''cliff'':22B ''consists'':64B ''daught'':83B ''deck'':111B ''dushnikh'':95B ''east'':12B ''edge'':146B ''enmon'':73B,78B ''entranc'':160B ''featur'':149B ''fenn'':58B,136B ''few'':33B ''fjotr'':84B ''for'':28B ''gra'':94B ''gra-dushnikh'':93B ''grindston'':108B ''gulch'':60B,138B ''hall'':69B,105B,128B ''his'':79B ''holding'':48B ''hom'':76B ''hous'':75B ''housing'':90B ''in'':9B,36B ''includ'':99B ''ingots'':155B ''is'':3B,26B,123B ''its'':159B ''karthwast'':1A,2B,68B,104B,127B ''lash'':92B ''lies'':140B ''locat'':8B,124B ''main'':120B ''men'':81B ''min'':54B,56B,61B,87B,114B,118B,122B,139B ''mining'':6B,34B ''near'':103B,158B ''nearby'':135B ''nord'':43B ''north'':19B,125B ''northwestern'':145B ''not'':39B ''notabl'':27B ''of'':13B,20B,31B,50B,65B,112B,126B ''on'':109B ''one'':30B ''ore'':134B,157B ''owned'':40B ''ownership'':49B ''peryit'':17B ''rack'':102B ''ragn'':97B ''reach'':11B,38B ''reachm'':47B ''resid'':72B ''s'':59B,74B,88B,115B,137B,144B ''sanuarach'':55B,117B ''settlements'':35B ''shrin'':15B ''silv'':53B,121B,133B,154B ''small'':5B ''smelt'':131B,151B ''surrounding'':52B ''tanning'':101B ''the'':10B,14B,24B,32B,37B,62B,86B,110B,113B,119B,142B ''thre'':66B ''to'':16B,77B ''town'':7B,25B,63B,143B ''wher'':70B ''wif'':80B ''with'':44B,129B,153B', 'reach', 'Karthwasten is a small mining town located in the center of the Reach. You do not know anyone who works here.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('salvius_farm', 'Salvius Farm is a small, family-run farm located east of Markarth and north of Left Hand Mine in the Reach. The farm is tended by Vigdis Salvius and Rogatus Salvius, who live together in the Farmhouse.', '''and'':16B,32B ''by'':29B ''east'':13B ''family'':9B ''family-run'':8B ''farm'':2A,4B,11B,26B ''farmhous'':40B ''hand'':20B ''in'':22B,38B ''is'':5B,27B ''left'':19B ''liv'':36B ''locat'':12B ''markarth'':15B ''min'':21B ''north'':17B ''of'':14B,18B ''reach'':24B ''rogatus'':33B ''run'':10B ''salvius'':1A,3B,31B,34B ''small'':7B ''tend'':28B ''the'':23B,25B,39B ''togeth'':37B ''vigdis'':30B ''who'':35B', 'reach', 'Salvius Farm is a small, family-run farm located east of Markarth and north of Left Hand Mine in the Reach. The farm is tended by Vigdis Salvius and Rogatus Salvius, who you do not know.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('cidhna_mine', 'Cidhna Mine is a medium-sized silver mine and forced-labor prison camp located in southern Markarth in the Reach. It is owned and operated by the influential Silver-Blood family and serves as the city’s prison, known as the most feared and secure facility in Skyrim. The mine consists of two zones: Cidhna Mine and Markarth Ruins.

Prisoners in Cidhna Mine are forced to mine silver ore day and night, receiving food only weekly upon meeting their quotas. The mine''s harsh conditions and impenetrable security make it a dreaded destination for those who break the law in Markarth. Its dual role as a prison and a functioning silver mine highlights the Silver-Blood family''s control over both justice and industry in the Reach.', '''and'':12B,28B,37B,49B,62B,76B,91B,113B,129B ''are'':69B ''as'':39B,45B,110B ''blood'':35B,122B ''both'':127B ''break'':102B ''by'':30B ''camp'':17B ''cidhn'':1A,3B,60B,67B ''city'':41B ''conditions'':90B ''consists'':56B ''control'':125B ''day'':75B ''destination'':98B ''dread'':97B ''dual'':108B ''facility'':51B ''family'':36B,123B ''fear'':48B ''food'':79B ''for'':99B ''forc'':14B,70B ''forced-labor'':13B ''functioning'':115B ''harsh'':89B ''highlights'':118B ''impenetr'':92B ''in'':19B,22B,52B,66B,105B,131B ''industry'':130B ''influential'':32B ''is'':5B,26B ''it'':25B,95B ''its'':107B ''justic'':128B ''known'':44B ''labor'':15B ''law'':104B ''locat'':18B ''mak'':94B ''markarth'':21B,63B,106B ''medium'':8B ''medium-siz'':7B ''meeting'':83B ''min'':2A,4B,11B,55B,61B,68B,72B,87B,117B ''most'':47B ''night'':77B ''of'':57B ''only'':80B ''operat'':29B ''ore'':74B ''over'':126B ''owned'':27B ''prison'':16B,43B,112B ''prisoners'':65B ''quot'':85B ''reach'':24B,133B ''receiving'':78B ''rol'':109B ''ruins'':64B ''s'':42B,88B,124B ''secur'':50B ''security'':93B ''serv'':38B ''silv'':10B,34B,73B,116B,121B ''silver-blood'':33B,120B ''siz'':9B ''skyrim'':53B ''southern'':20B ''the'':23B,31B,40B,46B,54B,84B,86B,103B,119B,132B ''thos'':100B ''to'':71B ''two'':58B ''upon'':82B ''weekly'':81B ''who'':101B ''zon'':59B', 'reach', 'Cidhna Mine is a medium-sized silver mine and forced-labor prison camp located in southern Markarth in the Reach. It is owned and operated by the influential Silver-Blood family and serves as the city’s prison, known as the most feared and secure facility in Skyrim. The mine consists of two zones: Cidhna Mine and Markarth Ruins.

Prisoners in Cidhna Mine are forced to mine silver ore day and night, receiving food only weekly upon meeting their quotas.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fenn''s_gulch_mine', 'Fenn''s Gulch Mine is a small silver mine located in the northwestern part of Karthwasten in the Reach.  There is nothing of interest at this location.', '''at'':29B ''fenn'':1A,5B ''gulch'':3A,7B ''in'':15B,21B ''interest'':28B ''is'':9B,25B ''karthwast'':20B ''locat'':14B ''location'':31B ''min'':4A,8B,13B ''northwestern'':17B ''nothing'':26B ''of'':19B,27B ''part'':18B ''reach'':23B ''s'':2A,6B ''silv'':12B ''small'':11B ''the'':16B,22B ''ther'':24B ''this'':30B', 'reach', 'Fenn''s Gulch Mine is a small silver mine located in the northwestern part of Karthwasten in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('kolskeggr_mine', 'Kolskeggr Mine is a small gold mine and settlement located east-northeast of Markarth and south of The Lover Stone in the Reach. Kolskeggr Mine is occupied by Forsworn, who forced the miners to abandon the site and seek refuge at Left Hand Mine.', '''abandon'':38B ''and'':10B,18B,41B ''at'':44B ''by'':31B ''east'':14B ''east-northeast'':13B ''forc'':34B ''forsworn'':32B ''gold'':8B ''hand'':46B ''in'':24B ''is'':5B,29B ''kolskeggr'':1A,3B,27B ''left'':45B ''locat'':12B ''lov'':22B ''markarth'':17B ''min'':2A,4B,9B,28B,47B ''miners'':36B ''northeast'':15B ''occupi'':30B ''of'':16B,20B ''reach'':26B ''refug'':43B ''seek'':42B ''settlement'':11B ''sit'':40B ''small'':7B ''south'':19B ''ston'':23B ''the'':21B,25B,35B,39B ''to'':37B ''who'':33B', 'reach', 'Kolskeggr Mine is a small gold mine and settlement located east-northeast of Markarth in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('left_hand_mine', 'Left Hand Mine is a small iron mine and settlement located southeast of Markarth and south of Salvius Farm in the Reach. The mine is know for its production of iron ore.

