INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('karthspire_camp', 'Karthspire is a large Forsworn camp and cave located east of Markarth and northwest of Old Hroldan Inn in the Reach. The Karthspire, and serves as a significant base for the Forsworn. Situated in a strikingly rugged landscape, Karthspire features both open camp areas and natural cave passages, blending Forsworn structures with the surrounding terrain. It is rumored that some hidden temple is somewhere in the mountainside of Karthspire.', '''and'':9B,15B,26B,47B ''are'':46B ''as'':28B ''bas'':31B ''blending'':51B ''both'':43B ''camp'':2A,8B,45B ''cav'':10B,49B ''east'':12B ''featur'':42B ''for'':32B ''forsworn'':7B,34B,52B ''hidd'':63B ''hrold'':19B ''in'':21B,36B,67B ''inn'':20B ''is'':4B,59B,65B ''it'':58B ''karthspir'':1A,3B,25B,41B,71B ''landscap'':40B ''larg'':6B ''locat'':11B ''markarth'':14B ''mountainsid'':69B ''natural'':48B ''northwest'':16B ''of'':13B,17B,70B ''old'':18B ''open'':44B ''passag'':50B ''reach'':23B ''rugg'':39B ''rumor'':60B ''serv'':27B ''significant'':30B ''situat'':35B ''som'':62B ''somewher'':66B ''strikingly'':38B ''structur'':53B ''surrounding'':56B ''templ'':64B ''terrain'':57B ''that'':61B ''the'':22B,24B,33B,55B,68B ''with'':54B', 'reach', 'Karthspire is a large Forsworn camp and cave located east of Markarth in the Reach.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('reach_imperial_camp', 'The Reach Imperial Camp is an Imperial military encampment located south of Bthardamz and west of Karthwasten in the Reach. Commanded by Legate Emmanuel Admand, the camp serves as a strategic base for the Imperial Legion''s operations in the region during Skyrim''s civil war.', '''admand'':28B ''an'':9B ''and'':17B ''as'':32B ''bas'':35B ''bthardamz'':16B ''by'':25B ''camp'':3A,7B,30B ''civil'':48B ''command'':24B ''during'':45B ''emmanuel'':27B ''encampment'':12B ''for'':36B ''imperial'':2A,6B,10B,38B ''in'':21B,42B ''is'':8B ''karthwast'':20B ''legat'':26B ''legion'':39B ''locat'':13B ''military'':11B ''of'':15B,19B ''operations'':41B ''reach'':1A,5B,23B ''region'':44B ''s'':40B,47B ''serv'':31B ''skyrim'':46B ''south'':14B ''strategic'':34B ''the'':4B,22B,29B,37B,43B ''war'':49B ''west'':18B', 'reach, legion', 'The Reach Imperial Camp is an Imperial military encampment located west of Karthwasten in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('reach_stormcloak_camp', 'The Reach Stormcloak Camp is a military encampment located west of Liar''s Retreat and northeast of Karthwasten in the Reach. It serves as a base for the Stormcloak forces during Skyrim''s civil war and is commanded by Kottir Red-Shoal.', '''and'':18B,39B ''as'':27B ''bas'':29B ''by'':42B ''camp'':3A,7B ''civil'':37B ''command'':41B ''during'':34B ''encampment'':11B ''for'':30B ''forc'':33B ''in'':22B ''is'':8B,40B ''it'':25B ''karthwast'':21B ''kott'':43B ''liar'':15B ''locat'':12B ''military'':10B ''northeast'':19B ''of'':14B,20B ''reach'':1A,5B,24B ''red'':45B ''red-shoal'':44B ''retreat'':17B ''s'':16B,36B ''serv'':26B ''shoal'':46B ''skyrim'':35B ''stormcloak'':2A,6B,32B ''the'':4B,23B,31B ''war'':38B ''west'':13B', 'reach, stormcloak', 'The Reach Stormcloak Camp is a military encampment located northeast of Karthwasten in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('cliffside_retreat', 'Cliffside Retreat is a small shack located south of Dragon Bridge and northeast of Liar''s Retreat in the Reach. The shack is inhabited by a lone bear hunter, who lives in seclusion amidst the rugged terrain.', '''amidst'':36B ''and'':14B ''bear'':30B ''bridg'':13B ''by'':27B ''cliffsid'':1A,3B ''dragon'':12B ''hunt'':31B ''in'':20B,34B ''inhabit'':26B ''is'':5B,25B ''liar'':17B ''liv'':33B ''locat'':9B ''lon'':29B ''northeast'':15B ''of'':11B,16B ''reach'':22B ''retreat'':2A,4B,19B ''rugg'':38B ''s'':18B ''seclusion'':35B ''shack'':8B,24B ''small'':7B ''south'':10B ''terrain'':39B ''the'':21B,23B,37B ''who'':32B', 'reach', 'Cliffside Retreat is a small shack located south of Dragon Bridge  in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('broken_tower_redoubt', 'Broken Tower Redoubt is a medium-sized fort located east of Karthwasten and north of Rebel''s Cairn in the Reach. The fort is occupied by Forsworn and consists of two zones, both named Broken Tower Redoubt: the ground level and the upper tower.

The fort''s position along the route between Karthwasten and Rorikstead makes travel through the area particularly hazardous, with Markarth''s guards warning travelers of the Forsworn presence. Its rugged, defensible structure and strategic location highlight the Forsworn''s efforts to control the region and resist outside forces.', '''along'':53B ''and'':17B,32B,45B,58B,81B,93B ''are'':64B ''betw'':56B ''both'':37B ''brok'':1A,4B,39B ''by'':30B ''cairn'':22B ''consists'':33B ''control'':90B ''defens'':79B ''east'':14B ''efforts'':88B ''forc'':96B ''forsworn'':31B,75B,86B ''fort'':12B,27B,50B ''ground'':43B ''guards'':70B ''hazardous'':66B ''highlight'':84B ''in'':23B ''is'':7B,28B ''its'':77B ''karthwast'':16B,57B ''level'':44B ''locat'':13B ''location'':83B ''mak'':60B ''markarth'':68B ''medium'':10B ''medium-siz'':9B ''nam'':38B ''north'':18B ''occupi'':29B ''of'':15B,19B,34B,73B ''outsid'':95B ''particularly'':65B ''position'':52B ''presenc'':76B ''reach'':25B ''rebel'':20B ''redoubt'':3A,6B,41B ''region'':92B ''resist'':94B ''rorikst'':59B ''rout'':55B ''rugg'':78B ''s'':21B,51B,69B,87B ''siz'':11B ''strategic'':82B ''structur'':80B ''the'':24B,26B,42B,46B,49B,54B,63B,74B,85B,91B ''through'':62B ''to'':89B ''tow'':2A,5B,40B,48B ''travel'':61B ''travelers'':72B ''two'':35B ''upper'':47B ''warning'':71B ''with'':67B ''zon'':36B', 'reach, legion, stormcloak', 'Broken Tower Redoubt is a medium-sized fort located east of Karthwasten in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fort_sungard', 'Fort Sungard is a large, strategically located fort east-southeast of Markarth and south-southeast of Rorikstead in the Reach. Perched atop a small mountain, the fort overlooks the crossroads connecting the Reach, Whiterun Hold, and Falkreath Hold. The northern plains offer the easiest approach to the fort. It is occupied by Forsworn, Fort Sungard poses a significant challenge to travelers and adventurers in the area. Its strategic position makes it a key location during Skyrim’s civil war.', '''adventurers'':67B ''and'':16B,40B,66B ''approach'':49B ''are'':70B ''atop'':26B ''by'':56B ''challeng'':63B ''civil'':82B ''connecting'':35B ''crossroads'':34B ''during'':79B ''easiest'':48B ''east'':12B ''east-southeast'':11B ''falkreath'':41B ''forsworn'':57B ''fort'':1A,3B,10B,31B,52B,58B ''hold'':39B,42B ''in'':22B,68B ''is'':5B,54B ''it'':53B,75B ''its'':71B ''key'':77B ''larg'':7B ''locat'':9B ''location'':78B ''mak'':74B ''markarth'':15B ''mountain'':29B ''northern'':44B ''occupi'':55B ''of'':14B,20B ''offer'':46B ''overlooks'':32B ''perch'':25B ''plains'':45B ''pos'':60B ''position'':73B ''reach'':24B,37B ''rorikst'':21B ''s'':81B ''significant'':62B ''skyrim'':80B ''small'':28B ''south'':18B ''south-southeast'':17B ''southeast'':13B,19B ''strategic'':72B ''strategically'':8B ''sungard'':2A,4B,59B ''the'':23B,30B,33B,36B,43B,47B,51B,69B ''to'':50B,64B ''travelers'':65B ''war'':83B ''whiterun'':38B', 'reach, legion, stormcloak', 'Fort Sungard is a large, strategically located fort east-southeast of Markarth in the Reach.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('harmugstahl', 'Harmugstahl is a small fort located north of Karthwasten and east of Druadach Redoubt in the Reach. It is rumored a warlock has taken residence in the location.', '''and'':11B ''druadach'':14B ''east'':12B ''fort'':6B ''harmugstahl'':1A,2B ''in'':16B,27B ''is'':3B,20B ''it'':19B ''karthwast'':10B ''locat'':7B ''location'':29B ''north'':8B ''of'':9B,13B ''reach'':18B ''redoubt'':15B ''residenc'':26B ''rumor'':21B ''small'':5B ''tak'':25B ''the'':17B,28B ''warlock'':23B', 'reach', 'Harmugstahl is a small fort located north of Karthwasten in the Reach.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bleakwind_bluff', 'Bleakwind Bluff is a small, ruined Nordic tower located northwest of Rorikstead in the Reach. Perched on an outcrop of rock, it is inhabited by hagravens and Forsworn, making it a dangerous site for unwary travelers.

The tower is accessed via a winding path marked by a pile of rocks on the north side of the main route connecting Old Hroldan Inn with Rorikstead. The path loops around a large rock, doubles back on itself, and ascends several flights of stairs that circle the outcrop, eventually leading to the tower.', '''access'':42B ''an'':20B ''and'':29B,78B ''around'':70B ''ascends'':79B ''back'':75B ''bleakwind'':1A,3B ''bluff'':2A,4B ''by'':27B,48B ''circl'':85B ''connecting'':61B ''dangerous'':34B ''doubl'':74B ''eventually'':88B ''flights'':81B ''for'':36B ''forsworn'':30B ''hagravens'':28B ''hrold'':63B ''in'':15B ''inhabit'':26B ''inn'':64B ''is'':5B,25B,41B ''it'':24B,32B ''itself'':77B ''larg'':72B ''leading'':89B ''locat'':11B ''loops'':69B ''main'':59B ''making'':31B ''mark'':47B ''nordic'':9B ''north'':55B ''northwest'':12B ''of'':13B,22B,51B,57B,82B ''old'':62B ''on'':19B,53B,76B ''outcrop'':21B,87B ''path'':46B,68B ''perch'':18B ''pil'':50B ''reach'':17B ''rock'':23B,73B ''rocks'':52B ''rorikst'':14B,66B ''rout'':60B ''ruin'':8B ''several'':80B ''sid'':56B ''sit'':35B ''small'':7B ''stairs'':83B ''that'':84B ''the'':16B,39B,54B,58B,67B,86B,91B ''to'':90B ''tow'':10B,40B,92B ''travelers'':38B ''unwary'':37B ''via'':43B ''winding'':45B ''with'':65B', 'reach', 'Bleakwind Bluff is a small, ruined Nordic tower located northwest of Rorikstead in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('cradle_stone_tower', '
Cradle Stone Tower is a small, ruined Nordic tower located west of Bard''s Leap Summit and east of Valthume in the Reach. The tower is home to a hagraven, making it a perilous destination for adventurers exploring the region.

