INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('dushnikh_yal', 'Dushnikh Yal is a prosperous Orc stronghold located in the southwest of Skyrim, southeast of Markarth. The stronghold thrives due to its combination of resource production and trade. The hunters, Arob and her son Nagrub, supply Hogni Red-Arm with meat for sale in Markarth''s marketplace, while Dushnikh Mine, an orichalcum mine with seven ore veins, contributes to the stronghold''s wealth.

Like many Orc strongholds, Dushnikh Yal is surrounded by a wooden palisade with lookout platforms positioned at regular intervals along the walls. A raised walkway runs along the inside of the wall, providing a clear view of the compound. The longhouse sits at the center of the stronghold, with various other structures and activities arranged around it. There are two gates for entry: one to the east and one to the west. ', '''activiti'':120B ''along'':86B,93B ''an'':54B ''and'':29B,34B,119B,134B ''are'':125B ''arm'':42B ''arob'':33B ''around'':122B ''arrang'':121B ''at'':83B,109B ''by'':75B ''cent'':111B ''cle'':101B ''combination'':25B ''compound'':105B ''contribut'':61B ''due'':22B ''dushnikh'':1A,3B,52B,71B ''east'':133B ''entry'':129B ''for'':45B,128B ''gat'':127B ''her'':35B ''hogni'':39B ''hunters'':32B ''in'':11B,47B ''insid'':95B ''intervals'':85B ''is'':5B,73B ''it'':123B ''its'':24B ''lik'':67B ''locat'':10B ''longhous'':107B ''lookout'':80B ''many'':68B ''markarth'':18B,48B ''marketplac'':50B ''meat'':44B ''min'':53B,56B ''nagrub'':37B ''of'':14B,17B,26B,96B,103B,112B ''one'':130B,135B ''orc'':8B,69B ''ore'':59B ''orichalcum'':55B ''other'':117B ''palisad'':78B ''platforms'':81B ''position'':82B ''production'':28B ''prosperous'':7B ''providing'':99B ''rais'':90B ''red'':41B ''red-arm'':40B ''regul'':84B ''resourc'':27B ''runs'':92B ''s'':49B,65B ''sal'':46B ''sev'':58B ''sits'':108B ''skyrim'':15B ''southeast'':16B ''southwest'':13B ''stronghold'':9B,20B,64B,114B ''strongholds'':70B ''structur'':118B ''supply'':38B ''surround'':74B ''the'':12B,19B,31B,63B,87B,94B,97B,104B,106B,110B,113B,132B,137B ''ther'':124B ''thriv'':21B ''to'':23B,62B,131B,136B ''trad'':30B ''two'':126B ''various'':116B ''veins'':60B ''view'':102B ''walkway'':91B ''wall'':98B ''walls'':88B ''wealth'':66B ''west'':138B ''whil'':51B ''with'':43B,57B,79B,115B ''wood'':77B ''yal'':2A,4B,72B', 'reach, orc', 'Dushnikh Yal is a prosperous Orc stronghold located in the southwest of Skyrim, southeast of Markarth. You do not know anyone at the fort.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('markarth_stables', 'Markarth Stables is located outside the city of Markarth, directly opposite the entrance. The stables are run by Banning, a Breton, and Cedran, a Breton hostler. Banning specializes in selling war dogs, while Cedran manages the stables and horses.', '''and'':24B,40B ''are'':18B ''banning'':21B,29B ''breton'':23B,27B ''by'':20B ''cedr'':25B,36B ''city'':9B ''directly'':12B ''dogs'':34B ''entranc'':15B ''hors'':41B ''hostl'':28B ''in'':31B ''is'':5B ''locat'':6B ''manag'':37B ''markarth'':1A,3B,11B ''of'':10B ''opposit'':13B ''outsid'':7B ''run'':19B ''selling'':32B ''specializ'':30B ''stabl'':2A,4B,17B,39B ''the'':8B,14B,16B,38B ''war'':33B ''whil'':35B', 'reach', 'Markarth Stables is located outside the city of Markarth, directly opposite the entrance. You do not know anyone at the stables.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
