INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hall_of_countenance', '
The Hall of Countenance serves as the primary living and sleeping quarters for many of the higher-ranked mages at the College of Winterhold. Located within this hall are the personal cubicles and beds of notable mages, including Drevis Neloren, the master trainer of Illusion, and Faralda, the master trainer of Destruction. Along with the Hall of Attainment, it is one of the two main sleeping areas for students and faculty at the College.

The hall contains several notable features: a trapdoor leading to the Midden, the underground area housing some of the College''s deepest secrets, as well as an arcane enchanter and an alchemy lab on the upper floor. Drevis Neloren’s bedroom on the lower floor also holds an alchemy lab, allowing for easy access to alchemical experimentation. The upper floor is home to Colette Marence, a Restoration expert, and Sergius Turrianus, an expert in Enchanting, both of whom also provide their respective magical training to students.', '''access'':132B ''alchemical'':134B ''alchemy'':110B,127B ''allowing'':129B ''along'':57B ''also'':124B,157B ''an'':105B,109B,126B,150B ''and'':13B,37B,50B,74B,108B,147B ''arcan'':106B ''are'':33B,71B,93B ''as'':9B,102B,104B ''at'':24B,76B ''attainment'':62B ''bedroom'':119B ''beds'':38B ''both'':154B ''colett'':142B ''colleg'':26B,78B,98B ''contains'':81B ''countenanc'':3A,7B ''cubicl'':36B ''deepest'':100B ''destruction'':56B ''drevis'':43B,116B ''easy'':131B ''enchant'':107B ''enchanting'':153B ''experimentation'':135B ''expert'':146B,151B ''faculty'':75B ''farald'':51B ''featur'':84B ''floor'':115B,123B,138B ''for'':16B,72B,130B ''hall'':1A,5B,32B,60B,80B ''high'':21B ''higher-rank'':20B ''holds'':125B ''hom'':140B ''housing'':94B ''illusion'':49B ''in'':152B ''including'':42B ''is'':64B,139B ''it'':63B ''lab'':111B,128B ''leading'':87B ''living'':12B ''locat'':29B ''low'':122B ''mag'':23B,41B ''magical'':161B ''main'':69B ''many'':17B ''marenc'':143B ''mast'':46B,53B ''midd'':90B ''nelor'':44B,117B ''notabl'':40B,83B ''of'':2A,6B,18B,27B,39B,48B,55B,61B,66B,96B,155B ''on'':112B,120B ''one'':65B ''personal'':35B ''primary'':11B ''provid'':158B ''quarters'':15B ''rank'':22B ''respectiv'':160B ''restoration'':145B ''s'':99B,118B ''secrets'':101B ''sergius'':148B ''serv'':8B ''several'':82B ''sleeping'':14B,70B ''som'':95B ''students'':73B,164B ''the'':4B,10B,19B,25B,34B,45B,52B,59B,67B,77B,79B,89B,91B,97B,113B,121B,136B,159B ''this'':31B ''