INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wayward_pass', 'Wayward Pass is a mountain pass located in the southwest of Winterhold, nestled between the ancient Dwarven ruin of Alftand and Nightgate Inn. The pass is known for being the resting place of an ancient traveler, whose tomb is marked by a shrine to Arkay, the God of Life and Death.', '''alftand'':22B ''an'':36B ''ancient'':18B,37B ''and'':23B,52B ''arkay'':47B ''being'':31B ''betw'':16B ''by'':43B ''death'':53B ''dwarv'':19B ''for'':30B ''god'':49B ''in'':10B ''inn'':25B ''is'':5B,28B,41B ''known'':29B ''lif'':51B ''locat'':9B ''mark'':42B ''mountain'':7B ''nestl'':15B ''nightgat'':24B ''of'':13B,21B,35B,50B ''pass'':2A,4B,8B,27B ''plac'':34B ''resting'':33B ''ruin'':20B ''shrin'':45B ''southwest'':12B ''the'':11B,17B,26B,32B,48B ''to'':46B ''tomb'':40B ''travel'':38B ''wayward'':1A,3B ''whos'':39B ''winterhold'':14B', 'winterhold', 'Wayward Pass is a mountain pass located in the southwest of Winterhold.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_midden', 'The Midden is a medium-sized dungeon located beneath the College of Winterhold, housing both the Atronach Forge and the mysterious Augur of Dunlain, a former mage of the College. The dungeon is a place of arcane secrets, filled with ancient magic and hidden knowledge.

There are three entrances to the Midden: a trapdoor located in the northern corner of the College courtyard, another at the base of the stairwell in the Hall of Countenance, and a hidden cave in the northern face of the rocky outcropping where the College is situated.  The Augur of Dunlain, a spectral figure, resides in the depths of the Midden.', '''ancient'':44B ''and'':22B,46B,79B ''anoth'':67B ''arcan'':40B ''are'':50B ''at'':68B ''atronach'':20B ''augur'':25B,97B ''bas'':70B ''beneath'':12B ''both'':18B ''cav'':82B ''colleg'':14B,33B,65B,93B ''corn'':62B ''countenanc'':78B ''courtyard'':66B ''depths'':106B ''dungeon'':10B,35B ''dunlain'':27B,99B ''entranc'':52B ''fac'':86B ''figur'':102B ''fill'':42B ''forg'':21B ''form'':29B ''hall'':76B ''hidd'':47B,81B ''housing'':17B ''in'':59B,74B,83B,104B ''is'':5B,36B,94B ''knowledg'':48B ''locat'':11B,58B ''mag'':30B ''magic'':45B ''medium'':8B ''medium-siz'':7B ''midd'':2A,4B,55B,109B ''mysterious'':24B ''northern'':61B,85B ''of'':15B,26B,31B,39B,63B,71B,77B,87B,98B,107B ''outcropping'':90B ''plac'':38B ''resid'':103B ''rocky'':89B ''secrets'':41B ''situat'':95B ''siz'':9B ''spectral'':101B ''stairwell'':73B ''the'':1A,3B,13B,19B,23B,32B,34B,54B,60B,64B,69B,72B,75B,84B,88B,92B,96B,105B,108B ''ther'':49B ''thre'':51B ''to'':53B ''trapdoor'':57B ''wher'':91B ''winterhold'':16B ''with'':43B', 'collegeofwinterhold', 'The Midden is rumored to be a hidden cave under the College of Winterhold. You do not know anything else about the area.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'winterhold', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('whistling_mine', 'Whistling Mine is a small iron mine and settlement located southeast of Winterhold, along the southern road that connects Winterhold to Windhelm, at the base of the mountains. The mine is nestled near the northern edge of Stillborn Cave. The settlement is home to a handful of Nord warriors who are trying to make a living through mining, though they face the harsh conditions of the region.

Among the residents are Angvid, Badnir, Gunding, and Horgar—each Nords attempting to carve out a livelihood in the tough and unforgiving environment of Whistling Mine. The mine itself serves as a modest source of iron, though the locals'' struggles to thrive in the area highlight the challenges posed by the surrounding terrain and climate.', '''along'':16B ''among'':70B ''and'':10B,77B,90B,123B ''angvid'':74B ''are'':53B,73B,114B ''as'':100B ''at'':25B ''attempting'':81B ''badn'':75B ''bas'':27B ''by'':119B ''carv'':83B ''cav'':41B ''challeng'':117B ''climat'':124B ''conditions'':66B ''connects'':21B ''each'':79B ''edge'':38B ''environment'':92B ''fac'':63B ''gunding'':76B ''handful'':48B ''harsh'':65B ''highlight'':115B ''hom'':45B ''horg'':78B ''in'':87B,112B ''iron'':8B,105B ''is'':5B,33B,44B ''itself'':98B ''livelihood'':86B ''living'':58B ''locals'':108B ''locat'':12B ''mak'':56B ''min'':2A,4B,9B,32B,95B,97B ''mining'':60B ''modest'':102B ''mountains'':30B ''near'':35B ''nestl'':34B ''nord'':50B ''nords'':80B ''northern'':37B ''of'':14B,28B,39B,49B,67B,93B,104B ''out'':84B ''pos'':118B ''region'':69B ''residents'':72B ''road'':19B ''serv'':99B ''settlement'':11B,43B ''small'':7B ''sourc'':103B ''southeast'':13B ''southern'':18B ''stillborn'':40B ''struggl'':109B ''surrounding'':121B ''terrain'':122B ''that'':20B ''the'':17B,26B,29B,31B,36B,42B,64B,68B,71B,88B,96B,107B,113B,116B,120B ''they'':62B ''though'':61B,106B ''thriv'':111B ''through'':59B ''to'':23B,46B,55B,82B,110B ''tough'':89B ''trying'':54B ''unforgiving'':91B ''warriors'':51B ''whistling'':1A,3B,94B ''who'':52B ''windhelm'':24B ''winterhold'':15B,22B', 'winterhold', 'Whistling Mine is a small iron mine and settlement located southeast of Winterhold. You do not know who works here.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('winterhold_imperial_camp', 'Winterhold Imperial Camp is an Imperial outpost located in Winterhold Hold, positioned southeast of Dawnstar and northwest of Frostflow Lighthouse. The camp serves as a strategic base for the Imperials in the region, providing support and defense in this distant part of Skyrim.

