INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hela''s_folly', 'Hela''s Folly is a shipwreck located northeast of Dawnstar, in the Winterhold region, and northwest of The Tower Stone. The wreck lies along the rugged coast, adding to the eerie and desolate landscape of the area. The ship''s remains are a stark reminder of the dangerous waters off Skyrim''s northern coast. There are rumors of an Argonian who have taken refugee there.', '''adding'':31B ''along'':27B ''an'':62B ''and'':18B,35B ''are'':40B,45B,59B ''argoni'':63B ''coast'':30B,57B ''dangerous'':51B ''dawnst'':13B ''desolat'':36B ''eeri'':34B ''folly'':3A,6B ''hav'':65B ''hel'':1A,4B ''in'':14B ''is'':7B ''landscap'':37B ''lies'':26B ''locat'':10B ''northeast'':11B ''northern'':56B ''northwest'':19B ''of'':12B,20B,38B,49B,61B ''off'':53B ''refuge'':67B ''region'':17B ''remains'':44B ''remind'':48B ''rugg'':29B ''rumors'':60B ''s'':2A,5B,43B,55B ''ship'':42B ''shipwreck'':9B ''skyrim'':54B ''stark'':47B ''ston'':23B ''tak'':66B ''the'':15B,21B,24B,28B,33B,39B,41B,50B ''ther'':58B,68B ''to'':32B ''tow'':22B ''waters'':52B ''who'':64B ''winterhold'':16B ''wreck'':25B', 'winterhold', 'Hela''s Folly is a shipwreck located northeast of Dawnstar, in the Winterhold region.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wreck_of_the_pride_of_tel_vos', 'The Wreck of The Pride of Tel Vos is a shipwreck located on a small island east of Winterhold, due east of the city. The wreck is home to a small group of bandits who have set up camp around the ruined vessel, using it as their hideout. ', '''around'':47B ''as'':53B ''bandits'':41B ''camp'':46B ''city'':31B ''due'':27B ''east'':24B,28B ''group'':39B ''hav'':43B ''hideout'':55B ''hom'':35B ''is'':16B,34B ''island'':23B ''it'':52B ''locat'':19B ''of'':2A,5A,10B,13B,25B,29B,40B ''on'':20B ''prid'':4A,12B ''ruin'':49B ''set'':44B ''shipwreck'':18B ''small'':22B,38B ''tel'':6A,14B ''the'':3A,8B,11B,30B,32B,48B,54B ''to'':36B ''up'':45B ''using'':51B ''vessel'':50B ''vos'':7A,15B ''who'':42B ''winterhold'':26B ''wreck'':1A,9B,33B', 'winterhold, sailor', 'The Wreck of The Pride of Tel Vos is a shipwreck located on a small island east of Winterhold, due east of the city. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('wreck_of_the_winter_war', 'The Wreck of the Winter War is a shipwreck located east-southeast of Snow Veil Sanctum and far northeast of Windhelm, in the Winterhold region. The wreck lies along the rugged and icy coastline, a remnant of a tragic event lost to time. The area is remote, with few travelers daring to approach the wreck due to its harsh environment and the treacherous terrain surrounding it. Situated between Yngol Barrow to the southwest and Snow Veil Sanctum to the northwest, the wreck serves as a mysterious and eerie landmark in the region.', '''along'':35B ''and'':23B,38B,67B,80B,93B ''approach'':59B ''are'':51B ''as'':90B ''barrow'':76B ''betw'':74B ''coastlin'':40B ''daring'':57B ''due'':62B ''east'':17B ''east-southeast'':16B ''eeri'':94B ''environment'':66B ''event'':46B ''far'':24B ''few'':55B ''harsh'':65B ''icy'':39B ''in'':28B,96B ''is'':12B,52B ''it'':72B ''its'':64B ''landmark'':95B ''lies'':34B ''locat'':15B ''lost'':47B ''mysterious'':92B ''northeast'':25B ''northwest'':86B ''of'':2A,8B,19B,26B,43B ''region'':31B,98B ''remnant'':42B ''remot'':53B ''rugg'':37B ''sanctum'':22B,83B ''serv'':89B ''shipwreck'':14B ''situat'':73B ''snow'':20B,81B ''southeast'':18B ''southwest'':79B ''surrounding'':71B ''terrain'':70B ''the'':3A,6B,9B,29B,32B,36B,50B,60B,68B,78B,85B,87B,97B ''tim'':49B ''to'':48B,58B,63B,77B,84B ''tragic'':45B ''travelers'':56B ''treacherous'':69B ''veil'':21B,82B ''war'':5A,11B ''windhelm'':27B ''wint'':4A,10B ''winterhold'':30B ''with'':54B ''wreck'':1A,7B,33B,61B,88B ''yngol'':75B', 'winterhold, sailor', 'The Wreck of the Winter War is a shipwreck located far northeast of Windhelm, in the Winterhold region. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('pilgrim''s_trench', 'Pilgrim''s Trench is a deep underwater ravine located northwest of Winterhold, along the coast. The trench is known for containing four submerged shipwrecks, remnants of vessels that met their untimely end in the treacherous waters of the Sea of Ghosts.  It is recommended to bring an underwater breathing potion if you wish to explore the wrecks.', '''along'':16B ''an'':50B ''breathing'':52B ''bring'':49B ''coast'':18B ''containing'':24B ''deep'':9B ''end'':35B ''explor'':58B ''for'':23B ''four'':25B ''ghosts'':44B ''if'':54B ''in'':36B ''is'':7B,21B,46B ''it'':45B ''known'':22B ''locat'':12B ''met'':32B ''northwest'':13B ''of'':14B,29B,40B,43B ''pilgrim'':1A,4B ''potion'':53B ''ravin'':11B ''recommend'':47B ''remnants'':28B ''s'':2A,5B ''shipwrecks'':27B ''submerg'':26B ''that'':31B ''the'':17B,19B,33B,37B,41B,59B ''to'':48B,57B ''treacherous'':38B ''trench'':3A,6B,20B ''underwat'':10B,51B ''untimely'':34B ''vessels'':30B ''waters'':39B ''winterhold'':15B ''wish'':56B ''wrecks'':60B ''you'':55B', 'winterhold, sailor', 'Pilgrim''s Trench is a deep underwater ravine located northwest of Winterhold, along the coast. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mount_anthor', 'Mount Anthor is a dragon lair located on a mountaintop south-southwest of Winterhold, in the Winterhold region. The lair is perched high on the mountain, offering a commanding view of the surrounding landscape. It lies north of Yorgrim Overlook, making it accessible through the rugged terrain of the region.', '''access'':46B ''anthor'':2A,4B ''commanding'':32B ''dragon'':7B ''high'':26B ''in'':18B ''is'':5B,24B ''it'':38B,45B ''lair'':8B,23B ''landscap'':37B ''lies'':39B ''locat'':9B ''making'':44B ''mount'':1A,3B ''mountain'':29B ''mountaintop'':12B ''north'':40B ''of'':16B,34B,41B,51B ''offering'':30B ''on'':10B,27B ''overlook'':43B ''perch'':25B ''region'':21B,53B ''rugg'':49B ''south'':14B ''south-southwest'':13B ''southwest'':15B ''surrounding'':36B ''terrain'':50B ''the'':19B,22B,28B,35B,48B,52B ''through'':47B ''view'':33B ''winterhold'':17B,20B ''yorgrim'':42B', 'winterhold, dragon', 'Mount Anthor is a dragon lair located on a mountaintop south-southwest of Winterhold, in the Winterhold region. You do not know anything else about this area.
', 'skyrimall, pale, eastmarch', '', 'winterhold');
